2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','商业法和公司法的基本知识对于商业专业人士来说是必不可少的。 本课程旨在介绍商业和公司环境中的法律基本原则和概念。课程的第一部分将首先审视香港特别行政区的法律制度（以及与世界上其他主要法律制度的比较），然后再介绍商业法中的重要主题，例如反贪污法、合同法、消费者法、侵权法、代理法和雇佣法。 本课程的第二部分将重点介绍公司法的重要方面，例如公司的成立、公司注册过程、董事会和公司股东之间的权力划分、局外人保护、融资和股息、解散公司和与上市公司有关的规则.
虽然主要侧重于香港法律，但会参考世界不同司法管辖区的法律以作比较。','Basic knowledge of Business Law and Company Law is essential to business professionals.
This course seeks to provide an introduction to the basic principles and concepts of the law in the business and corporation context.  The first part of the course will begin with an examination of the legal system of the Hong Kong SAR (together with a comparison with other major legal systems in the world) before proceeding to include important topics in business law such as anti-corruption law, contract law, consumer law, tort law, agency law and employment law. 

The second part of this course will focus on important aspects of company law such as the formation of companies, the process of incorporation, the division of powers between the board of directors and shareholders of the company, protection of outsiders, financing and dividend, dissolution of companies and rules relating to public companies.  

While the main emphasis is on Hong Kong law, reference will be made to the laws in different jurisdictions of the world for comparison purpose.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
