2026-27 Term 1','ACT2111 Intro Financial Accounting','','本课程旨在使学生熟悉和理解香港和中国（大陆）的税收基本原则。主要包括香港税制下的物业税、薪资税、利得税及个人入息课税。其他重要议题包括中国税制下的增值税、双重征税、收入转移和税收伦理。在本课程中引入的概念对于学生的高级学习和未来的职业生涯是必不可少的。','This course is designed to acquaint students with a fundamental understanding of taxation principles in Hong Kong and People’s Republic of China (PRC). It primarily covers property tax, salaries tax, profit tax and personal assessment under Hong Kong taxation system. Other essential topics include value-added tax under PRC taxation system, double-taxation, income-shifting and tax ethics. The concepts introduced in this course are essential for students’ advanced study and future career.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
