2026-27 Term 1','ACT3011 Intermediate Financial Accounting','N/A','本课程将介绍在会计领域（如财务会计、管理会计、风险管理、审计方面）中对数据的运用。学生将会学习如何使用各种公司数据（包括数值数据、文本数据及其他形式的数据）对会计相关问题进行分析。修读该课程的学生需要具备一定的编程和数据处理软件（如Stata）的知识。','This course explores the usage of data in accounting contexts such as financial accounting, financial planning, risk management, and auditing. Students will gain knowledge of solving accounting questions scientifically with real company data. Necessary programming skills and capability of statistic software such as Stata are expected for students enrolled.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
