ACT3011 Intermediate Financial Account','No co-requisite.','本课程为学生提供了详尽而又即时的审计及其他认证业务方面的知识。课程最开始内容包含审计的规章体制，相关方面的概念、原理、本质以及审计和认证的道德规范和标准流程以及调查方法。此外课程还进一步考查一系列高级课题包含高级审计技巧和审计方面的当代问题。最后，本课程强调会计和审计的道德考量，特别是职业会计师和审计师的道德规范标准。','This course provides student with comprehensive and up-to-date coverage of auditing and other assurance services. It first covers the regulatory framework of auditing, the relevant concepts, principles, natures, and ethical requirements of audit and assurance services and the standard procedures and methods of investigation. This course further examines various advanced topics including advanced auditing techniques and contemporary issues in auditing. Lastly, this course emphasizes ethical considerations in accounting and auditing and, in particular, the code of ethics for professional accountants and the ethical standard for Auditors.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
