FIN2010 Financial Management','','本课程将涵盖企业兼并收购与重组的各种形式及相关话题，通过结合理论模型与真实案例分析，旨在帮助学生掌握如何理解、计划、评估与执行企业的战略重组。课程将重点关注总部在美国、欧洲、香港与内地的大型上市公司，以及结合会计、金融、监管、组织行为与社会学等跨学科分析。','This course deals with various aspects of M&As and other corporate restructuring activities including mergers, acquisitions, and takeovers, anti-takeover tactics, financial re-capitalization, leveraged buyouts, management buyouts, going private, and reorganization under bankruptcy. The course combines applied theoretical approach with case study methods to facilities student in developing abilities to understand, plan, evaluate and execute corporate restructuring strategies. The course will cover a number of topics and cases with the emphases of large publicly held corporations headquartered in the U.S., Europe, HK, and mainland China, as well as cross-major issues of accounting, finance, law, strategy, organizational behaviour, and other social science subjects.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
