2024-25 Summer','No prerequisite needed.','No co-requisite needed.','本课程的重点是帮助学生提高他们的道德决策能力，并从利益相关者管理的角度审视企业开展的业务在全球社会中所存在的社会问题和伦理问题。本课程设置的目的是为了提高学生们对当下及未来的商业领袖所面临的既复杂又具有挑战性的社会和道德问题的认识和理解，并鼓励学生以对社会负责的方式行事，且能平衡多个利益相关者的诉求。该课程的特别之处在于探索出道德决策的工具，以评估和解决学生在生活中及许多商业场景中遇到的各种道德困境。最终，本课程将鼓励学生对他们的个人和职业生活产生积极的影响。','The focus of this course is to help students improve their ethical decision-making skills and examine social and ethical problems existing in global societies where business operate at the business organizational level from a stakeholder management perspective. The purpose of this course is to raise awareness and understanding complex and challenging ethical and social issues confronting business leaders of today and tomorrow, and encourage students to act in a socially responsible manner and balance the needs of multiple stakeholders. Particularly, the course explores ethical decision-making tools to assess and resolve various ethical dilemmas in the students’ lives and in many business scenarios. Ultimately, this course will encourage students to become positive influences in their personal and professional lives.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
