2026-27 Term 1','ACT2111 Intro Financial Accounting','No co-requisite.','本课程使学生对中华人民共和国的税收制度有基本的了解。让学生熟悉中国的税收制度，包括个人所得税、企业所得税、增值税和消费税。其他的章节涉及税收管理、转让定价和与房地产相关的税收，包括土地增值税、房地产税和印花税。在本课程中所学到的概念对税务合规和职业发展至关重要。','The course provides students with a fundamental understanding of the tax system in the People''s Republic of China. It also aims to acquaint students with the tax regimes in China, including individual income tax, enterprise income tax, value-added tax (VAT) and consumption tax. Other essential topics include tax administration, transfer pricing and property-related taxes, including land value-added tax, real estate tax and stamp duty. The concepts learnt in this course are essential for tax compliance and career development.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100031,'ACT4263','国际税收','International Taxation','ACT - Accounting','4263','A',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2','ACT2111 Intro Financial Accounting','ACT2111 Intro Financial Accounting','本课程旨在让学生对国际税收原则和国际税收管理的关键概念有基本的了解。紧跟国际经济全球化趋势，本课程将重点关注政府和跨国公司的税收问题、各种国际税收制度以及在全球投资的本地企业和外商投资企业的税收问题。它主要涵盖转让定价、税收协定、跨境交易和国际税收筹划考虑。其他重要主题包括香港和中国税收制度下的国际增值税问题、双重征税、收入转移和税收道德。本课程中介绍的概念对于学生的深造和未来的职业生涯至关重要。','This course is designed to acquaint students with a fundamental understanding of international taxation principles and key concepts of international taxation management. Following the trend of globalization in international economies, this course will put emphasis on taxation issues for government and multinational companies, various international taxation systems and taxation issues for local enterprises with global investment and foreign-invested enterprises. It primarily covers transfer pricing, tax treaties, cross border transactions and international tax planning considerations. Other essential topics include value-added international tax issues under Hong Kong and PRC taxation system, double-taxation, income-shifting and tax ethics. The concepts introduced in this course are essential for students’ advanced study and future career.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
