2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程向学生介绍了组织和管理的概念和理论，帮助学生了解和分析各种管理职能。本课程为学生提供不同的思想，讲述了生产，运作，人力资源管理在实体企业中的角色和作用，同时也阐明管理的行为，功能和这门学科的动机。管理是解决实际问题。课程鼓励学生将自己的经验，知识和意见融入到给定的案例研究中加以讨论再把所学运用到现实生活中。','This course introduces students with concepts and theories of organization and management that will help the student to understand and analyse various management functions. This course provides students with different schools of thought, the role of production, operation, human resource management in business entity and the behavioural, functional and motivational aspects of management. Management is practical issue. Within the course, students are expected to integrate their own experience, knowledge and observations for the application in the given case studies or in real-life scenarios.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
