2025-26 Term 1','','','该课程向学生介绍在商业世界用于决策的统计方法和推论。主要包括概率，描述性统计、数据收集、采样、假设检验、置信区间、相关和回归。并且会强调商业问题的应用。','This course introduces students with statistical methods used in making decisions and inferences in the business world. Major topics to be taught include probability, descriptive statistics, data collection, sampling, hypothesis testing, confidence intervals, correlation and regression. Application to business problems will be emphasized.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
