2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','课程目标在于帮助学生全方面地理解财务会计知识，为在高级公司会计领域进一步的学习打好基础。课题包括财务会计的概念框架、财务报表及其中一些项目例如现金、应收账款、存货、固定资产、无形资产、资产、负债、权益等概念的理解学习，同时还涉及到养老金和退休福利、比率分析以及简单的财务报表分析等。','This course aims to provide students with an in-depth understanding of financial accounting. It intends to form the basis for further studies in Advanced Corporate Accounting. Topics include the conceptual framework of financial accounting, financial statements, cash and receivables, inventories, revenue recognition, property, plant and equipment, intangible assets, financial assets, liabilities, equity, pension and postretirement benefits, ratio analysis and an introduction to financial statement analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
