2025-26 Term 2','ACT6111 Corporate Accounting','','本课程延伸至探讨财务会计学上更复杂的问题特別是关于集团的会计。本课程旨在使学生掌握企业合并和集团财务报告的知识,并增强学生将所学的会计和财务报告知识应用于企业决策的能力。其他课程内容包括汇率变动之影响套期会计。','This course extends to explore and investigate more advanced aspects of financial accounting with particular focus on group accounting. It aims to equip students with working knowledge of business combination and group reporting, and strengthen the students’ ability in applying the acquired accounting and financial reporting knowledge for business decisions-making. Other topics include effects of changes in foreign exchange rates and accounting for hedging','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
