2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程介绍成本和管理会计学的基本概念和应用及技巧。课题包含成本行为和分类, 销售量本利分析、成品和加工成本，决策分析、定价决策、变量分析、资本预算以及衡量和管理客户关系、加工绩效和策略成效。','This course covers the basics of cost and management accounting including concepts, techniques and applications. Topics include cost behaviour and classification, cost-volume-profit analysis, product and process costing, decision-making, pricing decisions, variance analysis, capital budgeting, and measuring and managing customer relationships, process performance, and strategic performance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
