2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在介绍中国的基本法律制度以及中国法律项下的企业经营的法律基础以及商业人士应当掌握的基本商事法律知识。这门课讲授的主题包括：民法的基本原则、物权法、合同法、侵权、反腐败、反洗钱、消费者权益保护、劳动法、商事组织（合伙、公司、并购）、企业上市与证券监管、企业破产等。我们主要关注中国现行有效的法律规则，必要时，也会对比讲授英国或美国的相关法律制度—实际上，我们会发现中国和西方的商事法律有着内在的一致性。这门课程也会简要介绍法律制度的经济学原理，并希望以此培养学生对制度的批判性思维。','This course introduces the legal frameworks of business and explains the laws that define and govern businesses and corporations in China. A basic acquaintance with the law is instrumental to practitioners in the business world. This course gives an introduction to the overall legal system of China and the laws that are relevant to business transactions and business organizations. Topics include principles of civil law, property, contract, tort, corruption, anti-money laundering, consumer protection, employment, business organizations (partnership, corporate, M&A), corporate listing, securities regulations, bankruptcy, etc. We focus on the current legal rules in China, but will refer to the laws in the UK or US occasionally when it provides a better angle. We will see, though, that business laws in the East and in the West are similar, once capturing their essences. The course also briefly covers the economic theory that undergirds the legal rules, and thereby train students to think critically about institutions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
