2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程主要介绍中国税收体系的原则和理论。学生同时可以通过一系列的案例分析学习到税法原理的应用。本课程主题主要包含：个人/企业所得税、增值税及附加、其他税种如土地增值税、房产税和印花税等，以及税务争议解决机制与反避税、IPO及并购重组中常见税务问题。','This course introduces to students the principles and concepts of Chinese taxation system. Students will learn how tax principles are applied through a series of case studies. Major topics covered in the course include individual income tax, enterprise income tax, value-added tax and surcharges, and other taxes such as land appreciation tax, property tax, and stamp duty, as well as tax dispute resolution, anti-avoidance rules, and tax issues involved in IPO and M&A deals.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
