2025-26 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程探讨财务和非财务数据在财务会计、管理会计、审计、内部控制和公司治理背景下解决问题的应用。学生将接触不同的高级数据分析技术和预测模型，如文本分析、神经网络和深度学习，以检测会计数据中的违规、异常和潜在欺诈。学生将获得知识和实践经验，应用这些技术，从会计数据产生价值进行预测。','This course explores the use of financial and non-financial data for solving problems in financial accounting, managerial accounting, audit, internal control and corporate governance contexts. Students will gain exposure to different advanced data analytics techniques and predictive models such as text analytics, neural networks and deep learning to detect irregularities, anomalies and potential fraud in accounting data. Students will gain knowledge and hands-on experience in applying these techniques to make predictions by generating value from accounting data','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
