2020-21 Summer','','','本课程是公司财务的高级课程，旨在深化学生的财务管理知识与分析能力。课程涵盖以下主要内容：公司治理与代理问题、风险分析与实物期权及资本预算、套利定价理论、有效资本市场与行为金融、股权融资（含首次公开招股）、期权在公司财务中的应用，以及企业并购与资产剥离。课程将通过案例分析、实证研究及真实案例的运用，培养学生在公司财务、投资银行、财务分析及管理咨询等领域所需的专业分析能力','This advanced corporate finance course builds on foundational finance knowledge to examine the strategic and analytical tools that financial managers apply in complex decision-making. Topics include corporate governance and the agency problem; risk analysis, real options and capital budgeting under uncertainty; the arbitrage pricing theory as an alternative model of risk and return; efficient capital markets and behavioral challenges; long-term equity financing including initial public offerings; options and their applications in corporate finance; and mergers, acquisitions and divestitures. Through the use of cases, empirical research articles, and real-life examples, students develop the advanced analytical skills needed for careers in corporate finance, investment banking, financial analysis, and management consulting.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
