2025-26 Term 2','ACT6111 Corporate Accounting','','课程目标在于让学生们充分意识到会计在实践中有时候会被利用从而歪曲公司在其财务报表中陈述的财务状况。课程探讨了盈余管理中的常用技术，例如主观应计部分，财务修饰以及帮助他们侦测识别财务舞弊的各种方法。课程主要以中国资本市场的现实案例作为教学辅助，通过案例讨论和演示，学生们将会对会计花招以及中国资本市场中的欺诈现象有更实际的了解。','This course aims to broaden students'' awareness of the various ways in which accounting practices can be mis-used to distort the financial position of the firm presented in its financial statements. It explores commonly used techniques for earnings management such as discretionary accruals and financial window-dressing and different discernment methods for their detection. Real-life case examples drawn from the Chinese Capital markets are used as the major teaching aids in this course. Through classroom case discussions and presentations, students will gain practical insights into accounting gimmicks and frauds in Chinese capital markets.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
