2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本课程将介绍利用数据挖掘技术开展商业分析的基本概念、关键技术与应用场景。主要内容包括数据采集、数据清洗、特征工程，以及多种数据挖掘模型。模型部分涵盖无监督学习方法（如聚类、降维与频繁项集挖掘）和监督学习方法（如决策树、支持向量机 SVM、K 近邻 KNN）。课程将强调使用编程语言、相关软件包与 AI 模型 API 等工具开展动手实践，开发技术解决方案。

此外，课程的一个重点是模型性能评估，特别是在商业情境下对数据挖掘任务进行评估的框架。最后，课程将探讨数据挖掘在文本分析与推荐系统中的应用。','This course introduces the fundamental concepts, key technologies, and application scenarios of business analytics using data mining.  Key topics include data collection, data cleaning, feature engineering, and a variety of data mining models. The modelling component covers unsupervised learning methods (such as clustering, dimensionality reduction, and frequent itemset mining) and supervised learning methods (such as decision trees, Support Vector Machines, and K-Nearest Neighbors). The course emphasizes hands-on practice using programming languages, relevant packages, and AI model APIs to develop technical solutions.

In addition, a major focus of the course is model performance evaluation, particularly the framework for assessing data mining tasks in business contexts. Finally, the course explores applications of data mining in text analytics and recommender systems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
