2018-19 Summer','Have background in basic Accounting and Statistical Analysis knowledge.','','结构化和非结构化数据的不断增长推动了一种更受数据驱动的决策形式。未来的会计师需要能够收集和处理数据。本课程的目的是首先介绍各种会计和财务研究数据集，并为学生提供开发分析数据模型以支持决策的各种定量分析技术。随着从数据建模中得到的信息的发展，将定量分析的实际含义传达给任何类型的观众成员是至关重要的。本课程旨在进一步提供数据可视化和可视化分析方面的介绍和实践经验，以帮助有效地总结大量数据。学生将学习结合分析和交互式可视化方法，并使用它们来演示或提供对现实世界问题和情况的见解。','The growing volume of both structured and unstructured data has pushed forward a more data-driven form of decision making. Future accountants need to be able to collect and work with data. This course aims to first introduce various accounting and financial research datasets and to provide students a number of quantitative analysis techniques in developing analytical data models to support decision-making. With the information developed from data modelling, it is crucial to communicate practical implications of quantitative analyses to any kind of audience member. This course aims to further provide an introduction as well as a hands-on experience in data visualization and visual analytics to help summarize large amount of data effectively. Students will learn to combine analytic and interactive visualization approaches and use them to demonstrate or provide insights into real-world problems and situations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100060,'ACT6243','金融市场的文本分析','','ACT - Accounting','6243','A',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 1
