2025-26 Term 2','Basic knowledge of Python','','全面检查大量的文本数据是一项艰巨的任务，需要懂得自然语言的处理。本课程旨在提供文本处理和检索的基本技术和主要算法，以提取有用的信息去支持决策。完成这门课程后，学生将学到如何独立获取和分析大量非结构化的文本数据，了解生成式大语言模型对企业和社会的影响，提高对商业的洞察力。','Thorough examination of huge amounts of text data is known to be a difficult task which requires the understanding of natural language processing. This course aims to provide students fundamental techniques and major algorithms used for text processing and retrieval to extract useful information to support decision making. After taking the course, students will know how to independently obtain and analyze huge amounts of unstructured textual data to generate the business insights for companies. The class will also touch on the recent development in generative AI, and discuss how they are re-shaping the business world.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100061,'ACT6244','人工智能与会计实务','','ACT - Accounting','6244','A',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','n/a','','本课程旨在帮助学生建立对人工智能（AI）核心概念及其在会计与审计领域应用的基础认知。随着AI技术持续革新并重塑行业格局，理解现代方法论在实务应用中的优势与局限变得至关重要。课程将系统阐释人工智能基本原理，重点探讨其在会计与审计实务中的具体应用场景。不同于聚焦技术实现细节的教学路径，本课程着重剖析支撑AI技术的基础理论框架，同时深入分析AI对财务决策流程的潜在影响，以及如何提升财务报告与审计实践中的效率与精确度。','This course is designed to provide students with a foundational understanding of Artificial Intelligence (AI) concepts and their relevance in the fields of accounting and auditing practices. As AI technologies evolve and reshape these industries, it is crucial for students to comprehend both the advantages and limitations of implementing modern methodologies in their practices. The course will explore key AI principles while emphasizing their practical applications in accounting and auditing practices. Instead of focusing on technical implementation details, the course will concentrate on the fundamental concepts that underpin AI technologies. The course will also examine the potential impact of AI on decision-making processes and how it can enhance efficiency and accuracy in financial reporting and auditing practices.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
