2024-25 Summer','Hands-on experience and knowledge on ONE OF below programming languages: R, Python, SAS, Stata. Undergraduate or graduate level course of econometrics and statistics. General understanding of derivative securities and fixed income securities.','','本课程旨在通过案例研究和讲座向学生概述国际信用评级机构采用的信用评级实践和方法, 以及监管合规的一般做法，包括信用指标、企业信用风险的测量和评估, 以及信用风险对公司财务和运营的影响。本课程还探讨了信用风险管理的一般概念，并通过创新的技术工具提供了对信用风险管理和实践的深入了解和新发展。','This course aims to use case studies and lectures to provide students with a general introduction of the credit rating practices and methodologies employed by international credit rating agencies as well as general practices for regulatory compliances, including credit metric, measurements and assessment of corporate credit risk and the effect of the credit risk on corporate finance and operations. This course also examines the general concept of credit risk management and offers an in-depth understanding and new developments in credit risk management and practices with innovative technological tools.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
