(100133,'AIE6016','面向化学与材料科学的人工智能与机器人技术','','AIE - Artificial Intelligence','6016','A',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人工智能学院','人工智能学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','None.','None.','本课程介绍面向化学与材料科学的核心人工智能与实验室机器人技术，重点聚焦材料化学工作流。学生将学习分子、反应与材料的实用表示方法；现代学习范式（图神经网络、生成模型、贝叶斯优化、主动学习）；以及这些方法如何与自动化实验及“自助驾驶实验室”相结合。课程涵盖机器人的硬件与软件基础（液体/固体处理、分配加样、任务调度、实验室自动化技术栈、数据/元数据标准、安全规范），并包含关于闭环优化与机器辅助合成规划的引导式迷你项目。学生将阅读并讨论代表性研究论文，同时构建端到端原型系统，将AI模型与实验设计和/或模拟机器人执行相整合。','This course introduces core AI and laboratory robotics technologies for chemistry and materials science, with an emphasis on materials chemistry workflows. Students will learn practical representations of molecules, reactions, and materials; modern learning paradigms (graph neural networks, generative models, Bayesian optimization, active learning); and how these methods connect to automated experimentation and “self-driving labs”. The course covers robotic hardware and software basics (liquid/solid handling, dispensing, scheduling, lab automation stacks, data/metadata standards, safety) and includes guided mini-projects on closed-loop optimization and machine-assisted synthesis planning. Students will read and discuss representative research papers and build end-to-end prototypes that integrate AI models with experimental design and/or simulated robotic execution.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
