(100149,'AIE8401','实用型人工智能教育（一）','','AIE - Artificial Intelligence','8401','A',2.00,8000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人工智能学院','人工智能学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','','','AIE8401-8402课程系列旨在为人工智能领域的研究生提供专业知识，使其能够通过实践操作和应用案例研究，具备教学、创新和变革学习的能力。AIE8401是该系列的第一门课程，为成为具有反思能力、以人为本并善于运用技术的教育者奠定基础框架。通过互动式工作坊、真实教学场景和反思性作业，学生将获得实践技能和战略思维，从而在不断发展的人工智能增强教育领域中发挥引领作用。','The AIE8401-8402 course series equips graduate students in AI area with the expertise to teach, innovate, and transform learning through hands-on practice and applied case studies. AIE8401 is the first one in this series, by establishing the foundational framework for becoming a reflective, human-centered, and technologically adopted educator. Through interactive workshops, real-world teaching scenarios, and reflective assignments, students gain the practical skills and strategic mindset needed to lead in the evolving landscape of AI-enhanced education.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
