(100151,'AIR5011','深度学习','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5011','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','CSC1001 or CSC1003, DDA3020/CSC4020/DDA2020/FTE4560
Remark: Requiring DDA4250 knowledge and solid programming skills','None','深度学习与应用是旨在从实践的角度阐述现代深度神经网络  的基本组成部分以及相关的应用领域。 课程涵盖的主题包括 卷积神经网络、循环神经网络、图神经网络、神经辐射场、注意力机制和  Transformer。  在此基础上，本课程还引入了 一些精心挑选的计算机视觉和自然语言处理  应用任务进行 介绍。 课程实施的过程中将安排一系列实践项目来巩固和强化课程中学到的概念。 通过学习本课程，学生可以掌握使用 python  库构建深度神经网络并解决一些实际中常见的人工智 能任务。','This course introduces deep learning, a branch of machine learning concerned with the development and application of modern neural networks. It covers a range of topics from basic neural networks, convolutional and recurrent network structures, deep unsupervised and reinforcement learning, and applications to problem domains like speech recognition and computer vision.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100152,'AIR5021','机器人操作','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5021','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程通过理论学习与实践操作深度融合，帮助学生全面掌握机器人操作的核心知识与技能。课程采用以问题为导向（PBL）、项目驱动及协同设计等主动学习方法，促进深度理解与解决实际问题的能力。
主要内容包括数学基础（线性代数、刚体变换）、正/逆运动学、动力学、轨迹与运动规划、单变量与多变量控制、运动控制及力控制等；同时覆盖传感器、执行器、控制器与实时嵌入式系统等关键硬件。
实践环节贯穿始终。学生将分组完成机器人系统的设计、搭建与编程，把所学理论应用于抓取搬运、路径跟踪、力控交互等真实任务。通过迭代原型开发、测试与调试，学生将在系统整合、参数整定和实时实现等方面得到充分锻炼。','This course provides students with a comprehensive understanding of robot manipulation through an integrated approach of theoretical learning and hands-on practice. It emphasizes active learning methods, including problem-based learning (PBL), project-based learning, and collaborative design tasks, to foster deep comprehension and practical problem-solving skills. Key topics include mathematical foundations (linear algebra, rigid-body transformations), forward and inverse kinematics, dynamics, trajectory and motion planning, individual and multivariable control, motion control, and interaction force control. Students will also gain familiarity with essential hardware components such as sensors, actuators, controllers, and real-time embedded systems. Hands-on practice is a core component of the course. Students will work in teams to design, build, and program a robotic system, applying theoretical concepts to real-world tasks such as pick-and-place operations, path tracking, and force-based interaction. Through iterative prototyping, testing, and debugging, students will reinforce fundamental principles while developing skills in system integration, control tuning, and real-time implementation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100153,'AIR5023','机器人数学基础','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5023','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Basic understanding of linear algebra, calculus, and grasp of probability theory are
required, along with previous exposure to statistics, differential equations, linear systems,
optimization, stochastic processes, and basic concepts of control theory','','该课程旨在介绍机器人学背后的数学原理。课程将主要包含三部分内容：(1)矩阵和线性代数，(2) 概率和统计，（3）机器人运动学、动力学及控制中的数学原理。除了介绍基础的数学知识，该课程侧重理解机器人研究需要何种数学工具以及为什么。课程旨在让学生能够将实际的机器人应用与背后的数学原理及工具结合起来。课程还将培养学生阅读文献的能力，侧重理解机器人文献中繁杂的数学原理。','This course aims to equip students with fundamental math knowledge and understanding its applications in robotics. The course includes three topics: (1) matrix and linear algebra, (2) probability and statistics, (3) fundamentals for robot kinematics, dynamics, and control. This is a math course, but we emphasize on understanding why it is required in robotics. Through lectures, students will be able to bridge math with real-world robotic applications. This course will also introduce literature-reading skills to help students understand the mathematical principles in robotics literature.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100154,'AIR5050','人工智能与机器人毕业设计（一）','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5050','A',3.00,5000,'Major','Distinction/Pass/Failure','实习','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Basic knowledge in engineering mathematics, computer programming, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and/or robotics design, and programming.','N.A','该课程为学生提供了一个与人工智能、机器人和计算科技专业人士合作的机会，以识别和解决课堂教育之外的实际问题。 通过体验式、自主式和团队学习的结合，它旨在帮助学生在行业环境中发展专业能力和转换学术知识，从而为学生提供创业的动力。','The course provides an opportunity for students to work with AI, robotics and computing technology professionals to identify and solve practical problems beyond the classroom education. Through a combination of experiential, self-directed and team learning, it aims to help students develop professional competencies and convert academic knowledge in an industry setting, and therefore provides momentum that students can use to start their career.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100155,'AIR5051','人工智能与机器人毕业设计（二）','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5051','A',3.00,5000,'Major','Distinction/Pass/Failure','实习','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Basic knowledge in engineering mathematics, computer programming, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and/or robotics design, and programming.','N.A','本课程是AIR5050课程的后继课程，为学生提供了一个与人工智能、机器人和计算科技专业人士合作的机会，以识别和解决课堂教育之外的实际问题。 通过体验式、自主式和团队学习的结合，它旨在帮助学生在行业环境中发展专业能力和转换学术知识，从而为学生提供创业的动力。','The course provides an opportunity for students to work with AI, robotics and computing technology professionals to identify and solve practical problems beyond the classroom education. Through a combination of experiential, self-directed and team learning, it aims to help students develop professional competencies and convert academic knowledge in an industry setting, and therefore provides momentum that students can use to start their career.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
