(100157,'AIR5058','具身智能','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5058','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程将带领学生探索具身智能技术由内至外的系统性知识架构，包括基本原理、关键技术与前沿应用，并了解该领域与既有相关学科间的关联与融合。课程将以机器人为主要载体，将涵盖机器人运动学、面向机器人的学习类算法、机器人运动控制与规划、机器人-环境间动态交互以及基于大模型的具身智能体设计等内容，并将设置仿真环境下机器人与人工智能相关的有趣课业项目，以“做中学”培养学生对该领域的理论理解与实践能力。','This course will guide students through a systematic exploration of the knowledge architecture of embodied intelligence technology, from its core foundations to its outer frontiers. The curriculum covers fundamental principles, key technologies, and cutting-edge applications, while also examining the connections and integration between this field and established related disciplines. Using robots as the primary vehicle, the course will encompass robot kinematics, learning-based algorithms for robotics, robot motion control and planning, dynamic robot–environment interactions, and the design of embodied agents based on large-scale models. In addition, the course features engaging project-based assignments in simulated environments that merge robotics and artificial intelligence, emphasizing a "learning by doing" approach. Through these multifaceted components, students will develop both theoretical understanding and practical competencies in the field from diverse perspectives.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100158,'AIR5059','人工智能数学与计算基础','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5059','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','Students should have basic undergraduate-level knowledge of linear algebra, calculus, probability and statistics, and programming, preferably in Python.
Prior exposure to optimization or machine learning is helpful but not required.','','本课程全面介绍人工智能研究生教育所需的核心数学基础与计算方法。课程内容涵盖线性代数与多元微积分基础，包括向量、矩阵及矩阵微分；概率论与统计学基础，包括随机变量、概率分布、统计推断和尾概率界；以及优化理论与方法，重点介绍梯度下降类算法和随机梯度类算法。
本课程侧重于培养学生对相关数学概念的理解及其在人工智能领域中的应用能力，而非严格的理论证明。通过本课程的学习，学生将掌握继续学习机器学习、深度学习及其他人工智能相关课程所必需的数学与计算基础。','This comprehensive course introduces the core mathematical concepts and computational techniques used in the graduate level education of artificial intelligence. Students will study fundamental linear algebra and multivariate calculus, including vectors, matrices, and basic matrix differentiation; probability and statistics, covering random variables, probability distributions, statistical inference, and tail probability bounds; optimization techniques, introducing the gradient descent-type methods and the stochastic gradient-type methods. The course emphasizes understanding and practical applications to AI of the mentioned mathematical concepts over detailed proofs, equipping students with the computational tools needed for future study of diverse AI courses.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100159,'AIR5064','人机交互','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5064','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','CSC2003 or CSC3002 or CSC3200','','本课程将概述人机交互领域，并向学生介绍关键的交互与体验设计范式、方法和途径。课程将帮助学生掌握相关理论、方法与技术，以研究不同的设计情境，开发并制作新颖设计理念的原型，以及探讨技术设计中的伦理问题。本课程还将介绍人机交互领域的一些前沿技术，例如面向人机交互的人工智能（AI for HCI）、软件智能体和虚拟现实。学生将以团队形式开展一个为期一学期的设计项目，其中两个主要的阶段性成果将作为作业进行考核。','This course will provide an overview of the field of Human-Computer Interaction (HCI) and will introduce students to key interaction and experience design paradigms, approaches and methods. The course will equip students with theory, methods, and techniques to investigate different design situations, develop and prototype novel design ideas, and engage with the ethical dimensions of technology design. This course will also introduce some state-of-the-art technologies in HCI, such as AI for HCI, software agents, virtual reality. Students in this course will work with a team on a semester-long design project, with two major deliverable milestones assessed as assignments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100160,'AIR5066','强化学习','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5066','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','Calculus/Analysis
Linear Algebra
Probability and Statistics
Computer Programming
Machine Learning (preferred but not required)','None','本課程是教授強化學習概念之基礎課程，透過修習本課程，可以學習強化學習上之基礎概念、理論、算法、及應用，並可以學習如何實現和使用強化學習模型。本課程主題包括多臂老虎機、有限馬爾可夫決策、動態規劃、蒙特卡洛法、時間-差分學習、PG算法、Q算法、actor-critic算法、off-policy算法、以及近似算法簡介。課程也將討論一些近期主題，例如大型語言模型的強化學習微調','This course is a basic introduction to reinforcement learning algorithms and their applications. Topics include: multi-armed bandits; finite Markov decision processes; dynamic programming; Monte-Carlo methods; temporal-difference learning; actor-critic methods; off-policy learning; introduction to deep variants of the aforementioned algorithms, including deep Q-learning, policy gradient methods, and actor-critic methods; The course will also discuss some recent topics, such as reinforcement learning fine-tuning for LLMs','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100161,'AIR5101','人工智能专题（一）','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5101','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100162,'AIR5202','系统与控制','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5202','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','自动控制理论是研究控制系统中的原理和方法的科学。如今，在我们的日常生活中，控制科学是不可或缺的，为我们提供了便利。本课程从典型系统的基本数学模型开始介绍知识，以及表征良好发展的控制系统的方法、现代控制系统，以及为特定系统设计合适的控制算法的原理。它还涉及工程过程和机器中动态系统的控制。本课程的学生将学习关于块图、建模原则、根轨迹规则、频率响应设计、波德图、控制器设计、线性系统和典型示例的知识。本课程的目标是帮助研究生学生准备足够的控制科学知识，并使他们能够根据不同的需求设计自己的控制器。','Automatic control theory is the science dealing with principles and methods of laws in control systems. Nowadays, control science is indispensable in our daily life to provide convenience for us. The course introduces knowledge beginning from a fundamental mathematical model of typical systems, the methods to characterize well-developed control systems, modern control systems, and the principle of designing proper control algorithms for certain systems. It also deals with the control of dynamic systems in engineered processes and machines. The students enrolled in this course will learn knowledge about block diagrams, modeling principles, root locus rules, frequency response design, Bode plots, controller design, linear systems, and typical examples. The goal of this course is to help postgraduate students to prepare with sufficient knowledge in control science and make them be capable of designing their own controllers based on different requirements.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100163,'AIR5205','机器人设计与制造','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5205','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100164,'AIR5206','移动机器人','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5206','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100165,'AIR5207','微纳米机器人','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5207','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程的目标是教授高级纳米技术和微纳机器人技术。学生将学习微纳机器人技术的发展，如传感器、执行器、超级电容器和3D制造技术。本课程还介绍了小尺度下的技术和基础物理，包括微观系统、尺度定律和自组装等。此外，学生将学习高级微纳机器人技术，包括结构设计、材料、驱动、控制和不同应用等方面的知识。','The goal of this course is to teach advanced nanotechnology and micro-nanorobotics. Students will learn the developments of technologies on micro-nanomachines, such as sensors, actuators, supercapacitors and 3D manufacturing. This course also introduces techniques and fundamental physics at the small scale, including microscopic systems, the scaling law and self-assembly. In addition, students will learn advanced micro-nanorobotics technologies, including their structure design, material, actuation, control and different applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100166,'AIR5211','软体机器人','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5211','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','None','None','这是一门面向研究生的聚焦于软体机器人的选修课程，内容包括：驱动，传感，控制及应用。通过参与软体机器人项目的开发，增加学生对软体机器人的了解及动手能力。','This course focuses on soft robotics, specifically for graduate students. The topics include actuation, sensing, control and application of soft robots. The students can learn fundamental knowledge and then develop hand-on ability by carrying out projects on soft robotics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100167,'AIR5212','机器人触觉导论','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5212','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','NA','NA','在本课程中，学生们将深入探讨触觉科学——触觉的科学。我们将揭示触觉和触觉感觉背后的基本原理，重点介绍其在各个领域的变革性作用，从身临其境的虚拟现实体验到开创性的医学培训。到课程结束时，参与者将全面了解触觉反馈系统，包括基础概念、实际应用以及对触觉技术未来的展望。','In this course, students will delve into the intricate world of Haptics—the science of touch. We''ll demystify the underlying principles behind haptic and tactile sensations, spotlighting its transformative role across domains, from immersive virtual reality experiences to groundbreaking medical training. By the end, participants will gain a holistic understanding of haptic feedback systems, encompassing foundational concepts, real-world applications, and a glimpse into the future of tactile technology.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100168,'AIR5213','工程材料','','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','5213','A',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
