2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','该课程主要包括三部分的内容。首先，系统地介绍了工程材料的基本概念和基本理论。其次，讲述了不同种类工程材料的结构与性能，包括金属、高分子、陶瓷、复合材料、和新型材料。最后介绍了与工程材料应用相关的知识，包括零件失效分析、功能材料选材、典型工件、以及工程材料的实际应用。','Brief course description:
This course focuses on the electronic, optical and magnetic properties of materials, and the relative applications in engineering, including robotics. It offers the fundamental understanding of the properties of the materials from the chemical bonds, crystal packing and dimension confinement in a theoretic way and experimental exploration, including hands-on using spectroscopy, resistivity, impedance and magnetometry measurements. The philosophy on a structure-property relationship between the microchemical bonds and macro materials character will be emphasized throughout the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
