(100174,'AIR6023','机器人数学基础','Math Fundamentals for Robotics','AIR - Artificial Intelligence and Ro','6023','A',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1','N/A','N/A','该课程旨在介绍机器人学背后的数学原理。课程将主要包含三部分内容：(1)矩阵和线性代数，(2) 概率和统计，（3）机器人运动学、动力学及控制中的数学原理。除了介绍基础的数学知识，该课程侧重理解机器人研究需要何种数学工具以及为什么。课程旨在让学生能够将实际的机器人应用与背后的数学原理及工具结合起来。课程还将培养学生阅读文献的能力，侧重理解机器人文献中繁杂的数学原理。','This course aims to equip students with fundamental math knowledge and understanding its applications in robotics. The course includes three topics: (1) matrix and linear algebra, (2) probability and statistics, (3) fundamentals for robot kinematics, dynamics, and control. This is a math course, but we emphasize on understanding why it is required in robotics. Through lectures, students will be able to bridge math with real-world robotic applications. This course will also introduce literature-reading skills to help students understand the mathematical principles in robotics literature.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
