2024-25 Term 1','','','该课程主要包括三部分的内容。首先，系统地介绍了工程材料的基本概念和基本理论。其次，讲述了不同种类工程材料的结构与性能，包括金属、高分子、陶瓷、复合材料、和新型材料。最后介绍了与工程材料应用相关的知识，包括零件失效分析、功能材料选材、典型工件、以及工程材料的实际应用。','This course mainly includes three parts. Firstly, the basic concept and theory of engineering materials are systematically introduced. Secondly, structure and performance of different kinds of engineering materials, including metallic materials, polymer materials, ceramic materials, composite materials, and functional materials, are presented. Lastly, knowledge about the application of engineering materials is introduced, including part failure analysis, material selection, typical workpieces, and application of engineering materials in real cases.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
