STA2001 Probability and Statistics I','','本课程主要讲授关于生物分子结构的计算生物学知识。主题包括生物分子结构介绍、分子动力学简介、用于分析数据的统计学习方法（如主成分分析，独立成分分析，多维等级分析，聚类算法等）、基础量子化学方法、计算机辅助药物分子设计。本课程将让学生透过Python编程练习掌握课堂所学核心知识，并透过软件操作方式实践所涉及的算法。','This course aims to provide introductory and practical content about Computational Biology, particularly structure-based computational biology. The topics include introduction to biomolecular structures, molecular dynamics simulations, essentials for statistical learning (e.g. principle component analysis, independent component analysis, multidimensional scaling, clustering algorithms), Markov State Models, basics for quantum chemistry and computer-aided drug design.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100204,'BIM2006','IT 和 BT 的融合及在生命与健康科学中的应用','The Merge of Information IT','BIM - 生物信息','2006','B',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Term 2
2019-20 Term 2
