(BIO1001 General Biology & CHM1001 General Chemistry) or BIO1008 Chemistry and Life Sciences','STA2001 Probability and Statistics I or STA2001H Honours Probability and Statistics I','本課程旨在為學生提供生物資訊學關鍵概念和方法的概述,適合具備基礎生物學和計算機科學背景的學生。課程內容主要集中在序列分析和功能分析，涵蓋生物資訊學導論、測序技術、序列比對、序列組裝，以及下一代測序數據分析技術。具體主題包括 NGS, ChIP-seq、表觀遺傳學、微生物組和宏基因組數據分析、基因表達分析、蛋白質鑑定及相關算法。在實踐方面，學生將完成多個练习，積累實際操作經驗，將課堂上學到的概念和工具應用於真實的生物數據集。','The aim of this course is to provide an overall understanding of key concepts and methodologies in Bioinformatics. It is suited for students who possess a basic background in both biology and computer science. The curriculum primarily focuses on sequence and functional analyses, covering an introduction to bioinformatics, sequencing technologies, sequence alignment, sequence assembly, and in-depth techniques for next-generation sequencing data analysis. Topics include NGS, ChIP-seq, epigenetic, microbiome and metagenomic data analysis, gene expression analysis, protein identification and related algorithmns. On the practical side, students will undertake several projects to gain hands-on experience, applying the concepts and tools learned in class to real bological datasets.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
