2019-20 Summer','BIM3001 Bioinformatics','','本课程介绍从基因组到蛋白质组等多组学生物大数据分析的基本概念、前沿方法和最新应用。主题包括全外显子组测序数据分析、全基因组关联分析、转录组数据分析，以及蛋白质组学的定量检测和分析方法，以及翻译后修饰功能调控。同学们通过这门课程将会学习到如何发现单基因疾病的致病突变位点，挖掘常见疾病的遗传相关位点，并了解遗传变异是如何调控基因和蛋白功能。本课程通过上机练习的方式，让学生将课堂所学的知识与技术应用到生物学大数据的分析中。','This course introduces basic concepts, advanced methodologies and state-of-the-art applications of computational methods for analyzing large-scale biological data from genome to proteome levels. Topics covered include whole exome sequencing data analysis, genome wide association study (GWAS), RNA-seq data analysis, and techniques in quantitative proteomics and post-translational modification. Students will learn to detect causal mutations for mendelian diseases, identify disease-associated genetic variants, and understand genetic impacts on gene and protein regulations. Students will have the opportunity to apply the concepts and skills in practical analyses of large-scale biological data.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
