BIM3001 Bioinformatics','NA','本课程的目的是为生物信息学的学生提供算法的一般知识，这些学生最好具有编程（CSC1001）和生物信息学（BIM3001）的基本概念。 本课程将介绍一系列算法技术，但以计算生物学为背景，包括算法和性能分析，分治法，基本数据结构，图算法，动态编程，序列相似性，多序列比对，贪婪算法，后缀树 ，motif发现，隐马尔可夫模型，系统发育重建，RNA二级结构预测和族群遗传学。 在实践方面，学生将练习如何运用所学概念对生物数据进行生物信息学分析，从而积累编程与实现的经验。','The aim of this course is to provide general knowledge of algorithms for bioinformatics students who preferably have basic concepts of Programming (CSC1001) and Bioinformatics (BIM3001). This course goes to introduce a series of algorithmic techniques but uses computational biology as the context, including algorithms and performance analysis, divide and conquer, elementary data structure, graph algorithms, dynamic programming, sequence similarity, multiple sequence alignment, greedy algorithm, suffix tree, motif finding, hidden Markov model, phylogeny reconstruction, RNA secondary structure prediction, and population genetics. On the practical side, students are given exercises to accumulate hands-on programming experiences on applying the learned concepts to perform bioinformatics analyses on biological data.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
