BIO1001 General Biology','','本课程主要为具有分子生物学、结构生物学、编程及物理相关基础的学生提供生物大分子结构及动力学建模的相关知识。主题包括统计力学基本概念，蒙特卡洛方法，分子动力学、自由能计算、增强采样方法。本课程将让学生透过Python编程练习掌握课堂所学核心知识，并透过软件操作方式实践现有分子模拟软件在生物大分子模拟项目中的应用。','This course aims to provide fundamental and practical knowledge about well-developed methodologies in biomolecular simulations for students with proper basic knowledge in molecular biology, structural biology, programming, general physics. The topics include brief introduction to statistical mechanics, Monte Carlo, molecular force-field, Molecular Dynamics simulations, free energy calculations and enhanced sampling techniques. On the practical side, students will have hands-on experience of coding the learned concepts into Python programs and performing molecular simulations of selected representative systems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100211,'BIM3011','分子模拟与建模 II','Molecular Simulations & Modeling II','BIM - 生物信息','3011','B',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2','CHM1001 General Chemistry      PHY1001 Mechanics      BIM2005 Computational Biology','','本课程旨在提供有关量子化学的初步见解，这是一门基础学科，支持生物分子的行为。当我们探讨量子化学领域的关键理论和原则时，我们将通过使用专门软件来补充课堂上获得的理论知识，从而获得实际的动手技能。该课程将涵盖一些重要主题，如量子力学思维框架的介绍、变分原理、波函数、分子轨道、电子密度以及QM/MM方法。','This course is designed to provide introductory insights into quantum chemistry, a fundamental discipline that underpins the behavior of biological molecules. As we explore fundamental theories and principles within the realm of quantum chemistry, we will complement our theoretical knowledge from lectures by using specialized software, enabling students to acquire practical, hands-on skills. The course will encompass essential topics such as an introduction to the quantum mechanical framework of thought, the variational principle, wave functions, molecular orbitals, electron density, and QM/MM methods.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100212,'BIM3014','统计生物数据库和数据可视化','Statistical Biological Database and Data Visualization','BIM - 生物信息','3014','B',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
