BIM3001 Bioinformatics','','本课程系统性地介绍一系列生物数据库，包括序列、表达、通路、疾病和药物数据库等。现代生物数据库不仅包括数据存储，还包括复杂的生物信息学分析方法以及用户有好的数据可视化模块。本课程通过介绍R软件中的ggplot2中的基本特性来介绍数据可视化的世界。数据可视化部分将从简单的绘图（例如直方图）开始，到高级绘图（如迭加图），再到生物信息学数据可视化专题，例如热图、曼哈顿图、韦恩图、UMAP、环形图等，最终是出版物和网页可视化的水平的专业制图。','This lecture introduces a collection of biological databases, including sequence, expression, pathway, disease, and drug databases. Modern biological databases comprise not only data warehousing, but also sophisticated bioinformatics analysis methods and user-friendly data visualization. This lecture introduces the world of data visualization by talking about the basic features of ggplot2 in R. The data visualization part starts with the simple plots, such as histograms, followed by  advanced plots, such as superimposing plots, and then special topics on data visualization in bioinformatics data, such as heatmap, Manhattan plot, Venn diagram, UMAP, circular plot, and finally the production of publication and web-ready visualizations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
