2025-26 Term 2','BIM2005 Computational Biology','','本课程旨在透过动手练习来进一步加强学生对计算生物学的认识。课程首先将介绍计算生物学上常用的LINUX作业系统，特别是其终端介面的使用与BASH脚本，然后介绍可视化软件VMD的使用。接著我们将专注于几个主要的计算生物学子领域，包括：分子动力学模拟、自由能计算、和QM/MM方法等。先透过简单複习本领域的基本知识后，同学便可以开始按照教程来练习。练习期间如有疑问，除教授外也配有助教帮忙指导。','This course aims to complement to the training in computational biology through hands-on tutorial class.  We will begin with introducing the Linux terminal and bash scripting, followed by VMD usage. Then we will focus on several major subfield of computational biology, including molecular dynamics simulation (MD), free energy calculations, and QM/MM.  For each subfield, we will have a short introduction to remind you the background knowledge before starting the practice.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
