2026-27 Term 1','BIO2004 Biochemistry      BIO3001 Genetics','BIO3001 Genetics','本课程介绍合成生物学，并聚焦医学和生物制造应用。课程主题包括(1)合成生物学的基本技术，包括DNA合成、DNA测序、代谢工程、基因编辑等;(2)细胞、生物体和复杂蛋白质的设计原理、工业案例研究和相关文献解读;(3)合成生物学在工业制造、医学研究等跨学科领域的应用。学生将了解合成生物学“建物致知”的基本概念，并获得合成基因组学的知识和技能。','This course provides an introduction to synthetic biology, with an emphasis on medical and manufacturing industrial applications. Topics will include (1) Fundamental technologies used in synthetic biology, including DNA synthesis, DNA sequencing, metabolic engineering, gene-editing, etc.; (2) design principles of cells, organisms, and complex proteins, industry case studies, and analysis of the synthetic-biological literature; and (3) applications of synthetic biology in industrial manufacturing, medical research, and other interdisciplinary fields. Students will learn the basic “build-to-understand” idea of synthetic biology and gain knowledges and skills of synthetic genomics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
