2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程将概述生命伦理学的主要领域。学生将知悉伦理学术语、资源，以及伦理学分析主要框架的相关知识。本课程将要研究和分析的问题包括生物伦理学的历史基础、临床伦理学、公共卫生伦理学、研究伦理学和动物护理伦理学。','This course provides an overview of the major areas of bioethics. Students will gain familiarity with the terminology, resources, and major frameworks of ethical analysis in the field. Issues that will be examined and analyzed include historical foundations of bioethics, clinical ethics, public health ethics, research ethics and animal care ethics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100221,'BIO2002','细胞与分子生物学','Cell and Molecular Biology','BIO - Biology','2002','B',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
