2025-26 Term 2','(CHM1001 General Chemistry & BIO1001 General Biology) or BIO1008 Chemistry and Life Sciences','NA','本科目是为对生物化学感兴趣的学生提供生物化学基础知识和学习方法的基础课程，也是相关专业，如生物科学、生物信息学、药学和化学等的主要必修课程，要求已经在大学阶段学习了普通生物学、普通化学等相关课程。

科目主题包括核酸的结构与功能、蛋白质结构与功能、酶学、细胞膜与信号转导、碳水化合物代谢、脂质代谢、氨基酸代谢、以及代谢的调控和整合等。','This course serves as a foundational exploration of biochemistry, offering fundamental knowledge and learning methods for students interested in biochemistry. It is a core requirement for students in related majors such as Biological Science, Bioinformatics, and Pharmacy. Prerequisites include prior coursework in general biology and general chemistry at the university level.

The course topics encompass structure and function of proteins, enzymology, structure and metabolism of carbohydrates and lipids.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
