2025-26 Term 2','BIO2101 Comprehensive Biology Laboratory','NA','本生化實驗課程提供分子生物學基礎、蛋白質化學及糖生物學技術的基础訓練。學生將進行包括分子克隆、重組蛋白質表達與純化，以及蛋白質糖基化修飾分析的實驗操作。此外亦將執行酶學與比色法檢測以量測糖類含量。本課程著重將理論性生化原理與實驗設計、數據分析及問題排除相結合，旨在培養批判性思維並錘鍊解析複雜生化問題的核心研究能力，為學生未來投身生物科學領域奠定基礎。','This biochemistry laboratory course provides hands-on training in fundamental molecular biology, protein chemistry, and glycobiology techniques. Students will perform practical experiments, including molecular cloning, recombinant protein expression and purification, and specific analyses of protein glycosylation. They will also conduct colorimetric and enzymatic assays to measure sugar content. The course emphasizes integrating theoretical biochemical principles with experimental design, data analysis, and troubleshooting. This training is intended to foster critical thinking and cultivate the essential research skills required for analyzing and addressing complex biochemical questions, thereby preparing students for future endeavors in the biological sciences.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
