2026-27 Term 1','BIO2101/BIO2032 Comprehensive Biology Laboratory','BIO3001 Genetics','本课程为遗传学实验课程，将用果蝇和哺乳动物细胞为模式系统，帮助学生熟悉各种遗传学，包括经典遗传学、反向遗传学、正向遗传学、光遗传学和分子遗传学等的研究思路和实验方法。','This is a genetics laboratory course which provides students both principles and hands-on trainings in experimental skills in classic genetics, reverse genetics, forward genetics, optogenetics and molecular genetics using drosophila and mammalian cell lines as the model systems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
