STA2001 Probability and Statistics I','','这门课程全面介绍了统计概念和方法，并特别关注它们的实际应用。学生将学习如何通过选择适当的方法来有效地应用统计技术，准确解释分析结果。为了确保课程中所使用的例子和练习符合真实世界的情景，它们主要来自医学文献的实际文章或基于真实的医学研究问题。每个新的统计学概念都会通过从当前医学研究问题导出的完整例子进行系统化地展示。','This course provides a comprehensive introduction to statistical concepts and methods, with a particular focus on their practical applications. Students will learn how to effectively apply statistical techniques by selecting the appropriate method for specific datasets and accurately interpreting analysis results. To ensure that the examples and exercises used in the course are representative of real-world scenarios, they are primarily sourced from actual articles within the medical literature or based on authentic medical research problems. Each new concept is systematically developed through fully worked-out examples derived from current medical research problems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
