2026-27 Term 1','BIO2002 Cell and Molecular Biology','','动物生理学是学习“动物如何工作”的学科。如果想要弄清楚，动物的生物学基础，人类的健康和疾病，和对人类事务很重要的非人类动物的健康和疾病等问题，动物生理学是一门关键的学科。这门课将会从机制，计划，比较以及环境四个角度，检视动物不的不同系统，包括神经，内分泌，运动，循环，防御，呼吸，排泄，消化和生殖等系统。','Animal physiology is the study of “how animal works”. It is one of the key disciplines for understanding: the fundamental biology of all animals, human health and disease, and the health and disease of nonhuman animals of importance in human affairs. This course investigates various systems of animals, including nervous, endocrine, locomotion, circulatory, defense, respiratory, excretory, digestive, and reproductive systems from mechanistic, evolutionary, comparative, environmental, and integrative point of views.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
