(100238,'BIO3210','发育生物学','Developmental Biology','BIO - Biology','3210','B',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','BIO2002 Cell and Molecular Biology','','本课程介绍发育生物学的基本原理与前沿进展。课程内容包括细胞命运决定、发育信号转导、生殖系形成、受精、早期胚胎发育、原肠运动、胚轴形成、神经系统与神经嵴发育、器官发生、干细胞生物学和类器官等。通过课堂讲授、前沿文献汇报和期末论文，学生将学习发育过程在细胞和分子水平上的调控机制，并理解发育生物学在生物医学研究和生物技术中的应用。','This course introduces the fundamental principles and current frontiers of developmental biology. Topics include cell fate determination, developmental signaling, germline specification, fertilization, early embryonic development, gastrulation, body axis formation, nervous system and neural crest development, organogenesis, stem cell biology, and organoids. Through lectures, frontier literature presentations, and a final essay, students will learn how developmental processes are regulated at the cellular and molecular levels and how developmental biology contributes to biomedical research and biotechnology.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
