2025-26 Term 2','BIO1001 General Biology/BIO1008 Chemistry and Life Sciences','NA','本科目是提供基本化学知识给在中学曾修读高考生物课程的学生。

蛋白质结构分析和蛋白质组学关注蛋白质的结构、功能和蛋白质组学方面。这么课程将讲授蛋白质在结构、功能和蛋白质组学方面如何被分析的各种研究手段。具体为通过系统的研究蛋白质包括酶在多方面的特性特别是三维结构特点，并联系日常的应用，包括疾病、药物、毒素、化学武器和动物行为等存在的蛋白质基础。通过学习这门课程，学生能对蛋白质功能发挥和产生异常等的分子机制特别是结构生物学基础。学生也能更好地进行批判性思维训练和科学读写方面的技巧。','This is a foundation course to provide general background knowledge of Structural Biology and Proteomics for science and engineering students who have taken biology courses at the level of Gaokao in their secondary schools.

The focus of Protein Structure Analysis and Proteomics is the study of the structure, function and proteomics of proteins. “Introduction to Proteins” shows how proteins can be analyzed in multiple ways including structural, functional and proteomics aspects. It refers to the roles of proteins and enzymes in diverse contexts and everyday applications, including medical disorders, drugs, toxins, chemical warfare, and animal behavior. Throughout the semester we will attempt to relate comprehensive aspects of proteins to help gain a better understanding for what happens when proteins don’t work as they should especially in terms of structural basis. The development of critical thinking processes and proficiency in scientific reading and writing will also be emphasized throughout the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
