2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程旨在提高本科生对科学研究的兴趣。同时，学生将在教授的指导下获得与生物科学、生物信息学/计算生物学或生物医学工程相关的研究经验。在本课程中，本科生可以以一定程度的独立性计划并开展生物医学相关研究课题。完成本课程后，学生应该对科学研究的过程有更好的认识，最终具备撰写研究论文的能力。','This course aims to increase the undergraduate student''s interest in scientific research. In the meantime, the student shall gain some research experience related to biological sciences, bioinformatics/computational biology, or biomedical engineering under the supervision of professors. In this course, the undergraduate students can learn, with some independence, how to plan and carry out a research project from start to end. After completing this course, students are expected to have a good sense of the process of scientific discovery, including writing research reports (manuscripts).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
