2026-27 Term 1','BIO3901 Research Internship I','','本课程旨在提高本科生对科学研究的兴趣。 同时，学生将在教授的指导下获得前沿的专业知识，并获得与生物科学、生物资讯学/计算生物学或生物医学工程相关的丰富科研经验。 在本课程中，学生可以学习如何独立地从头到尾规划和开展生物医学相关研究课题。 学生应能够反思研究过程、瞭解其科研需求和困难点、展示研究成果，甚至撰写研究论文。','This course aims to increase the undergraduate student''s interest in scientific research. In the meantime, the student shall gain an advanced professional experience and obtain extensive experience of work related to biological sciences, bioinformatics/computational biology, or biomedical engineering under the supervision of professors. In this course, the undergraduate students can learn, with some independence, how to plan and carry out a research project from start to end. The student shall be able to reflect on the research process, understand its requirements and difficulties, present the research results, and even write a research thesis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
