2019-20 Summer','BIO1001 General Biology or BIO1008 Chemistry and Life Sciences,   
BIO2002 Cell and Molecular Biology','','本課程為尚未修過免疫學的研究生與修讀完成普通生物學課程的本科學生開設。課程包括免疫的概念，免疫細胞，微生物以及機體如何抵禦病原體等內容。本課程還將講授最近爆發的新型冠狀病毒肺炎，以及腫瘤的免疫治療等。課程將展望免疫學領域的研究，抗體及免疫檢查點抑制劑於疾病治療的現狀及今後發展。通過修讀此課程，學生將掌握免疫學及機體防禦的基本概念，瞭解免疫學相關技術如何用於疾病的治療。','This introduction course is for graduate students who have not taken immunology before, and undergraduate students who have completed General Biology with a pass score. The course will cover general concepts of immunity, the immune cells, microbes and host defense against pathogens. The course will briefly discuss topics related to recent epidemic of the new coronavirus SARS-CoV-2 as well as immunotherapy for cancer. The course will provide a prospective view of the immunology research field and current and future applications of antibodies and checkpoint inhibitors for therapy. By taking this course, students are expected to gain the general concepts of immunity and host defense against microbial pathogens, as well as therapeutic applications of immunological techniques.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100254,'BIO4204','癌症生物学','* Cancer Biology','BIO - Biology','4204','B',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','BIO1001 General Biology      BIO2002 Cell and Molecular Biology','','本课程介绍了癌症生物学的一般概念，以及这些概念如何应用于癌症的临床定义和管理。着重介绍癌症的起源和癌症的遗传以及细胞基础等主题。 课程将研究与引发癌症有关的因素; 与癌症增殖有关的细胞间相互作用; 目前对癌症的治疗方法及其设计方法; 以及癌症治疗的未来研究和治疗方向。','The course provides an introduction to general concepts in cancer biology and how these concepts apply to the clinical definition and management of the disease. Specifically, topics regarding the origins of cancer and the genetic and cellular basis for cancer will be covered.  It will examine the factors that have been implicated in triggering cancers; the intercellular interactions involved in cancer proliferation; current treatments for cancer and how these are designed; and future research and treatment directions for cancer therapy.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
