CHM1001 General Chemistry','','生物物理学课程的目的是向学生介绍跨学科的生物物理学研究。 本课程主要介绍物理方法在生物系统研究中的应用，包括大分子，膜结构，神经，肌肉和光合系统等。 向学生介绍从大分子到大脑的生物系统的结构与功能。 本课程强调未来生物物理学与生物技术之间的紧密联系，并鼓励学生从最近的一些生物物理学研究中独立选择一个主题参与讨论。','The aims of the Biophysics course are the introduction of students into interdisciplinary biophysical research. This course introduces the use of physical methods in the study of biological systems, including macromolecules and membranes. Students are introduced to the basic concepts of structure and function of biological macromolecules and quantifications of their stabilities and interactions with partner molecules (including drug molecules). Throughout the course, a close connection between biophysics and biotechnology of the future is particularly emphasized. Students are encouraged to independently select a seminar topic from some of the recent biophysical research.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
