BIO2101 Comprehensive Biology Laboratory
BIO2104 Biochemistry Laboratory','','本课程旨在增强本科生对生物科学研究的兴趣, 并开展从事科学研究的基本训练，包括基础实验技能，文献阅读，课题设计以及课题进展汇报。学生应在指导教授的培训指导下完成生物科学实验室的专业技术知识和操作经验。修完本课程的本科生应该具备，一定程度的独立性开展生物科学特定方向研究课题的能力，进行文献阅读和综述，课题设计和开展研究项目的能力，更重要的是，在研究课题过程中，发现问题并解决问题，展示和解释研究结果，最后撰写研究论文的能力。','This course aims to cultivate undergraduate students interests in biological science and provide them the general scientific training in biological science, including basic experimental skills, literature reading and summary, project design, and project progress reports. Students should gain the professional experience of working in the biological laboratory under the guidance of the supervor. Undergraduate students who have completed this course should have the ability to carry out a certain biological research projects independently, to review and summary the literatures, to design and carry out research projects in biological science, and more importantly, to find out and solve problems in the middle of research projects, to present and interpret research results, and finally to write research manuscripts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
