2025-26 Term 2','BIO4901 Final Year Research Project I','','本科目旨在增强本科生对生物科学研究的兴趣, 并开展从事科学研究的基本训练，包括基础实验技能，文献阅读，课题设计以及课题进展汇报。学生应在指导教授的培训指导下完成生物科学实验室的专业技术知识和操作经验。修完本科目本科生应该具备，一定程度的独立性开展生物科学特定方向研究课题的能力，进行文献阅读和综述，课题设计和开展研究项目的能力，更重要的是，在研究课题过程中，发现问题并解决问题，展示和解释研究结果，最后撰写研究论文的能力。','This course aims to cultivate undergraduate students interests in biological science and provide them the general scientific training in biological science, including basic experimental skills, literature reading and summary, project design, and project progress reports. Students should gain the professional experience of working in the biological laboratory under the guidance of the supervor. Undergraduate students who have completed this course should have the ability to carry out a certain biological research projects independently, to review and summary the literatures, to design and carry out research projects in biological science, and more importantly, to find out and solve problems in the middle of research projects, to present and interpret research results, and finally to write research manuscripts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100258,'BMA2010','商业编程','Programming for Business','BMA - Big Data Management and App','2010','B',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程面向编程基础薄弱或零基础的商科本科生，介绍 Python 编程的基本概念，包括核心语法、数据类型、控制结构、函数、模块、类、文件操作和异常处理。在此基础上，课程将编程与商业应用相结合，涵盖数据处理、数据分析和数据可视化，使用 NumPy、Pandas 和 Matplotlib 等常用 Python 工具包。课程旨在帮助学生建立编程信心，并将计算思维应用于实际商业问题。','This course is designed for undergraduate business students with little or no prior programming background. It introduces the fundamentals of Python programming, including core syntax, data types, control structures, functions, modules, classes, files, and exceptions. The course then connects these foundations to business-oriented applications, including data processing, data analysis, and data visualization using commonly used Python packages such as NumPy, Pandas, and Matplotlib. The overall aim is to help students build programming confidence and apply computational thinking to practical business problems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
