2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程讲解生物医学科学和工程学中创新医疗器械，技术和治疗方法的设计和开发所需的基础知识。本课程侧重于介绍生物医学工程的基础知识，包括生物医学系统分析，人体生物力学，生物动力学，生物材料，生物电子学，生物传感器，生物医学信号处理和分析，药物释放；并介绍集成传感器和智能生物芯片来设计医疗设备的示例，以创建用于精准诊断和个性化医疗的新方法。','The aim of this course is to provide the foundational knowledge required to understand the design and development of innovative devices, techniques, and treatments in biomedical science and engineering. This course focuses on the basics of biomedical engineering, including biomedical systems analysis, biomechanics of the human body, biodynamics, biomaterials, bioelectronics, biosensors, biomedical signal processing and analysis, drug delivery. It also introduces examples of designing medical devices by integrating sensors and intelligent biochip to create new methods for precision diagnostics and personalized medical treatments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100261,'BME3002','系统生物工程（一）：细胞与心血管系统','Systems Bioengineering I: Cells and CV Systems','BME - Biomedical Engineering','3002','B',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','High school-level physics, chemistry, and mathematics. A study of BME3001 Introduction to Biomedical Engineering I is required.','None.','本课程旨在提供对干细胞工程、心脏细胞、解剖学、生理学和生物医学设备工程的全面了解。学生将探讨心血管功能的基本原理，并学习如何将尖端技术应用于开发拯救生命的心脏设备。课程涵盖的基本主题包括血压、心音、诊断、电图、超声心动图、心脏性能的机械方面、可植入心脏监测、心脏映射技术、先天性心脏病的多模态影像学、心血管磁共振成像和MR适应性心脏设备、心肌的可逆和不可逆损伤：缺血/再灌注损伤和心脏保护。医疗器械创新，心脏起搏器、除颤器、心脏瓣膜和人工心脏设计的工程原理。实验室课程将允许学生对心脏设备进行原型制作和测试，加深他们对系统级交互的理解。特别强调监管和伦理考虑，确保学生为应对设备开发和临床实施的挑战做好准备。访问心脏设备制造设施，以及国际知名专家的激励讲座，将为学生提供对心血管工程中现实应用和未来趋势的深入见解。本课程旨在为学生提供生物医学工程领域的跨学科技能，准备他们进行高级学习、研究或在医疗技术行业的职业发展。','This course is designed to provide a comprehensive understanding of stem cell engineering, cardiac cells, anatomy, physiology, and biomedical device engineering. Students will explore the fundamental principles of cardiovascular function and learn how cutting-edge technologies are applied to develop life-saving cardiac devices. The course covers essential topics such as blood pressure, heart tones, diagnosis, electrocardiography, echocardiography, mechanical aspects of cardiac performance, insertable cardiac monitoring, cardiac mapping technologies, multimodality imaging in congenital heart disease, cardiovascular magnetic resonance imaging and MR-conditional cardiac devices, reversible and irreversible damage of the myocardium: ischemia/reperfusion injury and cardioprotection. Medical device innovation, engineering principles for designing pacemakers, defibrillators, heart valves, and artificial hearts. Laboratory sessions will allow students to prototype and test cardiac devices, and it will deepen their grasp of system-level interactions. Special emphasis is placed on regulatory and ethical considerations, ensuring students are prepared to navigate the challenges of device development and clinical implementation. Industrial visits to cardiac device manufacturing facilities, combined with motivational lectures by internationally renowned experts, will provide students with insights into real-world applications and future trends in cardiovascular engineering. This course aims to equip students with interdisciplinary skills in biomedical engineering, preparing them for advanced study, research, or careers in the healthcare technology sector.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100262,'BME3003','生物医学导论（二）','Introduction to Biomedical Engineering II','BME - Biomedical Engineering','3003','B',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','BME3001 Intro to BME I','NA','本课程讲解生物医学科学和工程学中前沿的设计和开发方法，以及它们在创新设备，技术和治疗方法中的应用。本课程为学生提供当前生物医学工程领域尖端医疗器械的概述，涵盖了诊断设备设计，手术，康复工程，修复设计和临床工程方面的突破性技术进展和信息。','The aim of this course is to provide the cutting-edge design and development methods for innovative devices, techniques, and treatments in biomedical science and engineering. This course provides students overview and guidance with the timely information on breakthrough developments in medical device design, diagnostic equipment design, surgery, rehabilitation engineering, prosthetics design, and clinical engineering.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100263,'BME3006','生物传感器和生物医疗器械','Biosensors and Medical Devices','BME - Biomedical Engineering','3006','B',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
