2025-26 Term 2','BIO1001 General Biology / BIO1008 Chemistry and Life Sciences','NA','本科目是为对神经系统工程感兴趣的学生提供大脑各神经系统的工作原理、研究方法及其在在生物工程上的应用案例。该课程是生物医学工程学生的主要选修课程。

科目主题包括大脑的结构、神经元内或之间的信号转导、视觉系统、听觉系统、体感系统、运动系统、边缘系统、奖赏系统、情绪和执行系统、语言、学习记忆、睡眠梦境、神经退变及再生、脑机介面、神经假体、神经调节以及相关的疾病机理等。','This is the fundamental course to provide general knowledge and methods of studying neural systems and bioengineering for the students who are interested in neuroengineering. It’s a major elective course for the biomedical engineering major students. 

The topics include the structure of brain, signaling within neurons and across synapse, visual system, auditory system, somatosensory system, motor system, limbic system, reward system, emotion and executive system, language, learning and memory, sleep and dreaming, neural degeneration and regeneration, brain-computer interface, neuroprosthesis, neuromodulation and the related diseases.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
