2026-27 Term 1','BME4012 BME Final Year Project I','NA','本课程旨在提高本科生对生物医学工程科学研究的兴趣, 并提供从事科学研究的基本训练。同时，学生应在指导教授的指导下获得在生物医学工程实验室工作的专业技术知识和实践经验。在本课程中，本科生可以一定程度的独立性开展生物医学工程研究课题的能力，在指导教师的指导下，进行文献阅读和综述，课题设计和开展研究项目,并且了解药物非临床研究质量管理规范。修完本课程学生应具备，在研究课题过程中，发现问题并解决问题，展示和解释研究结果，最后撰写研究论文的能力。','This course aims to provide undergraduate students with general training on the practice in scientific research on biomedical engineering while cultivating their interest in scientific research. In the meantime, the student shall gain advanced professional experience of working in the laboratory of biomedical engineering under the supervision of senior researchers as well as good laboratory practice (GLP). In this course, the undergraduate students can learn how to plan and carry out a research project in biomedical engineering from start to end with some level of independence. After completing this course, students are expected to have the ability to discover and solve problems in the process of researching topics, display and interpret research results, and finally, write research manuscripts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100278,'BME4014','生物医学工程实践实习','Practical Internship in Biomedical Engineering','BME - Biomedical Engineering','4014','B',3.00,4000,'Major','Distinction/Pass/Failure','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
