2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','','本课程坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义理论为指导，坚持马克思主义的立场、观点和方法，旨在帮助学生全面了解新时代中国特色社会主义的理论与实践，深刻领会习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想的核心要义，坚定对马克思主义的信仰、对中国特色社会主义的信念、对实现中华民族伟大复兴中国梦的信心；贴近研究生思想和学习实际，帮助他们树立正确的世界观、人生观、价值观，培养学生深化理论认识、提升理论素养、增强实践能力、坚定理想信念。','This course adheres to the guidance of Xi Jinping''s thought on socialism with Chinese characteristics for a new era and the theory of Marxism, aiming to help students fully understand the theory and practice of socialism with Chinese characteristics for a new era, the core essence of Xi Jinping’s thought on socialism with Chinese characteristics for a new era. This course also helps to firm students’ Marxism belief, faith in socialism with Chinese characteristics, and confidence in realizing the Chinese dream of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation. Closing to the reality of graduate students’ thoughts and learning, the course helps students establish a correct world outlook, life outlook and values, deepen theoretical understanding, improve theoretical attainment, enhance practical ability, and firm ideals and beliefs.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
