2026-27 Term 1','CEC5000 Theory and Practice of State-building in Contemporary China','CEC5000 Theory and Practice of State-building in Contemporary China','本课程旨在通过学习自然科学重大理论和前沿问题，帮助学生掌握辩证唯物主义的自然观、科学观、技术观，帮助学生了解自然界发展和科学技术发展的一般规律，理解科学技术在社会发展中的作用，认识中国马克思主义科学技术观与创新型国家建设的重大意义，培养学生的创新精神和创新能力。','This course aims to help the students to understand the basic principles of the development of nature, science and technology by introducing Marx’s and Engel’s views on these aspects, as well as the important role of science and technology in social development. In Marx’s point of view, science and technology constitute a primary productive force in the development of society. And there is some effective way in taking science and technology, that is the dialectical way. Upon completion of the course, students are expected to develop a sense and interest of innovation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
