2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','','本课程旨在学习当代中国马克思主义观察和分析问题的基本立场、观点和方法，总体把握当代中国马克思主义科学体系和主要观点，全面理解习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，深入分析当代世界和中国面临的重大社会问题，聚焦学生关注的当代社会思潮和热点问题，提高学生正确分析和研判当代问题的能力和水平，增强学生实现中华民族伟大复兴中国梦的责任担当。','This course aims to help students learn the basic standpoints, viewpoints and methods of how contemporary Chinese Marxism observes and analyzes issues, master the scientific system and main viewpoints of contemporary Chinese Marxism, understand Xi Jinping’s Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and analyze the social issues of the contemporary world and China. Focusing on contemporary social thoughts and hot issues that students are concerned about, the course improves students'' competences to correctly analyze and judge contemporary issues and enhances students'' sense of responsibility to realize the Chinese dream of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
