(100386,'CHI2007','古典戏曲','','CHI - Chinese','2007','C',3.00,2000,'Chinese','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2020-21 Summer
2025-26 Summer','CHI1000 Chinese','','中国古典戏曲不仅产生了许多文学经典，也极富美学与文化价值。本课程概述古典戏曲之体制、形式、剧场及演变，循着古典戏曲的发展历程，析论元杂剧与明清传奇的代表作家及经典作品。课程拟探讨经典作品的产生，及不同剧类的发展脉络、艺术特色、思想内涵与社会意义。学生将重点研读《救风尘》、《赵氏孤儿》、《西厢记》、《牡丹亭》、《桃花扇》等经典戏剧文学，并欣赏昆曲及部分花部戏曲的表演片断，领略其美学特质。通过案头与场上的双线进路，本课程旨在引领学生了解古典戏曲及近世中国的文学、艺术、文化、思想，建立传统与现代的比较视野。','Chinese classical drama not only produced many literary classics but is also extremely rich in aesthetic and cultural value. This course outlines the system, form, theater, and evolution of classical drama. Following the developmental trajectory of classical opera, it analyzes representative writers and classic works from Yuan Zaju and Ming-Qing legends. The course aims to explore the genesis of these classic works, and the developmental threads, artistic characteristics, ideological connotations, and social significance of different types of dramas. Students will focus on reading classic dramatic literature and will enjoy performances of Kunqu and some local operas, appreciating their aesthetic qualities. Through both desk-based and practical approaches, this course intends to lead students to understand classical drama and the literature, art, culture, and thought of early modern China, establishing a comparative perspective between tradition and modernity.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
