2023-24 Term 2','','','本课程为中国书画系列课程中的一门，旨在通过理论及实践授课，使学生能够基本上掌握中国书画创作的原理，并在教学实践中培养学生的初步书画基础，为进一步提升学生鉴赏能力、培养对中国书画的创作基础。','As one of the courses from the Chinese Painting and Calligraphy series, this course, based on a theoretical and practical teaching method, aims at enabling students to basically grasp the principle of Chinese Painting and Calligraphy creation and cultivating them in acquiring the basics of painting and calligraphy so as to further enhance their artistic sensibility and build a foundation for Chinese Painting and Calligraphy creation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100392,'CHI2015','《诗经》与《楚辞》','','CHI - Chinese','2015','C',3.00,2000,'Chinese','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2
2020-21 Summer','CHI1000','','本课程选取《诗经》《楚辞》经典篇目释读，配合相关诗学批评理论讲梳，概述《诗经》《楚辞》的风格特征与诗史发展脉络，引导学生体悟诗骚艺术技法，感受古典诗人品格情趣，以期增进古典诗歌知识涵养，培养古典诗歌鉴赏力与美学趣味。','This course explicates canonical selections from the Book of Songs (Shijing) and Chu Prose (Chuci), in conjunction with relevant poetics and critical theory. It outlines their stylistic profiles and poetic-historical trajectory, cultivates command of shi–sao poetic technique, and fosters sensitivity to the ethos and sensibility of classical poets, thereby consolidating knowledge of classical poetry and refining aesthetic judgment and taste.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
