2022-23 Summer','CHI1000 大学中文','N/A','本课程旨培养学生对汉语特点的基本意识，并注重将汉语本体知识与汉语作为第二语言教学相联系。本课程通过介绍汉语的重要特征与语言教学的基本理论问题，鼓励学生将所学知识应用于教学实践当中，使学生可以就特定语言点独立设计教学方案。','This course aims to develop students’ necessary awareness of the features of Chinese language and highlights relevance of the knowledge the Chinese language to teaching Chinese as a second language. The essential features of different components of the Chinese language and some fundamental theoretical issues on language teaching will be introduced. Students are encouraged to explore the applications of the knowledge they have learned in practical teaching. The provision of this course enables the students to design teaching plans on the selected language points individually.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100402,'CHI4003','方言与中国文化','','CHI - Chinese','4003','C',3.00,4000,'Chinese','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 1
2023-24 Summer','CHI1000 大学中文','','方言是语言的地域变体。本课介绍方言反映的中国文化，包括汉语大方言介绍、方言记录与传承、移民史和地理如何塑造方言分布、如何从方言的角度分析地名、语言民俗等。','Dialects are regional varieties of a language. This course introduces Chinese culture reflected in dialects. These topics include an brief introduction to major Chinese dialects, dialect documentation and inheritance, how immigration history shapes and geography shapes dialect distribution, dialect information reflected in place names and language customs, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100403,'CHI4004','佛教语言与中国文化','','CHI - Chinese','4004','C',3.00,4000,'Chinese','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2021-22 Summer','CHI1000 Chinese
Exclusive course: GEC3001：佛教的历史和语言','','本课程是一门佛教的语言及其对中国文化影响的概述性课程。课程将介绍佛教在印度、丝绸之路，以及中国所使用的的语言。这些语言是佛教传播与发展的重要手段。课程将重点介绍印度的梵语、丝绸之路上的犍陀罗语和佛教汉语。在此基础上，探讨佛教对中国语言、文学、习俗及文化的影响。','This is an introductory course of the languages of Buddhism, and the influence of Buddhism on Chinese culture. The course will introduce the languages of Buddhism in India, on the Silk Road, and in China, which are the vital methods of the spreading and development of Buddhism. The course will focus on the discussion of Sanskrit in India, Gandhari on the Silk Road, and Buddhist Chinese. Based on the introduction of the languages and development of Buddhism, the students will have an overall understanding of Buddhism and know its influence on Chinese language, literature, customs and culture.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100404,'CHI4006','现代汉语','','CHI - Chinese','4006','C',3.00,4000,'Chinese','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','CHI1000 Chinese','','本课程旨在深入探讨现代汉语的语音、词汇、汉字、语法和修辞特点，培养和提高学生理解、分析和运用现代汉语的能力。课程内容涵盖但不限于以下方面：
- 分析汉语的发音特征，介绍汉语拼音的音节结构和拼写规则。
- 介绍现代汉语的词汇性质和构成。
- 讲解汉字形体的演变历史以及汉字的构字方法。
- 辨认词的词性、分析短语和句子的结构。
- 介绍汉语丰富的修辞格。','This course aims to delve into the phonetics, vocabulary, Chinese characters, grammar, and rhetorical features of modern Chinese, cultivating and enhancing students'' abilities to understand, analyze, and apply modern Chinese. The course content includes but is not limited to the following aspects:
- Analyzing the pronunciation features of Chinese, introducing the syllable structure and spelling rules of Chinese Pinyin.
- Introducing the nature and composition of vocabulary in modern Chinese.
- Explaining the historical evolution of Chinese characters and methods of character construction.
- Identifying the parts of speech of words, analyzing the structure of phrases and sentences.
- Introducing the rich rhetorical devices in Chinese.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
