2025-26 Term 1','','','本课程将指导学生从更深入而广泛的文化视角阅读文学文本、理解电影艺术。本课程以议题为中心，从时代背景、文化思潮、艺术特性等角度，探讨文学与电影之互动关系。','This course will guide students to read literary texts and understand cinematic art from deep and broad cultural perspectives. Centered on thematic topics, the course intends to explore the interactive relationship between literature and film through considerations of historical context, cultural trends, and artistic characteristics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
