2025-26 Summer','','','这是一门基础课程，旨在为理工科学生提供化学方面的通用背景知识。

课程主题包括：原子的电子结构、元素的周期性性质、化学键的一般概念、酸碱平衡、化学平衡、化学动力学、热化学、化学热力学、气体、液体、固体与现代材料、有机分子和生物分子导论、电化学等。

课程还将把化学的一般原理应用于全球性议题的讨论。通过问题解决的过程与策略，帮助学生成为具有创造力的问题解决者。','This is a foundation course to provide general background knowledge of Chemistry for science and engineering students.

The topics include the electronic structures of atoms, periodic properties of elements, general concepts of chemical bonding, acid and base equilibrium, chemical equilibrium, chemical kinetics, thermochemistry, chemical thermodynamics, gases, liquids, solids and modern materials, introduction of organic and biological molecules, electrochemistry, etc.

General principles in chemistry will be applied in the discussion of global issues. The process and strategy of problem solving will be used to help students become creative problem solvers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
