2026-27 Term 1','General Chemistry CHM1001','','课程主要包括了化学实验的基础操作和训练。一些化学的基本原理会在不同实验中得到学习。还包括计算化学。实验技能涵盖了蒸馏、再结晶、滴定法和色谱分析法的操作。','This course consists of laboratory classes, which covers basic techniques and training in experimental chemistry. The basic principles of chemistry are illustrated through experiments. Computational Chemistry will also be included.Experimental skills in distillation, recrystallization, extraction, filtration, separation and chromatography will be practised.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100428,'CHM1011','普通化学荣誉课程','Honours General Chemistry','CHM - Chemistry','1011','C',3.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
