2026-27 Term 1','For students who have taken Physics and Chemistry in high school','','在這裡輸入要轉換的內本課程是一門基礎課程，爲理工科學生提供化學方麵的一般背景知識。

科目主題包括物質的性質, 原子結構, 週期表, 化學計量學, 化學鍵, 酸和鹼, 化學平衡, 化學動力學, 熱化學, 氣體，液體，固體，現代材料，有機及生物分子簡介, 電化學, 非金屬，過渡金屬和人工智慧化學。

本課程難度有所提高，適合對化學、材料科學與工程、新能源科學與工程感興趣的學生。','This is a foundation course to provide general background knowledge of Chemistry for science and engineering students. The topics include the electronic structures of atoms, periodic properties of elements, general concepts of chemical bonding, acid and base equilibrium, chemical equilibrium, chemical kinetics, thermochemistry, chemical thermodynamics, gases, liquids, solids and modern materials, introduction of organic and biological molecules, electrochemistry, nonmetals, transition metals and artificial intelligence chemistry. The difficulty of this course is elevated to fit students who are interested in majoring in Chemistry, Materials Science and Engineering, New Energy Science and Engineering.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
