2025-26 Term 2','CHM1001 General Chemistry','','本课程分为三部分，第一部分讨论热力学定律，第二部分讨论物质结构，包括原子结构，分子结构及其反应。第三步幅讨论物质改变的相关概念，主要检视浓度，气压和温度如何影响化学反应速率，也讨论一些常见的反应机理。','The content of this course is divided into three parts.
The first part discusses the equilibrium, including the laws of thermodynamics. The second part covers the structure of substance, such as atomic and molecular structure and the reactions. The third part deals with the concept of change, such as chemical kinetics and reaction dynamics, relates parameters such as concentrations, pressures, and temperature to the reaction rates.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100430,'CHM2004','生物物理化学','Biophysical Chemistry','CHM - Chemistry','2004','C',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MAT1001 Calculus I','NA','复杂的生物物理系统受基本物理化学原理的支配。本课程介绍了广泛使用的生物物理方法的理论基础。课程侧重于两个方面：一是介绍物理化学家用来理解过程驱动力、分子相互作用、状态分布和反应行为的基本方法。另一个是帮助学生将理论与文献或他们自己的项目联系起来。本课程分为几个模块：(i) 气体特性 (ii) 热力学定律 (iii) 化学平衡，(iv) 化学动力学 (v) 统计热力学介绍。 (vi) 理论在现代研究中的应用。该课程最适合对计算生物学或生物信息学感兴趣的学生。','The complicated biophysical systems are governed by fundamental physical chemistry principles. This course provides an introduction to the theory underlying widely used biophysical methods. The course focuses on two aspects: one is to introduce the fundamental approaches used by physical chemists to understand the driving force of processes, the interaction of molecules, the distribution of states, and reaction behaviors. Another is to help students to relate the theories to literatures or their own projects.  The course is divided into several modules: (i) Gas properties (ii) Thermodynamic laws (iii) chemical equilibrium, (iv) chemical kinetics (v) introduction to statistical thermodynamics. (vi) Application of theories in modern researches. The course is most suitable for students with interests in computational biology or bioinformatics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100431,'CHM2110','分析化学','Analytical Chemistry','CHM - Chemistry','2110','C',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
