2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','分析化学是一个令人兴奋并且具有广泛应用的学科领域，领域涉及法医、农业、环境、太空探索，甚至病毒学和疫苗开发！
主题将包括分析化学的工具，经典的分析方法，样品制备方法的优化，使用误差和统计分析的准确性和精密度的考虑，以及电化学、光谱学和色谱作为定量和定性工具的应用。
我们希望本课程的讨论将帮助你理解分析化学的深度和重要性及其广泛的应用。','Analytical Chemistry is an exciting field with far-reaching applications, which involves forensics, agriculture, environment, space exploration, and even virology and vaccine development! In this course, topics will range from tools of analytical chemistry, classical methods of analysis, sample preparation methods, consideration of accuracy and precision using errors and statistical analysis, and applications of electrochemistry, spectroscopy, and chromatography as quantitative and qualitative tools.
We hope the discussions in this course will help you develop an appreciation for the depth and importance of Analytical Chemistry and its widespread applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
