2025-26 Term 2','For students who have taken Analytical Chemistry course','CHM2110 Analytical Chemistry','这门课程包括实验课，涵盖了滴定分析、电分析分析、光谱化学方法和化学分析中的仪器方法的基本技术。通过实验来阐明分析化学的基本原理。学生将学习色谱法、原子吸收/发射光谱法、分光光度法、质谱法和伏安法中不同仪器的操作和使用。','This course consists of laboratory classes, which cover basic techniques in titrimetric analysis, electroanalytical analysis, spectrochemical methods and instrumental methods in chemical analysis. The basic principles of analytical chemistry are illustrated through experiments. Students will learn the operation and usage of different instruments in Chromatography, Atomic Absorption/Emission spectrometry, spectrophotometry, mass spectrometry and voltammetry.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100433,'CHM2128','综合化学实验（无机及分析化学）','','CHM - Chemistry','2128','C',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 1','','','本课程由实验室课程组成，涵盖基本的实验室技术和实验化学培训。 通过实验说明无机化学和分析化学的基本原理。 实验对学生进行了全面的培训：（1）化学试剂和化学废物的安全处理； (2) 正确使用实验室仪器设备； (3) 分析化合物的基本技术； (4)记录实验数据，撰写实验报告。','This course consists of laboratory classes, which covers the basic laboratory techniques and training in experimental chemistry. The basic principles of inorganic and analytical chemistry are illustrated through experiments. The experiments provide comprehensive training for students on (1) safe handling of chemical reagents and chemical waste; (2) proper usage of laboratory apparatus and equipment; (3) basic techniques of analysing compounds; (4) recording experimental data and writing experimental report.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
