2026-27 Term 1','None','CHM1001 General Chemistry','本科目是提供基本无机化學知識給化学本科學生，范围包括和无机化學相关的理论，生物无机化学，催化作用，工业 过程，无机物料。本科内容含盖主族及过度金属原素的化学。','This course provides a general background knowledge of Inorganic Chemistry for undergraduate students. It covers physical inorganic principles, descriptive inorganic chemistry, bioinorganic chemistry and applications, including catalysis, industrial processes and inorganic materials. The content of the course also covers the chemistry of both main-group and transition metal elements.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
