2026-27 Term 1','','The following items must be prepared before the experiment
a.Read the laboratory manual and the relevant reference material thoroughly, and familiarize yourself with the experiment that you are going to perform.  Familiarize yourself with the experimental apparatus setup and the physical methods you are going to work with.  Look up the relevant reference books and literatures, or consult the demonstrators / instructor whenever necessary.  (Remember: whenever you have any doubt, consult your demo','本课程由实验室课程组成，涵盖基本实验室技术和实验无机化学培训。通过实验说明无机化学的基本原理。实验为学生提供了全面的培训：（1）安全处理化学试剂和化学废物； (2) 正确使用实验室仪器和设备； (3)无机化合物分析基本技术； (4)记录实验数据，撰写实验报告。','This course consists of laboratory classes, which covers the basic laboratory techniques and training in experimental inorganic chemistry. The basic principles of inorganic chemistry are illustrated through experiments. The experiments provide comprehensive training for students on (1) safe handling of chemical reagents and chemical waste; (2) proper usage of laboratory apparatus and equipment; (3) basic techniques of analysing inorganic compounds; (4) recording experimental data and writing experimental report.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
