BIO1001 General Biology / BIO1008 Chemistry and Life Sciences','NA','本课程是为生命与健康科学学生设计的有机化学入门课程，主要介绍构成生物分子的有机官能团和有机化学基本原理，使学生理解生物分子相关的结构、性质和反应机制。与生物分子相关的化学键和立体化学等基础概念将重点介绍。','This course is designed to provide a fundamental overview of organic chemistry to the life and health sciences students who preferably have basic knowledge of biology at the molecule level (BIO1001 and CHEM1001). This course will offer students with an overview of organic functional groups that constitute biomolecules, basic principles of organic chemistry to understand the formation, structures and chemical properties of biomolecules, and general reaction mechanisms of biomolecules. Selected fundamental concepts in chemical bonding and stereochemistry relevant to biomolecules will be highlighted.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100438,'CHM2320','有机化学（二）','Organic Chemistry II','CHM - Chemistry','2320','C',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
