2025-26 Term 2','CHM2320 is designed to accompany CHM 2310 or other basic organic chemistry courses, such as CHM2317. The students have taken either CHM2310 or CHM2317.','','本課程涵蓋有機化學的基本方面，這些方面對於理解高年級現代有機化學的更高級主題至關重要。  將給出有機化學中常見的各種化學鍵，以及對其化學反應性的基本了解。  此外，還將介紹不同類別的有機官能團，重點關注它們的結構方面、相對反應性和化學反應機理。本課程將講授包括醇、酚、醚、環氧化物、醛、酮、烯醇化物、羧酸、胺、胺基酸、糖類化合物、雜環化合物等的化學;  也將講授引入相關有機化學的反應性
和選擇性比較量化之處理。','This course covers the fundamental aspects of organic chemistry that are essential to the understanding of the more advanced topics of modern organic chemistry in the senior years. The various chemical bonds commonly encountered in organic chemistry, together with a basic understanding of their chemical reactivity, will be given. In addition, the different classes of organic functional groups will be presented, with a strong focus on their structural aspect, relative reactivity and chemical reaction mechanism. It includes: the chemistry of alcohols, phenols, ethers, epoxides, aldehydes, ketones, enolates, carboxylic acids, amines, amino acids, carbohydrates, heterocycles, etc., and will provide more quantitative aspects of organic reactivity and selectivity related to boththermodynamic and kinetic issues.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100439,'CHM2328','有机化学实验','','CHM - Chemistry','2328','C',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2','Students of Chemistry/Materials/New Energy/ Pharmaceutics, etc.; or pass in either (a) CHM 2310 or (b) CHM2320; or approved by Instructor.
CHM2328 is a 2-credit laboratory course which is designed to accompany the organic lecture course CHM 2310 and CHM 2320.   CHM 2328 will emphasize the basic laboratory techniques in organic synthesis, synthetic transformations, the purification of the resulting product(s), and the characterization of the resulting products by gas chromatography or with mass spectroscopy and/or infrared spectroscopy, NMR, etc..','The following items must be prepared before the experiment
a.	Read the laboratory manual and the relevant reference material thoroughly, and familiarize yourself with the experiment that you are going to perform.  Familiarize yourself with the experimental apparatus setup and the physical methods you are going to work with.  Look up the relevant reference books and literatures, or consult the demonstrators / instructor whenever necessary.  (Remember: whenever you have any doubt, consult your dem','本实验科(一)教授进行有机化学反应及有机物分离的实验技巧；(二)包括一些涉及基础有机化学反应如亲核取代反应或亲电芳香族取代反应的实验;（三）以及复杂分子的多步合成实验。此让同学对各有机分子的官能基的化学特性与活泼性有基础的理解，能够设计简单合成路线。','This laboratory course (1) covers the basic laboratory techniques for carrying out organic reactions and product isolation; (2) includes experiments that involve some basic chemical reactions such as nucleophilic substitution or electrophilic aromatic substitution. It allows students to acquire fundamental understanding of the chemical reactivity of the various organic functional groups.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
