experimental apparatus setup and the physical methods you are going to work with. Look up
the relevant reference books and literatures, or consult the demonstrators / instructor
whenever necessary. (Remember: whenever you have any doubt, consult your demons','本實驗科 (一) 教授進行有機化學反應及有機物分離的實驗技巧；(二) 包括一些涉及基礎有機化學反應如親核取代反應或親電芳香族取代反應的實驗；（三）以及複雜分子的多步合成實驗。此讓同學對各有機分子的官能基的化學特性與活潑性有基礎的理解，能夠設計簡單合成路線。','This laboratory course (1) covers the basic laboratory techniques for carrying out organic reactions and product isolation; (2) includes experiments that involve some basic chemical reactions such as nucleophilic substitution and electrophilic aromatic substitution. It allows students to acquire fundamental understanding of the chemical reactivity of the various organic functional groups.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
