2025-26 Term 2','For students who have taken Organic Chemistry course','','本科講授不同種類的光譜分析方法之基本原理及其在化合物結構鑑定之應用, 主要之光譜分析包括: 紫外光及可見光光譜, 紅外綫光譜, 質譜儀, 1H 和 13C-核磁共振光譜, 簡略介紹多核核共振光譜之應用,此外，各种色谱分析方法亦会簡略介紹, 此外，電子順磁共振及各种色谱分析方法亦会 簡略介紹，顯微鏡學亦会簡略介紹。','Primary spectroscopic techniques used commonly for structure elucidation of organic compounds and organometallic compounds, ultraviolet-visible spectrometry, infrared spectroscopy,  mass spectrometry, 1H and 13C nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy, brief introduction of multinuclear NMR, problem solving techniques in spectroscopic methods. In addition, Electron Spin Spectroscopy, chromatographic techniques: Column Chromatography, Thin-layer Chromatography, Gas Chromatography, Liquid Chromatography  and High performance Liquid Chromatography will be introduced. Microscopy will be introduced briefly.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
