(100452,'CHM4328','高等有机合成实验','Advanced Organic Synthesis Laboratory','CHM - Chemistry','4328','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
