2026-27 Term 1','Undergraduate Students of Chemistry/Materials/New Energy/ Pharmaceutics and pass in either (a)
CHM2338, or (b) CHM2328, or (c) approved by Instructor. Postgraduate Students in Chemistry or
Materials Science and Engineering.
CHM4328 is a 3-credit laboratory course which is designed to accompany the organic lecture course
CHM2338, CHM 2310 and CHM 2320, CHM2317. CHM 4328 will emphasize the ADVANCED
laboratory techniques in organic synthesis, synthetic transformations, the purification of the resulting
product(s), and the characterization of the resulting products by gas chromatography or with mass
spectroscopy and/or infrared spectroscopy, NMR, etc.. Students will gain experience with techniques
of multistep synthesis, handling of moisture and air sensitive reagents, solid phase chemistry,
asymmetric catalysis, chromatography, and further their understanding of analytical techniques.','The following items must be prepared before the experiment
a. Read the laboratory manual and the relevant reference material thoroughly, and familiarize
yourself with the experiment that you are going to perform. Familiarize yourself with the
experimental apparatus setup and the physical methods you are going to work with. Look up
the relevant reference books and literatures, or consult the demonstrators / instructor
whenever necessary. (Remember: whenever you have any doubt, consult your demons','本實驗科 (一) 教授進行有機化學反應及有機物分離的實驗技巧；(二) 包括一些涉及有機化學反應如親核取代反應或親電芳香族取代反應的實驗；（三）以及複雜分子的多步合成實驗等特定化学反应。此讓同學對各有機分子的官能基的化學特性與活潑性有更好的理解，能夠設計簡單合成路線，并进一步提升相关化学实验操作的动手能力。','This laboratory course (1) covers the advanced laboratory techniques for carrying out  organic reactions and product isolation; (2) includes experiments that involve some  specific chemical reactions and experimental operation; (3) multi-step organic  synthesis of complex molecules. It allows students to acquire well understanding of the chemical reactivity and relevant experimental operation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100453,'CHM4330','金属有机化学及催化','Organometallic Chemistry and Catalysis','CHM - Chemistry','4330','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
