(100457,'CHM4422','化学动力学与催化','Chemical Kinetics and Catalysis','CHM - Chemistry','4422','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','CHM1001 General Chemistry.','','本课程将会由化学动力学的基础开始介绍，主要关注化学反应速率理论和反应机理。随后，本课程将会介绍均相催化（酶催化）和异相催化反应，包括催化反应的反应机理和反应动力学模型。最后，本课程还会涵盖一些关于催化剂的介绍，增进对催化剂性能的理解。','This course will cover the fundamentals in chemical kinetics, primarily the reaction-rate theories and the reaction mechanisms. After that, catalytic reactions will be introduced, including the reaction mechanisms associated with homogenous catalysis (enzymatic reactions) and heterogenous catalysis. Lastly, the design of catalysts will be brought up, in order to provide a better understanding on the performance of catalysts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
