2025-26 Term 2','The final year students of Chemistry Major','None','本課程涵蓋化學的基本面，這對於最後一年理解現代化學的更高級主題至關重要。 本課程的目的是培養學生獨立規劃、執行和展示與化學問題相關的研究調查結果的技能，以及批判性審查他人科學工作的能力。
完成課程後，學生應該能夠：
---獨立識別、制定和界定科學研究問題，包括說明它們與現有化學知識和當前研究問題的關係，
---根據科學問題應用不同的研究方法，
---分析他們對科學資訊的需求，進行資訊搜索，並評估、編譯和批判性地解釋所產生的材料，
---設定科學調查的子目標並在規定的期限內進行調查，
---在規定的期限內以書面報告的形式提出科學調查的結果，在內容、結構和語言上符合科學技術的形式要求，
---對科學作品進行口頭陳述，滿足內容相關性以及語言和表達清晰度的要求，
---對研究進行批判性審查和評論，
--- 進行評估時考慮到與已完成的調查中所解決的問題相關的科學、社會和倫理方面，以及
- --確定自己需要進一步發展知識和技能。','This course covers the fundamental aspects of chemistry that are essential to the understanding of the more advanced topics of modern chemistry in the final year. The aim of the course is that students develop skills in independent planning, execution, and presentation of the results of research investigations related to chemistry problems, as well as the ability to critically review the scientific work of others. Upon completion of the course, students should be able to: --- independently identify, formulate, and delimit scientific research questions, including giving an account of their relation to established knowledge in chemistry and to current research issues, --- apply different research methods on the basis of scientific questions, --- analyse their need of science information, perform information searches, and assess, compile, and critically interpret the material yielded, --- set up subgoals for scientific investigations and carry out investigations within given time limits, --- present the result of scientific investigations within given time limits in a written report that meets the formal requirements of science and technology in terms of content, structure and language, --- perform oral presentations of scientific works, meeting the requirements of relevance of content and clarity of language and delivery, --- critically review and comment on research, --- make assessments with consideration given to the relevant scientific, societal and ethical aspects related to the problem addressed in the completed investigation, and --- identify their own need of further knowledge and skills development','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
