(100462,'CHM6118','高等仪器分析实验','','CHM - Chemistry','6118','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2024-25 Summer','None','None.','本课程介绍了先进仪器分析在解决分析化学、有机化学、无机化学和物理化学相关问题中的实际应用。课程将围绕新兴二维材料（如石墨烯）的合成展开综合性实验教学，随后通过多种先进的仪器分析方法对合成样品的结构和性能进行探究。这些方法包括光学显微镜、扫描电子显微镜与能量色散X射线光谱、X射线衍射、X射线光电子能谱、扫描探针显微镜（如原子力显微镜、静电力显微镜和开尔文探针力显微镜）以及透射电子显微镜与电子衍射等。通过本课程，学生将通过设计的动手实验，深入理解各种仪器分析方法。','This course introduces the practical applications of advanced instrumental analysis to explore problems associated with analytical, organic, inorganic, and physical chemistry. Integrated laboratory course will be launched on the topic of synthesis of the emerging two-dimensional materials such as graphene, followed by the exploration on the structures and properties of the synthesized samples, by a couple of advanced instrumental analytical methods, including optical microscopy, scanning electron microscopy and energy dispersive X-ray spectroscopy, X-ray diffraction, X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy, scanning probe microscopy such as atomic force microscopy, electrostatic force microscopy, and Kelvin probe force microscopy, and transmission electron microscopy with electron diffraction, etc. Through this course, students are expected to gain deep understanding on various instrumental methods by the designed hands-on experiments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
