(100477,'CHM6742','超分子化学','','CHM - Chemistry','6742','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','None','None','超分子化学主要研究分子识别现象以及由非共价相互作用所形成的高阶自组装结构。本课程旨在系统介绍超分子化学的基本概念与典型应用。课程内容分为两大部分：
第一部分聚焦于超分子化学的基础概念与理论，包括：（1）超分子化学的发展简史；（2）超分子相互作用的本质，如氢键、π–π相互作用、阳/阴离子–π相互作用、离子–偶极相互作用、卤键等；（3）超分子体系的表征方法；（4）超分子结构单元的合成与自组装。
第二部分着重探讨超分子化学的应用，通过选取具有代表性的超分子体系，介绍其在材料科学、电子学、能源科学与生物学等领域中的重要应用实例。','Supramolecular chemistry focuses on the study of molecular recognition and high-order assemblies formed by noncovalent interactions. This course provides an overview of fundamental concepts and essential applications of supramolecular chemistry. This course covers two parts. The first part focuses on the fundamental concepts, including 1) a brief history of supramolecular chemistry; 2) nature of supramolecular interactions, such as hydrogen bonding, π-π interactions, cation/anion-π interactions, ion/dipole interactions, halogen bonding, etc.; 3) characterizations of supramolecular systems; 4) synthesis and self-assembly of supramolecular structural motifs. The second part focuses on the application of supramolecular chemistry, discussing selected supramolecular systems and introducing important examples of applying supramolecular chemistry in materials sciences, electronics, energy science, and biology.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
