(100479,'CHM6820','能源存儲與轉化中的計算化學','','CHM - Chemistry','6820','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100480,'CHM6830','电化学系统','','CHM - Chemistry','6830','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','','','电化学系统是一门综合性课程，旨在让学生深入理解电化学的原理、理论及其应用。电化学在能源存储、腐蚀防护、材料合成与分析化学等多个领域都发挥着至关重要的作用。本课程旨在为学生打下基础理论知识并培养实践技能，帮助他们在这一充满活力的交叉学科领域中进行探索并取得卓越成就。','The Electrochemical Systems is a comprehensive course designed to provide students with a solid understanding of the principles, theories, and applications of electrochemistry. Electrochemistry plays a crucial role in various fields, including energy storage, corrosion prevention, materials synthesis, and analytical chemistry. This course aims to equip students with the fundamental knowledge and practical skills necessary to explore and excel in this exciting and interdisciplinary field.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
