2026-27 Term 1','Linear Alegbra.','','矩阵分析和计算在各种工程问题中得到了广泛的应用。它们也是信息和智能科学与工程的先决条件。本课程将分为两部分。第一部分涵盖了相互但先进的矩阵分析主题，包括线性空间和线性变换、内积和范数、特征值分解、奇异值分解、最小二乘问题、半正定矩阵、非负矩阵等。第二部分涵盖了矩阵分析研究的一些前沿，包括线性子空间之间的角度、矩阵相位等。','Matrix analysis and computations are widely used in various engineering problems. They are also prerequisite for information and intelligent science and engineering. This course will have two parts. The first part covers mutual but advanced matrix analysis topics, including linear spaces and linear transformation, inner products and norms, eigenvalue decomposition, singular value decomposition, least square problems, positive semidefinite matrices, nonnegative matrices, etc. The second part covers some forefront in matrix analysis study, including angles between linear subspaces, matrix phases, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
