2026-27 Term 1','Calculus
Linear Algebra
Probability and Statistics
Programming','None','如今，作为数字媒体最常见的媒介，图像已经随处可见也非常容易获取，使得如何对图像进行处理和计算在各个领域有个广泛的应用。此外，随之深度学习技术的快速发展，使得计算机视觉方向如今备受关注。本课程将主要围绕图像处理以及计算机视觉，介绍该领域的多种课题，并将介绍这些课题的传统方法以及基于深度学习的前沿方法。例如，图像分类、分割、检测、增强、合成等，也将介绍基于图像的三维重建技术，以及前沿的三维信号处理技术等等。','Nowadays, as the most common medium of digital media, images can be seen everywhere and are very easy to obtain, making how to process and calculate images has a wide range of applications in various fields. In addition, with the rapid development of deep learning technology, the direction of computer vision is now attracting attention. This course will mainly focus on image processing and computer vision, introduce various topics in this field, and introduce traditional methods of these topics as well as cutting-edge methods based on deep learning. For example, image classification, segmentation, detection, enhancement, synthesis, etc., will also introduce image-based 3D reconstruction technology, and cutting-edge 3D signal processing technology, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
