2026-27 Term 1','Probability and Statistics. Linear algebra.  Python programming.','None.','本课程介绍数据分析的基本概念和实用技能。内容涵盖 SQL 数据操作、相似性搜索、机器学习算法（分类、回归、聚类）、降维、数据可视化、推荐系统、数据流与网络广告、图分析、大型语言模型。课程结合理论基础和实践操作，突出现代数据科学与人工智能的应用。','This course introduces fundamental concepts and practical skills in data analytics. Topics include SQL for data manipulation; similarity search; machine learning algorithms (classification, regression, clustering); dimensionality reduction; data visualization; recommendation systems; data streams and web advertising; graph analytics, and large language models. Emphasis is on both the theoretical foundations and hands-on experience, with applications drawn from modern data science and AI fields.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100490,'CIE6007','機器學習','','CIE - 计算机与信息工程','6007','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2017-18 Term 2
