Mathematical background required: probability and random process, matrix analysis, convex optimization','None.','本课程介绍无线通信系统物理层的基本原理和基础知识。主题包括调制技术、接收机结构、无线信道建模、信道容量与信道编码、MIMO通信、分集技术、均衡以及OFDM（正交频分复用）。','This course introduces the principles and fundamentals in the physical layer of wireless communication systems. Topics include modulation techniques, receiver structure, wireless channel modeling, channel capacity and channel coding, MIMO communications, diversity schemes, equalization, and OFDM.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
