2026-27 Term 1','ECE4016 computer networks or equivalent','None.','课程分两部分。第一部分主要讲述一些基本概念，包括计算机网络的发展历程，应用层，传输层，网络层。第二部分是一个研讨会形式的论文展示和讨论，包括一个期末大作业。','This course has two parts. The first part is to teach basic concepts and applications of computer networks, including general development of computer networks, application layer, transport layer, network layer. The second part is a seminar style paper presentation and discussion, with a final project.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
