2025-26 Term 2','Probability theory and statistics','','在本课程中,我们将学习信息理论,并将其应用于统计学习。信息理论可用于估计推导和假设检定的基本界限,包括Cramer-Rao不等式和Fisher矩阵。除了经典的熵、互信息和Kullback-Leibler散度的概念外,我们还将探讨f-散度、总变差距离、隐Markov链、以及其他从信息理论中派生的结果。我们将讨论图模式,包括Bayesian网络、Markov随机场和sum-product算法。最后,我们介绍 PAC 学习的基础。','In this course we will study information theory with applications to statistical learning. Information theory can be applied to derive fundamental limits of estimation and hypothesis testing. Canonical examples include the Cramer-Rao bound and the Fisher information matrix. In addition to the classical notions of entropy, mutual information, and Kullback-Leibler divergence, we will also explore f-divergence, total variation distance, and other useful results originating from information theory. We will discuss graphical methods, including Bayesian network, Markov random field, sum-product algorithm. Finally, we introduce the basis of PAC learning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
