Bonus:
1.Have taken courses or done projects in machine learning / computer vision
2.Familiar with PyTorch','None','本课程聚焦人工智能领域的前沿动态和未来趋势。通过多样化的学习形式，包括课堂讲解、讨论交流和动手实践，学生将全面了解人工智能技术的最新进展及其社会影响。同时，课程注重培养学生的批判性思维和实际操作能力，帮助他们在快速发展的人工智能领域中发挥创新和引领作用。','This course will delve into cutting-edge developments and emerging trends in the field of artificial intelligence. Through a combination of lectures, discussions, and hands-on projects, students will gain a comprehensive understanding of the latest advancements in AI technology and their implications for society, and will be equipped with the knowledge and skills to critically analyze and contribute to the rapidly evolving field of artificial intelligence.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
