2025-26 Summer','Linear algebra, multivariate calculus or analysis, machine learning','None.','深度学习是人工智能领域最受追捧的技能之一。在本课程中，您将学习深度学习的基础知识，了解如何构建神经网络，并学习如何领导成功的机器学习项目。您将了解卷积网络、RNN、LSTM、DQN、GAN/Diffusion、Adam、Dropout、BatchNorm、Xavier/He 初始化等。您还将在本课程中学习深度学习的一些经典任务，例如分类、对象检测和语义分割。','Deep Learning is one of the most highly sought-after skills in AI. In this course, you will learn the foundations of Deep Learning, understand how to build neural networks, and learn how to lead successful machine learning projects. You will learn about Convolutional networks, RNNs, LSTM, DQN, GAN/Diffusion, Adam, Dropout, BatchNorm, Xavier/He initialization, and more. You will also learn some classic tasks of deep learning in this course, such as classification, object detection and semantic segmentation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
