2024-25 Term 2','None','None','自动控制理论是一门研究控制系统原理和方法的科学，它还涉及到工程过程和机器中的动态系统控制。建立控制系统的目的是开发一种模型或算法，以调节系统输入达到期望的状态。本课程将介绍自动控制系统的基本概念、完善的数学方法和经典方法，包括框图、建模原理、根轨迹法则、频率响应设计、波特图、控制器设计以及典型实例。该课程的目标是帮助研究生掌握足够的控制科学知识，使他们能够根据不同的需求设计自己的控制器。','Automatic control theory is the science dealing with principles and methods of laws in control systems, it also deals with the control of dynamical systems in engineered processes and machines. The objective of setting up a control system is to develop a model or algorithm to regulate the inputs of a system to a desired state. The course will introduce fundamental concepts, well-developed mathematics, and classical methods of an automatic control system, including block diagrams, modeling principles, root locus rules, frequency response design, Bode plots, controller design and typical examples. The goal of this course is to help postgraduate students to prepare with sufficient the knowledge in control science, and make them be capable of designing their own controllers based on different requirements.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
