2020-21 Summer','CSC1001 Introduction to Computer Science: Programming Methodology','None.','本课程提供了对机器智能的基本问题和方法论的全面介绍并强调與应用結合，展示了如何通过结合机器智能技术与计算机视觉和机器人技术来解决现实世界的问题。详细的应用包括智能导航，智能建站，總包，推薦系統，圖像識別，机器人定位等。','This course provides a comprehensive introduction of the fundamental problems and methodologies of machine intelligence with a strong emphasis on applications. This course focuses machine intelligence and shows how to solve real-world problems by combining machine intelligence technique with computer vision and robotics. The detailed applications include routing 、station allocations 、crowdsourcing 、 recommender systems、image recognition, robotics location et al.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
