2026-27 Term 1','','','人工智能（AI）芯片是专门设计用于高效处理人工智能算法的硬件组件，这类芯片在医疗保健和自动驾驶汽车等多个行业中起着至关重要的作用。本课程主要涵盖 AI 芯片的发展历程、芯片类型、神经网络加速器、面向 AI 应用的现场可编程门阵列（FPGA）、AI 芯片的关键组件、工作原理、并行计算架构、机器学习算法、AI 算法与芯片的应用场景，以及 AI 芯片及应用的未来趋势。','Artificial Intelligence (AI) chips are specialized hardware components designed to efficiently process artificial intelligence algorithms. These chips play a vital role in various industries, including healthcare and autonomous vehicles. This course mainly focuses on evolution of AI Chips, types of AI Chips, Neural Network Accelerators, field-programmable gate array (FPGA) for AI Applications, Key Components of AI Chips, How AI Chips Work, Parallel Computing Architecture, Machine Learning Algorithms, Applications of AI algorithms and Chips, and Future Trends in AI Chips and applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
