2026-27 Term 1','Basic prior knowledge in probability, linear algebra, algorithms and programming.','N.A.','本课程为学生提供与人工智能（AI）、AI 芯片及计算技术领域专业人士合作的机会，旨在培养学生发现并解决课堂外实际问题的能力。通过体验式团队学习或研究 / 行业研讨会等形式，课程助力学生发展专业能力，将学术知识转化为行业或研究场景中的实践应用，为学生开启职业生涯提供动力。','The course provides an opportunity for students to work with AI, Al chips and computing technology professionals to identify and solve practical problems beyond the classroom. Through a combination of experiential team learning or research/industrial seminars, it aims to help students develop professional competencies and convert academic knowledge in an industry or research setting, and therefore provides momentum that students can use to start their career.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
