(100525,'CIE6107','機器人與智能系統','','CIE - 计算机与信息工程','6107','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2017-18 Term 1
2020-21 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2','None','None','这门研究生课聚焦于机器人的基本概念，包括：机器人运动学，动力学，驱动，传感，控制及应用。这门课不但讨论基于马达或传统驱动器的机器人，还讨论由新型材料制作而成的机器人（比如软体机器人）。通过参与机器人项目的开发，学生可以增加对机器人系统基本知识的了解及发展动手能力。','This course will concentrate on basic concepts  of robotics, including robotic kinematics, dynamics, actuation, sensing, control and application of robotic systems. The course will discuss not only robots driven by electric motors and traditional actuators, but also robots composed of noval materials (e.g., soft robots). Consequently, the students can learn fundamental knowledge and then develop hand-on ability by carrying out projects on robotic systems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
