2022-23 Summer
2025-26 Summer','CIE 6134 RF Circuits and Systems, or relevant courses or background in the area of radio-frequency circuits','','本课程旨在向理工科学生介绍通信集成电路的设计和测试。课程实验内容涵盖通信系统的关键组件，包括滤波器、射频放大器、振荡器、混频器和收发机。学生可使用业界广泛采用的 EDA 工具，如 Keysight 和 Cadence 软件，进行模拟和特性分析。课程将提供一系列实验来构建和评估相关电路。在这些实验室中，学生将亲身体验如何使用专业设备，包括示波器、信号源、网络分析仪和频谱分析仪进行电路测量和特性分析。','This course teaches essential steps in IC design and measurement for communication systems. The topics will cover the critical components in communication systems, including filters, RF amplifiers, oscillators, mixers and transceivers. Students will use EDA tools, which are widely employed by the industry, such as Keysight and Cadence software, to do building block simulation and characterization. A series of experiments will be provided to build and evaluate the circuits. In those labs, students will have hands-on experiences on how to use professional equipment sets including oscilloscopes, signal sources, network analyzers  and  spectrum  analyzers  for  circuit  measurement  andcharacterization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100528,'CIE6110','進階凸優化','','CIE - 计算机与信息工程','6110','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2016-17 Term 2
