2021-22 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','None','None','NA','The course covers two main parts: theoretical foundation and practical algorithms for convex optimization, while various types of convex optimization problems and algorithms are introduced throughout the coverage. The study of the theoretical foundation focuses on the most fundamental properties of convex sets, convex functions and duality theory. A close attention is also paid to the subject of convex cones, generalized inequalities, generalized convex functions, and convex conic programs. Students learn algorithms and acquire hands-on experience through problem-solving in CVX and MATLAB. Computer projects include solving unconstrained and constrained convex optimization problems via gradient descent, interior-point methods, ADMM and more.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100529,'CIE6115','能源系統高級專題','','CIE - 计算机与信息工程','6115','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2019-20 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2','Students are expected to have basic proficiency in Python programming.','None.','本课程介绍用于分析和管理现代能源系统的高级建模、优化与数据驱动方法。主要内容包括优化理论、能源系统中的机器学习应用、电力市场与电网优化运行，以及太阳能、风能、生物质能、地热能和氢能等可再生与混合能源系统的设计与分析。学生将学习如何利用优化与预测技术，在不确定条件下提升能源系统的效率、灵活性与可持续性。课程强调跨学科融合，结合工程、经济与政策视角，培养学生在低碳与智能能源转型中的综合分析与创新能力。','This course introduces advanced modeling, optimization, and data-driven methods for analyzing and managing modern energy systems. Topics include optimization theory, machine learning for energy applications, electricity market and power grid operation, and the design of renewable and hybrid energy systems such as solar, wind, biomass, geothermal, and hydrogen. Students will learn how to apply optimization and forecasting techniques to improve system efficiency, flexibility, and sustainability under uncertainty. The course emphasizes interdisciplinary integration, linking engineering, economics, and policy perspectives to support the global transition toward low-carbon and intelligent energy systems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
