2024-25 Term 2','College physics and basic computer science','','本课程重点讲述纳米科技相关的基础和前沿问题，通过介绍最新的科技进展和学科热点，重点介绍人工智能和机器人技术在纳米科技领域相关杰出的代表性工作，帮助研究生在各自的科研中找到合理的研究途径和研究方法。本课程还包括介绍纳米科技领域主流科学家的学术历史，为从事纳米科技领域的研究生提供职业生涯方面的参考。','This course focuses on the basic and leading problems related to nanotechnology, by introducing the latest technological advances and academic hotspots, focusing on introducing artificial intelligence and robotics in the field of nanotechnology and the outstanding representative work in the field of nanotechnology, helping researchers find reasonable results in their own research Research methods and research methods。 This course also includes an introduction to the academic history of mainstream scientists in the nanotechnology field, and provides career reference for researchers engaged in the nanotechnology field.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
