STA 2001 Probability and Statistics I','N/A','本课程是面向理工科学生开设的课程，主要讲授包括计算机系统和通信网络在内的资源竞争系统的性能分析方法。本课程侧重于方法论和应用，其内容主要涵盖以下几个方面：马尔可夫链导论，离散时间马尔可夫链, 及其应用于计算机搜索引擎排序算法；联邦学习通信性能分析；最大似然估计理论，信息传递算法，及其应用于竞技打分排序系统和社交网络源检测。','This course provides science and engineering students with exposure to the basic concepts and analytical tools that are essential to construct or analyze models of resource contention systems, such as computer systems and communication networks. It is a course focusing on methodologies and applications, which include the following topics: Introduction to Markov chains, Discrete-time Markov chains and its applications in Google search engines, communication analysis in Federated Learning, Maximum Likelihood Estimation, Message Passing, and its application in ranking systems and rumor source detection in social network.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
