2025-26 Term 1','','','本课程旨在向理工科学生介绍基于现代CMOS工艺技术的模拟集成电路设计；同时通过在作业及课程项目中采用业界主流的EDA软件工具进行仿真，使修读学生掌握模拟集成电路的设计方法和流程。电路设计的具体内容包括：基础知识回顾，放大器设计，反馈分析，稳定性和频率补偿，电流源，带隙电压参考电路，线性调节器，数据转换器，和滤波器。','This course covers the design of analog integrated circuits using modern CMOS technology. Extensive circuit simulations will be made using EDA tools in the homework problems and the course project. Contents include: review of fundamentals, amplifier design, feedback analysis, stability and frequency compensation, current source, bandgap voltage reference, linear regulator, data converter, filter design.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
