EIE 3202 Analog Integrated Circuits','None.','本课程旨在向理工科学生介绍射频集成电路和系统的设计；同时，通过在作业及课程项目中采用业界主流的EDA软件工具进行仿真，使修读学生掌握模拟集成电路的设计方法和流程。具体内容包括：微波基本理论和概念（例如传输线，史密斯圆图，阻抗匹配，散射参数）;射频收发器系统架构；射频设备和电路（例如低噪声放大器，混频器，压控振荡器，锁相环，功率放大器）。','This course covers the design of RF integrated circuits and systems. Extensive circuit simulations will be made using EDA tools in the homework problems and the course project. Contents include: basic microwave theories and concepts (e.g. transmission line, smith chart, impedance matching, scattering-parameters); RF transceiver system architectures; RF devices and circuits (e.g. low-noise amplifiers, mixers, voltage-controlled oscillators, phase-locked loops, power amplifiers).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
