2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在为国际生提供入门水平的语言训练，包括听说读
写四个方面。课程内容将重点关注日常对话，话题包括拼音与汉字，问好，家人，时间，爱好，约时间，看朋友。通过多种形式的练习，学生可以运用基本的词汇和语法结构通过问答方式完成对话，收集简单的信息。学生可以运用所学汉字理解简单的文字内容，并对简单的个人信息等相关问题做出简要回应。
本课的教学对象为汉语零基础国际生。修读过任何高于入门级别汉语课程的学生，不允许选修本课。','This course aims to provide introductory level language training to international students through listening, speaking, reading and writing. The course content focuses on conversation in everyday settings. The topics include Introduction to Pinyin and Chinese Characters, Greetings, Family, Dates and Time, Hobbies, Making Appointments and Visiting. The provision of this course will enable students to participate in brief conversation with simple vocabulary and grammar structures and collect simple information through asking and answering questions. Through various kinds of exercises, students are expected to understand simple signs and general messages that contain familiar characters and give brief answers to simple questions closely related to their personal information with the characters they have acquired.
This course is designed for the students who don’t know Chinese at all. The students who have ever completed higher level of Chinese courses are not allowed to take this course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
