2026-27 Term 1','Students who have passed Intermediate level of Chinese proficiency test or have taken CLC1301 and obtained a Grade B or above are eligible to enroll in CLC1401.','N/A','本课程旨在为国际生提供高级汉语训练，同时满足汉语高级水平国际生对当代中国社会、文化、历史等方面知识的需求，使其有能力进行中国及汉语等方面相关研究。课程以专题内容为纲，借助教材、视频、音频等多种教学材料及方法，围绕社会生活、身心健康、中国文化，科技发展等话题展开教学，培养高级汉语语言能力的同时，训练及培养学生批判性思维的能力。本课程的课程对象为通过汉语中级水平测试的学生。
学生需参加统一的中文水平测试，以此确定课程的分班。','This Chinese course is designed to address the evolving needs of high-level learners seeking to deepen their understanding of contemporary China while improving their language proficiency. The curriculum develops the advanced linguistic skills necessary for critical engagement with China-related topics. Adopting a content-based approach, the course aims to bridge language acquisition and cultural knowledge through a variety of learning materials.
Students will develop advanced-level Chinese competency by exploring key themes in contemporary Chinese society, including topics on family, technology, social changes, health and culture.
Beyond conventional texts, the course is supplemented with authentic digital resources to cultivate advanced language proficiency while fostering critical thinking and intercultural skills.
Placement in this course is determined by a mandatory Chinese proficiency test.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
