2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程介绍计算机科学基本概念及使用 Java 语言的应用开发，无需学生具备相关先修背景。课程内容包括：1) 程序设计基本元素：变量、内置数据类型、基本运算、条件与循环语句、数组及输入/输出；2) 函数：模块化程序设计与函数库的使用；3) 面向对象程序设计：类、封装、继承等核心概念；4) 计算机科学基础：基础算法、递归、大O表示法及复杂度分析。','The course introduces basic concepts in computer science and application development using Java language, not assuming the previous related background of the students. Topics include: 1). elements of programming: variables, built-in data types, basic operations, conditionals and loops, arrays, and input/output. 2). functions: modular programming and libraries 3). object-oriented programming: classes, encapsulation, inheritance, etc. 4). basic concepts in computer science: some fundamental algorithms, recursion, the big-O notation, and complexity analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
