2021-22 Summer','No prerequisites, however this course would presume some basics of MAT2040.','','本课程介绍与计算机科学密切相关的，离散而非连续的数学概念与方法，强调证明及逻辑推理。内容包括：逻辑，证明方法，递归，初等数论，图论，计数方法等。','This course introduces the relevant mathematical concepts and techniques in computer science with emphasis on proofs and rigorous reasoning. Topics include: logics, methods of proofs, recursion, elementary number theory, graph theory, counting.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
