2025-26 Term 2','CSC3002 C/C++ Programming or CSC3200 Data Structures and Advanced P','','介绍计算机系统的主要组件，包括指令集架构 （ISA）、CPU 数据路径、控制单元设计、流水线、内存层次结构（缓存）、虚拟内存,外设接口和多处理器架构。本课程将以 RISC-V 架构作为参考。','Introduction of the major components of a computer system, including instruction set architecture (ISA), CPU datapath, control unit design, pipelining, memory hierarchy, peripheral interfaces, and multiprocessor architecture. RISC-V architecture will be used as a reference architecture.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100590,'CSC3060','计算机系统导论','Introduction to Computer Systems','CSC - Computer Science','3060','C',4.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','CSC 3200 Data Structures and Advanced Programming','','介绍计算机系统的主要组件，包括硬件、软件及其相互作用。本课程将涵盖计算机的基本概念，包括数据表示、数字逻辑和门电路、指令集架构 (ISA)、CPU 数据路径/控制单元设计、流水线、内存层次结构（缓存）、虚拟内存、外设接口、操作系统基础、系统软件如编译器和链接器, 和多处理器架构。本课程将以 RISC-V 架构作为参考。','Introduction of the major components of a computer system, including hardware, software, and their interactions. The course will cover basic concepts of computers, including data representation, digital logic and gates, instruction set architecture (ISA), CPU data path/control unit design, pipelining, memory hierarchy (caches), virtual memory, peripheral interfaces, OS fundamentals, system software such as compilers and linkers, and multiprocessor architectures. RISC-V architecture will be used as a reference throughout this course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
