AIE1001 Introduction to AI Programming','','本课程将介绍抽象数据类型的概念和数据抽象的优点。讨论各种常用的数据类型，包括数组、堆栈、队列、列表、树和图，以及它们的实现。此外，本课程还将介绍哈希表和堆等高级数据结构，并以排序和搜索为例简要介绍数据结构的应用和算法的复杂性分析。','The concept of abstract data types and the advantages of data abstraction are introduced. Various commonly used data types including array, stack, queue, list, tree, and graph, and their implementations will be discussed.  In addition, advanced data structures such as iterator and heap will be covered. Applications including basic sorting and searching methods are described to illustrate the use of data structures, together with the complexity analysis of the algorithms.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
