(100599,'CSC3120','程序设计语言原理','Programming Language','CSC - Computer Science','3120','C',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','CSC3200 Data Structures and Advanced Programming & CSC3001 Discrete Mathematics','','探讨程序设计语言的基本构件（作用域、控制流）与若干方面（语法、语义、类型），并涵盖语言设计中的特定选择与传统，如函数式编程与逻辑编程，及其相应能力（例如高阶函数、回溯）。','Exploring the building blocks (scoping, control flow) and aspects (syntax, semantics, types) of programming languages as well as specific choices and traditions in language design such as functional and logic programming along with their capabilities (e.g., higher order functions, backtracking).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

