(100601,'CSC3160','语音与语言处理基础','Fundamentals of Speech and Language Processing','CSC - Computer Science','3160','C',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
