2026-27 Term 1','CSC3100 or CSC3200','','此课程为数据库系统的入门。讨论的主题包括数据模型、关 系数据库、关系代数和SQL、E-R模型、数据库设计和规范 化、存储模型、索引和散列、查询执行和优化、事务管理、 分析处理、数据库日志和恢复。','This is an introductory course in database systems. Topics discussed include data models, relational database, relational algebra and SQL, E-R-model, database design and normalization, storage model, indexing and hashing, query execution and optimization, transaction management, analytic processing, database logging and recovery.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
