2024-25 Term 1','MAT2040 – Linear Algebra','','本课程的目的是学习基础多媒体概念。主题包括多媒体数据表示，多媒体数据压缩，JPEG和MPEG压缩标准，多媒体通信和系统。在课程中，学生将会学习各种多媒体技术的工作原理，并在应用中获得使用不同媒体的实践经验。','This course is to study the fundamental multimedia concepts. Topics include multimedia data representation and operation, multimedia data compression, JPEG and MPEG compression standards, multimedia communications, and multimedia system. In this course, students will learn the principles of multimedia technologies, and will gain hands-on experience in applying various medias in the application.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100605,'CSC3200','数据结构与高级程序设计','Data Structures and Advanced Programming','CSC - Computer Science','3200','C',4.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','CSC1001 Introduction to computer science: Programming Methodology','','本课程涵盖数据结构和数据结构的高级编程两个方面。它将介绍C++编程，涵盖函数与库，字符串与流，指针与内存动态管理，类和模版等。课程也将介绍抽象数据类型的概念以及抽象数据的优点。内容将涵盖如下通用抽象数据类型：向量/矩阵，列表，堆栈、队列，树、集合、哈希表和图等。重点强调如何利用C++中的高级编程技术如模版和迭代器去实现上述抽象数据类型.','The course focuses on the introduction of C/C++ language and various commonly used data types. Topics include C/C++ language basics, function and library, string and stream, pointer and dynamic memory management, class and template. Abstract data types such as array, linked list, stack, queue, tree, set，hashtable, graph and their implementations using C++ will be introduced in this class.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
