2025-26 Term 2','(CSC1003 or CSC1001 or CSC1005 or AIE1001);
(CSC3002 or CSC3200).','None','本课程旨在讲授软件工程的基本概念、知识框架和软件周期模型。

课程主要包括：软件过程、需求工程、系统建模、软件测试、程序分析等内容。课程同时简要讲授近年来热门的应用于软件工程场景的人工智能技术，与应用于人工智能软件的软件工程技术。

本课程假定学生已经具备了熟练使用一至两门程序设计语言，进行程序设计的能力。','The main goal of this course is to illustrate the basic concepts, knowledge framework, life cycle model of software engineering. The topics include software processes, requirement engineering, system modeling, software testing, program analysis, etc. The course also briefly introduces AI for SE and SE for AI techniques that are popular in recent years.This course assumes the students have acquired essential skills in software development with one to two programming languages.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
