CSC3100 Data Structure','NA','本课程介绍并行编程的概念，重点介绍共享内存并行编程。课程内容包括并行计算机架构、并行编程语言、并行编程工具、高效并行处理和内存局部性的并行数据结构设计、同步控制、负载平衡，以及并行编程在高性能计算和人工智能/机器学习中的实际应用。并行编程模型包括 Vector/SIMD、Pthread、OpenMP、OpenACC、MPI、CUDA/OpenCL 和 Triton。','This course introduces concepts of parallel programming, with a focus on shared-memory parallel programming. Topics include parallel computer architectures, parallel programming languages, parallel programming tools, parallel data structure designs for efficient parallel processing and memory locality, synchronization controls, load balancing and practical applications of  parallel programming to high performance computing and AI/Machine Learning. Parallel programming models include Vector/SIMD, Pthread, OpenMP, OpenACC, MPI, CUDA/OpenCL, and Triton.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
