(100612,'CSC4051','跨学科计算毕业设计','Computing Capstone for Interdisciplinary Studies','CSC - Computer Science','4051','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','实习','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','“跨学科计算毕业设计”是一门基于项目的课程，旨在将计算原理与跨学科项目相结合。学生将组成团队，运用各自的专业知识协作解决现实世界中的问题。课程内容包括项目规划、跨学科协作、计算技术、伦理考量以及有效展示等。通过完成本课程，学生将培养跨学科的问题解决能力，并获得将计算原理应用于复杂项目的实践经验。','The Computing Capstone for Interdisciplinary Studies is a project-based course that integrates computing principles with interdisciplinary projects. Students collaborate in interdisciplinary teams, applying their diverse expertise to solve real-world problems. Topics include project planning, interdisciplinary collaboration, computing techniques, ethical considerations, and effective presentation. By completing this course, students develop interdisciplinary problem-solving skills and gain practical experience in applying computing principles to complex projects.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
