(100614,'CSC4100','自然语言处理','Natural Language Processing','CSC - Computer Science','4100','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
