Advanced machine learning    CSC1001 Introduction to CS    CSC3100 Data Structures','DDA 4220 Deep learning     CSC4501 AI Enabled Speech Communicatio    CSC3160 Fundamentals of SLP    CSC6203 Selected Topics in CS (III)    CSC4100 Natural Language Processing    CSC6052 Natural Language Processing    CSC5051 Natural Language Processing','这门课程提供了自然语言处理（NLP）的全面学习。我们将深入研究词表示、语言模型、深度学习在NLP中的应用以及大型语言模型（LLMs）。具体来说，我们将讨论LLMs的架构工程、数据工程、提示工程、训练技术和效率增强。
学生将深入了解NLP和LLMs在各个领域的应用，如文本挖掘、搜索引擎、人机交互、医疗/法律/金融咨询、低资源语言、多模态和科学人工智能，以及如何处理数据隐私、偏见和伦理等问题。该课程还将探讨NLP和LLMs的局限性，如对齐中的挑战。
课程设置包括关于高级主题的客座讲座和课堂展示，以促进实际理解。这门课程适合任何希望在自己领域掌握NLP和LLMs使用的人。','This course offers a comprehensive study of Natural Language Processing (NLP). We will delve into word representations, language models, the application of deep learning in NLP, and Large Language Models (LLMs). Specifically, we will discuss the architectural engineering, data engineering, prompt engineering, training techniques, and efficiency enhancements of LLMs.
Students will gain insights into the application of NLP and LLMs in various domains, such as text mining, search engines, human-machine interaction, medical/legal/financial consulting, low-resource languages, multi-modality, and AI for Science, as well as how to handle issues of data privacy, bias, and ethics. The course will also investigate the limitations of NLP and LLMs, such as challenges in alignment.
The curriculum includes guest lectures on advanced topics and in-class presentations to stimulate practical understanding. This course is ideal for anyone seeking to master the use of NLP and LLMs in their field.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
