(100616,'CSC4118','信息论与统计学','','CSC - Computer Science','4118','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','MAT1001 Calculus I   
MAT1002 Calculus II     
MAT2040 Linear Algebra     
STA2001 Probability and Statistics I','STA2002 Probability and Statistics II    
STA2001H Honours Probability and Statis','本课程深入探讨信息论与统计学之间的紧密联系。两个领域虽然都以概率为基础进行信息处理，但各自提供了独特的视角与方法。课程伊始，我们将比较这两个学科在信息度量方面的主要概念，阐明其异同。随后，课程将系统介绍编码理论的基本数学原理及其在不同应用场景下的实践，作为信息论的核心内容之一。在此基础上，我们进一步探讨如何将编码理论应用于统计问题，特别是模型选择这一关键任务。最后，课程将结合实际案例，分析信息论与统计学的融合在机器学习中的应用，例如玻尔兹曼机（Boltzmann Machines）等模型。','This lecture delves into the synergistic relationship between information theory and statistics. Both disciplines are fundamentally concerned with probability-based information processing, yet offer distinct perspectives and tools. Initially, we will establish the connections between the core concepts of information quantity as defined within each field, highlighting their similarities and differences. Subsequently, the lecture will explore the mathematical theory of coding across diverse scenarios, a cornerstone of information theory, examining its principles and applications. Building upon this foundation, we will then investigate how coding theory can be applied to statistical problems, specifically focusing on the crucial task of model selection. Finally, we will examine the practical implications of this interplay in the realm of machine learning, with examples including Boltzmann Machines.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
