(100619,'CSC4124','图计算','','CSC - Computer Science','4124','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','data structure','','本课程探讨图论与图算法，重点关注图算法的原理及图计算的现代发展。内容包括图遍历、最短路径计算、中心性测量等经典方法。学生还将深入学习子图匹配、凝聚子图检测、图压缩以及并行和分布式图处理等高级主题。课程还介绍当代技术，如节点嵌入、图神经网络和图变换器，帮助学生解决复杂的实际问题。通过基于项目的学习，学生将掌握将图算法应用于现实场景的实践技能，加深对图计算理论与实践的理解。','This course explores graph data mining and algorithms, emphasizing algorithmic principles and modern advancements in graph computation. Topics include classical methods such as graph traversal, shortest path computation, and centrality measures. Students will also delve into advanced topics like subgraph matching, cohesive subgraph detection, graph compression, and parallel and distributed graph processing. The course introduces contemporary techniques, including node embeddings, graph neural networks, and graph transformers, enabling students to solve complex real-world problems. Through project-based learning, students will develop practical skills to apply graph algorithms to real-world applications, enhancing their understanding of both theory and practice in graph computing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
