(100635,'CSC4801','人工智能辅助软件工程','','CSC - Computer Science','4801','C',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','CSC3200 or CSC3100','','本课程关注人工智能辅助软件工程的原理及实践，让学生理解最新的人工智能技术，如大语言模型，代理式人工智能等，如何在提高软件工程的效率，产能和质量方面发挥作用。本课程专为有基础编程和软件开发基础知识的学生而设，课程内容包括：（1）现代人工智能的基本原理与底层机制；（2）代理式大语言模型的编程框架；（3）人工智能在需求分析、系统设计、代码生成、软件测试及部署运维等环节的前沿应用；（4）人工智能赋能的软件开发全链路实践。在实践环节，课程将侧重于实用性项目开发，引导学生亲身实践如何利用人工智能工具支持并完成软件生命周期的各个关键阶段。 此外，课程将定期邀请资深业界专家，分享最新技术趋势与工业级落地案例。期末将设立综合性课程大项目，模拟真实工业场景下的人工智能辅助的部署、测试及代码审查，全面提升学生的复杂系统开发与工程实战能力。','This course focuses on the principles and practices of AI-assisted software engineering, enabling students to understand how the latest AI technologies, such as large language models and agent-based AI, can improve the efficiency, productivity, and quality of software engineering. This course is designed for students with basic programming and software development knowledge. The course content includes: (1) the basic principles and underlying mechanisms of modern AI; (2) the programming framework of agent-based large language models; (3) cutting-edge applications of AI in requirements analysis, system design, code generation, software testing, deployment, and maintenance; and (4) the full-chain practice of AI-enabled software development. In the practical component, the course will focus on practical project development, guiding students to personally practice how to use AI tools to support and complete each key stage of the software lifecycle. In addition, the course will regularly invite senior industry experts to share the latest technological trends and industrial-grade implementation cases. At the end of the semester, a comprehensive course project will be established to simulate the deployment, testing, and code review of AI-assisted systems in real industrial scenarios, comprehensively improving students'' ability to develop complex systems and their engineering practice.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
