Besides, this course involves some basics of high-level programming languages (e.g., C/C++ and Java) for illustrating key concepts and algorithms. Students without learning any high-level programming language are not suggested to select this course.','N/A','本课程主要重点讨论高效算法的设计与分析，以及它们解决的实际应用问题。具体而言，本课程主要包括4个方面的主题：1）动态规划；2）数据结构；3）图论；4）其他算法，包括且不限于分治与递归、贪心、最小生成树， 最大流等。','This is an intermediate algorithms course with an emphasis on teaching techniques for the design and analysis of efficient algorithms, emphasizing methods of application. Specifically, the course mainly includes 4 groups of topics: 1) Dynamic Programming;  2)  Data  Structure;  3)  Graph  Theory;  4)  Other Algorithms including divide-and-conquer, greedy, MST, maximum flow, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
