Besides, this course is heavily based on coding with high-level programming languages (e.g., C/C++, or Python) for illustrating key concepts and algorithms. Students without learning any high-level programming language are not suggested to select this course.','N/A','本课程专注于工业级算法设计与实现，深入聚焦于解决现实场景中的复杂问题。所有教学内容均来源于全球领先公司的面试题，涵盖了从基础技能到高级思维的全面进阶路径。通过频繁的动手编码教学练习，课程引导学生将算法思维转化为工业级代码。课程的主要内容分为三部分：1) 基础数据结构；2) 经典算法范式；3) 其他常见的面试题类型。所有作业和考试均要求动手编程。','This course focuses on industrial-level algorithm design and implementation, deeply focusing on solving complex problems in real-world scenarios. All teaching content is derived from interview questions from world-leading companies, covering a comprehensive progression path from foundational skills to advanced thinking. Through frequent hands-on code-teaching exercises, the course guides students in translating algorithmic thinking into industrial-grade codes. The course''s main content is divided into three parts: 1) Basic Data Structures; 2) Classic Algorithm Paradigms; and 3) Other Common Interview Question Types. All assignments and exams require hands-on programming.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
