(100640,'CSC5031','操作系统','','CSC - Computer Science','5031','C',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No','No','这门课将介绍操作系统的4个核心，程序管理，记忆体管理，档案管理，以及输出入管理。根据学生注册人数，N，学生会分成 N/2 个组，会有 N/4 个 programming projects。每个progrmming project会有二组学生参与，做同一个 progrmming project 的二组，需要同一天报告他们的成果。从报告中，可以互相学习对方设计的有点，并改进自己设计缺点，达到教学相长的目的。','This course will present the core concepts of operating systems based on process management, memory management,file management,and I/O management. Students will be divided into groups. Each group contains 1-2 studnets. If the number of group is N,N/2 programming projects will be given based on the four managements. Each projects will have two groups to work on. They need to do the competition when presnet the project they work on in the class.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
