(100654,'CSC5150','计算毕业设计（一）','','CSC - Computer Science','5150','C',3.00,5000,'Major','Distinction/Pass/Failure','实习','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Basic knowledge in engineering mathematics, computer programming, algorithm design, computer system, computing theories, and artificial intelligence.','N.A','该课程旨在通过应用工程数学、计算机编程、算法设计、计算机系统、计算理论、人工智能等知识，开展实验学习，以识别和解决课堂教学之外的实际问题。通过体验式、自主式和团队学习的结合，它旨在帮助学生在行业环境中提升专业能力和转换学术知识，为学生开启职业生涯提供帮助。学生选修这门课程之前，应先找到一位导师；导师可以是香港中文大学（深圳）的教授，也可以是香港中文大学（深圳）以外的教授或工程师。','The course provides an opportunity for students to work with computing and information technology professionals to identify and solve practical problems beyond the classroom education. Through a combination of experiential, self-directed and team learning, it aims to help students develop professional competencies and convert academic knowledge in an industry setting, and therefore provides momentum that students can use to start their careers. To take this course, the student must secure a mentor, who may be either a professor from CUHK-Shenzhen or an external professor/engineer from outside the university.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100655,'CSC5151','Computing Capstone II','','CSC - Computer Science','5151','C',3.00,5000,'Major','Distinction/Pass/Failure','实习','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程是CSC5050的后续课程。这两门课程共同为学生提供一个持续两个学期的机会，与计算和信息技术专业人士合作，识别并解决课堂教育之外的实际问题。通过体验式、自主式和团队学习相结合的方式，旨在帮助学生培养专业能力，并将学术知识应用于实际工业环境中，从而为学生开启职业生涯提供动力。','The course follows CSC5050. Both courses together provide an opportunity, lasting two semesters, for students to work with computing and information technology professionals to identify and solve practical problems beyond the classroom education. Through a combination of experiential, self-directed and team learning, it aims to help students develop professional competencies and convert academic knowledge in an industry setting, and therefore provides momentum that students can use to start their careers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
