(100665,'CSC6042','高等数据库系统','','CSC - Computer Science','6042','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2023-24 Summer','An Introductory Course in Database Systems','Nil','这是数据库系统的高级课程。涵盖的主题包括高级索引和高级散列结构、数据库高级设计和更高规范化、效率性能分析和基准测试、文档检索和网络搜索、高级数据库恢复算法、数据仓库.数据挖掘、并行和分布式数据库。','This is an advanced course in database systems. Topics covered include advanced indexing and hashing structures, advanced normalization, database performance analysis and benchmarking, text retrieval and web search, advanced recovery algorithms, data warehouse, data mining, and parallel and distributed databases.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100666,'CSC6051','图像处理与计算机视觉','','CSC - Computer Science','6051','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
