Algorithms','N/A','如今，作为最常见的数字媒体形式，图像随处可见且非常容易获取，这使得图像处理和计算在各个领域的广泛应用中变得至关重要。此外，随着深度学习技术的快速发展，计算机视觉领域也引起了广泛关注。本课程将主要聚焦于图像处理和计算机视觉，涵盖该领域的多种课题，并介绍这些课题的传统方法和基于深度学习的前沿技术。相关课题将包括图像分类、分割、检测、增强、合成等。此外，本课程还将深入探讨3D表示以及3D信号处理技术的最新进展。','Nowadays, as the most common medium of digital media, images can be seen everywhere and are very easy to obtain, making image processing and computation essential in a wide range of applications across various fields. Moreover, with the rapid development of deep learning technology, the field of computer vision has attracted significant attention. This course will mainly focus on image processing and computer vision, covering various topics within the field and introducing both traditional methods and cutting-edge techniques based on deep learning. The topics will include image classification, segmentation, detection, enhancement, synthesis, etc. Additionally, the course will delve into 3D representations and the latest advancements in 3D signal processing technologies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100667,'CSC6052','自然语言处理','','CSC - Computer Science','6052','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程全面介绍自然语言处理，重点介绍基本概念和技术，以及自然语言处理中的不同任务。 本课程的主题包括但不限于：自然语言处理的数学基础、信息论、文本表示、分词和标记化、词性标注、句法和语义解析、命名实体识别、关系和事件提取 、共指解析、情感分析、阅读理解、关键短语提取与生成、摘要、对话系统、机器翻译等。期望学生学习该领域的最新研究进展，了解必要的技术以及任务和 使用适当的算法/模型来完成课程项目。','This course provides a comprehensive introduction to natural language processing, focusing on fundamental concepts and techniques, as well as different tasks in natural language processing. Topics of this course include, but are not limited to: mathematical foundation for natural language processing, information theory, text representation, word segmentation and tokenization, part-of-speech tagging, syntactic and semantic parsing, named entity recognition, relation and event extraction, coreference resolution, sentiment analysis, reading comprehension, key-phrase extraction and generation, summarization, dialogue system, machine translation, etc. Students are expected to learn the latest research progress in this area and understand the necessary techniques as well as the tasks and use appropriate algorithms/models to finish a course project.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
