(100670,'CSC6103','虚拟化技术','','CSC - Computer Science','6103','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','No','No','在本课程中，将详细介绍用于 CPU、内存和 I/O 的虚拟化技术。 还将给出一些通过或使用虚拟化技术开发的系统，例如 KVM 和 Docker 系统。 学生将被要求为嵌入式处理器设计 VM 或 Docker，作为他们的最终编程项目。','In this course, the virtualization techniques used for CPU, memory, and I/O will be described in some details. Some systems developed by or using virtualization techniques will be given as well, for example, the KVM and Docker systems. Students will be asked to design VMs or Dockers for embedded processors as their final programming projects.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
