(100672,'CSC6105','计算机与网络安全','','CSC - Computer Science','6105','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','',NULL,'•	Graduate standing (MSc, MPhil, PhD student)
•	Good understanding of Operating Systems & Computer Networks (at the undergraduate level) is important','N/A','本课程旨在从应用的角度介绍计算机和网络安全的重要主题。 主题包括：(i) 应用密码学（例如，密码原语、使用 OpenSSL 编程），(ii) 网络安全（例如，未经授权的访问、大规模网络攻击、防火墙和入侵检测系统），(iii) 网络安全（例如 、HTTP 会话管理和 Web 攻击），以及 (iv) 系统安全（例如，缓冲区溢出、密码、文件系统安全），以及 (v) 无线安全（例如，WiFi 安全、无线宽带网络安全）。 该课程还根据当前的研究趋势讨论最新的应用安全主题。','This course aims to introduce important topics in computer and network security from an applied perspective. Topics include: (i) applied cryptography (e.g., cryptographic primitives, programming with OpenSSL), (ii) network security (e.g., unauthorized accesses, large-scale network attacks, firewall & intrusion detection systems), (iii) web security (e.g., HTTP session management and web attacks), and (iv) system security (e.g., buffer overflow, passwords, file system security), and (v) wireless security (e.g., WiFi security, wireless broadband network security). The course also discusses latest applied security topics according to the current research trends.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
