2026-27 Term 1','Students are required to have some basic programming skills. Knowledge of Unix/Linux and Python will be helpful.','N/A','本课程涵盖云计算原理、云系统架构、虚拟化技术、云服务、大数据分析、云编程工具包以及特定的云应用。我们将研究一些公有云或私有云及应用工具，例如建立在港中大（深圳）校园内的 AIRS 云平台、亚马逊 AWS 以及阿里云等。课程将介绍云编程工具，并重点探讨现有云、移动边缘云、机器学习与人工智能（AI）之间的交互。','Topics covered include principles of cloud computing, cloud systems architecture, virtualization techniques, cloud services, big data analytics, cloud programming toolkits, and specific cloud applications. We will study some public or private clouds and application tools: such as the AIRS cloud built on CUHK-SZ campus, Amazon AWS, and Aliyun, etc. Cloud programming tools are introduced. We emphasize the interactions between existing clouds, mobile edge clouds, machine learning, and artificial intelligence (AI).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
