CSC-3050 Computer Architecture
CSC-3100 Data Structure','NA','本課程介紹並行程式設計的概念。主題包括平行電腦體系結構、平行程式語言、平行程式設計工具、用於高效並行處理的資料結構設計、同步控制,以及將平行计算應用於高效能運算和人工智慧/機器學習。使用的平行語言包括 Pthread、OpenMP、MPI、OpenMP、OpenACC、Cuda、Triton 和向量內在函數。','This course introduces concepts of parallel programming. Topics include parallel computer architectures, parallel programming languages, parallel programming tools, data structure designs for efficient parallel processing, synchronization controls, and applying parallel programming to high performance computing and AI/Machine Learning. Parallel languages used include Pthread, OpenMP, MPI, OpenMP, OpenACC, Cuda, Triton, and vector intrinsic.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100683,'CSC6116','计算机图形学','','CSC - Computer Science','6116','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1','MAT1001 or MAT1011, MAT1002 or MAT1012, MAT2040, CSC3100','','本课程主要涵盖计算机图形学的四个部分：光栅化、曲线和网格、光线跟踪、动画/模拟。具体来说，它包括变换、照明、着色、管线、纹理映射、几何、光传输、采样、材质、光线跟踪、光学、相机、AR/VR等。
课程结束后，学生应了解现代计算机图形学的基础知识和实践技能，并能够编写自己的实时渲染程序。','This course covers mainly four parts of computer graphics: rasterization, curves and meshes, ray tracing, animation/simulation. Specifically,  it covers transformation, illumination, shading, pipeline, texture mapping, geometry, light transport, sampling, material, ray tracing, optics, cameras, animation and etc.
After the course, the students are expected to understand the fundamentals and have practical skills in modern computer graphics and able to write your own realtime rendering program.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
