(100699,'CSC6133','用于计算机视觉的深度学习','','CSC - Computer Science','6133','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','Remark:
- Basic knowledge of linear algebra and calculus is required.
- Proficiency in Python programming is required.
- Familiarity with general machine learning concepts is assumed and strongly recommended.
- Familiarity with PyTorch or an equivalent deep learning framework is strongly recommended.','','本课程介绍计算机视觉领域的核心思想和现代技术，重点强调深度学习在视觉理解中的方法与应用。课程内容涵盖图像分类、目标检测等基础任务，以及自监督学习、扩散模型、三维重建、视频分析和视觉–语言多模态系统等前沿方向。通过本课程，学生将系统理解计算机视觉的重要研究问题，并掌握利用深度学习构建有效视觉模型以解决实际任务的能力。','This course introduces the core ideas and modern techniques in computer vision, with a strong emphasis on deep learning methods that enable computers to process and understand visual information. Topics range from image classification and object detection to self-supervised learning, diffusion models, 3D reconstruction, video analysis, and multimodal vision–language systems. Students will develop a solid understanding of key research challenges in computer vision and learn to build effective deep learning models for real-world visual tasks.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
