2025-26 Term 2','No specific course. Undergraduate level background in Operating Systems and Computer Networks and programming experience.','None','计算机应用的高阶主题。','Selected Topics in Computer Security and Privacy. Introduction and overview (security of software, networks, and systems in general, including attacks and countermeasures). Review of applied cryptography. Security and privacy issues in modern, distributed computer systems (Cloud, edge, network function virtualization, blockchains, supply-chains, multi-agent systems). Modern digital identity issues: Decentralized Identifiers (DIDs), Verifiable Credentials, identity wallets; revocation. Privacy technologies, including Zero-Knowledge Proofs and practical considerations, such as use of secure elements and enclaves in mobile devices.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100711,'CSC6203','计算机专题（三）','','CSC - Computer Science','6203','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
