(100761,'CSS6010','调查实验','','CSS - Computational Social Science','6010','C',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程讲授调查研究的原则，包括抽样、问卷设计、调查质量控制和访谈技巧。课程还将介绍实验研究的基本内容以及如何在民意调查中加入实验。','This course teaches the principles of survey research, including sampling, questionnaire design, survey quality control and interview techniques. It will also introduce the basic components of experimental research and how to imbed experiments in public opinion surveys.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
