2025-26 Term 2','(CSC1001 or CSC1003 or CSC1005 or AIE1001); (MAT1001 or MAT1011 or MAT1010)','','本课程是数据科学的入门级课程。分为四个部分，将依次讲解概率，统计，优化，和机器学习的基础知识。这门课将辅以大量实例，从具体例子出发讲述核心内容和思想，从而激发学生的兴趣和学习热情。','This course is to provide a comprehensive introduction to data science. Topics will include probability, statistics, optimization, and machine learning. These four topics will be taught in the above-mentioned order. For each topic, we selectively choose the content to fit the first-year undergraduate students'' background.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100776,'DDA2010','应用机器学习','','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','2010','D',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','None.','None.','本课程为文科学生提供机器学习的基本介绍，没有任何数学或者编程方面先导课程的要求。本课程的目标是
i.	介绍回归（函数估计），分类，聚类，降维，神经网络等基本机器学习方法;
ii.	展示如何利用基于Python机器学习工具库和AI助手，有效地应用机器学习技术解决应用中出现的相关问题。
然而，本课程将
i.	不涉及机器学习方法背后的技术细节，例如数学、优化算法和理论性质，
ii.	重点培养学生利用Python机器学习工具库中的函数，通过AI助手编写简单代码，或修改现有代码，解决应用中出现的相关问题的能力。','This course provides a fundamental introduction to machine learning for students of arts, without any prerequisite courses in math and programming. The goal of this course is to
i.	introduce fundamental machine learning methods for regression (function estimation), classification, clustering, dimensionality reduction, and neural networks;
ii.	show how to apply the corresponding machine learning libraries in Python and AI agents, and demonstrate applying these machine learning techniques is effective for solving various kinds of problems arising from applications in humanities and social science, management and economics, medicine, and etc.
However, this course 
i.	will not go into the technical details behind machine learning methods, e.g., the math, optimization algorithms and theoretical properties;
ii.	focus on training students to gain the capability to use AI agents to write simple codes or make modifications on existing codes by utilizing the functions in machine learning libraries in Python to solve relevant problems arising from applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
