MAT2040 or MAT2041;
CSC3002 or CSC2003.','','本课程介绍各种可视化算法和工具。这些算法和工具可以用于分析和可视化数据。学生将获得视觉设计和可视分析的理论知识。此外，学生将学习如何利用现有的编程工具（D3）来可视化和分析各种数据类型。主题将包括数据和任务模
型、交互技术、网络和树可视化、高维数据可视化、体数据可视化、流数据可视化等。学生将通过多次可视化设计和编程作业，以及一个团队项目来理解不同数据的可视化和分析方法。','This course introduces visualization techniques and tools for analyzing and visualizing data. Students will gain theoretical knowledge of visual design  and analysis. In addition, students will learn to visualize and analyze various data types through visualization and interaction tools (i.e., D3). Topics will include data and task models, interaction techniques, graph and tree visualization, high-dimensional data visualization, volume visualization, flow visualization, etc. Students will work on multiple design and programming assignments and one group project to gain solid understanding on visualizing and analyzing different data types.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100781,'DDA3005','数值方法','Numerical Methods','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','3005','D',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
