2026-27 Term 1','(CSC1001 or CSC1003 or CSC1005 or AIE1001) and (CSC1002 or CSC1004 or CSC1006) and (STA2001 or STA2003 or ECO2121 or STA2001H)','None.','本课程是一门机器学习基础课程，介绍机器学习的主要概念、方法与应用。学生将学习如何基于多样化数据构建计算模型，用于预测、分类、表示学习和模式发现。课程内容包括线性回归、逻辑回归、支持向量机、核方法和决策树等经典方法；卷积神经网络、循环神经网络、Transformer 和大语言模型等深度学习模型；以及降维、聚类、密度估计和自监督学习等无监督学习方法。课程还将介绍数据预处理、模型评估、过拟合与泛化等重要内容。','This fundamental course introduces the main concepts, methods, and applications of machine learning. Students will learn how to develop computational models from diverse data for prediction, classification, representation, and pattern discovery. Topics include classical methods such as linear regression, logistic regression, support vector machines, kernel methods, and decision trees; deep learning models such as CNNs, RNNs, transformers, and large language models; and unsupervised learning methods such as dimensionality reduction, clustering, density estimation, and self-supervised learning. The course also covers data preprocessing, model evaluation, overfitting, and generalization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100783,'DDA3020H','机器学习荣誉课程','Honours Machine Learning','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','3020H','D',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','(CSC1001 or  CSC1003  or  CSC1005  or  AIE1001)
and (CSC1002 or CSC 1004 or CSC 1006)
and (STA2001 or STA 2003 or STA 2001H or ECO 2121)
and (MAT2040 or MAT2041A or MAT2041 or MAT2042)','','本课程为机器学习入门基础课程，旨在系统介绍机器学习的核心概念与方法。学生将首先学习机器学习的理论基础，包括模型构建、模型训练、特征提取等内容；随后在真实大规模数据上进行实践，掌握可扩展的机器学习技术与工具。课程内容涵盖监督学习、无监督学习以及神经网络等主要内容。通过课程实践环节，学生将能够将理论知识应用到实际问题中，提升数据分析与模型开发的综合能力。','This fundamental course introduces the core concepts of machine learning, combining theoretical foundations—such as models, training processes, and evaluation methods—with hands-on experience applying scalable machine learning techniques to real-world data. Topics include supervised learning, neural networks, and unsupervised learning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100784,'DDA3600','因子投资','Factor Investing','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','3600','D',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','STA2001 Probability and Statistics I
MAT2040 Linear Algebra

Basic knowledge of finance and investment is beneficial.
Familiarity with Python (assignments will require coding with Python).','None','这门课程将通过计量经济学和机器学习的视角探索因子投资的理论和实践。课程核心内容包括因子投资的基础概念、投资组合排序、横截面和时间序列回归，以及多重假设检验。课程还涉及高级机器学习模型、另类数据，以及诸如因子择时和因子配置等因子投资实践问题。鉴于授课教师在量化对冲基金行业的丰富经验，本课程会强调实际操作和应用。课程结束时，学生将具备进行实证研究、开发和回测基于因子的量化策略，以及在专业金融行业中践行因子投资的能力。','This course offers a thorough exploration of factor investing, blending econometrics and machine learning. Key topics include foundational concepts of factor investing, portfolio sorting, cross-sectional and time-series regression methods, and multiple hypothesis testing. The course also covers advanced machine learning models, integrating alternative data sources, and addressing practical challenges such as factor timing and allocation. Drawing on the instructor’s extensive experience in the quantitative hedge fund industry, the course emphasizes real-world practice and application. By course end, students will be prepared to conduct empirical research, develop and backtest factor-based strategies, and apply factor investing principles in professional settings.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
