2026-27 Term 1','CSC1001, STA 2001 or STA 2003, STA 2002 or STA 2004, STA 4001','','本課程介紹隨機模擬的基本方法，以及隨機模擬在工業生產、服務和金融等領域的數據分析與決策問題中的應用。除了隨機模擬的基礎知識，學生將學習如何將具體的運營系統轉換為模擬模型、並用計算機程序實現模擬實驗。教學內容包括：靜態與動態模擬、數據驅動模擬、對模擬結果的統計分析、模擬實驗設計和基於模擬技術的優化方法。','This course introduces the basic stochastic simulation techniques and how to use them to solve data and decision analytics problems in application domains such as manufacturing, service and finance. Students will learn the basic pipelines of simulation and also how to formulate real operation systems into suitable simulation models, and how to use computer code to implement simulation experiments. Topics include static and dynamic simulation, simulation with spreadsheets, statistical analysis of simulation results, experiment design and simulation optimization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100786,'DDA4007','优化建模与应用','','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','4007','D',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','MAT3007 Optimization      STAT2001 Basic Con in Stat & Prob I','','本课程旨在培养学生将复杂的现实问题转化为数学优化模型的能力，并使用优化求解器进行求解。课程兼顾优化模型构建与动手实践，课程融合了线性规划、整数规划、网络优化、非线性规划、随机优化以及鲁棒优化等内容，并结合物流、生产、排班、交通、医疗、能源系统等实际案例进行讲解与训练。通过本课程的学习，学生将掌握优化模型的设计、建模与计算求解能力，为后续的科研项目、毕业设计以及数学建模竞赛打下坚实基础。','This course trains students to translate complex real-world problems into mathematical optimization models and implement these models using modern optimization solvers. Emphasizing both formulation and hands-on implementation, the course integrates linear, integer, network, nonlinear, stochastic, and robust optimization with practical case studies from logistics, production, scheduling, transportation, healthcare, power systems and more. Students will gain the ability to design, formulate, and solve models computationally, preparing them for research projects, capstone work, and mathematical modeling competitions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
