STA2002 or STA2002H Probability and Statistics II','None','本課程介紹基本的貝葉斯方法。 首先介紹了常用的分佈及其相應的共軛先驗。 對於復雜的模型和先驗，學生將學習在 R 中應用馬爾可夫鏈蒙特卡羅算法進行後驗推理。 貝葉斯方法的一些應用將涉及解決現實世界的問題，包括貝葉斯回歸、層次模型和潛在變量模型。','This course introduces fundamental Bayesian methodology. It first presents commonly used distributions and their corresponding conjugate priors. For sophisticated models and priors, students will learn to apply Markov Chain Monte Carlo algorithms in R for posterior inference. Some applications of Bayesian methods will be involved to solve real-world problems, including Bayesian regression, hierarchical models and latent variable models.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
