力。 学生将在真实的商业环境中开发解决方案并展示结果和建议。','The registered students will work in a corporate/institution for some cumulative working hours within a maximum of 12-month span. They are expected to work under the guidance of a Supervisor and possibly other colleagues employed at the company. Internships may be arranged through the SDS or Campus Career Centers, or by the student.

