Remark: Proficiency in Python is a must
Bonus:
1.	Have taken courses or done projects in computer vision / natural language processing
2.	Familiar with modern deep learning libraries such as PyTorch and TensorFlow','N/A','深度学习与应用是一门旨在帮助学生系统掌握深度学习基础知识及其关键应用的课程。课程首先介绍核心主题，包括神经网络架构、训练目标、优化方法、正则化技术，以及相关的经验准则和常见工程实践。随后，课程将深入探讨深度学习在多种设置中的应用，包括有监督学习、自监督与无监督学习、以及强化学习。课程还将涵盖深度学习在计算机视觉和自然语言处理等领域的应用。如时间允许，还将介绍若干前沿专题。学生将通过实践项目，掌握经典深度学习方法，并熟悉主流深度学习框架，如PyTorch和TensorFlow。','Deep Learning and Applications is a course designed to provide a foundational understanding of deep learning and its key applications. The course begins with core topics such as neural network architectures, training objectives, optimization techniques, and regularization methods, along with empirical properties and common engineering practices. It then explores deep learning in various settings, including supervised learning, self-supervised and unsupervised learning, and reinforcement learning. Applications in computer vision and natural language processing will be discussed. If time permits, advanced topics may also be introduced. Students will complete hands-on projects to gain practical experience with classical deep learning methods and to become familiar with widely used frameworks such as PyTorch and TensorFlow.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
