臂老虎機、有限馬爾可夫決策、動態規劃、蒙特卡洛法、時間-差分學習、PG算法、Q算法、actor-critic算法、off-policy算法、以及近似算法簡介。','This course provides a basic introduction to reinforcement learning algorithms and their applications. Topics include multi-armed bandits; finite Markov decision processes; dynamic programming; Monte-Carlo    methods; temporal-difference learning; actor-critic methods; off-policy learning; introduction to deep variants of the aforementioned algorithms, including deep Q-learning, policy gradient methods, and actor-critic methods.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
