MAT2040 Linear Algebra','None.','本课程为深度学习理论提供数学基础。具体而言，本课程涵盖深度监督学习的入门知识、深度人工神经网络（ANN）的不同架构（包括全连接前馈ANN、卷积ANN、残差ANN和循环ANN）、ANN上的微积分运算、ANN的近似结果，以及通过梯度下降（GD）优化方法训练ANN的入门知识。','This course provides a mathematical introduction to the theory of deep learning. In particular, this course covers an introduction to deep supervised learning, different architectures of deep artificial neural networks (ANNs) (including fully-connected feedforward ANNs, convolutional ANNs, residual ANNs, and recurrent ANNs), calculus operations on ANNs, approximation results for ANNs, as well as an introduction to the training of ANNs by means of gradient descent (GD) optimization methods.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100797,'DDA4260','数据科学之应用：生活中的网络','Networked Life','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','4260','D',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1','Any basic course in linear algebra and probability.','','我们的生活和工作与个人和物理设备的网络相连。 这种网络化的互动可以获得巨大的经济效益，并引发了关于为什么这项技术能够成功运作和如此良好扩展的基本问题。 来自这些领域的研究人员都在努力量化和解释我们周围世界日益增长的复杂性和连通性，并且在推理新的社会、经济和技术网络的过程中，他们已经开始发展一门丰富的新科学。 本课程将通过实际应用激发学生对这些系统的概述和对关键思想的基本理解。 它将介绍适用于各种情况的数学和经济学中的各种工具和建模概念，旨在提供真正的跨学科学习体验。','We live and work being connected to networks of individuals and physical devises. This networked interaction allows to reap huge economic benefits and raises fundamental questions about why this technology works successfully and scales so well. Researchers from these areas all strive to quantify and explain the growing complexity and connectivity of the world around us, and they have begun to develop a rich new science along the way to reason about the new social, economic and technological networks. The course will motivate the student through actual applications to enable both an overview of these systems and a fundamental understanding of the key ideas. It will introduce the various tools and modeling concepts from mathematics and economics that apply in each situation, targeting at a truly interdisciplinary learning experience.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100798,'DDA4300','数据科学，机器学习和AI中的优化','','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','4300','D',1.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MAT3007 or MAT3007H; MAT2040 or MAT2041 or MAT2041A or MAT2042
Students are already familiar with basic and entry-level optimization models, theories, and tools, such as Matlab, Python, etc.','','本课程将介绍机器学习，数据科学和AI中多种常见的优化模型/理论/算法，包括线性/线性，凸/非凸，离线/在线优化以及在大模型预训练/微调/推理，商业/金融分析，运营管理中的应用。','This course will discuss computational optimization/game models/theories/algorithms for solving linear/nonlinear, convex/nonconvex, offline/online optimization/game problems in Data Science, Machine/Reinforcement Learning, LLM Training/Tuning/Inferencing, Business/Finance Analytics, and Operations Management.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100799,'DDA4302','多臂老虎机和在线算法','','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','4302','D',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1','Deep familiarity with probability theory and statistics, as well as some exposure to game theory and mechanism design, would help but are not required. Familiarity with programming languages is not required.','','这门课程涵盖在线学习的概念、理论和算法，重点探讨多臂老虎机问题的多种形式，包括随机/对抗/马尔可夫老虎机、上下文老虎机、信息理论下界以及马尔可夫决策过程（MDPs）。此外，课程还涉及其他在线学习形式，如在线凸优化、先知不等式以及竞争比分析。','This course covers the concepts, theory, and algorithms of online learning, focusing on various formulations of multi-armed bandit problems, such as stochastic/adversarial/Markovian bandits, contextual bandit, information theoretical lower bound, and MDPs. It also covers other online learning formulations, such as online convex optimization, prophet inequality and the analysis of competitive ratios.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

