库存控制模型，
无限期动态规划（Infinite-horizon DP），
近似动态规划（ADP）','This course covers optimization-and-learning methods for operations models, centered on Markov decision processes (MDPs) and structural policies (especially in inventory systems).
Scope note: We cover MDP foundations, structured policies, inventory control, infinite-horizon DP, and approximate dynamic programming (ADP).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
