2026-27 Term 1','Linear algebra (matrix analysis). Multi-variable calculus. Some programming skills.','','本课程涵盖了连续最优化问题的基本理论和算法。内容包括最优条件，梯度法，牛顿法，凸集与凸函数，对偶理论，以及先进一阶算法等。将介绍一些最优化的应用，比如在数据科学中的应用。课程还需要通过在计算机上实现算法以解决问题。','This course covers basic theory and algorithms for unconstrained and constrained optimization problems, convex and non-convex optimization problems, optimality conditions including duality theory. Algorithms include basic first-order and second-order methods.  Some applications of optimization, such as those in data science, will be introduced.  The course also requires algorithm implementation and problem solving on computers.
Students should have taken the courses of Linear algebra (matrix analysis) and Multi-variable calculus. Students should also be familiar with MATLAB, Python, or other appropriate programming languages.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
