2026-27 Term 1','Calculus-based elementary probability and mathematical statistics, proof-based advanced calculus (or mathematical analysis) or real analysis.','N/A','测度论：概率空间、随机变量、概率分布、积分、Fubini 定理、 Lebesgue 界定收敛定理; 条件期望；随机变量不同收敛方式；弱和强大数定理、Borel-Cantelli 引理；特征函数和中心极限定理；鞅及 其收敛定理；对布朗运动和随机游走的应用。','Mesure theory: probability space, random variables, probability distributions, integration, Fubini’s theorem, Lebesgue’s dominated convergence theorem, conditional expectation; Various modes of convergence;  weak  and strong laws of large numbers,  Borel-Cantelli lemmas; Characteristic functions and central limit theorems; Martingales and convergence theorems; Applications to Brownian motions and random walks.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
