(100824,'DDA6111','离散优化','','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','6111','D',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本研究生课程介绍整数规划与混合整数规划的理论、建模方法和算法。课程内容包括经典建模方法、 多面体理论基础、有效不等式、割平面方法、分支定界、分支割平面、分解方法、固定维数算法以及现代凸松弛方法。','This graduate course introduces the theory, modeling, and algorithms of integer and mixed-integer programming. It covers classical formulations, polyhedral foundations, valid inequalities, cutting planes, branch-and-bound, branch-and-cut, decomposition methods, fixed-dimension algorithms, and modern convex relaxations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100825,'DDA6112','随机优化','','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','6112','D',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1','DDA6010 Optimization Theory and Algori','','随机优化是用于不确定性环境下决策建模与求解的基本工具。由于随机优化问题在计算上具有挑战性，我们将特别关注用于处理两阶段和多阶段随机规划、随机整数规划以及具有概率约束的优化问题的求解方法。我们将通过经典示例（如报童问题）以及更现实复杂的案例（如水电调度问题）来探讨这些模型的应用。除了实际求解方法外，课程还将涵盖理论基础，如样本平均近似方法以及各类风险度量在不确定性决策中的作用。','Stochastic optimization (SO) is a fundamental modeling and solution tool for decision making under uncertainty. As SO problems are computationally challenging, we put a special focus on solution methods for tackling two-stage and multi-stage stochastic programs, stochastic integer programs, and optimization problems with probabilistic constraints. Applications of these models will be explored through classical examples, such as the newsvendor problem, as well as more realistic and complex cases, such as hydropower generation scheduling. In addition to practical implementation, the course will also cover theoretical foundations such as sample average approximation and the role of various risk measures.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
