(100832,'DDA6206','深度学习专题','','DDA - Data and Decision Analytics','6206','D',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
