2025-26 Term 1','MAT1001 Calculus I or MAT1003 Analysis I;
MAT1002 Calculus II or MAT1004 Analysis II;
MAT2040 Linear Algebra;
STA2001 Probability and Statistics I;
Measure theory','None','本课程将探讨深度学习领域中的若干精选数学主题。具体而言，本课程涵盖深度监督学习的入门知识、深度人工神经网络（ANN）的基础理论、基于梯度流的优化方法、确定性梯度下降（GD）、 以及随机梯度下降（SGD），基于梯度的优化方法在强凸优化问题中的收敛性分析，以及在深度ANN训练中基于梯度的优化方法的收敛性分析，采用Kurdyka–Łojasiewicz（KL）不等式理论。本课程旨在为计划从事深度学习理论及相关领域研究的博士生和研究生提供基础性介绍。','This course treats several selected mathematical topics in the field of deep learning. In particular, this course covers an introduction to deep supervised learning, basics on deep artificial neural networks (ANNs), optimization with gradient flows, deterministic gradient descent (GD), and stochastic gradient descent (SGD), convergence analyses for gradient based optimization methods applied to strongly convex optimization problems, as well as convergence analyses for gradient based optimization methods in the training of deep ANNs using the theory of Kurdyka–Łojasiewicz (KL) inequalities. This course aims to provide an introduction for PhD and graduate students who intend to do research on the theory of deep learning and related topics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
