2026-27 Term 1','ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H)','','运营管理涉及对与产品和服务生产、交付相关的各项活动进行规划与协调。高效的运营管理是各行业取得成功的关键决定因素之一。实现卓越运营是提升效率、获得竞争优势的核心战略。本课程旨在向学生介绍企业运营职能中的基本概念、主要挑战与战略方法，并结合定性与定量方法，帮助学生掌握进行运营决策所需的分析工具。','Operations Management (OM) involves planning and coordinating all activities related to the production and delivery of goods and services. Effective OM is a critical determinant of success across various industries. Achieving operational excellence is a core strategy for enhancing efficiency and gaining a competitive edge. This course aims to introduce students to the fundamental concepts, challenges, and strategic approaches within the operations function of a firm. It integrates both qualitative and quantitative methods to equip students with the analytical tools necessary for informed decision-making in operations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
