2025-26 Term 2','ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H)','','数据分析和决策制定使用经济理论，数学和统计推断等工具来分析经济现象和它们之间的关系，并通过决策过程进一步提供商业洞见。','Data analytics and decision making is concerned with using aspects of economic theory, mathematics, statistical inference, and optimization to analyze economic phenomena and relationships and to further give business insights through decision making process.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
