2023-24 Summer','No.','No. Open to all students, except students from GSCLM program.','本课程从构成全球贸易主要部分的消费领域切入，旨在研究和讨论供应链管理的当代创新。在全渠道零售的时代背景和“一带一路”、粤港澳大湾区等热点话题下，本课程将从实际的角度探讨行业最佳实践，拓宽学生的知识面，为其在全球贸易、物流、电子商务和消费部门供应链管理方面的职业生涯做准备。','This course aims to investigate contemporary innovations in supply chain management in the consumer sector which constitutes a major part of global trade. With the contemporary backdrop of omni-channel retail and heated topics like the Belt and Road Initiatives and Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area, this course will discuss from a practical perspective the best practices in the industry, and broaden the knowledge of attendants in preparation for careers in global trade, logistics, E-commerce and consumer sector supply chain management.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
