2026-27 Term 1','','ECE2001 Basic Circuit Theory','本课程通过一系列的电子线路实验强化学生对电路电子学理论的认识。这些实验的目的允许学生验证基本的直流电路原理、理解RLC正弦交流电路、设计一阶与二阶无源与有源滤波器、各种运算放大器与晶体管电路。','This course aims to strengthen the concepts of basic circuit theory by carrying out a series of lab experiments. This involves experiments that allow students to verify principles of basic DC circuits, understand the sinusoidal RLC AC circuits, design first and second order passive and active filters and various Op Amp and transistor circuits.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100901,'ECE1811','电子线路设计实验荣誉课程','Honours Electronic Circuit Design Laboratory','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','1811','E',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','ECE2001 Basic Circuit Theory','本课程将人工智能技术与电子线路实验深度融合，构建智能化的实验教学体系。课程覆盖基础电路分析（如直流电路、RLC正弦交流电路）、动态系统（如一阶与二阶无源/有源滤波器）、以及非线性器件（如运算放大器与晶体管电路）。实验中引入多类机器学习算法：利用回归方法实现电路测量数据的自动拟合与异常检测；采用优化算法对等效电路参数进行智能匹配；结合信号处理技术开展动态系统的波形识别与性能优化等。课程强调理论与实践结合，旨在提升学生运用人工智能算法实现电路数据分析、故障诊断和参数优化的能力。','This course deeply integrates artificial intelligence technologies with electronic circuit experiments to establish an intelligent experimental teaching framework. The curriculum covers fundamental circuit analysis (e.g., DC circuits, RLC AC circuits), dynamic systems (e.g., first-order and second-order passive/active filters), and nonlinear devices (e.g., operational amplifiers and transistor circuits). The experiment systematically incorporates various machine learning algorithms: employing regression methods for automated curve fitting and anomaly detection of circuit measurement data; utilizing optimization algorithms for intelligent parameter matching of equivalent circuits; and combining signal processing techniques for waveform recognition and performance optimization of dynamic systems. The course emphasizes the integration of theory and practice, aiming to equip students with the ability to use artificial intelligence algorithms for circuit data analysis, fault diagnosis, and parameter optimization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100902,'ECE2000','人工智能算法工程','','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','2000','E',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100903,'ECE2001','基本电路理论','Basic Circuit Theory','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','2001','E',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','MAT1001 Calculus I
Algebra involving complex numbers are required.','','课程以介绍线性电路的基本概念和分析方法为目的。所包含的内容有：电路基础定理；网格及节点分析；戴维宁和诺顿等效电路；暂态和稳态分析；RCL电路；交流电路；频率响应；拉普拉斯和傅立叶变换；二端口网络；二极管电路；晶体管电路；运算放大器电路。拉普拉斯和傅立叶变换部份以应用为主。二极管及晶体管主要讨论分段线性模型以说明电路原理；另外，运算放大器则讨论理想模型。最后，将会介绍使用计算机仿真进行电路分析。','The course introduces basic concepts and methods in linear electric circuit analysis.  The topics to be covered include: fundamental circuit theorems; mesh and nodal analysis; Thevenin and Norton equivalent circuits; transient and steady-state analyses; RCL circuits; AC circuits; frequency responses; Laplace and Fourier transforms;  two-port networks; diode circuits; transistor circuits; operation amplifier circuits. The part on Laplace and Fourier Transforms stresses their use rather than their mathematical proofs. Only piece-wise linearly models of diodes and transistors will be considered and their circuits are included mainly to illustrate the principles of circuit theory. Similarly, only ideal op-amp circuits will be included. Finally, circuit analysis using computer simulations will be introduced.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100904,'ECE2050','数字逻辑与系统','Digital Logic and Systems','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','2050','E',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
