2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程旨在向理工科学生介绍数字逻辑与系统设计的基础概念和技术。内容包括：数字系统概念，记数系统和编码，布尔代数，逻辑门和逻辑电路，逻辑函数及简化方法，逻辑电路设计，锁存器和触发器，计数器，寄存器，记忆体和存储系统，简单可编程逻辑器件，复杂可编程逻辑器件，现场可编程逻辑门阵列，计算机辅助设计工具和超高速集成电路硬件描述语言。','This course gives science and engineering students exposure to the basic concepts and techniques in digital logic and system design. Topics include digital system concepts, numbering systems and codes, Boolean algebra, logic gates and logic circuit elements, logic functions and simplification, logic circuits design, latches and flip-flops, counters, registers, memory and storage systems, SPLD, CPLD, FPGA, and introduction to CAD tools and VHDL.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100905,'ECE2810','数字系统设计实验','Digital Systems Design Laboratory','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','2810','E',1.00,2000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','ECE2050 Digital Logic and Systems','課程將通過一系列實驗增強學生在數字邏輯系統方面的能力。實驗包括數字邏輯仿真軟件(如MultiSim)、邏輯門、組合邏輯、真值表、Karnaugh圖、累加器/比較器、編碼器/譯碼器、觸發器、計數器、移位寄存器、存儲器、現場可編程邏輯門陣列/ 超高速集成電路硬件描述語言。','The course will strengthen students’ capability in digital logic system by means of a series of hands-on laboratory practices in digital system design. The experiments involve digital logic simulation software (e.g. MultiSim), logic gates, combinational logic, truth table, Karnaugh map, adder/comparator, encoder/decoder, flip-flop, counter, shift register, memory, FPGA/VHDL.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100906,'ECE2811','数字系统设计实验荣誉课程','Honours Digital Systems Design Laboratory','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','2811','E',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','ECE2050 Digital Logic and Systems','ECE2050 Digital Logic and Systems','这门课程旨在培养学生在数字逻辑系统设计方面的高级技能，使用仿真软件（如 MultiSim）以及 FPGA/VHDL 等硬件平台。通过一系列逐步递进的实验，学生将接触并掌握逻辑门、组合与时序电路、真值表、卡诺图、加法器、比较器、编码器、译码器、触发器、计数器、移位寄存器和存储器等数字系统组件。课程强调理论概念的实际应用，训练学生设计、仿真、调试和分析数字系统，并撰写结构完善的技术报告。','This course develops advanced skills in digital logic system design using simulation software (e.g., MultiSim) and hardware platforms such as FPGA/VHDL. Through a series of progressively complex experiments, students work with logic gates, combinational and sequential circuits, truth tables, Karnaugh maps, adders, comparators, encoders, decoders, flip-flops, counters, shift registers, and memory components. Emphasizing practical application of theoretical concepts, the course trains students to design, simulate, debug, and analyze digital systems, and to produce well-structured technical reports','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
