2026-27 Term 1','','ECE3810 Microprocessor System Design Laboratory','学习用于实现嵌入式系统的先进微控制器平台。学生将使用 ARM Cortex 平台学习微控制器的架构，并了解 Cortex 寄存器、内存和 I/O 空间分配、位带、总线、指令集、中断控制等高级功能。学生将学习如何使用 C 语言作为主要语言对嵌入式系统和外设寄存器进行编程。','To learn an advanced microcontroller platform for the implementation of an embedded system. Using ARM Cortex platform, students will study the architecture of microcontroller and learn the advanced features of Cortex’s registers, memory and I/O space allocation, bit-banding, buses, instruction set, interrupt control, etc. Students will learn how to program the embedded system, the peripheral registers, using C-language as the primary language.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
