2026-27 Term 1','SSE students: CSC1001 or CSC1005; SDS students: CSC1003 or CSC1004.','C# or C++ (CSC3002) Experience Recommended','本课程的目的在于向学生介绍电子游戏设计与开发过程中的人机交互、软件工程与编程实践的基本知识。通过商业游戏引擎的学习，学生将接触到电子游戏开发的方方面面，包括物理引擎、关卡设计、摄像机、二维三维设计、人机界面设计等等。同时这门课还会涉及电子游戏的前沿进展，例如网络游戏，游戏人工智能、虚拟现实、增强现实、人机交互等。','The purpose of this course is to provide a foundation in human-computer interaction, software engineering, and programming practice in game design and development. By introducing a commercial game engine, the students will be exposed to all major aspects of developing video games, including physics, level design, camera, 2D & 3D design, and human-computer interface design, among others. Students will learn recent advances in video games, e.g., online gaming, artificial intelligence, virtual reality, augmented reality, human-computer interaction, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100914,'ECE3201','微电子电路导论','Introduction to Microelectronic Circuits','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','3201','E',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
