2026-27 Term 1','EIE2001','','本课程提供半导体物理的基础知识，包括电子和空穴、能带图、费米能量、本征和掺杂半导体、漂移和扩散电流。将解释P-N结、双极晶体管和MOS晶体管的原理。将介绍器件性能指标，即电流效率、传输频率和固有增益。涵盖的其他主题包括晶体管级别的基本模拟电路和数字电路。学生必须按要求完成指定的实验。','This course provides the basic knowledge of semiconductor physics, including electrons and holes, energy band diagram, Fermi energy, intrinsic and doped semiconductors, drift and diffusion currents. The principles of P-N junctions, bipolar and MOS transistors will be explained. The device performance measures, namely current efficiency, transit frequency and intrinsic gain, will be introduced. Other topics covered include basic analog circuits and digital circuits at the transistor level. This course includes mandatory laboratory modules.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
