ECE2001 Basic Circuit Theory','','本课程旨在向理工科学生介绍模拟集成电路的基础概念和技术。内容包括：非理想运算放大器，晶体管放大器设计，运算放大器设计，反馈分析，稳定性和频率补偿，噪声分析，电流源，带隙电压参考电路，线性调节器，数据转换器，和滤波器。','Non-ideal opamp. Transistor amplifier design. Opamp design. Feedback analysis. Stability and frequency compensation. Noise analysis. Current source. Bandgap voltage reference. Linear regulator. Data converter. Filter.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100916,'ECE3250','系统与控制','System & Control','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','3250','E',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','Calculus, Linear Algebra, Signals and Systems','','内容将涵盖《反馈控制导论》（L. Qiu 和 K. Zhou 著）前 5 到 6 章的内容，分为三个主要部分：1. 物理系统的建模；2. 开环和闭环系统的时域和频域分析；3. 控制器设计，以满足稳定性、鲁棒性，精度和速度性能要求。','The content will follow the first 5 to 6 chapters of the textbook “Introduction to Feedback Control” by L. Qiu and K. Zhou. It will cover three parts: 1. modelling of physical systems; 2.  time domain and frequency domain analysis of open-loop and closed-loop systems; 3. Controller design for stabilization, robustness, and performance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
