Or equivalent courses.','None','这门课程从一个统一的视角教授网络通信的基本原理和实践。原理部分包括信息论、排队、效用最大化、控制、图形和编码等方面的内容。实践部份包括互联网的基本机制，如分层、寻址、路由、拥塞控制和媒体访问控制。与互联网相关的进一步课题包括内容分发网络、点对点通信和实时通信。课程还将涵盖蜂窝网络和无线局域网中无线通信的基础知识。','This course teaches the basic principles and practices of network communications from a unified view. The principle part includes the researches from information theory, queuing, utility maximization, control, graph and coding. The topics include the basic mechanisms of Internet, such as addressing, routing, congestion control and media access control, and also the theories behind these mechanisms. Further topics related to Internet include content distribution networks, peer-to-peer communication, and real-time communication. The basics about wireless communications in both cellular network and wireless LAN will be covered.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
