ECE1810 Electronic Circuit Design Laboratory','','本课程旨在向理工科学生介绍数字集成电路的基础概念和技术。本课程介绍CMOS工艺和CMOS器件。具体讨论反相器的静态和动态各种特性。讨论组合逻辑门，时序逻辑门和算法器的设计和实现。同时会讨论信号互联产生的问题。','This course introduces to the students in the field of science and engineering on the fundamental concept and technology of digital integrated circuits. CMOS manufacturing process and CMOS devices are introduced. The static and dynamic characteristics of inverters are discussed in details. The design and implementations of combinational logic gates, sequential logic gates and arithmetic building blocks are discussed. The issues with interconnect are talked about.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100931,'ECE4103','超大规模集成电路设计自动化','Very Large Scale Integrated Circuit Design Automation','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','4103','E',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Summer','ECE2001 and CSC3002','CSC3100','本課程旨在介紹 VLSI 電路設計自動化 (CAD) 中應用的基本概念和演算法。範圍將涵蓋數位系統物理設計的各個領域，包括電路分區、佈局規劃、佈局、佈線和時序優化。','This course aims to present the fundamental concepts and algorithms applied in Design Automation (CAD) of VLSI circuits. The scope will include various areas in Physical Design of digital systems, including circuit partitioning, floorplanning, placement, routing, and timing optimization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
