•	A good programming skill (for platforms like Matlab, python, C++)
•	Deep learning platform (like TensorFlow, PyTorch, Caffe)','','本科目主要涉及数字图像处理的基本概念, 并利用数字图像处理 基本技术及相关软件（包括但不限于 PhotoShop，MeshLab，美图 秀秀等）来解决实际问题。   这门课将介绍的数字图像处理的基本概念，理论和方法包括：图像 获取，数字图像表达，采样，插值，几何失真，图像修复，图像去 噪及去雾，图像增强及美颜，图像压缩，图像分类，目标识别，光 流预测和图像分割等有趣的应用。 同时，有关现实生活中多媒体 系统的应用也会被介绍。','This course is designed for SSE students to learn the principles of digital image processing and the use of digital image processing techniques to solve practical problems. The course will introduce basic concepts, theory and methods of digital image processing, including image acquisition, image representation, sampling, interpolation, geometric distortions, image restoration, boundary/edge detection, morphological processing and image segmentation. Their applications in real-world multimedia systems will also be described.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100937,'ECE4513','图像处理和计算机视觉','Image Processing and Computer Vision','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','4513','E',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2024-25 Summer','•	Basic digital image processing skills
•	Basic programming skill (for platform like Matlab, python)
•	Basic signal processing skills','','本科目主要涉及图像处理和计算机视觉的基本概念,并利用图像处理和计算机视觉相关技术来解决实际问题。

图像是现代社会信息表达和交流的重要形式。 如今，从摄影、娱乐、教育、国防到医疗等各种应用，每分钟都会生成数十亿张图像。 对信号、对象、句法和语义级别的大量图像内容的良好理解对于创建新功能和启用新应用程序至关重要。 本课程以项目为基础，旨在教授图像形成/表示、分析/理解和检索的实用算法和系统解决方案，以及图像分类、图像对象检测和图像分割等最新主题。 完成本课程后，学生应能够了解图像分析与理解领域的现状，并具备解决这些问题的实用编程和系统技能，为该领域未来的研究探索和行业职业生涯奠定基础。','This  course  is  designed  for  SSE  students to learn the  principles  of image processing and computer vision techniques to solve practical problems.Image is an essential form of information representation and communication in modern society. Nowadays billions of images are generated every minutes in a variety of applications ranging from photography, entertainment, education, defense to medical. A good understanding of vast amount of image content at signal, object, syntactic and semantic levels,would be essential to create new capability and enable new applications. This course is project based, and the objective is to teach practical algorithm and system solutions for image formation/representation, analysis/ understanding, and retrieval, as well as the latest topics like image classification, image object detection and image segmentation. Upon completion of the course, students should be able to understand the current state of art in the image analysis and understanding area,and have practical programming and system skills to address these problems and have basis for future research exploration and industry career in this area.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100938,'ECE4520','三维数据处理','3D Data Processing','ECE - Electrical Computer Eng','4520','E',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2','CSC1001, CSC 3002','None','本课程教授 3D 表示和计算几何的基本理论以及处理现实 3D 数据的实践技能。主题包括：3D 曲线和曲面理论、网格表示和点云、低级 3D 数据处理、3D 重建、3D 理解和高级 3D 深度学习技术。','This course teaches both fundamental theories of 3D representation and computational geometry and practical skills to process real-life 3D data. Topics include: 3D Curve and Surface Theory, mesh representation and point cloud, low-level 3D data processing, 3D reconstruction, 3D understanding and advanced 3D deep learning techniques.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
