2025-26 Summer','ECO2011 Basic Microeconomics','No co-requisite.','宏观经济学是对整体经济的分析研究。在微观经济学的学习中，您已经研究了个体在经济市场中如何表现和互动。在这个学期，我们将关注整个经济，了解它的行为方式和影响它的因素。我们研究的问题包括国内生产总值（GDP），经济增长，利率，失业率，通货膨胀和商业周期。
宏观经济学研究帮助政府决定其经济政策的走向，并帮助企业估计政府政策可能对商业环境的影响。宏观经济学问题包括：长期影响国民收入增长率的因素是什么？政府可以做些什么来影响失业率？是什么导致通货膨胀？本课程将解决于此相关和类似的问题。','Macroeconomics is the study of the economy as a whole, to understand how it behaves and what affects it. Macroeconomics analyses and explains issues like economic growth, interest rates, unemployment, inflation, and business cycles. The study of Macroeconomics allows the government to decide what its economic policy should be, and allows business environment. Macroeconomic questions include: What affects the long term growth rate of GDP? What can the government do to affect the unemployment rate? What causes inflation? These and other questions will be addressed in this course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
