2016-17 Summer','ECO2021 Basic Macroeconomics','None','ECO3021是我们宏观经济学的第二课，我们将在这门课中学习经济个体的宏观汇总行为。这门课程的内容主要分为长期经济增长和短期经济周期两个部分。在长期经济部分，我们将主要学习有关经济增长，通货膨胀，就业率以及政府债务的模型。在短期经济部分，我们将主要关注经济震荡，货币政策，同时介绍一些具有微观基础的宏观经济模型。如果时间允许，我们将讨论国际贸易和国际金融，生命周期消费理论和其他主题。','This is the second course in macroeconomics, which studies the aggregate behavior of large collection of economic agents. The course is divided into two parts: long-run growth and short-run business cycles. In the long-run part, we study growth, inflation, unemployment, and government debt. In the short-run part, we study economic shocks and monetary policy. Macroeconomic models based on micro foundations will be discussed. We will also study topics on international economics, life cycle consumptions, and some other topics if time permits.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
