2026-27 Term 1','ECO2121 Basic Statistics or （STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H）','No co-requisites','本课程介绍了计量经济学的理论基础与实践。包括应用统计方法
（主要通过回归分析）进行经济数据实证分析进而得出结论。本课
的目的是为学生介绍计量经济学理论基础和相关实践，以及让学生
学会如何使用真实数据进行计量经济模型分析。
本课程具备很强的应用性，我们将使用Python/R/STATA
进行数据分析。本课程将培养学生在实证研究中运用
Python/R/STATA的技能。该软件的使用将在辅导课程中说明，一
些习题课可能会安排在计算机实验室里进行。','This course provides an introduction to econometric theory and practice.
We begin with a comprehensive discussion of simple and multiple
regression analysis. More advanced topics will be tackled later in the
semester, such as time series analysis, panel data, and binary models.
The purpose of the course is to introduce you the statistical methods that
economists use to test economic theory and interpret economic data, and
to give you experience in estimating econometric models with real
world data.

This course has a strong applied emphasis. We will use Python/R/STATA
for data analysis. The course will provide you the opportunity to
establish your skills of applying Python/R/STATA in empirical study.
Instructions on how to use the software will be given in tutorials and,
if necessary, some of the tutorials may take place in the computer lab.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
