2026-27 Term 1','ECO3011: Intermediate Microeconomic Theory','No co-requisite.','博弈论是以数学建模为基本方法，研究理性决策者在策略环境中之行为的学科。其为经济学、社会学、生物学、心理学等诸多领域提供了理论研究的重要方法论，以及实证研究的微观基础。本课程将介绍博弈论的基础概念和分析方法，以及在商业环境中的多种应用。','Game Theory is the study of mathematical models in analyzing strategic scenarios for rational agents. It has been widely adopted as the theoretical toolkit as well as the micro-foundation of empirical studies in multiple areas, such as economics, sociology, biology and psychology. This course provides an introduction to main concepts in Game Theory, basic analytical methods and various applications in a business environment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
