2015-16 Summer','ECO 3121 Introductory Econometrics','No co-requisite.','本课程通过对计量经济学理论和方法的学习，使学生能够可以基于
实验和调查数据对政策进行评估和因果推断。
• 如何评估政策或事件的影响？
• 如何根据观察来识别因果关系数据？
本课将广泛使用示例来说明各种统计因果推理的方法。涵盖的主题
包括：横截面和面板估计、标准误差计算、随机控制实验、工具变
量估计（两阶段最小二乘估计法）、差分估计法、断点回归等。讲
述方法论时，将结合实证论文和数据，学习 STATA 软件的具体操
作。该课程有助于未来做实证研究的学生。','This course expounds upon quantitative evaluation methods using experimental and non-This course expounds upon quantitative evaluation methods using
experimental and non-experimental data.
• How do we evaluate the impact of a policy or an event?
• How do we identify a causal relationship based on observational
data?
Examples will be extensively used to illustrate various statistical
methods for causal inference. Topics include cross-section and panel
estimation, calculation of standard errors, randomized control trials,
instrumental variable estimation, difference-in-differences, regression
discontinuity design, etc. Students will learn how to apply various
statistical methods and the basics of STATA. The course will be
especially helpful for students who will do empirical research in the
future.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
