2023-24 Summer','ECO2011 and (MAT1010 or （MAT1001 or MAT1011)) and (ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H))','No co-requisite.','本课程讲授投资学和资产定价，简要介绍金融市场和包括股票、债券、期货、期权等金融衍生品在内的金融工具，并基于一个权衡风险与回报的理论框架来讨论最优资产配置和证券的均衡定价。本课程涵盖无套利原则、资产定价模型、两基金分离定理等金融经济学经典内容，（如时间允许）还会介绍更新一些的行为金融学模型。','This course introduces investments and asset. It provides an overview of financial markets and instruments including stocks, bonds, futures, options, and other derivatives. A risk-return framework is used to think about optimal asset allocation and equilibrium pricing of securities. Topics covered in this course include classic topics such as no-arbitrage principle, Capital Asset Pricing Model, two-fund separation theorem, and recent behavior models that explore the limits of arbitrage if time permitted.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
