Some knowledge of econometrics (students need to understand regression)','No co-requisite','本课程从理论和实证的角度讲授政府在经济中的作用。 本课程着重介绍公共经济及财政领域的理论和实证工具，并讲解如何将这些工具应用于税收政策、社会保险、公共产品和环境保护政策的分析。 完成本课程后，学生能够初步掌握政府干预经济的基本逻辑、经济主体对政府行为的应对以及分析政府政策的理论和实证工具。','This course focuses on the role of the government in the economy from a theoretical and empirical perspective. This course introduces the theoretical and empirical tools that are used to assess government policies and presents their application in the analysis of tax policy, social insurance programs, public goods, and environmental protection. The aim of the course is to provide a basic understanding of the rationale for government intervention in the economy, the response of economic agents to the government''s actions, and the theoretical and empirical approach to analyze the merits of possible government policies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
