(100963,'ECO3470','劳动经济学','Labor Economics','ECO - Economics','3470','E',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','',NULL,'ECO3011 Intermediate MicroEcon Theory and （ECO2121 Basic Statistics   or   STA2001 Probability and Statistics I   or   STA2003 Probability）','No co-requisite.','这门课程旨在提供劳动经济学的基本介绍，并将结合应用微观经济理论和实证分析。这门课涵盖的主题包括：劳动供给、劳动需求、劳动市场均衡、人力资本、不平等与歧视、移民与劳动流动性，以及委托人-代理人问题。在适当的情况下，我们也将讨论公共政策问题。','In this course, we delve into the foundations of labor economics, integrating applied microeconomic principles with hands-on empirical research. The main topics covered include: Labor Supply, Labor Demand, Labor Market equilibrium, Human Capital, Inequality & Discrimination, Immigration & Mobility, and the Principal-Agent problem. Throughout the course, we''ll engage in discussions on pertinent public policy matters related to the labor market.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
