2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','本课程的主题是环境经济学，尤其关注可持续性问题。课程旨在从全球角度提供一个环境经济学和可持续发展的综合概述，向学生介绍用于分析可持续发展和实践的经济概念和理论。它还关注被建议作为实现可持续性的手段的政策工具。','The subject is one on economics of the environment, with special attention on sustainability. This subject aims to provide an integrated overview of environmental economics and sustainable development from a global perspective. Students are introduced to the economic concepts and theories for analysing sustainable development and practices.  It also focuses on the policy instruments which have been suggested as a means of achieving sustainability.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
