2026-27 Term 1','Students should have a good understanding of the undergraduate level of calculus and linear algebra and some rudimentary knowledge of probability and statistics. A prior course in undergraduate econometrics would be helpful, but not required.','No co-requisite.','本门课程是一门硕士研究生的计量经济学课程。该课程将涵盖模型设置、估计方法和因果推断，强调通过实践学习的方法获取实证分析技能。Python语言和编程将会贯穿整个课程。','This is an introductory course in econometrics designed for the MSc program. It covers model specifications, estimation methods, and causal inference, emphasizing empirical skills through learning by doing. The Python computer program will be used throughout the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
