2025-26 Term 2','ECO6105 Advanced Macroeconomics','','本课程是为研究生开设的国际金融专业课，旨在帮助学生理解和把握国际金融的相关理论和实证研究。课程内容主要涵盖国际收支和经常账户、汇率的决定、蒙代尔-弗来明模型、国际金融体系、资本管制和跨境资本流动、宏观经济政策的国际传导与协调、以及金融全球化背景下的中国经济。','This is a graduate-level international finance course. It aims to provide students with a solid understanding of the modern theories and empirics of international finance. Topics covered include balance of payments and current account, exchange rate determination, the Mundell-Fleming model of output and exchange rate determination under fixed and flexible exchange rates, international financial systems, capital controls and cross-border capital flows, international policy spillover and coordination, and Chinese economy in the context of financial globalization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
