2026-27 Term 1','','','该课程旨在扩宽学生视野，并加深其对中国金融经济发展现存问题的认知和理解。届时我们将邀请来自政治、金融界和学术界的资深人士，进行一系列课程讲座。此课程重点强调基于大量现实金融经济案例的市场实践性，而不仅仅局限于理论知识学习。因此学生会以小组形式，在各位老师的指导下，结合中国金融经济相关热点问题完成高质量的项目研究。','The course aims to broaden students’ perspectives on many contemporary issues in Chinese financial development. Practitioner speakers will work with students on both classroom case presentations and projects. By offering students opportunities of integrating theories with existing finance practices, the course helps students gain practical insights into the latest trends of corporate finance and investment management in China.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(100992,'ECO6109','金融市场计量经济学','','ECO - Economics','6109','E',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Term 1
