2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','通过引入一个国际通用的经济分析框架对中国经济各个部份与政策影响做系统性的分析与国际比较，从而改善从学术研究到分析实体经济运行与政策影响之间的差距。本课程主要包含两个部分：（1）授课部分主要包括对国际通用的经济分析框架的全面介绍，包括实体经济，国际收支，货币与财政政策等，以及中国经济各部门具体指标与政策分析的具体案例；（2）所有同学将以学习小组的形式选择一个关于中国及全球经济及政策的研究课题，提交课程论文并做演示。课程将会以中英文授课。','This course aims to bridge the gap between academic research and the analysis of real economic operations and policy impacts by systematically analyzing various sectors and policy effects on the Chinese economy through the introduction of an internationally recognized economic analysis framework and its comparison with global contexts. The course consists of two main parts: (1) a lecture component providing a comprehensive overview of the internationally standardized economic analysis framework, covering aspects such as the real economy, balance of payments, monetary and fiscal policies, as well as specific case studies analyzing key indicators and policies within China''s economic sectors; (2) all students will form study groups to select a research topic related to China’s and the global economy and policies, submit a term paper, and deliver a presentation. The course will be conducted in both English and Chinese.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
