2025-26 Term 2','Statistics and probability theory, linear algebra, basic knowledge of Python (do not need to master). Basic machine learning theory.','None','本课程将教授如何应用机器学习技术来分析来自商业世界的文本。本课程的主要目的是向学生揭示数据挖掘技术的强大功能，在商业领域中海量数据集的价值以及从文本中提取的丰富信息。学生将学习如何利将现实世界中的问题转换为可以通过ML算法解决的数学模型，并在解决方案空间中找到最佳的ML算法。学生将了解和熟悉自然语言处理模型，并学会通过词袋，词嵌入和序列模型对文本进行建模。还鼓励学生了解最新的NLP方向的进展，例如ChatGPT，多模态语言模型，知识图谱构建和分析等等，获得每种算法背后的数学基础的基本知识。','Text analytics has become an important tool in business and economics. It is a field that lies on the interface of information retrieval, machine learning, and natural language processing. This course carefully covers a coherently organized framework drawn from these intersecting topics. Starting with basic algorithms of machine learning for text, following up with learning methods from text when combined with different domains such as multimedia and the web, and finally, various sequence-centric and natural language applications will be discussed. Course grade will be based on class discussions, a group project, homework assignments and a final exam.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
