2026-27 Term 1','Knowledge of multivariable calculus, linear algebra, undergraduate probability and statistics is required.','N/A','这是经济学博士生的第一门高级计量经济课程。本课程的目标是提供严格的概率统计以及计量经济学基础训练，让学生真正地了解那些常用计量方法背后的理论。涵盖的内容包括： 概率统计的基本概念，大数定律， 中心极限定理，最小二乘法，渐进近似，两阶段最小二乘法。另外，在作业中，学生将会通过做小课题以及使用统计软件模拟来加深对计量方法的理解。','This is the first advanced course in econometrics for first year PhD students in economics. The objective of the course is to provide students with rigorous training in probability theory, statistic, and basic econometric theory. Topics covered include: basic concepts in probability and statistics, the law of large numbers, the central limit theorem, ordinary and generalized least squares, asymptotic approximations, two-stage least squares, generalized method of moments. In this course, students will work on problem sets and simulation studies to enhance their understandings of materials.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
