2025-26 Term 2','ECO 6231','','这是 ECON 6231 的序列课程，将深入探讨计量经济学理论中的一些主题。将包括面板数据分析、离散选择模型、因果推理等。如果时间允许，我们还将研究计量经济学中的机器学习。通过本课程，学生将在之前课程的基础上，进一步了解高级计量经济学相关主题。','This is a sequel to ECON 6231, delving into more advanced concepts within econometric theory. Our exploration will encompass a comprehensive understanding of panel data analysis, discrete choice models, and the intricacies of causal inference. Time permitting, we will also delve into the dynamic realm of machine learning in the context of econometrics. Through this sequel, students will navigate the nuanced landscape of advanced econometric topics, building on the foundational knowledge acquired in the preceding course','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
