2026-27 Term 1','Students should have taken an Econometrics course at the introductory level that teaches
OLS and IV regression (e.g., ECO3121), an intermediate Microeconomics course (e.g.,
ECO3011) and the undergraduate Calculus sequence (e.g., MAT1001 and MAT1002).
Knowledge of game theory is helpful but not required. Familiarity with Stata, R or
MATLAB is helpful but not required.','N/A','产业组织(IO)研究非完美竞争市场中企业的行为，而现实世界中大
部分市场都属于此类。IO 研究的内容包括企业为提高利润而采取
的定价和营销策略，也包括企业间互动所产生的影响，还包括针对
企业的非竞争性行为所制定的公共政策，如反垄断法律法规。本课
程教授 IO 的部分主要问题的理论和实证知识，这些问题有：寡头
竞争、市场结构的确立、区别化产品、需求估算，以及反垄断话
题。','Industrial Organization (IO) studies firm behavior in settings where the
perfect-competition assumption does not hold, i.e., the majority of the
real-world markets. The subjects that IO studies include pricing and
marketing strategies firms can use to increase profits, the effects of
interactions between firms, as well as the public policy responses to
firms'' anti-competitive behavior, e.g., antitrust laws and regulation. This
course studies both theoretical and empirical aspects of some of the
main topics in IO: e.g., oligopoly competition, determination of market
structure, product differentiation, demand estimation, and antitrust
issues.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
