2026-27 Term 1','Only for Ph.D. students. No other prerequisites.','','本课程涵盖了应用微观经济学的主题，包括环境、劳动、发展、政治经济学、产业组织、公共经济学和中国经济。其主要目标是帮助对应用微观经济学感兴趣的博士生制定研究议程。','This course covers topics in applied microeconomics, including environment, labor, development, political economy, industrial organization, public economics, and Chinese economy. Its main goal is to help Ph.D. students who are interested applied microeconomics develop research agenda.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
