2025-26 Term 2','ECO6221 Macroeconomic Theory I & ECO6223 Macroeconomic Theory II','No','本门课程将介绍金融市场的功能以及货币政策如何通过影响经济。课程内容主要包括：人们为什么使用金融市场、利率和央行政策银以及国际资本流动。','This course introduces the functions of financial markets and how monetary policy impacts the economy through financial markets. The course topics generally include: why people use financial markets, interest rate and central bank policy, banking, and international capital flows.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
