2025-26 Term 2','ECO6105 Advanced Macroeconomics','','本课程是为研究生开设的国际金融专业课，旨在帮助学生了解国际金融领域以及国际宏观经济学的前沿研究，掌握国际金融研究的相关方法。课程内容主要涵盖国际收支、外汇市场与风险、利率平价条件和汇率的决定、蒙代尔-弗来明模型、国际金融体系、资本管制和跨境资本流动、宏观经济政策的国际传导与协调、以及金融全球化背景下的中国经济。','This is a graduate-level international finance course. It aims to provide students with a solid understanding of selected topics of current academic research in the areas of international finance and its intersection with international macroeconomics and to teach interested students the tools for conducting research in this field. Topics covered include balance of payments, foreign exchange markets and risk, international parity conditions and foreign exchange rate determination, the Mundell-Fleming model of output and exchange rate determination under fixed and flexible exchange rates, international financial systems, capital controls and cross-border capital flows, international policy spillover and coordination, and Chinese economy in the context of financial globalization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101036,'ECO6324','宏观经济学高阶专题','','ECO - Economics','6324','E',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
