2026-27 Term 1','ECO6221 Macroeconomics Theory I and ECO6223 Macroeconomics Theory II, or consent of the instructor.','None.','本课程系统介绍宏观经济学与国际经济学领域的前沿研究进展，旨在帮助研究生深入理解该领域的核心问题、理论框架与实证/定量研究方法。课程内容将围绕经济增长、发展与结构转型、经济周期与宏观经济政策、宏观金融、国际贸易以及国际金融等专题展开，并结合具有代表性的经典文献与最新研究成果，梳理相关研究脉络，揭示重要学术争议与前沿问题。通过本课程的学习，学生将进一步提升文献阅读、学术分析与独立研究能力，为后续开展高水平学术研究奠定坚实基础。','This course provides an introduction to frontier research in macroeconomics and international economics. Its purpose is to familiarize students with current questions, analytical frameworks, and empirical and quantitative methods that define research in the field. Topics may include economic growth, development and structural transformation, business cycles and macroeconomic policy, macro-finance, international trade, and international finance. The course is intended to strengthen students’ preparation for independent research by exposing them to seminal contributions, recent advances, and open questions at the research frontier.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
