2025-26 Term 1','none','none','n/a','This course is intended to improve student’s understanding and mastery of grammar. It aims to use English grammar as an entry-point to the study of grammar in general, providing students with a general descriptive framework which is applicable to other languages. Grammatical structures are examined at multiple different scales – from morphology to discourse and everything in-between – to give students a sense of grammar as a holistic system. In addition to gaining theoretical understanding, students will improve their use of English grammatical structures through practice exercises.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
