2025-26 Term 1','Successful completion of all four foundation English courses (ENL1001, 1002, 1003, and1004) or their equivalence as recognized by HSS or having obtained special approval from HSS.','NA','本课程以技能为导向，旨在帮助学生通过运用学术思辨概念来培养公众演讲能力。涵盖的主题包括：论证模式与结构、针对不同场合和听众的演讲结构、如何用证据和逻辑有效地支持观点、如何在演讲中利用多媒体工具、如何对演说、即兴演讲、批驳和反驳、逻辑谬误以及基本的辩论规则和程序进行专业的分析。修完本课程后，学生将能够鉴别和评判演讲，能够进行快速且系统的思考来构思演说，并利用修辞和辩论技巧发表引人入胜且合乎道德的公开演讲。本课程所教授的内容适用于学术，商业，以及社交等不同的场合。','This skills-based course will help students develop public speaking competence through the application of academic-argument and debate-related concepts. Topics to be covered include professional structures and modes of argumentation, composition of speeches for different occasions and audiences, effectively supporting ideas with evidence and logic, utilizing multimedia tools in presentations, professional analysis including peer-review and observation of real-world speeches, impromptu speaking, refutation and rebuttal, logical fallacies, and basic competitive debate rules and procedures. Upon successful completion, students will be able to recognize and critique speeches, be capable of systematic brainstorming leading to rapid composition, and utilize rhetorical and argumentative techniques to deliver engaging and ethical public speeches. This course will be relevant to students in academic, business, and social settings.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
