2025-26 Term 2','Nil.','Nil.','本课程旨在向学生介绍基本的创意写作技巧和规范，以及部分英美现当代经典文学作品，通过大量的阅读和写作训练提高学生在英文小说创作过程中的语感和英语语言运用的综合能力。','This course is designed as an introductory creative writing workshop with an emphasis on prose writing. It intends to acquaint the students with basic writing craft and terminologies, and give a broad introduction to creative practice in the writing of fiction. The curriculum is geared toward the examination of both the macro scope of prose writing (character orchestration, dialogue composition, structure arc etc.) and the micro aspects of English language utilization (how to effectively construct a sentence, colloquium etc.).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101080,'ENB2004','当代英语文学概论','Introduction to Contemporary English Literature','ENB - English Studies','2004','E',3.00,2000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
