2025-26 Term 1','Successful completion of all four foundation English courses (ENL1001, 1002, 1003, and1004) or their equivalence as recognized by HSS or having obtained special approval from HSS.','None','本课程旨在引导学生探索当代英语文学，聚焦诗歌与小说两大文类。在诗歌部分，学生将系统研读英美诗歌的多样形式与风格；小说部分则以短篇作品为核心，涵盖微型小说、闪小说、极短篇小说及短篇小说等体裁。课程将结合历史语境，分析这些作品与近现代重要文学潮流（如现代主义与后现代主义）的关联，同时从文学思潮与创作风格的维度，梳理从现实主义到实验性写作的演进脉络。通过研读反映历史变迁与文化动态的诗歌与散文，学生将深入观察文学形式如何随时代演变，并如何以独特的艺术方式回应现实。课程特别注重传统诗歌形式的传承与创新写作手法的探索，引导学生思考文学创作的延续与突破。此外，课程将引入多元文学批评方法作为分析工具，包括新批评、女性主义、精神分析与马克思主义文学理论，帮助学生建立多维度的文本解读能力。通过本课程的学习，学生不仅能深化对当代英美文学的理解，掌握文学形式的基本特征，更能灵活运用理论工具，独立完成对文学作品的鉴赏与批评。','This course introduces students to the study of contemporary English literature. It will focus on poetry and fiction. Students will examine a variety of poetry in various forms, both English and American. Fictional forms will focus on shorter works, with examples of microfiction, flash fiction, short short stories, and short stories. These texts will be placed in historical context, with relation to important recent literary developments, including Modernism and Postmodernism. Texts will also be placed in context with important literary movements and styles, from realism to more experimental modes of writing. Students will study poetry and prose that reflect historical and cultural changes, noting how poetry and prose evolve over time, reflecting changing attitudes to how poetry and prose reflect contemporary realities. Particular emphasis will be given to the poetic forms that are more traditional and those that explore new ways of writing. Several approaches to literature will also be introduced and employed as interpretive tools: New Critical Analysis, Feminist, Psychoanalytic, and Marxist approaches to literature. Students will develop a nuanced understanding of contemporary British and American literature; will develop an understanding of basic literary forms; and will learn how to adapt approaches to specific texts as ways of interpreting and assessing literary works.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
