2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本科目以英语语料为例, 帮助学生从语言学的角度探索语言基本知识。课程从语言学主要领域入手，通过一系列课题，引导学生分析英语语音、语义、结构中有趣的特征，以及影响语用的因素。同时学生将探讨语言的变迁和语言的习得。课程注重提高学生的逻辑分析能力和思辨能力。','This course aims to develop students’ understanding of the basics in linguistic inquiry. A wide range of topics are included to introduce students to some of the major subfields of linguistics, with a focus on data/examples from the English language. Among the topics covered are the development of English as a language, the pragmatic considerations governing its use, and its grammatical characteristics from the sentence down to the individual speech sound. Special attention is given to the development of logical, analytical and critical thinking skills.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101083,'ENB3002','语言与社会','Language and Society','ENB - English Studies','3002','E',3.00,3000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
