2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','Successful completion of all foundation English courses (the ENL series/the ENG series)','','本科目旨在培养学生对在英语为国际工作语言环境下人们如何进行沟通交流的认识。科目的主要内容议题包括：群际沟通；沟通和身份；跨文化沟通；沟通障碍案例研究等。该科目将帮助学生从一系列学术视角（包括语言学，管理学和社会学）来理解跨文化交际理论，并将这些理论应用于现实生活中的交际问题。 此外，学生还将了解来自不同英语国家人民的文化习俗。','The aim of this course is to enable students to gain an understanding of communication practices in professional contexts where English is used as an international language. Key topics will include: the dynamics of intergroup communication; communication and identity; cross-cultural communication with reference to Chinese speakers of English; case studies of communication difficulties and breakdown. The course will help students to understand theories of intercultural communication from a range of academic perspectives (including linguistics, management studies and sociology) and apply these theories to ‘real life’ instances of communication problems. In addition, students will also gain am understanding of the cultural practices of various groups of language users from various English-speaking countries.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101086,'ENB3005','语言与媒体','Language and Media','ENB - English Studies','3005','E',3.00,3000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Successful completion of all ENL series courses (for language majors); successful completion of all U-core English courses (for non-language majors); or equivalence as approved by HSS.','','本课程将培养学生分析语言与媒体之间的共生关系方面的能力。它将向学生们介绍媒体研究领域的主要学派、辩论、概念与研究方法，特别关注新媒体以及语言在其中的使用。本课程将帮助学生将这些理论和方法与他们作为媒体用户和观众的日常生活联系起来，并对互联网时代语言如何与媒介互动从而衍生出新的交流方式进行批判性的研究和思考。','This course will enable students to analyze the symbiotic relationship between language and media. It introduces students to the field of media studies (key authors, debates, concepts, methods), with a special focus on the new media and how language is used there. It helps students situate the theories and methods in relation to their lives as media users and audiences, and learn to conduct critical research into and think critically about how the ‘mediation’ of language in the age of the Internet has contributed to new modes of communication.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101087,'ENB4001','毕业设计','','ENB - English Studies','4001','E',6.00,4000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','毕业设计通常采用论文或项目的形式。论文是学生在指定导师的指导下分阶段设计和实施的研究的书面成果, 是学生在导师的帮助下构思和进行的一项具有原创成分的报告。毕业设计也可以是项目的形式，所谓项目是指是为公司或机构解决实际问题而进行的有理论支持的深思熟虑设计的作品。此类作品必须同分析报告一起提交才能视作有效的毕业设计，而且分析报告必须包含对项目的反思以及公司或机构就该设计的反馈意见。学生可以自己拟定论文或项目主题但须得到导师的批准。','The Final Year Project is typically in the form of a dissertation or a project. A dissertation is a written product of research designed and carried out over stages by the student under the guidance of an assigned supervisor. It is a report of a largely original investigation conceived and conducted by the student with the help of the supervisor. A project can be in the form of an artefact which is the result of a theory-supported deliberate design for solving practical problems in real-life situations, in collaboration with a host organization. An artefact can only be accepted as a valid Final-Year Project when it is submitted together with an analysis report with a proper reflection section and a host evaluation feedback. Each student is required to complete a dissertation or project with decent quality on a topic of their own choice but approved by the supervisor.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101088,'ENB4101','企业文传要略','Essentials of Corporate Communications','ENB - English Studies','4101','E',3.00,4000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','1. Successful completion of all ENL series courses (for language majors); successful completion of all U-core English courses (for non-language majors); or equivalence as approved by HSS.
2. Successful completion of Year 2 major required courses of the English Studies program.','None','ENB4101是一门企业文传的入门课程，为有意成为不同领域的专业人士的学生打下理论和实践基础。这些领域包括活动策划、人力资源、市场营销、和公共关系。该课程还为有意攻读企业传播学相关专业硕士的学生做好准备。通过学习这门课程，学生将能够理解企业传播学中的基本概念和理论，并有能力将这些理论应用于企业内部和外部的传播实践中。此外，学生还会具备创建适合不同受众，不同交流目，和不同交流场景的信息的能力。','ENB4101intends to be an introductory course for those students who aim to work as a professional in a wide range of fields including event planning, human resources, marketing, and public relations. The course also intends to prepare students for a postgraduate study in various concentrations of corporate or strategic communication. Students will be able to understand key concepts and theories in corporate communication and develop skills of putting such theories into communication practices both inside and outside organizations. They will also be able to create messages appropriate to the audience, purpose, and context.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101089,'ENB4102','商务英语写作','','ENB - English Studies','4102','E',3.00,4000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 1
2024-25 Term 2','Successful completion of all four courses of the ENL series or equivalence as recognized by HSS.','ENB4101','ENB4102旨在培养学生在日益国际化的企业环境中的沟通技能，尤其是书面表达能力。发展学生的批判性思维能力，从而成为更好的沟通者。改善学生的语言能力和写作风格，从而书写出简洁、准确、有创意、写作风格恰当的文书材料。此外，课程将整合AI工具如ChatGPT到教学中，帮助学生探索和了解AI工具的能力和局限，以及恰当地使用AI帮助他们起草各种企业文传材料以实现和不同读者沟通的目的。','ENB4102 intends to develop students’ proficiency in corporate communication skills (especially their writing skills) which they will need in facing an increasingly globalized corporate world. Students will be expected to develop critical thinking skills to become better communicators, refining language and style skills to produce written materials that are concise, precise, creative and stylistically appropriate to the corporate communication profession. Additionally, AI tools like ChatGPT will be integrated into the course, so as to help students explore and understand the capabilities and limitations of the AI tool and identify suitable use cases of AI in drafting various corporate communication materials for different audiences.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101090,'ENB4103','中西方文化差异','','ENB - English Studies','4103','E',3.00,4000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','NA','NA','本课程旨在帮助学生探索现代中国与世界的文化差异，以培养和加深他们对中外文化差异所涉及的各方面的问题的认识和了解。本课程将让学生有机会深入分析和比较中国文化与其他文化之间的相似和不同，从而培养学生对中西方跨文化关系基本问题的批判意识，进而更好地了解他们应该如何在世界上的展示自己的文化认同。','It is difficult for people from different cultures to communicate not only due to language barriers, but also due to different values and culture styles. This course is designed to help students explore cultural differences between China and the West, aiming to enhance their knowledge and understanding of the multifaceted issues involved. By comparing and analyzing the similarities and differences between Chinese and Western cultures, the course will also help students to develop critical awareness of basic issues in cross-cultural communications, and to better understand our cultural identity from a different perspective.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101091,'ENB4104','公司形象与跨文化传播','','ENB - English Studies','4104','E',3.00,4000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Successful completion of all four courses of the ENL series or equivalence as recognized by HSS.','ENB4101','随着中国经济实力和全球影响力在过去几十年间迅速增长，越来越多中国企业将业务扩展到世界各地。由于意识形态和文化差异，中国企业的形象在海外往往受到诋毁。如何在外国文化领域呈现正面的企业形象是许多中国企业需要解决的问题。本课程旨在提高学生的跨文化意识，给包括客户、员工、大众传媒、投资者和政府在内的主要海外受众塑造和展示积极的企业形象。学生将应用跨文化传播理论，学习如何讲述海外受众能够理解和欣赏的中国故事。','With the rapid increase of China’s economic power and global influence over the past few decades, more and more Chinese companies have extended their reaches or businesses to various parts of the world. Due to ideological and cultural differences, oftentimes the image of Chinese companies is vilified. How to present a positive corporate image in a foreign culture is an issue that many Chinese companies need to address. This course aims to raise students ‘cultural awareness in cultivating and presenting corporate image to key overseas audiences including customers, employees, mass media, investors and governments. Students will learn how to tell Chinese stories which audiences from non-Chinese cultures can understand and appreciate by applying cross-cultural communication theories.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101092,'ENB4105','国际商务礼仪','','ENB - English Studies','4105','E',3.00,4000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','Successful completion of all four courses of the ENL series or equivalence as recognized by HSS.','ENB4101','在全球性商务活动中，良好业务关系的建立很大程度上取決于企业人员的多元文化素质以及跨文化交际能力。本课程旨在通过介绍与跨国商务活动相关的不同主题，培养学生在多元文化商务环境中的职业应对能力。课程内容主要包括：商务旅行習俗、商务社交礼仪、非语言商务交流习惯、商务活动着装规范、跨文化日常行为准则、商务用餐礼仪、商务谈判语言标准、商务交往信函通用体例等。','Building global business relationships depends on the awareness of cultural differences and the ability to learn about other cultures and adjust quickly once in a new cultural environment. This course   intends to help students develop the ability mentioned above by introducing them to topics that are related to global business settings, such as travel customs, socializing, gestures and other nonverbal communicators, dressing code and appearance, cultural attitudes and behaviours, dining customs and table manners, oral and written communication etiquette and so on.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
