2026-27 Term 1','Successful completion of all ENL or ENG series U-Core courses.','','本课程介绍使用 Python 进行计算机编程的基础知识。本课程侧重于自然语言处理相关的基本技术。核心主题包括：Python语法、数据类型、运算符、程序流程和控制结构、定义和使用函数、输入和输出、数据结构和算法、面向对象编程的基础知识以及语言处理相关的应用案例。','This course introduces the basics of computer programming using Python. It focuses on basic skills related to Natural Language Processing. The key topics include the basic Python syntax, data types, operators, flow and control structure, defining and using functions, I/O, data structure and algorithms, the basics of object-oriented programming, and applications related to language processing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
