2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','/','/','本课程重点讨论固体中电子和声子的原理和应用，包括低维材料和超导材料中的各种电声现象。主要面向未来有志于凝聚态物理相关专业继续深造的学生。课程内容包括晶体学和晶体散射，声子和比热，自由电子模型和基础能带理论，半导体，磁性和超导。','The conversion of energy resources into useful forms of energy is fundamental to civilization and has been a major driver of economic growth, while creating significant social and environmental costs. In this course, we define the Energy Challenge faced by humanity and introduce the main conversion methods for different energy resources, including conventional and renewable energy technologies. Students will learn how to conduct basic analyses to evaluate energy systems using principles from physics, chemistry, materials science, and engineering approaches. Furthermore, they will understand the key advantages and drawbacks of each technology and design better technology for the future.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
