2025-26 Term 2','','','这是一门介绍前沿能源应用材料及相关器件的课程，主要针对以电能为基础的能源体系（光电，风电，热电等）和以热能为基础的能源体系（核能，光热等）和相关材料等。包括太阳能、风能、热能等相关系统。该课程会介绍部分能源体系的基本工作原理、设计思路以及所用的功能材料，包括导体，半导体，碳材料和其他纳米材料等。','This course introduces state-of-the-art energy applications, mostly focusing on the electrical-based technologies, thermal-based technologies (e.g., solar, wind and thermal) and related materials. Their basic principles, designs, and the materials will be introduced. It covers conductors, semiconductors, carbon based materials, and other nanomaterials.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101115,'ENE3015','电化学与电池实验','Laboratory of Electrochemistry and Batteries','ENE - Energy Engineering','3015','E',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','CHM1001 General Chemistry','','课程提供机会给学生动手操作金属离子电池相关实验。实验涵盖商业正负极材料的极片制备、扣式电池组装、电池性能测试等。以锂离子电池为例，电池性能测试包括充放电曲线、倍率性能测试、循环稳定性测试等。表征技术包括循环伏安技术、电化学阻抗技术等。','The course mainly covers fundamentals of electrode preparation, batteries assembly, electrochemical test of commercial cathode and anode materials. Taking Li-ion batteries as examples, the electrochemical performance tests include charge/discharge curves, rate performance, cycling stability, etc. The characterization techniques cover cyclic voltammetry, electrochemical impedance,  etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
