2026-27 Term 1','PHY2001 - Electricity and Magnetism
EIE2001 - Basic Circuit Theory','','本课程将介绍电力系统的基本知识。学生将学习电力系统建模、运行及电力经济的基本知识。本课程的主要内容包括三相系统，电力系统的基本构成，标幺值，电力系统建模，电力系统潮流模型及求解算法，电力系统最优潮流模型及求解算法，电力系统经济及安全运行，电力市场基础，以及智能电网和能源互联网简介。本课程将为在电气工程领域的进阶学习打好基础。','This course introduces the basics of electrical power system. Students will learn the basic knowledge of power system modelling, operation and its economics. The key topics include: three phase systems, power system components, per unit quantities, power system modelling, power flow models and solution algorithms, optimal power flow and solution algorithms, economic and secure operation of power systems, fundamentals of electricity market, and introduction to smart grid. This course provides a foundation to further study in power engineering topics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
