2026-27 Term 1','','','能源转换过程对于将自然能源转化为对社会有用的能源形式至关重要。本课程将研究一些主要的能量转换过程：将热能转化为机械功的朗肯循环和布雷顿循环；制冷系统；传热设备；以及化学过程。讨论了热力学、化学动力学和传热学的概念，并着重介绍了它们在能源系统中的实际应用。','Energy conversion processes are essential for transforming natural energy resources into forms of energy that are useful to society. This course examines some of the major energy conversion processes: the Rankine and Brayton cycles that convert thermal energy into mechanical work; refrigeration systems; heat transfer equipment; and chemical processes. Concepts from thermodynamics, chemical kinetics and heat transfer are discussed with emphasis on their practical application in energy systems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
