This course is open to SSE students. Students from other faculties may apply with the course instructor''s approval in the AD week.','','能源是人类社会生存和发展的重要物质基础，环境则是关系到社会可持续发展的重大问题。当前化石能源日渐枯竭，新能源的开发与利用已刻不容缓。传统能源的开发利用更是造成全球气候变暖、臭氧层破坏等重大环境问题的主要原因。
本课程介绍能源与环境领域的基本知识、基本理论和基本方法，特别是化石能源、太阳能、电池、氢能源及生物质能领域的工作原理和研究现状，以深刻理解能源与环境所面临的问题及解决途径。"','"This course is designed to help students to acquire a comprehensive understanding of the global energy crisis and environmental issues our society is currently facing. This includes theoretical aspects of energy conversion, working principles behind various energy devices (such as heat engine, photovoltaics, batteries, fuel cells), and their impacts on the environments. With particular focus on renewable energy resources, the routes toward a green society will be highlighted.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
