(101127,'ENE4011','智能电网','Smart Grid','ENE - Energy Engineering','4011','E',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2024-25 Summer','Basic knowledge in power and energy systems.
A course in electrical power systems (e.g., ENE3050 or ENE6001) is very helpful but not strictly required.','','本课程介绍智能电网的基本组成部分、智能电网与传统电网的主要区别、可再生能源发电在智能电网中的应用、分布式能源（DER）的控制以及发电中使用的储能技术。 它帮助学生学习如何优化智能电网，使其具有成本效益和效率，以及如何提高电网可靠性。','This course introduces the fundamental components of smart grids, the main difference between the smart grid and traditional grids, application of renewable energy generation sources in smart grids, and control of distributed energy resources (DERs), and energy storage technologies used in power generation. It helps students learn how to optimize smart grids so they are cost effective and efficient and how to increase grid reliability.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101128,'ENE4012','电力市场','Electricity Market','ENE - Energy Engineering','4012','E',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1
2023-24 Summer
2024-25 Summer','Calculus, Linear algebra','','這個科目提供了對電力系統經濟和電力市場的基礎理解。它深入探討了電力行業從整合模式向競爭性市場模式的轉變，並探討了如何在這兩種框架下進行規劃。該課程旨在闡明經濟原則在設計和運營電力市場中的應用，包括這一領域獨有的關鍵考量。

涵蓋的主題包括：

-	電力市場的經濟學基礎
-	電力市場的核心組成
-	拍賣理論與合約市場
-	合約市場
-	現貨市場
-	電力市場中的金融工具
-	輸電定價機制
-	輔助服務市場','This is a foundation course to provide general background knowledge of fundamentals of power system economics and electricity market.

This unit focuses on restructuring the power industry from the old integrated model to a more competitive market model and how the planning work will be done in both integrated power industry model and the power market model. The unit also intends to help students understand how the economic laws are used to design and run the power markets and what special factors that need to be considered for power market design.

The topics covered are:
•	Fundamentals of Economics in Electricity Market
•	Core Components of Electricity Markets
•	Auction Theory and Contract Markets
•	Contract Market
•	Spot Market
•	Financial Instruments in Electricity Market
•	Transmission Pricing Mechanisms
•	Ancillary Services Markets','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101129,'ENE4013','电机学','Electrical Machines','ENE - Energy Engineering','4013','E',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1
2023-24 Summer','','','本课程以电机为背景讲授机电系统的原理和分析，并介绍不同类型的交流和直流电机（包括变压器、感应电机和同步电机等）的运行特性。仿真模型（例如 MATLAB Simulink 模型）将用于让学生了解电机的动态行为。本课程为学生在电机设计等方面的未来学习做好准备。','This course teaches the principles and analysis of electromechanical systems in the context of electrical machines, and introduces the operation characteristics of different types of AC and DC electrical machines including transformers, induction machines and synchronous machines. Simulation models (e.g., MATLAB Simulink models) will be used to give students exposure to the electrical machines’ dynamic behavior. This course prepares students to undertake future studies in electrical machine design, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
