(101147,'ENE6045','金属离子电池的组装、测试与分析','','ENE - Energy Engineering','6045','E',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','CHM1001 General Chemistry','','课程提供机会给学生动手操作金属离子电池相关实验。实验涵盖商业正负极材料的极片制备、扣式电池组装、电池性能测试等。以锂离子电池为例，电池性能测试包括充放电曲线、倍率性能测试、循环稳定性测试等。表征技术包括循环伏安技术、电化学阻抗技术等。','The course mainly covers fundamentals of electrode preparation, batteries assembly, electrochemical test of commercial cathode and anode materials. Taking Li-ion batteries as examples, the electrochemical performance tests include charge/discharge curves, rate performance, cycling stability, etc. The characterization techniques cover cyclic voltammetry, electrochemical impedance,  etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
