2026-27 Term 1','NIL','N/A','ENG1001K是专为大学音乐专业学生开设的四门课程系列中的第一门课，旨在提高学生的英语综合语言能力。课程从音乐专业所需的重要语言沟通技能开始，涵盖音乐专业课和排练场景中的英语表达常用句。学期后续几周将着重于听力和阅读技巧、演讲，以及表达性论文写作。课程测评方式为听力考试、阅读考试、个人演讲、表达性论文课堂写作和课程参与度评价。','ENG1001K is the first of a four-course series designed exclusively for music majors to enhance their integrated English language skills relevant to their academic pursuits within the music domain. The course begins with basic music terminologies and English expressions commonly used in music lessons and rehearsal settings. Subsequent weeks address key areas such as listening and reading skills for music related lectures and textbook reading, oral presentations on musical instruments, and expressive essay writing. Assessment components include listening and reading exams, an individual presentation, an in-class essay, and class participation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
