2026-27 Term 1','NO','NO','本课程旨在帮助医学院学生使用基础学术英语技能进行有关医学话题的学习和表述。课程包括基础医学术语，科学杂志文章和视频，实用交际策略，演讲技巧和基础学术写作技能。学生将通过一系列进阶的听说读写作业不断进步。课程的考核方式包括：一个词汇考试，一个课堂演讲，一个听力考试，一个阅读考试, 两份写作作业和一个课堂期末写作考试。','This course aims to help medical students use basic academic English skills to study and present medical topics. It covers the essentials of medical terminology, scientific magazine articles and videos, practical communication strategies, presentation skills and basic academic writing skills. Students will progress through a series of increasingly complex vocabulary, reading, listening, speaking and writing assignments. Assessments will include one vocabulary test, one graded class presentation, one listening exam, one reading exam, two writing assignments and one final (in-class) essay writing assignment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
