2025-26 Term 2','Successful completion of English for Music Professionals (ENG1001K) or equivalence as recognized by HSS','N/A','ENG1002K是为大学音乐专业学生开设的四门英语课程系列中的第二门课。 课程旨在夯实学生的英语语言技能，以满足音乐专业课和大学学习所需。课程内容包括议论性演讲，重点培养学生构建论点与依据的能力、语言运用能力、演讲技巧，以及从听众角度思考的认知。学生也将撰写音乐评论，用书面语言描述音乐、在传达个体情感和意见的同时保持理性与客观。课程内容也涵盖因果关系论文和小组讨论技巧。学生将学会用文字探讨音乐领域的因果关系，并通过小组讨论学习提出观点、有理有据地推进话题和积极参与讨论。课程测评方式为议论性演讲、音乐评论写作、因果关系论文、小组讨论考试和课堂参与度评价。','ENG1002K, the second in a series of four courses tailored for college music majors, aims to enhance students’ English language proficiency for music-related courses and broader university-level studies. It focuses on argumentative speech skills, emphasizing argument construction, language use, delivery techniques, and audience adaptation. Students will learn to write music reviews, exploring genre description, emotional conveyance, and objective-opinion incorporation. The course also covers cause-effect essay writing and strategies for group discussions. Through essay writing, students will learn how to use coherent language to describe cause-effect relationships in the music field. Through group discussions, they will learn how to contribute comments based on evidence, facilitate discussions, and participate in a balanced manner. The course assessments include an argumentative speech, a music review, a cause-effect essay, a group discussion, and class participation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
