2026-27 Term 1','English for Academic Purposes (I) (ENG1002) or equivalence as defined by HSS','NA','本课程将在《学术英语（一）》的基础上继续强化学生在社会生活、学术场合以及工作环境所需的英语沟通能力的培养。课程将通过一系列真实的学术英语阅读材料来提高学生对不同体裁的语言特征的认识与了解，同时也为课堂讨论提供有意义的话题指导。本课程的课堂教学将围绕汇报技巧和研究论文写作技能两大中心任务来进行。课程的主要考核方式包括：一份研究计划书、一份研究计汇报以及一篇完整的研究论文。','This course aims to build upon concepts learned in ENG1002 (EAP1) to construct the foundation of strong oral and written English communication skills required to succeed in today’s social, academic, scientific, and business environments. Students will engage a variety of materials to include authentic academic texts, peer reviewed journal articles, and related videos. In-class activities will center on presentation skills related to research paper writing. Assessments will include a research proposal, a research presentation and a major research paper.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
