2026-27 Term 1','Successful completion of English for Music Professionals II (ENG1002K) or equivalence as recognized by HSS.','N/A','ENG2001K 是为大学音乐专业学生开设的四门英语课程系列中的第三门课。课程旨在提高学生的英语语言能力和音乐素养，以满足公众和学术环境所需。学生将通过短视频制作提升他们的演讲技巧和向大众普及音乐知识的能力。课程也包括比较论文写作，为要提升
学生文书写作和批判性思维能力。课程内容也涵盖了讲演音乐会（一种集演讲和音乐表演为一体的专业表达形式），以适应音乐领域的专业要求。最后，课程将通过分析性论文帮助学生熟悉学术论文的内容和结构。学生将阅读音乐领域文献、整合资料、构建分析性思维，为将来学术论文撰写夯实语言基础。课程测评方式包括演说短视频制作, 比较论文写作，精简版讲演音乐会,研究性论文阅读分析考试，以及课堂参与度评价。','ENG2001K, the third of a four-course series for college music majors,
aims at enhancing their English language skills and cultivating their
music identities in both public and academic settings. Students will learn to deliver video mini-lectures to improve their presentation skills and raise public awareness of music. Meanwhile, students will refine their writing and critical thinking skills through comparative essay writing. To prepare students for advanced academic pursuits, the course also introduces them to lecture recitals, a prevalent form of integrated lecture-music performance in professional settings. The final teaching component focuses on music research articles to acquaint students with scholarly content and structure. Students will learn to read research papers in the music field, synthesize information in academic language and construct their own analytical arguments, paving the way to compose research articles in their future studies. Course assessments include a video mini-lecture, a comparative essay, a mini lecture recital, an in-class exam on music research paper analysis, and class participation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
