2026-27 Term 1','ENG1001M and ENG1002M or equivalence as defined by HSS.','N/A','本课程是为医学二年级学生设计的。它旨在培养学生在医学目的和研究中使用英语进行交流的能力。它侧重于所有四种语言技能——口语、听力、阅读和写作。学生将熟练掌握不同背景下的医学术语和语言框架，从而使他们能够与患者进行有效沟通、与同行合作、在会议上发表演讲以及撰写学术文章。','This course is designed for the second-year medical students. It aims to develop students’ ability to communicate when using English for medical purposes and research. It focuses on all four language skills – speaking, listening, reading and writing. Students will gain proficiency in medical terminology and linguistic frameworks across diverse contexts, thereby enabling them to engage in effective communication with patients, collaborate with peers, deliver presentations at conferences, and compose scholarly articles.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
