2025-26 Term 2','English for Academic Purposes (II) (ENG2001) or equivalence.','N/A','ENG2002H《社会科学专业英语》旨在发展学生在不同语境下的实用沟通技巧，尤其是口头和书面表达能力。通过涵盖不同的文体，学生的口头报告、转介信、项目报告、以及商业计划书的书写等几方面的技能将会得到切实的提高，以满足日后从事与社会科学相关职业的交际需要。此外，学生将学习撰写职业履历，包括简历、求职信、邮件和个人陈述，并练习求职面试技巧。','ENG2002H aims to develop students’ practical communication skills (especially speaking and writing skills) in different settings. Through a comprehensive coverage of different genres and styles, students will be able to acquire communication skills which are essential for presentations and other workplace activities related to the social science oriented profession. Major learning topics include oral presentation, referral letters, report writing and project proposals. In addition, students will produce a professional portfolio consisting of a cover letter, resume and personal statement, and practice developing job interview skills.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101189,'ENG2002K','音乐专业英语 IV','','ENG - English','2002K','E',3.00,2000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Successful completion of English for Music Professionals III (ENG2001K) or equivalence as recognized by HSS.','n/a','ENG2002K是为大学音乐专业学生开设的四门英语课程系列中的最后一门。课程侧重于培养学生的沟通交流技巧和专业素养，以适应研究生学业和音乐行业要求。课程内容包括职场电子邮件和音乐微自传写作。课程重点为项目提案写作与口头讲演，以培养学生的说服力和叙事技巧。通过此门课程，学生也将学会高效搜索工作机会和研究生项目、提高简历和求职信写作能力，以及掌握必备的面试技巧。课程测评方式包括项目提案文书写作和口头讲演、简历与求职信撰写、个人模拟面试和课堂参与度评价。','ENG2002K is the last of a four-course series for college music majors, focusing on advanced communication skills essential for success in the music industry and graduate-level study. Throughout this course, students will delve into various aspects of professional communication, starting with professional emails and musicians'' micro-autobiographies. They will also develop written and oral project proposals, honing their storytelling techniques and mastering persuasive language. In addition, this course covers job and graduate program search strategies, resume writing, cover letters, and interview skills. Course assessments include a written project proposal, the oral presentation of the proposal, a resume and a cover letter, an individual mock interview, and class participation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101190,'ENG2002M','医学英语（四）','English for Medical Professionals IV','ENG - English','2002M','E',3.00,2000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','ENG2001M or equivalence as defined by HSS.','','本课程为二年级医学生设计，旨在提升学生在医疗环境中的沟通技能。通过模拟真实医疗场景的实践任务，培养学生的听、说、读、写四项语言能力。学生将学习如何进行患者咨询、撰写实习申请的个人陈述，并参与小组面试。本课程采用案例研究、医生与患者的角色扮演、小组讨论等方式，促进团队合作、共情和专业沟通能力的培养。课程结束后，学生将具备在临床环境中有效沟通的能力，能够综合复杂的医学文本，并展示清晰、专业的写作水平。','EMP2002 is designed to provide medical students with proficient spoken and written skills in English for effective communication in both academic and professional contexts. In this course, students will learn how to communicate with experts in their field and lay persons as well. The course will focus on medical comments writing, communication skills in healthcare environments and professional correspondences required for internship/job applications and/or application for further studies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
