2025-26 Term 2','English for Academic Purposes (II) (ENG2001) or equivalence.','N/A','ENG2002S《理工专业英语》是专为理工学院学生开设的专业英语课程。本课程旨在进一步提高学生英语口语和写作的能力，以促进学生在今后学术和工作环境中进行有效的英语交际。在这门课程中，学生将学习如何与该领域专家以及业外人士进行有效的沟通与交流。课程将侧重于学生对于技术报告、工程方案以及专业信函的了解和掌握。学生还将学习运用恰当的语言和沟通技巧，进行专业相关的报告展示以及工作面试。','ENG2002S is a discipline-specific English course for students from the School of Science and Engineering. This course is designed to provide students with sufficient spoken and written skills for effective communication in both academic and professional contexts. In this course, students will learn how to communicate with experts in their field and lay persons as well. The course will focus on technical reports, technical proposals, and professional correspondences required for internship/job applications and/or application for further studies overseas. Students will also learn to identify appropriate language as well as delivery skills for conducting technical presentations and job interviews.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
