2025-26 Term 2','Successful completion of ENL1001 (Listening & Speaking for Language Majors I) or equivalence.','There are no co-requisites for this course.','《英语视听说（二）》是为计划修读语言类本科专业的人文学
院学生所提供的听说课程中的第二门。本课程将继续为学生提供广泛的口语和听力训练，进一步培养学生在学术及日常生活所需要的听说能力。课程将在  ENL1001  的基础上，强化对专业笔记技能的训练，使他们能够更有效地理解和记录较为具有挑战性的听力材料（如长篇的演讲及大学的讲座）。课程也将通过对演说的深度分析与呈现，增强学生的口语说服力以及帮助他们学会克服口语交际中容易出现的逻辑谬误。此外，课程也将训练学生的公开演说（含即兴演讲） 的能力。','This is the second course aimed at developing the speaking and listening skills of students who plan to take language programs. The course continues to provide students with extensive speaking and listening practices with a view to applying these to a range of both academic and real-world situations. Building on the learning fostered in ENL1001, students will now acquire professional note-taking skills, allowing them to engage more effectively with extended speeches and university lectures. Students will also present, in groups, an in-depth Speech Analysis in which they will explore modes of persuasion and fallacies in communication. Finally, students will practice preparing, researching, and delivering their own public speeches, as well as learn how to respond to impromptu public speaking scenarios.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101201,'ENL1003','阅读与写作（一）','','ENL - English for Language Students','1003','E',3.00,1000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 1
