2025-26 Term 1','There are no pre-requisites for this course.','There are no co-requisites for this course.','这是面向计划参加语言课程的一年级学生的两门专注于阅读和写作的课程中的第一门。第一门课程将巩固和建立学生已经拥有的知识。学生将使用文本来制定合适的阅读策略。将向学生介绍对文本的批判性理解、解构和分析。学生将完成两项作业，以提高书面表达能力、掌握基本结构并学习说明文写作。将有每周阅读和阅读考试。本学期，学生将对英语如何在文化和社会环境中发挥作用有基本的了解。','This is the first of two courses focusing on reading and writing for first year students who plan to take language programs. This first course will consolidate and build on the knowledge already possessed by students. Students will work with texts to develop suitable reading strategies. Students will be introduced to critical comprehension, deconstruction and analysis of text. Students will complete two assignments to improve written expression, master basic structure and be introduced to expository essay writing. There will be weekly readings and a reading examination. This semester, students will develop a basic understanding of how English language works in a cultural and social setting.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101202,'ENL1004','阅读与写作（二）','','ENL - English for Language Students','1004','E',3.00,1000,'English','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
