2025-26 Term 1','No.','No.','本课程旨在提高学生对当前商业问题的理解。 特邀演讲者将被邀请涵盖经济和金融的各个方面。 整个学年平均将举办五到十场系列研讨会。 课程将以小组书面报告和口头报告结束。','This course is designed to enhance students’ understanding of current issues in business. Guest speakers will be invited to cover various aspects of economics and finance. The series of five to ten seminars will be conducted on average during the entire academic year. The course will conclude with a group written report and an oral presentation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
