(101282,'FEMBA6110','公司治理与社会责任','','FEMBA - Business Admin in FIN','6110','F',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','None','None','本课程将建立一个分析框架，让学生了解中国的公司治理和会计实务，并与美国、日本和韩国等其他国家的实践进行比较。更具体地说，本课程将分析经济改革、国家所有制、家族所有制、家族继承、政治力量、海外上市、市场中介、新技术和文化对公司治理和透明度的作用。课程将以讲座和案例讨论的形式进行。讲座将设置理论背景，案例讨论将要求学生将理论应用到实际案例中，涵盖的公司包括阿里巴巴、安然、中石油、新达、新鸿基、三星、奥林巴斯、嘉汉林业、九鼎等等。','The course will set up an analytical framework for students to understand corporate governance and accounting practices in China, comparing with the practices in other countries, such as U.S., Japan and South Korea. More specifically, the course will analyse the role of economic reform, state ownership, family ownership, family succession, political forces, over sea listing, market intermediary, new technology and culture on corporate governance and transparency. The course will be delivered in a format of lecture and case discussion. The lectures will set up the theoretical background and the case discussion will require the students to apply theories into real cases, which will cover firms as Alibaba, Enron, PetroChina, Suntec, Sun Hung Kai, Sumsung, Olympus, Sino Forest, Jiu Ding, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
