(101294,'FEMBA6122','数据、模型和决策','','FEMBA - Business Admin in FIN','6122','F',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Summer','No','No','商业决策通常是困难和冒险的，因为决策者必须依靠不完整和不完善的信息对复杂和关键问题做出迅速选择。 本课程的第一个目标是通过引入决策分析和数据分析方法，帮助学生提高不确定性下商业决策的知识/技能。 本课程的第二个目标是在商业应用的背景下介绍最先进的机器学习方法，并帮助学生在随后的职业生涯中抓住数据支持的商业机会。 该课程还将教授学生如何使用商业软件（包括统计软件和决策软件）来解决现实世界的商业决策问题。','Business decisions are often difficult and risky because decision-makers have to make prompt choices over complex and critical problems, relying on incomplete and imperfect information. The first objective of this course is to help students to improve their knowledge/skills in business decision-making under uncertainty, by introducing decision-making analysis and data analysis methodologies. The second objective of this course is to introduce state-of-the-art machine learning methods in the context of business applications and help students rise up to data-enabled commercial opportunities in their subsequent careers. The course will also teach students how to use commercial software (including statistics software and decision making software) to solve real-world business decision problems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
