(101303,'FEMBA6131','供应链管理与供应链金融','','FEMBA - Business Admin in FIN','6131','F',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2021-22 Summer
2022-23 Summer','No.','No.','供应链管理是当今商业世界中一个快速发展的业务领域。京东、苹果、特斯拉等跨国公司为了获得竞争优势，在供应链管理上投入巨资。 公司内部和公司之间材料、信息和资金流的协调和整合对于有效的供应链管理至关重要。 传统上，这些公司更关注物质和信息流。 现在，资金流及其管理对于供应链的成功至关重要。 在本课程中，我们将介绍供应链管理和供应链金融的基本概念和模型，包括材料采购、与供应商和客户的关系、终端消费者信息的使用、供应链金融产品和供应风险管理连锁金融。 我们将讨论在各个行业的应用，特别是在中国的行业。','Supply chain management is a fast growing business area in today’s business world. Global companies, such as JD.com, Apple, and Tesla, have heavily invested in supply chain management in order to gain competitive advantages. The coordination and integration of the flows of materials, information, and funds within and across companies are critical in effective supply chain management. Traditionally, the firms focus more on material and information flows. Now, financial flow and its management is critical to the success of a supply chain. In this course, we will cover basic concepts and models in supply chain management and supply chain finance, including the sourcing of materials, the relationships with suppliers and customers, the use of information from end consumers, supply chain finance products and risk management in supply chain finance. And we will discuss applications in various industries, in particular, industries in China.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
