2024-25 Term 2','No','No','该课程旨在加强学生对国际商业惯例、文化多样性和全球经济趋势的了解，随后将在中国以外的选定国家进行为期五天的学习周。学生必须提交书面报告，并对自己的工作进行口头陈述。游学期间，学生通常会在当地一流大学参加一到两天的课程，并参与一系列活动，包括参观公司、客座讲座、文化熏陶和交流机会。所涉及的具体国家和行业可能因课程和考察重点而异。','The course is designed to enhance students'' understanding of international business practices, cultural diversity, and global economic trends, followed by a five-day study week in a selected country outside China. Students have to submit a written report and make oral presentation of their work. During the study tour, students typically participate in one or two days of courses at local top universities and engage in a range of activities, including company visits, guest lectures, cultural immersion, and networking opportunities. The specific countries and industries covered may vary depending on the programme and the focus of the study tour.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
