(101316,'FEX6101','高级公司金融','','FEX - Business Admin in FIN','6101','F',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','None.','None.','本课程侧重于个人如何在不同情况下做出最佳决策。 它提供了对各种经济概念的见解，这将使学生在商业环境中成为更加有效的决策者。 这些概念包括市场如何运作、产品的需求和供应以及企业在竞争市场与集中市场中的战略行为。','This course explores the financial management decisions of a corporation in depth. Specific topics include capital budgeting analysis under perfect and non-perfect competition; the theories of agency costs and asymmetric information that underlie financial decisions; capital structure; dividend policy; raising equity capital and long-term debt; IPOs and backdoor listing; and corporate risk management.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101317,'FEX6102','竞争战略','','FEX - Business Admin in FIN','6102','F',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','Same as the general requirements for EMBA students. （Please check with CUHK’s EMBA Chinese Program.）','Same as the general requirements for EMBA students. （Please check with CUHK’s EMBA Chinese Program.','本课程侧重于高管如何在不同情况下做出最佳决策，尤其是在面临不确定性和复杂性的情况下。 它旨在为学生提供战略思维和思考如何提高企业竞争力，从而实现可持续发展。 它将介绍如何战略性地管理资源、能力和核心竞争力的各种战略理论和分析工具。 它将深入分析企业如何应对外部环境中的机会和威胁。','This course focuses on how executive makes optimal decisions under different circumstances, especially in the face of uncertainty and complexity. It aims to provide students with a strategic mindset and thinking on how to enhance firm competitiveness, thereby achieving sustainable development. It will introduce various strategic theories and analytical tools on how to manage resources, capabilities, and core competencies strategically. It will provide an in-depth analysis of how businesses respond to opportunities and threats in the external environment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101318,'FEX6103','会计实践','','FEX - Business Admin in FIN','6103','F',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程中，学生将深入了解用于记录资产、负债和所有者权益的会计原则，以及这些会计原则对企业分析的影响。 报告还将深入分析中国内地和中国上市公司（包括A股、B股和H股公司）财务报告和财务披露的要求和做法。','In this course, students gain in-depth knowledge of accounting principles used to record assets, liabilities, and owners’ equity and the effects of these accounting principles on the analysis of the enterprise. It will also provide an in-depth analysis of the requirement and practice of financial reporting and financial disclosure in mainland China and listed Chinese companies, including A-share, B-share, and H-share firms.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
