2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','NA','NA','本课程对主要中央银行（例如美联储和中国人民银行）的货币政策制定以及这些政策对全球金融市场，特别是对中国金融市场的影响进行系统回顾。 此外，该课程还提供有关中国宏观金融问题的最新发展以及这些新发展在全球金融体系中的相互作用的见解。','This course provides a systematic review of monetary policy making in major central banks (e.g., the Federal Reserve and the People''s Bank of China) and the impact of these policies on the global financial markets, especially on China’s financial markets. In addition, the course offers insights on the latest development of macro financial issues in China and the interactions of these new developments within the global financial system.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
