2026-27 Term 1','Basic financial knowledge, programming skill and statistics/optimization knowledge required and previous exposure to calculus, linear algebra, derivatives, corporate finance, python and statistics.','','本课程涵盖量化投资组合管理技术和策略，并使用Python进行计算实践。它专为有志在量化资产管理领域或系统交易策略方面发展的学生所设计。课程包括基本投资概念、经典投资组合理论、最先进的智能贝塔策略制定、因子建模和风险优化、主动投资组合管理和设计、动态对冲等。编程和数字算法为课程内容的一个重点，学生有望学习并将Python应用于解决行业中常遇到的实际问题中。','The course covers quantitative portfolio management techniques and strategies with hands-on computing using Python. It is specially designed for students with a career endeavor in the quantitative asset management field or systematic trading strategies. Topics will include fundamental investment concepts, classical portfolio theories, state-of-the-art smart beta strategies formulation, factors modelling and risk optimization, active portfolio management and design, dynamic hedging etc. Programming and numerical algorithm will be a focus and students are expected to learn and apply Python to real practice problems encountered widely in the industry.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101366,'FIN(6128)','机器学习与金融建模** 从 2027/07/16 起可用','','FIN - Finance','(6128)','F',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
