2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Master students who have learned Calculus, Linear Algebra, and Statistics/Probability
At least one course in Programming/Algorithm/Machine Learning/Data Mining','','大数据分析与大规模机器学习在金融、金融科技和交易领域的应用日益广泛。本课程主要涵盖三部分内容。
课程第一部分将面向金融科技专业学生，讲授大数据的存储、处理、分析、建模及预测等全流程管理。第二部分将系统介绍机器学习与深度学习技术及其在金融与金融科技领域的实践应用。最后环节将聚焦大型语言模型、智能体、生成式模型、强化学习等前沿话题，并探讨其在金融科技中的创新应用。
课程将邀请三位特邀嘉宾进行专题讲座，同时安排四至五次实验环节（其中约半数为选修）。','Big Data Analytics and large-scale Machine Learning have seen more and more application in Finance, Fintech and Trading. The course mainly covers three parts.
The first part of this course is to teach students majoring in Fintech how to manage big data including storage, processing, analysis, modeling, and prediction.
The course will also be devoted to machine learning and deep learning, and their application in Finance and Fintech. 
Lastly, this course will cover hot topics such as LLMs, AI agents, generative models, RL and their application in Fintech.
This course will invite three guest speakers to give related lectures.
In addition, four to five lab sessions will be included (about half of them are optional).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
