2026-27 Term 1','No pre-requisites.','No co-requisites.','课程旨在构建一个以项目为驱动的研习环境，以探索金融科技（FinTech）的颠覆性应用，并将其系统化地应用于解决现实世界中的复杂商业需求。课程设计涵盖了 FinTech 领域的核心概念框架、前沿技术工具集以及精细化的运营方法论。通过系统化的“边做边学”的方式，课程将确保学生培养出卓越的实践操作能力，并能独立完成具有创新性和高影响力的尖端项目。','This course is designed as a project-based learning environment to explore the transformative application of financial technology (FinTech) in addressing complex, real-world business imperatives. The curriculum provides rigorous coverage of core conceptual frameworks, cutting-edge technical toolsets, and essential operational methodologies, enabling students to cultivate superior hands-on proficiencies and execute innovative, high-impact projects through a systematic learning-by-doing pedagogy.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101368,'FIN(6145)','金融实践项目** 从 2027/07/16 起可用','','FIN - Finance','(6145)','F',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程作为金融科技方向的实践项目，旨在通过项目制学习模式，探索如何运用金融科技解决实际商业问题。课程涵盖核心概念、工具及实务操作，使学生通过实践学习掌握实操技能，完成前沿项目开发。','This course serves as a capstone project for the FinTech track, designed to explore how financial technology can be applied to solve real-world business problems through a project-based learning environment. The course covers core concepts, tools, and practical operations, enabling students to develop hands-on skills and complete cutting-edge projects through a learning-by-doing approach.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
