2021-22 Summer','No prerequisites.','No co-requisite.','本课程旨在介绍金融的基本概念以及做金融决策所需要的基本工具。本课程包含四个部分：(1)基础概念和工具，包括金融市场的构成，金钱的时间价值和资产定价模型，（2）投资者的决策，包括风险和回报分析，投资策略的开发，（3）公司的决策，包括资本预算及资本结构，以及（4）人工智能在金融中的应用。','This is an introductory finance course that develops the basic concepts and tools for making financial decisions. The course consists of four parts: (1) basic concepts and tools, including the structure of financial markets, time value of money, and financial asset valuation, (2) investors’ decisions, including risk and return assessment and investment strategy development, (3) corporates’ decisions, including capital budgeting and capital structure, and (4) the application of AI in finance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
