2017-18 Summer','ECO3121 & (ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H))','No co-requisite','本课程着重讲述对有投资决策有用的金融理论与实证证据。课程内容大致可分为四类：股票组合管理理论、股票估值理论与实践、股票市场的实证研究和有效市场假说与行为金融学。我们将同时涵盖美国股市和中国股市。','The focus of this course is on the financial theories and empirical evidence that are useful for investment decisions. The topics covered in this course can be broadly categorized into four groups: stock portfolio management theories, stock valuation theories and practices, empirical evidence in the equity markets, and efficient market and behavioral finance. We will cover both the US stock market and the Chinese stock market.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101376,'FIN3090','人工智能在金融中的应用','AI Applications in Finance','FIN - Finance','3090','F',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','FIN2010 & (ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H))','','课程旨在对机器学习与人工智能方法如何应用于金融领域核心问题进行实践导向的探讨。课程将人工智能的基础方法与前沿技术同金融应用场景相结合，重点阐释人工智能技术如何重塑金融分析与决策过程。通过系统化的实践学习路径，学生将培养运用人工智能方法解决实际金融问题的实践能力，并能够将相关方法应用于真实的金融项目与行业场景。','This course provides a practice-oriented exploration of how machine learning and artificial intelligence methods can be applied to core problems in finance. It integrates foundational and frontier AI methods with financial applications, highlighting how AI technologies transform financial analysis and decision-making. Through a systematic learning-by-doing approach, students will develop practical capabilities to apply AI methods to real-world projects and industry applications in finance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101377,'FIN3210','金融科技理论与实践','Fintech Theory and Practice','FIN - Finance','3210','F',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
