(101379,'FIN3340','风险投资与创业金融','Venture Capital and Entrepreneurial Finance','FIN - Finance','3340','F',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1
