2022-23 Summer','FIN2010 & (ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003))','No co-requisite.','本课程将以 Python 为主要工具，结合现代人工智能（AI）技术，全面介绍金融数据分析的方法与实践，旨在提升编程效率、自动化复杂任务，并优化分析结果的准确性。学生将学习处理与可视化金融数据的核心技能，掌握股票与投资组合绩效分析方法，包括风险价值（VaR）计算、资本资产定价模型（CAPM）回归分析、Fama-French 模型以及均值—方差投资组合优化。课程还将探讨金融数据的关键统计特征，如平稳性与自相关性，并分析其对模型可靠性的影响。课程最后将以 WRDS 数据库为案例，复现 Fama-French 三因子模型，并引入 AI 应用，如自然语言转代码、智能数据清洗、自动化特征工程和智能报告生成，显著提升工作流程效率与挖掘深层次洞察的能力。完成课程后，学生将具备将 Python 与 AI 技术结合，开展高效、创新、数据驱动的金融分析的能力。','This course offers a practical introduction to financial data analysis using Python, blending core finance concepts with modern AI-powered tools to boost coding productivity, automate complex tasks, and enhance analytical accuracy. Students will develop essential skills in manipulating and visualizing financial data, analyzing stocks and portfolio performance through Value-at-Risk (VaR), regression in the Capital Asset Pricing Model (CAPM), the Fama-French model, and mean-variance portfolio optimization. Key statistical properties of financial data, including stationarity and autocorrelation, will be examined to understand their influence on analysis reliability. The course culminates in a hands-on case study replicating the Fama-French 3-Factor Model using WRDS, with AI applications such as natural language-to-code translation, intelligent data cleaning, automated feature engineering, and smart reporting pipelines used to streamline workflows and uncover deeper insights. By the end, students will be equipped to combine Python and AI for efficient, innovative, and data-driven financial analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
