(101383,'FIN4060','中国与世界的金融市场','Financial Markets in China and the World','FIN - Finance','4060','F',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2016-17 Term 1
