2026-27 Term 1','FIN2010 & (ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H))','No co-requisite.','本课程是关于债券市场的利率和风险管理。 深入了解了不同的债权投资组合策略并说明如何使用各种类型的衍生证券来转移与固定收益证券投资相关的风险。本课程还广泛涵盖债券市场的所有部门和债券估值方法。','This course is about interest rates and risk management in bond markets. It develops insights into different bond portfolio strategies and illustrates how various types of derivative securities can be used to shift the risks associated with investing in fixed-income securities. It also provides extensive coverage on all sectors of the bond market and the techniques for valuing bonds.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
