2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','本课程建立在核心会计知识的基础上。它使学生具备分析各行业财务报表数据的技能，以便在投资和估值方面做出明智的商业决策。 将部署各种模型，如股息贴现模型、自由现金流模型、剩余收益估值模型、非正常收益增长模型，以及并结合实际业务情况解释比率，如市盈率、市净率和PEG。','This course builds upon core accounting knowledge. It equips students with skills to analyze and interpret financial statement data in various industries to make informed business decisions in investment and valuation. Various models will be deployed such as Dividend Discount Model, Free Cash Flows Model, Residual Income Valuation Model, Abnormal Earnings Growth Model as well as interpretation of ratios such as P/E, P/B and PEG with real business context.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
