2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在深入探讨宏观动态环境下的金融决策，架起货币理论与金融市场实践之间的桥梁。课程超越基础的核算框架，聚焦于金融中介机制、中央银行政策以及货币冲击向资产价格的传导过程。学生将探讨央行数字货币（CBDC）、金融稳定性以及地缘政治对资本流动的影响等前沿议题，从而掌握在全球及中国金融领域进行高阶分析与实践所需的关键工具。','This advanced course analyzes financial decisions within a dynamic macroeconomic context, bridging the gap between monetary theory and financial market practice. Moving beyond basic accounting frameworks, the curriculum focuses on the mechanisms of financial intermediation, central bank policies, and the transmission of monetary shocks to asset prices. Students will engage with contemporary issues such as CBDCs, financial stability, and geopolitical impacts on capital flows, equipping them with the analytical tools necessary for high-level practice in global and Chinese finance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
