2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在拓宽学生对中国金融发展中许多当代问题的视野，并提高他们有效分析这些问题的能力。业界嘉宾将与学生一起完成课堂案例演示和项目研究。通过为学生提供将理论与现有金融实践相结合的机会，该课程帮助学生获得对中国金融行业最新趋势的实践见解。
本课程聘请多名就职于金融机构的业界导师授课，授课语言为中文。','The course aims to broaden students’ perspective on many contemporary issues in Chinese financial development and enhance their analytical skills to effectively analyze these issues. Practitioner speakers will work with students on both classroom case presentations and projects. By offering students opportunity to integrate theories with existing finance practices, the course helps students gain practical insights in the latest trends of the financial industry in China.
This course is conducted mainly in Chinese in the form of workshops hosted by local financial industry executives.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101403,'FIN6109','行为金融学','','FIN - Finance','6109','F',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2016-17 Term 1
