2019-20 Summer','','','市场微观结构研究旨在剖析各类交易机制的本质与影响，探究不同交易规则如何作用于价格形成过程，以及资产价格呈现特定时间序列特征的内在成因。本课程将为你系统讲授市场微观结构与高频金融领域的核心模型、理论概念及量化分析方法，同时夯实金融建模相关认知；课程还将深入分析由信息不对称、存货管理以及市场参与者交易策略所衍生的底层经济学逻辑。','Microstructure studies examine the nature and consequences of different trading mechanisms, and explore how different trading protocols affect price formation, and why asset prices exhibit particular time series properties they do. In this course we will equip you with the core models, concepts, and quantitative methods in market microstructure and high frequency finance, along with an understanding of financial modelling. We will also examine the economic underpinning arising from asymmetric information, inventory control and strategies of participants.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
