2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程讲解金融风险管理的核心概念与基本原理，旨在打通金融领域学术理论与实务风险管理之间的壁垒。学生将深入掌握主流金融业务与金融产品，学习对信用风险、市场风险、操作风险、流动性风险等核心风险进行识别、研判、量化与管控。课程同时涵盖当下行业前沿难题，包括监管政策变革、人工智能带来的行业影响、地缘政治风险等相关专题内容。','This course introduces the key concepts and core principles of Financial Risk Management, aiming to bridge the gap between academic theory and practical risk management in the financial sector. Students will gain an in-depth understanding of common financial businesses and products, and learn how to identify, assess, measure, and manage key risks (credit, market, operational, and liquidity risks). The curriculum extends to modern challenges, incorporating topics such as regulatory changes, the impact of artificial intelligence (AI) and geopolitical risks.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
