2025-26 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程主要介绍创业公司融资的相关课题。具体包括：（1） 如何针对创业公司进行估值，这也是本课程的主要讨论课题 （2）评估创业公司的商机：中小企业与大企业适用的经济理论的差异（3）创业公司的融资需求和融资手段（4）成功的风险投资基金如何成功"退出"。','The course covers financial topics most relevant to newly formed companies, with an emphasis on innovative startups that target large markets and raise outside capital. Includes topics on: (1) valuation, which is the course''s primary theme, underlying all of the topics covered, (2) evaluating business opportunities, which focuses on the underlying economic principles that differentiate large opportunities from small opportunities, (3) funding business opportunities, which covers both identifying a company''s needs and acquiring the capital to finance those needs, and (4) discussing how successful entrepreneurial ventures "exit."','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
