Investment Management and Analysis','N/A','本课程结合理论和实践（美国与中国资本市场）来分析另类资产及其投资管理知识。课程将从机构投资经理（如对冲基金，私募股权基金，风险投资基金，ETF等）的角度分析如何进行另类资产配置。通过本课程，学生将了解对冲基金，ETF，私募股权基金，等经典替代资产的回报，风险，特征和投资策略。同时，作为机构投资者，学生也将理解如何进行另类资产配置。
（*部分案例以及模拟交易平台为中文）','This course combines theory and practice (with US and Chinese capital markets) to analyze alternative assets and their investment management knowledge. The course will analyze how to conduct alternative asset allocation from the perspective of institutional investment managers (such as hedge funds, private equity, venture capital, ETFs, etc.). Through this course, students will learn about the returns, risks, characteristics, and investment strategies of classic alternative assets such as hedge funds, ETFs, and private equity funds. Meanwhile, students will also understand, as institutional investors, how to allocate alternative assets.
