2026-27 Term 1','FIN2010     Financial Management
ECO3121    Introductory Econometrics','','金融科技（Fintech）正以革命性的方式与速度改变金融服务行业。本课程的目的是向学生介绍金融科技的理论与实践，主要涵盖新技术在金融服务中的应用，例如大数据、区块链、机器学习与人工智能等。通过本课程的学习，学生将对近期金融科技发展态势和金融服务的创新形式有广泛了解，包括 P2P 借贷（和众筹）、智能投顾、保险科技和加密货币等。此外，我们将讨论金融科技转型过程中出现的监管挑战和隐私问题；金融公司、大型科技公司与保险公司的代表们也将会与班级分享金融科技在各自行业中的最新进展。','Financial technology (FinTech) is revolutionary and rapidly changing the financial services industries. The objective of this course is to introduce students to the theory and practice of FinTech. This course covers the applications of new technologies in financial services such as big data, blockchain, machine learning and artificial intelligence (AI). Students are expected to develop a broad understanding of the recent FinTech developments and the new forms of financial services such as peer-to-peer lending and crowdfunding, robo-advisors, InsurTech and cryptocurrencies. In addition, we will discuss the regulatory challenges and privacy concerns that emerge as part of the FinTech transformation.  Representatives from financial firms, big technological companies or insurance companies will be invited to share with the class the recent development in FinTech in the industry.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
