2026-27 Term 1','Undergraduate level knowledge of probability, statistics, linear algebra, and econometrics.
Familiarity with Python (assignments will require coding with Python).
Basic knowledge of finance and investment is beneficial.','None','这门课程将介绍现代投资组合管理概念和投资组合与资产管理的技术分析技能。课程主题包括资产配置、资产定价模型、套利定价模型、最优投资组合的构建、投资决策的税收效应等。学生需要完成构建最优投资组合相关的课程项目。此外，如何对投资组合决策表现的预测，陈述和评估也将包括在课程中。','In this course, students will learn the modern portfolio management concepts and technical analysis skills of portfolio and asset management. The topics include asset allocation, asset pricing model, the arbitrage pricing model, construction of optimal portfolio, etc. Students are expected to complete the class projects related to construction of optimal portfolio. Furthermore, expectation of portfolio decisions, presentation and evaluation on portfolio performance will be included in the class.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
