Students are not allowed to select other course(s) during the term they enroll in this course. Students are not allowed to retake this course.','','本课程旨在让学生将课堂知识应用于实际工作，使学生获得金融相 关行业的实践工作经验，最后走向成功的职业道路。本课程中，学 生应根据自身兴趣、个人技能及职业发展规划寻找相符的实习职 位，主动联系职业发展中心寻求帮助和并获得持续反馈。实习结束 后，学生将有机会对自己的职业道路方向进行反思，并根据实际情 况优化职业发展规划。','This course links classroom knowledge and real-world applications with an actual work setting opportunity. It provides students with hands-on work experience in finance related industry, which are necessary for a successful career path. Students should have some ideas of their job interest personal skill sets and career path, and then secure a position in line with that. Students should take the initiative to contact the Career Development Centre for assistance and continual feedback. After the internship experience, students can have a reflection opportunity on the direction of their career paths.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
