2026-27 Term 1','Students are assumed to be familiar with basic microeconomics, including solving optimization problems using Lagrange multipliers, and linear algebra.','','本课程涵盖资产定价的基本模型，以及用于解释经验资产定价事实的资本市场摩擦模型和需求系统方法。课程首先介绍均值—方差分析、投资组合选择和资本资产定价模型，随后讨论风险厌恶、无套利定价、状态价格、随机贴现因子和风险中性估值等核心工具。课程还将分析信息不对称、交易成本、有限市场参与、融资约束和搜寻成本等市场摩擦如何影响资产价格。最后，课程介绍基于需求系统的资产定价模型，说明投资者需求、机构交易和投资者异质性如何影响资产价格与预期收益。','This course covers the basic model of asset pricing, as well as models of capital-market frictions and the demand system approach to interpreting empirical asset-pricing facts. It begins with mean-variance analysis, portfolio choice, and the Capital Asset Pricing Model, then develops core asset-pricing tools such as risk aversion, no-arbitrage pricing, state prices, stochastic discount factors, and risk-neutral valuation. The course further examines how market frictions—including information asymmetry, transaction costs, limited participation, financial constraints, and search costs—affect asset prices. It concludes with demand-based asset-pricing models that explain how investor demand, institutional trading, and investor heterogeneity shape prices and expected returns.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
