2026-27 Term 1','Asset Pricing, Corporate Finance','None','本课程旨在介绍中国金融体系及企业行为，例如政企关系、金融机构和金融市场在中国的独特特征。本课程涉及重要的研究方法，如IV、DID和RDD，以及它们在实证研究中的应用。此外，本课程通过对学术论文的讲解及讨论帮助学生掌握研究方法，熟悉研究前沿，以便他们可以开始自己的研究。','This course provides a treatment of the financial system in China. The course discusses cutting-edge research topics in regarding to Chinese firms, financial markets and institutions, e.g., the interaction between governments and firms, the unique characteristics of China’s financial institutions, stock and corporate bond markets. The course introduces important research methodologies, such as IV, DID and RDD and how they are applied in research as well. The class is based on carefully planned paper presentations and discussions. The goal is to help students mastering the most useful research methodologies and getting familiar with the research frontier, so that they can start their own China related research after taking this class.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101455,'FIN6314','金融科技','','FIN - Finance','6314','F',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
2021-22 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本课程对区块链金融进行了深入分析。我们将首先讨论区块链和共识机制的基础知识，重点是工作量证明和比特币实施。我们还将讨论区块链的当前和潜在用途。然后我们将讨论权益证明和替代共识机制，以及以以太坊区块链为重点的智能合约。然后，我们将描述基于智能合约的去中心化金融（DeFi）的潜在优势，并深入研究DeFi的主要领域，例如基于自动做市（AMM）的交易所和抵押品。','This course offers in-depth analysis of blockchain-based finance. We’ll begin by discussing the basics of blockchains and consensus mechanisms with a focus on proof-of-work and Bitcoin implementation. We’ll also discuss current and potential uses of blockchain. Then we’ll move to discussing proof-of-stake and alternative consensus mechanisms, and smart contracts with a focus on Ethereum blockchain. We will then describe potential advantages of smart-contract-based, decentralized finance (DeFi), and delve into main DeFi areas, such as automated-market-making (AMM)-based exchanges and collateralized and flash borrowing/lending.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
