2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','法语（一） 是为法语零基础、具备一定语言学习能力的学生开设的基础语言课程， 可对应欧洲语言共同参考框架 A1 级别。 作为一门初级课程，本课程将为通过各种教学活动为学生提供法语听力、口语、阅读和写作技巧方面的基本训练。本课程的教学重点是使学生具备日常生活场景中的基本语言交流能力，能够参与并完成某些社会活动。
学完本课程的学生将具备基本的法语会话能力、 简短的法语文章阅读能力，并能够在语句书写中使用正确的语法。 通过聆听慢速法语演讲、听写练习以及法语歌曲赏析，学生将锻炼其法语听力与理解的能力。 通过该课程的学习，学生将熟悉以现在时为的语法知识，法语词汇量会达到 500 左右，并在课上接触到一些法国文化知识。','French I is a foundational language course for students who have no prior knowledge of French but have successfully mastered another foreign language. It is equivalent to an A1 level course for the beginners according to the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages (CEFR). It provides rudimental teaching in French listening, speaking, reading, and writing skills through different kinds of language activities. The primary focus of this course is to equip students with basic communicative language competence so that they can function in certain everyday interactions and accomplish simple tasks in several social contexts.
Upon completion of the course, students will master some fundamental conversational skills and be able to read short and simple texts in French. They will develop basic listening skills through listening to materials such as French music, dictation, and standard French speech at a slower rate of speech. They will develop a vocabulary bank of around 500 words with a basic command of grammar using the present tense. They will also learn something about French culture in the class.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
