(101495,'FTE4312','区块链与去中心化应用','Blockchain and Decentralized Applications','FTE - Fintech','4312','F',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程从技术和商业层面讲授区块链技术、分布式账本技术、加密货币、非同质化通证以及去中心化应用程序，重点涵盖去中心化金融（包括去中心化交易所、自动做市机、稳定币、闪电贷、链上治理等）与分布式共识机制（如工作量证明、权益证明、拜占庭容错等）。学生将学习区块链系统的运作原理、基于智能合约的软件应用开发，以及去中心化金融与经济系统的分析方法。','The course covers the technical and business aspects of blockchain technologies, distributed ledger technology, cryptocurrencies, non-fungible tokens, and decentralized applications, with a strong emphasis on decentralized finance (including decentralized exchanges, automated market makers, stablecoins, flash loans, and on-chain governance) and distributed consensus mechanisms (such as proof-of-work, proof-of-stake, and Byzantine fault tolerance). Students will learn how these systems work, how to develop smart-contract-based software applications, and how to analyze decentralized financial and economic systems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
