2023-24 Summer','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','自古以来，人类对遥远的天空充满着好奇与着迷。这种好奇和着迷促使了人们对天空探索的长足发展，发明了各种观测天文学的技术。本课程目的不仅教授天文学基本知识，也旨在启发学生对大自然如何运作的好奇心。课程内容涵盖广泛的主题，从现代天文学的起源、观测天文学到测量天体的技术，从太阳系到恒星演化。 此外，内容也会介绍中国传统的天文学。','Since ancient times, human beings have been curious about and fascinated with the remote sky, and this curiosity and fascination have boosted humans’ inquisition into the sky and invented various techniques in observational astronomy. The course is designed not only to present a volume of knowledge, but also to arouse students’ curiosity about how nature works. A wide range of topics will be covered, ranging from the origin of modern astronomy, observational astronomy to techniques in measuring celestial objects, from the solar system to stellar evolution. Moreover, traditional Chinese astronomy will be introduced.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
