2026-27 Term 1','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程旨在介绍和探索中国古代科学在理论、方法及传播方面的重要突破，欢迎所有专业的本科生修读。通过本课程的学习，学生将理解并分析古代中国人如何运用科学方法来应对自然、技术、工程、数学及医学等领域的实际问题。课程还将探讨古代中国语境下人类与自然的关系，帮助学生更全面地认识古代中国科学的独特价值及其对现代社会的启示。','This course is open to students from all majors. It will introduce major breakthroughs in the theories, methods, and diffusions of science in ancient China. The course is designed to help students contextualize and appreciate how ancient Chinese people utilized scientific methods in solving contemporary concerns related to nature, science, technology, engineering, mathematics, and medicine. The roles of human in being part of nature will also be studied.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
