2024-25 Term 2','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程探讨分子遗传学上的重大发现，公众对遗传学的误解以及生物技术的最新进展。话题包括遗传学的起源，人类基因组计划，遗传疾病，复杂性状与基因的关系，基因测试，古DNA研究，拉马克与表观遗传学，基因工程，基因修饰生物，基因治疗，人群遗传学。本课程旨在帮助学生了解生物技术的基本原理，在将来做出智性选择。','The course discusses the fundamental discoveries in molecular biology, public misunderstandings of genetics, and the latest progress in biotechnologies. The topics include the origin of genetics, Human Genome Project, inherited diseases, complex traits & genes, genetic test, ancient DNA, Lamarck and epigenetics, genetic engineering, genetically modified organisms (GMO), gene therapy and population genetics. It helps the students understand the mechanism of biotechnologies and make informed decisions in the future.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
