2025-26 Term 1','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','可持续发展科学家和从业者现在面临的挑战是：人类如何在环境不退化的情况下提升社会福祉？企业和城市制定环境可持续发展政策的指导原则是什么？公司首席可持续发展官如何落实可持续转型变革战略？有哪些可持续评估方法可以量化人类活动对环境的影响？

本课程将介绍国际前沿环境可持续发展理论和案例研究，包括绿色增长、生态经济学、循环经济、环境社会与治理投资、联合国可持续发展目标、环境伦理与不平等、城市低碳转型等。通过选修本课程，学生将全面了解企业、城市、政府和市场应如何应对可持续发展挑战。','The challenge now for sustainability scientists and practitioner is: How can humanity transit to a world where human well-being is pursued while environmental degradation of the planet is minimised? What are the guiding principles in sustainability policy design at corporation and city levels? How do nowadays Chief Sustainability Officer implement sustainability transition strategies? Which sustainability assessment methods can be used to quantify human impacts on our environment?This course will introduce next generation environmental sustainability theories and case studies, including green growth, ecological economy, circular economy, environmental, social and governance investing, United Nation Sustainable Development Goals, environmental ethics and inequalities, urban low-carbon transition etc. By taking this course, students will develop knowledge in how firms, cities, government and markets tackle sustainability challenges.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
