(101518,'GEB2205','地学遗产','','GEB - GE Areas: Area B','2205','G',3.00,2000,'GenEd','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
