2024-25 Term 2','GFH1000/GFN1000. Knowledge in physics at high-school level.','GFH1000/GFN1000','这是一门探索光学和光子学的入门课程，涵盖现代应用的基本概念、基本原理和技术基础。
该课程深入研究光学相关的技术，涵盖透镜系统、照相技术、全息技术、发光二极管（LED）、激光器、光通信系统等。在学习这些技术的过程中，学生还将获得几何光学、光的波动性、光的偏振、傅里叶光学、电致发光、光放大、光通信系统等方面的知识。本课程专为各个学科的本科生设计，全面介绍光学和光子学的发展历史与前沿领域。','This is an introductory course that explores optics and photonics, encompassing fundamental concepts, basic principles, and technical foundations for modern applications.
The course delves into the technology of light, covering lens systems, photography, holography, LEDs, lasers, optical communication system, and more. Additionally, students will gain knowledge in geometric optics, the wave nature of light, polarization, Fourier transform, electroluminescence, light amplification, system considerations, and beyond. Designed for undergraduate students across various disciplines, this course provides a comprehensive introduction to the fascinating realm of optics and photonics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
