2024-25 Summer','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课旨在培育学生以逻辑的方法分析及研判推理论述。学生将系统了解基本的逻辑概念譬如论述、蕴含、对确以及谬误等等，并将学习形式逻辑包括演绎和归纳推理的规则和技巧，并将之应用于判断具体的推理论述之优劣。非形式逻辑的一些基本推理原则和谬误亦会有所涉及。','This course is designed to develop the student''s ability to analyse and evaluate arguments from a logical point of view. It will provide students with a basic understanding of such concepts as augment, implication, validity, and fallacies. Students will learn the logical principles of deductive and inductive inferences and the techniques of applying them for determining the validity or soundness of arguments. Elements of good reasoning from an informal perspective will also be covered.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
