(101544,'GEB3201','全球环境挑战','','GEB - GE Areas: Area B','3201','G',3.00,3000,'GenEd','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2019-20 Term 1
