2019-20 Summer','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程旨在为某些数学领域（包括几何、代数、微积分、集合论等）提供历史背景。课程主题覆盖从古代美索不达米亚、埃及、希腊、印度、阿拉伯、中国、中世纪欧洲的数学到现代数学。本课程对所有学生开放。','This course aims at providing the historical background to some areas of mathematics including geometry, algebra, calculus, set theory etc. The topics will range from the mathematics of ancient Mesopotamians, Egyptians, Greeks, Hindus, Arabs, Chinese, medieval European to modern mathematics. This course is open to all students.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101548,'GEB3402','科学技术学研究方法','','GEB - GE Areas: Area B','3402','G',3.00,3000,'GenEd','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2022-23 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','课程将集中在科学技术学（STS）领域对研究方法问题展开讨论。具体内容包括历史研究法、案例研究法、比较研究法、人类学方法、扎根理论、现象学方法等，以经典研究和学术前沿为材料在实践中展示STS中的建构主义同结构功能主义，以及同实证主义进路在方法应用上的异同，并结合中国问题重点探讨当上述方法进入到STS领域后所展开的方式和可能遇到的问题。','In this course, the diverse research methods for science and technology studies (STS) will be introduced and discussed, including historical studies, case studies, comparative studies, anthropology studies, grounded theory, and phenomenology and so on. Structural functionalism and social constructionism, the major two approaches in STS will be introduced. Both classical and new emerging literature will be used as the materials to demonstrate the differences and similarities between these two approaches as well as their relationship with positivism in choosing qualitative research methods mentioned above. Students will also learn how these qualitative research methods should be conducted in specific issue related to STS, and the possible problems they may face when these methods applied in the Chinese social contexts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
