2025-26 Term 2','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程探讨人类的社会属性和政治属性的本质。讨论的主题包括政体类型、政治美德、正义、自然权利和法律、主权、社区和文化。课程主题和文本将因授课教师而异。','This course examines the social and political nature of human beings. Topics to be discussed may include regime types, political virtues, justice, natural right and law, sovereignty, community, and culture. Topics and texts will vary by instructor.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101559,'GEC2108','历史学家的技艺：史学理论与方法','','GEC - GE Areas: Area C','2108','G',3.00,2000,'GenEd','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 2
