2019-20 Summer','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课以古代中国、希腊和罗马的若干战争或战役为例，讲述古代中国和欧洲的战争方式，包括战略思想、战术传统、军事组织、武器装备、后勤运输等。同时，本课将带领同学阅读和辨析所选战例相关的历史史料，如《史记》、《三国志》、《伯罗奔尼撒战争史》、《罗马史》等的章节，从而了解历史是如何被记录、传承和再塑造。','This course will use several key wars or battles in ancient China, Greece and Rome as examples to discuss the ways of war, including strategy, tactics, weapons, logistics, etc.  This course will also lead students to read some original historical materials, including  Shiji, the Peloponnesian War, Roman History etc. Discussion based up these historical materials will help students to understand how history is recorded, remembered and reconstructed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
