2022-23 Summer','GFN1000/GFH1000','GFN1000/GFH1000','本课程适用于迄今为止没有接触过国际关系学术领域的学生,旨在向学生介绍当代国际关系主要问题领域的基本概念和理论，主要向学生介绍：§ 国际关系理论的产生基础；§ 国际关系的经典理论：现实主义、自由主义和马克思主义；§ 相对较新且影响越来越大的理论建构主义；§ 国际关系理论和核心问题，包括主权、权力、战争、和平、国际政治经济、新世界（混乱）秩序、人道主义干预、国际法和恐怖主义；§ 为了解国际关系研究中的理论学派奠定良好基础；§ 在国际政治研究方面打下坚实的基础，为进一步研究做准备。','This course is for students who have hitherto had no exposure in the academic field of International Relations. It seeks to introduce students to the basic concepts and understanding of the major issue areas of contemporary international relations. It introduces students to:§ the basics of understanding and producing theories in IR;§ the canonical theories of IR: Realism, Liberalism and Marxism;§ the relatively new and increasingly influential theory-constructivism;§ ways in which such theories approach central topics in IR including sovereignty, power, war, peace, IPE, New World (dis-)Order, humanitarian intervention, International Law and Terrorism;§ a good basis from which to appreciate the theoretical schools of thought in the study of international relations;§ a strong foundation in the study of international politics as a basis for further study.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
