(101593,'GEC3107','读史阅世——中国的历史学家及其时代','','GEC - GE Areas: Area C','3107','G',3.00,3000,'GenEd','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','中国史学源远流长，名家辈出，史学传统早已成为中国文化的重要组成部分。中国史家大多具有强烈的入世情怀，以自己特有的方式来记录、参与和反思时代。本课程希望通过介绍中国著名的历史学家的生平与论著，帮助同学了解中国史学发展历程，理解史家情怀，鉴古知今。','The goal of this course is to develop the students with a wide-range knowledge of great Chinese historians and their works. As traditional Chinese intellectuals, most of Chinese historians not only write great works in history, but also participate in and make history. Through a series of lectures and tutorials, the students could have the chance to learn and appreciate various approaches to the study of Chinese historiography.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
