(101600,'GEC3203','理解制度','','GEC - GE Areas: Area C','3203','G',3.00,3000,'GenEd','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2023-24 Summer','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','理解社會現象需要深入了解其嵌入的社會政治制度背景。本課程討論並應用各種視角來分析各種社會現象後的社會政治制度。課程亦著重制度的發展和演變，以及其個體行為基礎。這是一門本科通識課程。課程將以學者和實踐者的個案材料作為學習資源。','Context matters. Understanding social phenomena requires deep knowledge of their embedded socio-political institutional contexts. The course discusses and applies various perspectives for analyzing the socio-political institutions underlying various social phenomena. It also focuses on  the development and evolution of institutions, as well as their individual behavioral foundation. The course is an undergraduate–level, general education course. It draws on materials and cases developed by academics and practitioners as its learning resources.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
