2026-27 Term 1','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程将探讨西方和/或东方哲学中的不同趋势、运动、流派和辩论。课程主题和文本将因授课教师而异。这学期的内容是欧洲现象学传统。','This course explores different trends, movements, schools, and debates within Western and/or Eastern philosophy. Particular topics will vary by instructor. Our focus in this semester will be on the tradition of European phenomenology.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
