2024-25 Term 2','GFH1000/GFN1000 （mutually exclusive with PHI1103）','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程主要介绍十几位中国古代杰出的思想家以及他们思考世界与人生所得到的启发与智慧。这些思想从古至今延续不断，构成了中国文化的核心价值，对当今时代与人也极具指导意义，同时可以为未来人类建构新的价值观念提供借鉴。本课程旨在传授思想文化知识，有助于学生培育人文关怀、提升修养、拓展生命境界。课程教学语言为汉语普通话。（本课程与“PHI1103中国哲学史”互相冲突，辅修哲学的同学请选“PHI1103”）','This course mainly introduces a dozen of ancient Chinese thinkers and their thoughtful contemplation of world and life. Lasted from ancient to present, the wisdom of these thoughts formed the core value of Chinese culture. It still holds guiding significance for the present age, and may provide valuable reference for future humanity. This course aims at the education of cultural and philosophical knowledge, which may help students cultivate humanistic concerns, improve the capacity of self-cultivation, thus promote all-round human development. The teaching language is Chinese Putonghua.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
