2022-23 Summer','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程对跨学科的环境人文学领域进行了主题性介绍。学生将探讨该领域的全球案例研究，并了解一些对我们环境困境提出挑战的复杂问题。对政治、历史、传播、经济、伦理和领导力感兴趣的学生将会发现本课程具有吸引力。','This course provides a thematic introduction to the interdisciplinary field of Environmental Humanities. Students tackle global case studies in the field and learn some of the complexities challenge our environmental predicament. Students interested in politics, history, communications, economics, ethics, and leadership will find this course of interest.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
