2024-25 Term 2','GFH1000/GFN1000','GFH1000/GFN1000','本课程让学生能够慎思明辩，探索思考与学习过程，并从知识管理的角度去反思知识的意义。学生完成本课程后，可加深对自己思考及学习的瞭解。','This course enables students to explore on the thinking process, perform critical reasoning, and reflect the meaning of knowledge under the context of knowledge management. After finishing this course, a student is expected to gain better understanding of themselves in the area of thinking and learning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
