2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程向学生介绍社会科学研究的方法，并将其应用于全球研究与政治学领域。课程将理论推理与定量和定性方法的实践训练相结合，内容包括基础形式化建模、因果推断、调查与实验设计以及定性研究方法。课程强调研究设计、批判性阅读、同伴评议，以及通过期末研究计划书和小组展示来有效传达研究成果。','This course introduces students to the methods of social science research with applications in global studies and political science. It combines theoretical reasoning with practical exposure to quantitative and qualitative methods, including basic formal modeling, causal inference, survey and experimental design, and qualitative methods. The course emphasizes research design, critical reading, peer evaluation, and communication of findings through a final research proposal and group presentation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
