2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','Nil.','本课程旨在向学生介绍国际关系研究中影響二十一世纪世界政治未来趋势的热点问题。课程可能还会涵盖本方向中其他课程未涵盖的相关且重要的国际关系議題。此外，任课老师可在这门课上向学生介绍自己的专业知识和最近的研究领域及成果，从而拓宽学生的学术和知识视野。学生需要通过大量的预习、演讲、课堂辩论和讨论，加深对特定主题的理解並开展自己感興趣的研究。','This course introduces students to the study of international relations as an academic field. It discusses the evolution, main actors, and dynamics of modern international system. It familiarizes students with main theoretical concepts and frameworks used by scholars to understand and analyze international politics. It then applies various international relations to examine most critical subjects in international relations such as war and peace, conflict and cooperation, diplomacy and foreign policy. The course will also teach students how to use conceptual and theoretical approaches learnt in class to make sense out of ever changing reality of international politics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101710,'GLB5120','国际关系理论与实践','','GLB - Global Studies','5120','G',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2019-20 Term 2
