2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Nil.','Nil.','本课程探讨全球经济的政治博弈，重点研究权力、制度、理念及其他因素如何在一个充满碎片化与动荡的时代塑造各国外交经济政策。我们将超越基础理论框架，批判性分析全球经济及其治理的动态机制，重点关注以下前沿议题：地缘经济竞争、金融治国术、供应链武器化，以及技术脱钩的政治经济学。
课程强调政策导向的研究，通过专题作业训练符合专业场景要求的分析写作与政策思辨和论证能力。','This course focuses on the political foundations and consequences of the contemporary world economy and the dynamic and complex interaction between state and market, and power and wealth. It addresses the major theoretical approaches to study international political economy and debates among different schools in the field. This course also surveys the evolution of the international economic systems since the Second World War, with particular reference to the post-Cold War international political and economic order. It will discuss the concrete and important issues in international political economy such as international trade, finance, production and the even increasing connection between domestic political economy and international political economy under the context of globalization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101712,'GLB5220','国际经济与商业','','GLB - Global Studies','5220','G',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2019-20 Term 2
