2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程旨在提高学生对国际经济和商业领域各种学派和模式的认识和理解，并用它们分析不断变化的全球生产、金融和贸易体系。课程首先探讨宏观经济学、货币政策和财政政策，然后分析美国、中国、日本、德国、印度、韩国和欧盟等主要经济实体的不同经济问题和政策。课程将分析区域解体的多种原因以及欧洲、非洲、亚太和美洲大陆的一体化理论和模型，还将讨论国际经济和商业中各种相关的当代问题。','This course is to enhance students’ understanding and knowledge of various schools and models in the field of international economics and business and use them to analyze changing global productive, financial and trading systems. It firstly discusses macroeconomics, monetary and fiscal policies, and then analyses different economic issues & policies of the major economic entities such as USA, China, Japan, Germany, India, Korea, and European Union. It also analyzes multiple reasons for regional disintegration and theories and models of integration in Europe, Africa, Asia-Pacific, and America continent. Various related contemporary issues in international economics and business will also be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
