2025-26 Term 2','No','No','本课程侧重于个人的社会和政治态度与行为及其后果。它将使学生熟悉收集和测量民意的现有方法，特别是调查研究和实验社会科学。课程将比较不同社会政治文化的各个方面及其对民意测量的影响。本课程还将在政治参与、社会认同、政治沟通和政治争论等一般概念下研究民意和行为的测量。学生应提出自己的研究想法，并使用实证的证据来检验自己的假设。','This course focuses on individual social and political attitude and behavior and their consequences. It will familiarize the students with the existing methods for collecting and measuring public opinion, particularly on survey research and experimental social science. It will compare the various aspects of political culture in different societies and the implications for measurement of opinion. It will also examine the measurement of public opinion and behavior under the general concepts of political participation, social identity, political communication, and political contention. Students are expected to develop their own research ideas and use empirical evidence to test their hypotheses.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
