2025-26 Term 2','none','none','本课程介绍外交政策分析这一被明确界定的国际关系子领域。它旨在帮助学生了解国家外交政策的制定过程，利用跨学科的见解来解释具体事件并掌握与政策相关的知识。通过对世界政治主要参与者进行一系列比较案例研究，介绍并着眼于外交政策决策中的各种理论及其在各个问题领域和不同情况下的适用性。在此过程中，课程将探讨可能会阻碍外交政策决策中理性选择的各种因素，以及可最大限度减少外交政策决策中非理性的可能的方式。','This course is to introduce foreign policy analysis as a well-defined sub-field of international relations. It aims to understand the processes by which state foreign policies are made, utilizing interdisciplinary insights to explain specific events and generate policy-relevant knowledge. It will introduce and highlight a variety of theories in foreign policy decision-making and their applicability in various issue areas and under different circumstances by doing a series of comparative case studies of major players in world politics. In doing so, it will explore various factors that may impede rational choice in foreign policy decision making and the possible ways that irrationality in foreign policy decision-making could be minimized.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
