2025-26 Term 2','None','None','该课程通过重点案例研究，运用综合方法为学生提供学术和从业者对经济外交和谈判的看法。它不仅涉及经济外交的实践，而且强调经济治国方略在界定二十一世纪全球各国的权力和影响力方面的作用。课程还将讨论各种形式的经济治国方法的优缺点，如经济制裁、经济援助、贸易战，并讨论其在全球化和相互依存的背景下的有效性。','The course provides students with both academic and practitioners’ perspectives of economic diplomacy and negotiations through an integrated approach by deploying focused case studies. It does not only address the practices of economic diplomacy, but also highlights the role of economic statecraft in defining how power and influence of nation-states are exercised across the globe in the 21st century. The course will also discuss the strength and weakness of various forms of economic statecraft such as economic sanction, economic assistance, trade war and discuss their effectiveness in the context of globalization and interdependence.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
