(101726,'GLB5580','非西方国家政治和经济','','GLB - Global Studies','5580','G',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程探讨非西方国家经济和政治的相互作用。学生将了解政治制度如何影响经济发展、税收、贸易、外国投资和主权债务领域的经济结果，以及上述领域的经济结果如何影响国内政治和政治制度。','This course explores the interaction of economics and politics in non-Western countries. Students will learn about how political institutions affect economic outcomes in the areas of economic development, taxation, trade, foreign investment and sovereign debts as well as how economic outcomes in the above areas affect domestic politics and political institutions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
