2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程为社会科学研究方法的博士级介绍和概述。课程涵盖的主题包括但不限于理论和研究问题的产生、测量、研究设计（定量和定性）以及混合方法。具体涉及的主题将取决于课程讲师。','This course provides a PhD-level introduction to and overview of approaches to social science research. The course covers topics such as, but not limited to, the generation of theories and research questions, measurement, research designs (quantitative and qualitative), and mixing methods. The specific topics covered will depend on the course instructor.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
