2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在为学生提供有关比较政治、政治与国际关系、国际政治经济学、全球治理和全球社会发展的理论知识、理解和批判。 它侧重于经典理论、理论范式、宏观和微观概念以及学科的最新争论和发展。','This course is designed to provide students with the theoretical knowledge, understandings and critics about comparative politics, politics and international relations, international political economy, global governance and global social development. It focuses on the classical theories, theoretical paradigms, macro- and micro-concepts and the latest debates and developments in the subjects.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101745,'GLB6040','批判性思维和社会科学研究研讨会','','GLB - Global Studies','6040','G',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','','','本课程的目的是促进学生培养论文研究的概念和实操。 来自校内外的教授、高年级博士生、政策学者和实践者等受在研讨会上发表他们的研究和观察，重点介绍他们对研究发展不同阶段的见解。课程旨在帮助学生培养分析技能，以识别和评估陈述、论点、观点和证据，使用批判性推理来解决问题并思考具有挑战性的道德和政治问题。','The purpose of this course is to facilitate the development of students’ conceptualization and execution of thesis research. Invited speakers such as faculty members from within and outside the school, senior PhD students, and policy scholars and practitioners will present their research and observations at the seminar, with emphasis on their insights into different stages in research development. It is to help students develop analytical skills to identify and evaluate statements, arguments, beliefs, and evidence, to use critical reasoning to address problems and think about challenging moral and political issues.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101746,'GLB6050','比较区域研究高级研讨课','','GLB - Global Studies','6050','G',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','In essence, this course GLB6050 Advanced Seminar on Theories of Comparative Area Studies as a graduate seminar requires extensive reading, active class participation, well-executed presentation, and intensive writing.','','本课程旨在作为研究生层次的课程，介绍并批判性地回顾比较政治学和区域研究中不同的研究方法。课程涵盖了理论视角和方法论途径，既包括学科内的也包括跨学科的方式，旨在探讨支持发展中国家和发达国家政治制度及其社会基础的因素，如政治文化、公民社会和公共领域。','This course is designed as a graduate-level course to introduce and critically review the contrasting approaches on how to study areas in comparative politics and area studies. It covers the theoretical perspectives and methodological approaches - in disciplinary as well as interdisciplinary ways- that aim to explore the factors supporting political institutions and their societal underpinnings in developing and developed countries, such as political cultures, civil societies, and public spheres.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101747,'GLB6060','高级定量研究方法（一）','','GLB - Global Studies','6060','G',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程提供博士研究中量化方法选择与应用及相关分析技术的高级研究。通过学习和实际应用问题，学生将从收集、描述和分析社会、经济和政治领域的定量信息中获得高级定量研究各个阶段的经验。具体内容将由特定课程教师在学部研究生委员会的指导下设计。','This course provides an advanced study of the selection and use of quantitative methods and associated analytical techniques in doctoral research. Through study and practical application problems, students will gain experience in all phases of advanced quantitative research from gathering, description, and analysis of quantitative information in the social, economic, and political areas. The specific contents to be covered will be designed by specific course instructors under the instructions of the Divisional Graduate Panel.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101748,'GLB6070','高级定量研究方法（二）','','GLB - Global Studies','6070','G',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','GLB6060 Advanced Quantitative Research Methods 1','','本课程提供博士研究中量化方法选择与应用及相关分析技术的高级研究。通过学习和实际应用问题，学生将从收集、描述和分析社会、经济和政治领域的定量信息中获得高级定量研究各个阶段的经验。具体内容将由特定课程教师在学部研究生委员会的指导下设计。学生需要先完成GLB6060然后再参加本课程。','This course provides an advanced study of the selection and use of quantitative methods and associated analytical techniques in doctoral research. Through study and practical application problems, students will gain experience in all phases of advanced quantitative research from gathering, description, and analysis of quantitative information in the social, economic, and political areas. The specific contents to be covered will be designed by specific course instructors under the instructions of the Divisional Graduate Panel. Students need to complete GLB6060 before taking this course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101749,'GLB6080','高级定性研究方法','','GLB - Global Studies','6080','G',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','GLB6020 Social Science Research Method','','本课程面向攻读研究生研究课程的学生。总体目标是向学生介绍定性研究人员在全球研究研究中常用的先进方法和技术。它包括包括案例研究、过程追踪、访谈、民族志、档案研究、田野调查及混合方法等重要主题。在本学科结束时，学生将能够使用专业方法设计和执行研究项目。具体内容将由特定课程教师在学部研究生委员会的指导下设计。','This course is aimed at students undertaking graduate research programs. The overall aim is to introduce students to advanced methods and techniques commonly used by qualitative researchers in global studies research. It includes important topics such as case studies, process tracing, interviews, ethnography, archival research, fieldwork, and mixed methods. By the end of this subject, students will be able to design and execute a research project using a specialist method. The specific contents to be covered will be designed by specific course instructors under the instructions of the Divisional Graduate Panel.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
