2024-25 Term 1','','','這門課程為人文和社會科學的學生設計，提供邏輯推理和數據分析方法的基礎訓練，這些方法廣泛適用於應用語言學、語言教育、心理學、政治科學和城市研究等多個研究領域。課程涵蓋的主要主題包括研究設計、基礎機率論、抽樣與統計推論、線性迴歸分析、數據視覺化等。本課程採取淺顯易懂而實用的方法教授人文和社會科學中的數據分析方法。為了增強理解，課程中廣泛使用相關領域的應用實例，幫助學生掌握基本的數據分析技能及其在各自研究領域中的應用。','This course is tailored for students in humanities and social science, offering foundational training in logical reasoning and data analysis methods that are widely applicable across various research fields, including applied linguistics, language education, psychology, political science, and urban studies. Key topics covered in the course include research design, basic probability theory, sampling and statistical inference, linear regression analysis, data visualization, etc. The course adopts a “user-friendly” practical approach to teach data analytical methods in humanities and social science. To enhance understanding, applied examples from relevant fields are extensively used, helping students grasp essential data analytical skills and their applications in their respective areas of study.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101769,'HSS1010','政治学原理','Principles of Political Science','HSS - Humanities and Social Science','1010','H',3.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
