2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程旨在为学生提供政治学作为一门学科的基本概述，并让他们深入了解我们时代一些基本政治问题的原则。本课程将从三个相互关联的部分对“政治学”的各个重要方面进行概述，这三个部分旨在突出政治理论、比较政治学和国际关系方面的内容','This course aims to furnish students with the basic overview of political science as a discipline, and give them insight into the some of the basic principles underlying political questions of our time. This course will provide an overview of various important aspects of ‘political science’ in three interrelated sections designed to highlight aspects of Political Theory, Comparative Politics, and International Relations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101770,'HSS1011','社会科学研究导论','Introduction to Social Science Research','HSS - Humanities and Social Science','1011','H',3.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Nil.','Nil.','这门课为人文社会科学的学生设计, 全面探讨与语言研究、应用心理学、城市研究和政治学等多个研究领域相关的基础概念和方法。课程涵盖的主题包括研究设计、定量和定性研究方法以及研究伦理。我们将使用这些学科中的实际案例，使学生能够更好地理解如何在各自学习领域中实际应用基本的研究技能。课程结束时，学生将具备基本的研究能力，为他们的学术追求和未来发展奠定良好的基础。','This course is tailored for students in humanities and social science, providing a
comprehensive exploration of foundational concepts and methodologies relevant
to a variety of research fields, including language studies, applied psychology,
urban studies, and political science. Key topics covered in the course encompass research design, quantitative and qualitative research methods, data analysis, and
research ethics. To facilitate a deeper understanding, we utilize applied examples
from these disciplines, allowing students to see how essential research skills are
practically implemented in their respective areas of study. By the end of the
course, students will have developed a robust toolkit of research competencies
that will serve them well in their academic pursuits and beyond.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101771,'HSS2007','国家与民族：中华民族的形成与发展','','HSS - Humanities and Social Science','2007','H',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程旨在引导学生树立正确的中华民族历史观。在历史学、民族学、政治学、人类学等学科的交叉视野下，带领学生了解中华民族起源、发展与演变的历史，揭示各民族迁徙互动、交融互嵌与制度整合的历史逻辑，帮助学生认识民族交融与国家构建的内在关联，增强文化自信与历史自觉，树立命运与共的中华民族共同体理念。','This course aims to guide students in establishing a correct historical perspective on the Chinese nation. Through an interdisciplinary approach that combines history, ethnology, political science, and anthropology, it leads students to understand the origin, development, and evolution of the Chinese nation, reveals the historical logic of the migration, interaction, integration, and institutional consolidation among various ethnic groups, helps students recognize the intrinsic connection between ethnic integration and national construction, enhances their cultural confidence and historical awareness, and fosters the concept of a community with a shared future for the Chinese nation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
