(101799,'IBA4007','信息系统研究初探','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','4007','I',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1','1)  Having completed the course MIS2051
 
2)  Having completed at least one course from the following list:
ECO3080 Machine Learning for Business
MIS3011 Advanced Al for Business: From Theories to Applications
MIS3012 LLMs in Business-From Prompt Engineering to Al Agents
MKT3060 Quantitative Marketing Methods in the Al Age
FIN3090 AI Applications in Finance
 
3)  Having completed at least one course from the following list:
- ECO1020 Principles of Economics
- ECO2011 Basic Microeconomics','None','本课程向四年级本科生介绍信息系统关键历史性和代表性科研文献。学生将在授课老师的指导下深入研读信息系统领域的科研文献，其主要目的是培养学生尽快地了解信息系统专业的科研历史，主要分支的特点、历程、和近况，从而为学生成为信息系统科研专家打下坚实的专业知识基础。','This course introduces to the final-year undergraduate students the key history and representative scientific literature of information systems. Under the guidance of the lecturer, students will conduct in-depth study of the scientific research literature in the field of information system. The main purpose is to train students to understand the scientific research of the information system field speedily, including the characteristics, history and current situation of the main branches, so as to prepare students for becoming an information system researcher with a solid foundation of domain knowledge.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

