2026-27 Term 1','Students should have good knowledge in calculus and linear algebra, as well as basic training in coding.','','本课程提供了统计数据分析的全面和实用的介绍。主题涵盖离散和连续概率模型，假设的估计和检验，简单和多元线性回归分析，等等。在整个课程中，学生将通过学习理论、培养直觉和通过几个实际例子来学习统计推断和回归分析的概念和基础。','This course provides a comprehensive and practical introduction to statistical data analysis. Topics cover discrete and continuous probability models, estimation and testing of hypotheses, simple and multiple linear regression analysis, and so on. Throughout the course, students will learn concepts and fundamentals of statistical inference and regression analysis by studying theory, developing intuition, and working through several practical examples.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101806,'IBA6102','商业机器学习','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','6102','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程提供了对现代机器学习算法的全面介绍，旨在帮助学生理解机器学习如何在商业环境中运作。课程将探讨监督学习和非监督学习中的关键算法，包括：（1）线性回归；（2）逻辑回归；（3）支持向量机；（4）决策树；（5）神经网络；（6）聚类算法。对于每种算法，我们将讨论它们在各类商业环境中的实际应用，如推荐系统、图像处理和情感分析等。','The course offers a comprehensive introduction to modern machine learning algorithms, providing a foundational understanding of how these methods operate. A few classic topics in both supervised and unsupervised learning will be explored, including (1) linear regression; (2) logistic regression; (3) support vector machines; (4) decision trees, bagging, boosting; (5) neural networks; (6) clustering. For each algorithm, the course will discuss their practical applications in various business settings such as recommendation systems, image processing, and sentiment analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101807,'IBA6103','经济模型分析','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','6103','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Calculus, probability theory, linear algebra, optimization','','这门课程深入探索经济分析，重点放在博弈论的理论基础及其实际应用上。学生将深入学习研究多个决策者之间的决策互动，为他们分析现实世界中的复杂经济场景做好准备。学生将学习各种博弈论模型，培养战略思维、模型构建和结果预测的技能。通过实践学习，学生将把这些方法应用于现实世界的商业问题分析。','This course provides an in-depth exploration of economic analytics, focusing on the theoretical foundations and practical applications of game theory. Students will gain a comprehensive understanding of  the dynamics interactions of multiple decision makers, preparing them to analyze complex economic scenarios in the real world. Students will learn various models and their applications, developing skills in strategic thinking, model formulation, and outcome prediction. Through hands-on learning, students will apply these methods to real-world business problems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
