2026-27 Term 1','IBA6001
IBA6002','Basic knowledge of Python.
Basic knowledge of statistics and probability, some linear algebra, calculus.','本课程强调信息在企业中的重要性，为学生提供全面的信息管理、情报分析以及数据可视化和分析技术知识，以提升企业竞争力。通过探索各种数据分析技术和编程实践，学生将掌握商业智能与分析的核心技能，同时学习有效数据可视化和数据处理的基础知识，并为高级数据分析实践做好准备。','This course equips students with practical programming skills to solve modern business analytics problems. Through hands-on labs and practices with real-world data, students learn to preprocess and analyze structural data, network data, textual data, and time series data. The course emphasizes building robust data pipelines, handling noisy and imperfect real-world data, extracting meaningful features and implementing data analyses models for business decision-making. Students will implement classic time-series methods, fundamental network and text analytics techniques, and practical machine learning workflows, including feature engineering, model selection, and ensemble methods. By the end, students can design, code, and evaluate end-to-end business data analytics solutions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
