2025-26 Term 2','No formal prerequisite. College level knowledge about business and informationtechnology or consult the instructor.','None','本课程涵盖信息系统的开发生命周期。本课程向学生介绍整个系统开发过程，但主要侧重于信息系统需求的建模，这些需求能够识别信息问题，并为组织中的这些问题制定有效解决方案的原型。学生将在旨在开发现代信息系统的系统开发项目中获得需求建模、系统分析和可行性评估方面的知识和经验。他们还将获得使用 CASE 工具生成对象和类定义以及创建模型的实践经验。','This course covers the development lifecycle of information systems. While the course introduces students to the whole systems development process, it focuses on the modelling of information systems requirements that enable identification of information problems and the prototyping of an efficient solution to those problems in an organization. Students will gain knowledge and experience in requirements modelling, systems analysis and feasibility assessment within a system development project aimed at developing a modern information system. They will also obtain practical experience in the use of a CASE tool to produce object and class definitions and to create models.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
