2026-27 Term 1','a. Introductory Statistics
b. Basic Programming Skills (R or Python)','','本课程结合商业实务中的案例研究、理论概念与分析框架，系统讲解网络分析与用户体验研究的理论知识和实操方法。课程从商业视角阐释网络分析的定义、涵盖领域，以及全球企业通用的核心关键绩效指标。
课程第一模块聚焦网站分析，讲解企业与研究人员用于测算和优化线上业务关键绩效指标的各类工具。第二模块围绕网络分析的重要分支——用户体验研究展开，内容大量融合应用统计学与实验设计相关知识。课程同时还涵盖社交媒体、网络安全以及用户隐私等拓展主题。
实操研讨课上，学生将运用R编程语言与谷歌分析工具开展练习。完成本课程学习后，学生将能够透彻理解网络技术运行逻辑，并具备针对网络数据设计、开展统计分析的完整能力。','Through a combination of case studies, theoretical concepts, and analytics frameworks used in business applications, this course introduces the theory and practice of Web Analytics and User Experience research. It provides a business perspective on what Web Analytics is, the areas it covers, and the most important KPIs used by companies worldwide. The first part of the course focuses on Website Analytics and the tools companies and researchers use to measure and optimize Web business KPIs. The second part of the course focuses on UX Research, an important aspect of Web Analytics, and draws heavily on applied statistics and experimental design. Other topics covered in the course are social media, network security, and user privacy. During the tutorials, students will use the R programming language and Google Analytics. By the end of the course, students will have a solid understanding of how web technologies work and how to plan and conduct statistical analysis of web data.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101815,'IBA6201','仿真与实地试验','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','6201','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','IBA6101 Statistical Analysis, or an equivalent course.','','仿真与实地实验作为衡量企业经营战略的有效工具，在企业中被广泛采用。本课程向学生展示如何采用仿真和实地实验来获得管理和战略见解。仿真方法，包括概率分析和蒙特卡罗方法，将介绍评估系统的性能。本课程将涵盖实地实验的主题，包括实地实验设计和实验数据分析，以使学生对实地实验的实施和解释有一个很好的理解。','Simulation and experiment methods are widely adopted in companies as effective tools to measure their operational strategies. This course shows students how to adopt simulations and field experiments to gain managerial and strategic insights. Simulation methods, including the probability analysis and Monte Carlo method, will be introduced to evaluate system performance. Topics on field experiments, including filed experiment designs and experimental data analysis, will be covered to have a good understanding on the implementation and interpretation of field experiments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101816,'IBA6202','市场营销分析','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','6202','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1','','','本课程旨在介绍解决与数据驱动下的营销相关的问题的定量分析技能。在数字化时代，收集、分析和解释有关市场和客户的数据对于品牌的成功至关重要。数据分析技能对于期望从事市场营销、咨询和创业方向的职业的学生来说非常重要。通过本课程，学生将拥有多项技能，包括通过分析数据以了解客户、为公司的营销决策提供信息、评估数据的质量和有用性、分析和评判其他人进行的分析、以及将基于分析得出的结论有效的可视化和传达给同事。','Quantitative and analytical skills are introduced in this course to solve problems associated with data-driven marketing. Gathering, analyzing, and interpreting data about markets and customers is critical for the success of an organization. This skill is important for careers in marketing, consulting, and entrepreneurship. Students will analyze data to understand customers and inform marketing decisions, evaluate the quality and usefulness of available data, and analyse conducted by others, and communicate analysis-based conclusions to colleagues and managers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
