(101818,'IBA6204','收益管理','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','6204','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','收益管理研究企业如何通过科学制定各销售渠道的定价与销售策略以实现利润最大化。定价作为企业经营中最有力的杠杆之一，却也是最缺乏系统认知的领域。在实践中，定价决策往往缺乏足够的深思熟虑和系统性方法。本课程旨在教授学生如何借助数据、信息技术及分析工具，以更科学的方式制定定价策略。课程内容融合运营管理、市场营销及决策理论，并结合大量实际案例研究。学生将通过系统学习消费者行为与需求的量化模型、优化与统计分析工具，掌握如何将这些模型与工具应用于实际收益管理场景。','This course focuses on how firms should manage their pricing, and product availability policies across different selling channels in order to maximize performance and profitability. Building on a combination of lectures and case studies, the course develops a set of methodologies that students can use to identify and develop opportunities for revenue optimization in different business contexts, including transportation and hospitality industries, retail, media and entertainment, financial services, health care, manufacturing, and others. Quantitative models will be introduced to help students tackle important business problems including capacity allocation, markdown management, customized pricing, and demand forecasts under market uncertainty, and so on.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
