2025-26 Term 2','Students should have taken basic probability and statistics courses, e.g., STA2002 or above.','None','时间序列数据在金融和工业领域十分常见。本课程介绍时间序列的相关理论和应用。课程内容包括：趋势与季节性、自协方差、线性时间序列分析、条件异方差模型、非线性时间序列分析。','Time series data are common in finance and industry. This class introduces the related theories and applications of time series. Topics include: Trend and Seasonality, Autocovariances, Linear Time Series Analysis, Conditional Heteroscedastic Models, Nonlinear time series analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
