（*本课程采用中英双语授课）','This course aims to provide students with professional skills and real-world experiences. Internships in Analytics will be structured to help students combine in-class theory with real-world applications in business, government, consulting and research, as well as gain skills and experiences that are necessary to prepare for a successful career. Upon completion of the internship, students are required to submit written reports that describe what they have learned from the internship experience and how they apply theories to address practical problems encountered during the internship period. The Pass/Failure grading scheme will be adopted for this course.
