2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','随着互联网的普及，电子商务和在线平台已经成长为一个庞大的行业，迅速改变了商业格局。这一演变催生了新的商业模式，如社交媒体平台、电子商务、在线服务平台、全渠道零售等，所有这些都需要新的概念和技能来管理。本课程的目标是使学生掌握必要的概念和技能，以便在快速发展的在线商业环境中取得成功。涵盖的主题包括：数据处理与分析、社交媒体分析、在线零售、创新物流技术、全渠道零售等。','With the convenience of the Internet at our fingertips, e-commerce and online platforms have grown into a huge industry, rapidly transforming the business landscape. This evolution has led to the emergence of new business models, such as social media platforms, online marketplaces, service platforms, and omni-channel retailing, all of which require new sets of concepts and skills to manage. The objective of this course is to equip students with the necessary concepts and skills to navigate and excel in the rapidly evolving online business environment. Topics covered will include data processing and analytics, social media analytics, online retailing, innovative logistics and technologies, omni-channel retailing, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101825,'IBA6302','深度学习与大数据前沿专题','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','6302','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Master students who have learned Calculus, Linear Algebra, and Statistics/Probability
At least one course in Programming/Algorithm/Machine Learning/Data Mining','None','处理大规模数据集的能力已成为职场必备技能。掌握大数据分析技能的人才在当前就业市场中十分抢手。本课程第一阶段将为信息系统专业的学生传授核心基础知识，涵盖大型科技公司的后端运作机制，例如分布式文件系统、Hadoop 生态系统、关系型数据库、非关系型数据库管理系统以及 Spark 框架。
第二阶段将聚焦高级深度学习技术，包括多层感知机（MLP）、卷积神经网络（CNN）、计算机视觉（CV）、循环神经网络（RNN）等。我们还将探讨深度学习的两大重要应用领域：生成式人工智能（AIGC）与图神经网络（Graph Neural Network）。
第三阶段将介绍当今机器学习与人工智能领域的一种新兴学习范式 —— 强化学习（Reinforcement Learning）。此外，课程还包含 4 至 5 节实验课（其中约半数为选修课），涵盖以下核心内容：高级 Python 编程与 Python 数据分析、Spark 编程、基于 TensorFlow 的深度神经网络开发以及强化学习实践。','The ability to handle large scale data set has become an essential job market skill. Those who masters big data analytics have become very popular in current job market. The quarter of this course is to equip students majored in Information System basic knowledge of how large IT firms operates in the backend, such as Distributed File System, Hadoop ecosystem, Relational DB and NoSQL DBMS, and Spark.
The second quarter will be devoted to advanced deep learning techniques, such as MLP, CNN and CV, RNN etc.  We will also talk about two important application of Deep learning: AIGC and Graph Neural Network.
The third quarter will be about a new learning paradigms of today’s ML and AI, which is Reinforcement Learning.
In addition, four to five lab sessions will be included (about half of them are optional) to cover the following element: Advanced Python programming and Data Analytics in Python; Programming in Spark; Deep Neural Network with TensorFlow; Reinforcement Learning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
