2025-26 Term 2','Basic knowledge of probability and statistics is preferred but not required.','','本课程旨在培养学生将商业策略和分析方法应用于供应链管理的能力。课程不仅传达了许多关键供应链和物流管理概念背后的直觉，还提供了可用于分析供应链和物流管理各个方面的简单技术。课程还将介绍供应链管理规划、分析、设计、开发和评估的系统方法。','The course is designed to prepare students to apply business strategies and analytical methodologies in supply chain management. It conveys both the intuitions behind many key supply chain and logistics management concepts and provides simple techniques that can be used to analyze various aspects of the supply chain and logistics management. The systems approach to planning, analysis, design, development, and evaluation of supply chain management will be introduced.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
