2025-26 Term 2','IBA6102 Machine Learning for Business','','This course equips students with the skills to make more effective decisions by leveraging Artificial Intelligence (AI) to analyze emerging and large-scale data. AI excels at extracting meaningful insights from unstructured data and solving complex optimization problems. While numerous software tools simplify these tasks, this course goes beyond by focusing on the critical thinking needed in real-world business environments—specifically, how to clearly define objectives, identify resource constraints, and structure key decisions. By integrating AI-driven insights and optimization techniques, students will learn to navigate complexity and make smarter, data-informed decisions.','This course equips students with the skills to make more effective decisions by leveraging Artificial Intelligence (AI) to analyze emerging and large-scale data. AI excels at extracting meaningful insights from unstructured data and solving complex optimization problems. While numerous software tools simplify these tasks, this course goes beyond by focusing on the critical thinking needed in real-world business environments—specifically, how to clearly define objectives, identify resource constraints, and structure key decisions. By integrating AI-driven insights and optimization techniques, students will learn to navigate complexity and make smarter, data-informed decisions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
