(101843,'IBA6666','管理咨询决策分析','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','6666','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','None','None','在技术变革与市场波动交织的时代，现代管理咨询行业正经历着深刻的重塑。如今，顶尖咨询公司不再仅仅依赖传统的概念性框架，而是急需能够将严谨的量化分析与敏锐的商业直觉完美结合的顾问。对于未来的咨询精英而言，剖析复杂且无结构的企业难题，并将海量数据转化为能够直接驱动高管层决策的高价值、可落地建议，已成为一项不可或缺的核心竞争力。
本课程为立志投身于管理咨询、科技资讯、战略规划及企业顾问领域的硕士生量身定制。课程将商业分析置于结构化问题解决的框架之下。课程不设编程基础门槛。学生将依托真实的咨询案例与企业数据集，系统学习如何运用分析工具来破解企业面临的重大战略困局。通过高度还原的案例模拟与课程项目，学生将掌握数据故事化沟通的艺术：不仅学会如何计算数据，更学会如何制作极具说服力的叙事，并进行战略提案。本课程产出的项目成果在咨询案例面试与顶尖名企求职中，成为展现学生结构化思维与分析实力的强有力证明。','In an era defined by rapid technological disruption and market volatility, modern management consulting has evolved. Today’s top-tier consulting firms no longer rely solely on conceptual frameworks; they demand advisors who can seamlessly marry rigorous quantitative analysis with strategic business intuition. For future consulting professionals, the ability to dissect complex, unstructured corporate challenges and translate data into high-impact, actionable recommendations for executive leadership has become a defining competency.

This course is tailored for master''s students aspiring to careers in management consulting, technology consulting, strategic planning, or corporate advisory. It places business analytics firmly within a structured problem-solving framework. No prior programming background is required. Utilizing real-world consulting cases and corporate datasets, students will systematically learn how to apply analytical tools to address critical strategic challenges. Through highly realistic case simulations and course projects, students will master the art of data storytelling—learning not just how to process data, but how to construct compelling narratives and deliver persuasive strategic pitches. The deliverables from this course will serve as strong evidence of students'' structured thinking and analytical capabilities in consulting case interviews and competitive corporate recruitment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
