2026-27 Term 1','College level knowledge about finance and information technology or consult the instructor.','','本课程向博士生和准博士生介绍信息系统关键历史性和代表性科研文献。学生将在授课老师的指导下深入研读信息系统领域的科研文献，其主要目的是培养学生尽快地了解信息系统专业的科研历史，主要分支的特点、历程、和近况，从而为学生成为信息系统科研专家打下坚实的专业知识基础。','This course introduces doctoral and prospective doctoral students to the key history and representative scientific literature of information systems. Under the guidance of the lecturer, students will conduct in-depth study of the scientific research literature in the field of information system. The main purpose is to train students to understand the scientific research of the information system field speedily, including the characteristics, history and current situation of the main branches, so as to prepare students for becoming an information system researcher with a solid foundation of domain knowledge.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101861,'IBA8008','信息系统研究方法','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','8008','I',3.00,8000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','College level knowledge about finance and information technology or consult the instructor.','','本课程介绍信息系统的研究方法，这些方法围绕先进信息技术的设计、开发、应用、理论、和评估而发展。本课程的主要目的是帮助学生提高对信息系统研究中典型研究方法的理解，包括信息建模、算法设计、模拟、理论发展、实证验证、和案例分析。该课程将侧重于两类研究文章的阅读和讨论：方法论论文和科技论文。前者将用来阐明信息系统研究方法的当代思想，后者将作为信息系统研究成功的范例。学生将从这两类文章中获得对研究方法论的深入了解，以便成功地设计、执行和发表研究成果。在本课程中，学生将阅读并阐述他们对选定研究文章的分析和理解。','This course introduces research methodologies in Information Systems that evolve around the design, development, application, theorization, and evaluation of advanced information technologies. The main objective of this course is to assist students to improve their understanding of the typical research methodologies found in the IS research including information modeling, algorithm design and computation, simulation, theory development, empirical validation, and case analysis. The course will focus on the reading and discussion of two types of research articles: methodological papers and research papers. The former will be used to shed light on the contemporary thinking in IS research methods, and the latter will serve as examples of successful information systems research. Insights on research methodologies will be gained from the two types of articles in order for students to design, execute, and publish research findings successfully. During this course, students will read and present their analysis of selected research articles.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101862,'IBA8009','运营管理研究方法','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','8009','I',3.00,8000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','College level knowledge about operations management or consult the instructor.','None','本课程介绍运营管理领域的基本理论与研究方法。本课程的主要目的是帮助学生提高对运营管理研究中典型研究方法的理解，包括博弈论分析、实证分析等。','This course introduces basic theories and methods for operations management research. The main objective of this course is to assist students to improve their understanding of the typical research methodologies found in the OM research, including game theory, empirical methods and so on.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101863,'IBA8010','运营管理专题','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','8010','I',3.00,8000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2','College level math, statistics, and contextual knowledge about firm operations.','None.','本课程涵盖了最新研究和论文。学生将阅读和讨论运营管理领域的最新论文。本课程将帮助学生了解前沿研究和发展出自己的研究思路。','This course covers recent research and seminal papers. Students will read and discuss recent papers in the operations management field. This course will help students learn the cutting edge research and develop their own research ideas.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101864,'IBA8011','信息系统学实证研究方法','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','8011','I',3.00,8000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1','College level knowledge about finance and information technology or consult the instructor.','None','本研讨课程旨在培养博士生在信息系统（IS）领域进行严谨实证研究所需的方法、工具和批判性思维技能。在老师指导下，学生将深入学习主流的实证研究方法（例如计量经济学、实验、机器学习），并演示如何运用这些方法研究电子商务、社交媒体、数字化转型和IT治理等信息系统现象。本课程内容将根据学生的兴趣和导师的专业知识而有所不同，并将随着信息系统学科格局的变化而不断发展。','This course aims to provide students with the methods, tools, and critical thinking skills necessary to conduct rigorous empirical research in Information Systems (IS). This course introduces mainstream empirical research methods (e.g., econometrics, experiments, machine learning) and demonstrates how they can be employed to investigate IS phenomena such as e-business, social media, digital transformation, and IT governance. The contents of this course may vary based on the interests of the students and the expertise of the instructors, and will continue to evolve with the changing landscape of the information systems discipline.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
