(101872,'IBA8013','信息系统学分析研究方法','','IBA - Information Management and Bus','8013','I',3.00,8000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','College level knowledge about business, economics, and information technology or consult the
instructor.','None','本课程帮学生获得设计、执行和批判严格分析研究的信息系统（IS）的方法论专业知识。它强调分析方法——包含经济学、运筹学和计算方法——以解决当代信息系统问题，如信息基础设施/信息商品的经济学、商业决策和高效的大数据分析。本课程旨在帮助学生培养识别新的和有影响力的分析研究主题的能力，并选择适当的研究方法进行调查。具体内容可能会根据参加本课程的学生的兴趣和教授该课程的教师而在每学期有所不同。','This course equips students with the methodological expertise to design, execute, and critique rigorous analytical research in Information Systems (IS). It emphasizes analytical approaches—economic, OR-based, and computational—to address contemporary IS problems such as economics of information infrastructure/information goods, business decision-making, and efficient big data analytics. This course aims to help students develop the ability to identify new and impactful analytical research topics and select appropriate research methods to conduct the investigation. The specific contents may vary from semester to semester based on the interests of the students attending this course and the faculty members teaching this course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
