(101875,'ICS6201','纳米集成电路制造工艺','','ICS - Integrated Circuits and System','6201','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程首先讲授集成电路制造中工艺的基本原理，包括：晶圆生长、热氧化、薄膜沉积、刻蚀工艺、光刻工艺、扩散与离子注入、金属化工艺、多层工艺、隔离技术。在工艺技术基础上，进一步讲授CMOS工艺集成与纳米集成电路制造技术，包括：高k金属栅（HKMG）、低温工程、光学邻近校正（OPC）、可制造性设计（DFM）、极紫外光刻（EUV）等。此外，课程重点介绍FinFET和GAA等先进逻辑器件工艺、DRAM和3D NAND等先进存储工艺、以及双极（Bipolar）、BiCMOS和BCD等特色工艺，并简要介绍3D集成与封装的先进工艺。','This course will first teach the basic principles of individual processes in integrated circuit manufacturing, including wafer growth, thermal oxidation, film deposition, etching process, photolithography process, diffusion and ion implantation, metallization process, multilayer process and isolation. On the basis of technology, this course will further teach complementary metal-oxide-semiconductor (CMOS) process integration and nano-integrated circuit manufacturing technology, including High-K Metal Gate (HKMG), Cryogenic Engineering, Open Platform Communications (OPC), Dubai Financial Market (DFM), Extreme Ultraviolet (EUV), etc. In addition, this course focuses on the introduction process of advanced logic
devices such as Fin Field-Effect Transistor (FinFET) and Generalized Access Authorization (GAA), advanced equipment processes such as Dynamic Random-Access Memory (DRAM) and 3D NAND, and characteristic processes such as bipolar, BiCMOS, and Binary-Coded Decimal (BCD), and briefly introduces advanced processes of 3D integration and packaging.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
