(101882,'ICS6208','电源管理集成电路','','ICS - Integrated Circuits and System','6208','I',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程以开关电源转换器为重点，涵盖其他类型的电源管理电路。主要内容包括：电源管理集成电路的分类和应用；开关电源转换器的分析与设计方法，主要包括连续导通模式（CCM）和不连续导通模式（DCM）下开关电源转换器的稳态模型、功率晶体管建模与损耗分析、开关电源转换器的交流等效模型及频率响应特性、电压模式（VPM）和电流模式（CPM）的闭环控制与稳定性补偿方法；开关电源转换器设计实例：重要电路模块的分析与设计实现方法；开关电源转换器的最新发展，包括单电感多输出（SIMO）技术和多相调制技术；开关电源转换器设计技术在包络跟踪放大器和 D 类放大器等相关电路中的应用；无电感开关电容转换器电路和低压差线性稳压器的基本结构与设计方法。','The course focuses on switching power converters and covers different types of power management circuits. The main contents include: (1) classification and application of power management integrated circuits; (2) analysis and design methods of switching power converters, comprising the steady state of switching power converters in continuous conduction mode (CCM) and discontinuous conduction mode (DCM) model, power transistor modelling and loss analysis, alternating current (AC) equivalent model and frequency response
characteristics of switching power converter, closed-loop control and stability compensation
method of voltage mode and current mode; (3) design examples of switching power converter analysis and design implementation methods of important circuit modules; (4) latest development of switching power converters, encompassing single-inductor multiple-output (SIMO) technology and multi-phase modulation technology; (5) switching power converter design technology in envelope tracking amplifiers and class D amplifiers and other related circuits applications; and (6) basic structures and design methods of non-inductive switched capacitor converter circuits and low-dropout linear regulators.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
