(101888,'IDE2000','如何开始创业','How to Start a Startup','IDE - Innovation DesignEntrepreneur','2000','I',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2','N/A','no co-requisites','该课程侧重于新公司的创建、启动和发展。通过个人任务及小组合作，学生将在整个学期中开发并展示一个综合、有效的商业想法，并学分析并解决创业过程中的一些关键问题，例如：商业机会、深入的市场分析、产品或服务设计、营销战略的开发、人力资源需求评估以及可持续的财务战略的构建。我们在本课程中将应用一种名为“Learn2”的新的教学方法。在一个整合的框架下，学生们将身临其境的躬亲实践来学习如何创立他们自己的公司。在为期一学期的课程结束时，学生们将深入了解成功的企业家创办公司所需的流程和工作。最终的结课成果将是一份全面的商业计划，以及一个关于他们创业想法的正式的路演。','The course focuses on the creation, development, and launch of a new business. Working individually (or on occasion in groups), students spend the entire term developing an effective and comprehensive presentation of a real business concept by addressing key issues such as: business opportunities, in-depth market analysis, product or service design, development of a marketing strategy and campaign, assessment of human resource requirements and the building of a sustainable financial strategy. We apply in this course a new methodology called “Learn2”. This is an integrated framework that provides students with an immersive and hands-on approach to learning how to start their startups. By the end of the semester-long program, students will have gained a deep understanding of the processes and activities that a successful entrepreneur needs to launch a startup. The output will be a comprehensive business plan and a formal presentation of their idea.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
