(101896,'IDE3002','商业创新与创业实习','Business Innovation and Entrepreneurship Practicum','IDE - Innovation DesignEntrepreneur','3002','I',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','《商业创新与商业实习》（IDE-3002）介绍了创业创新的理论基础，重点在于技术变革模式、市场变革、新创企业和创新体系。在此基础上，课程采用案例教学和实践导向的方法，关注现实中的创业实践、创新挑战、决策制定和创新战略。通过案例研究、应用项目工作和实践练习，学生学会分析创新差距、评估管理选择，并运用创新和创业理论来分析真实的创业情境','Business Innovation and Entrepreneurship Practicum IDE-3002- is a course that is designed exclusively for the Chinese University of Hong Kong in Shenzhen. This course introduces the theoretical foundations of entrepreneurial innovation, with emphasis on patterns of technological change, market change, new ventures, and innovation systems. Building on these foundations, the course adopts a case-based and practice-oriented approach, focusing on real-world entrepreneurial practice, innovation challenges, decision-making, and innovation strategy. Through case studies, applied project work, and practical exercises, students learn to analyze innovation gaps, evaluate managerial choices, and apply innovation and entrepreneurship theories to analyze real entrepreneurial situations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101897,'IDE3005','企业创新：设计思维与创业心态的应用','Business innovations: Design Thinking and Entrepreneurial Mindset','IDE - Innovation DesignEntrepreneur','3005','I',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
