2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','设计思维是商业创新的基本模式，不断启发企业在各个方面进行创新思考，并激发其灵感。创业心态不仅限于计划自己创业的人，对于企业高管和内部创业者来说，尤其是在后新冠疫情日益严峻的环境中，要在职涯发展中脱颖而出，并取得成功晋升机会，创业心态与设计思维也至关重要。
本课程将采用当代设计思维模式的系统方法，探索在商业战略和商业决策制定过程中，市场需求的可取性、技术可行性和商业可能性之间作出权衡。本课程将通过打破你的线性思维方式，在团队项目工作中提供清晰的指导，从而在确定机会和创新解决方案方面，找出严谨而令人振奋的策略计划方向。
本课程的讲师将通过其领导科技初创公司，和风险企业的设计思维过程，分享她在商业化过程中的构思，和新产品开发方面的扎实商业经验，以及在戴森、强生、雀巢、联合利华、百事、宝洁等跨国公司的企业真实案例，与你分享她的个人实战经验。','Design thinking is an essential model for business innovations and continuously inspires the companies to innovate in all perspectives. Entrepreneurial mindset is not limited to those who are planning to develop their own startups, it is also crucial for corporate executives and intrapreneurs to excel and succeed in their career development especially in an increasingly challenging environment after the pandemic outbreak.  This course will adopt a systematic approach in contemporary design thinking model to explore the balance of market desirability, technology feasibility and business viability during the formation of a business strategy and business decisions making processes.   This course will be rigorous and mind blowing in identifying the opportunities and innovative solutions by breaking your linear way of thought with clear step-by-step guidance on team project work.

The lecturer in this course will share her solid business experiences in commercialization ideations and new products developments by leading the design thinking processes in tech startups and ventures, as well as corporate experience in MNCs like Dyson, Johnson & Johnson, Nestle, Unilever, PepsiCo, Procter & Gambles, etc..','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
