(101900,'IDE4110','中国创新管理','Management of Innovation in China','IDE - Innovation DesignEntrepreneur','4110','I',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2017-18 Term 2
