2026-27 Term 1','None','None','本课程探讨当代中国的创新与创业，研究国有企业   及私营企业如何管理创新。学生将分析中国大陆和大湾区（包括香港特别行政区）不断发展的创新生态系统。
随着工业化4.0，创科与创新的迅速发展，已深入影响到了我们生活上的各个层面。日新月异的创新和创科技术，给我们的经营方式带来了实质性，甚至颠覆性的变化课程内容涵盖创新框架、商业模式以及在中国背景下管理创新的战略方法。
通过本地和国际案例研究，学生将学习如何制定有关创新战略和实施的关键决策。本课程由资深市场从业者教授，内容涵盖创科与创新、创新创业生态系统、创新过程、创科技术发展趋势以及应对新技术时代的策略
本课程提供与高层管理人员交流的独特机会，进行客座讲座，他们将带来当前的市场洞察和第一手经验，并辅以企业参访，让学生直接了解中国的创新实践。','This course explores innovation and entrepreneurship in contemporary China, examining how state-owned enterprises and private companies manage innovation. Students will analyze the evolving innovation ecosystem in mainland China and the Greater Bay Area, including Hong Kong SAR.
With the advent of Industry 4.0, the rapid development of innovation and technology has profoundly impacted every aspect of our lives. The constantly evolving innovations and technologies have brought substantial, even disruptive changes to our business operations. The curriculum covers innovation frameworks, business models, and strategic approaches to managing innovation in the Chinese context.
Through local and international case studies, students will learn how to make critical decisions regarding innovation strategy and implementation. Taught by senior market practitioner, the course covers innovation and technology, innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystems, innovation processes, technology development trends, and strategies for navigating the new technological era.
The course provides unique opportunities to engage with senior executives through guest lectures, where they will share current market insights and firsthand experience. This is complemented by company visits that allow students to directly observe innovation practices in China.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
