2026-27 Term 1','NIL.','NIL.','本课程是一门日语初级课程，旨在为语言类专业学生及有志学习新语言的非语言类学生提供入门指导(日语能力考试N2及以上水平的学生请勿选修本课程)。课程注重培养学生使用日语进行“听、说、读、写、思”的基础能力。通过系统的语法讲解、大量例句与练习，帮助学生夯实日语基础。学生完成本课程后，将了解日本社会与文化的基本状况，理解日语的基本语言特点、语法结构与生活常用词汇，掌握日语词形变化，可以表达基础句型并进行简单生活情境会话。','This course is designed for beginners in Japanese, intended for language majors and students interested in learning a new foreign language. (Students with Japanese proficiency at JLPT N2 level or above should not enroll in this course.) The course focuses on developing basic skills in listening, speaking, reading, writing, and thinking in Japanese. Through intensive exposure to grammatical items, example sentences and exercises, students will build a solid foundation in elementary Japanese. Upon completion, students will attain a basic understanding of Japanese society, culture, and the linguistic features of Japanese, will acquire daily-life vocabulary, be able to use simple grammar patterns, and engage in short conversations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
