2026-27 Term 1','There are no pre-requisites for this course.','There are no co-requisites for this course.','韩国语（一）面向零基础的同学开设。通过介绍韩国语言的基本原理和韩国文化，本课程将专注于促进学生用韩国语进行听、说、读、写的基本技能。课程也会进行基本语法、词汇和发音的教学。','To introduce students to the basic principles of the Korean language as well as Korean culture, the classes will focus on promoting each of the four skills – listening, speaking, reading, and writing – in conjunction with basic elements of grammar, vocabulary, and pronunciation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
