2025-26 Term 2','MAT1001 or MAT1010 or MAT1011','','本课程是微积分（一）之延续，将覆盖级数与多元微积分。本课强调对微积分的直观和概念性的理解，培养学生的计算能力和应用微积分解决数学与实际问题的意识和能力。','This course is a continuation of Calculus I, covering series and multivariable calculus. It emphasizes intuitive and conceptual  understanding of theory of series and multivariable calculus, as well as computation skills; it cultivates the ability to use Calculus to solve problems within mathematics and from other scientific  disciplines.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101952,'MAT1002B','微积分（二） (B)','Calculus II (B)','MAT - 数学','1002B','M',3.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MAT1001 or MAT1010 or MAT1011','','本课程是微积分（一）之延续，将覆盖级数、多元微积分和带约束条件的最优化。它致力于经济与商务分析中的核心数学工具。本课程强调对微积分的直观和概念性的理解，培养学生的计算能力和应用微积分解决数学与商务分析问题的意识和能力。','This course is a continuation of Calculus I, covering series, multivariable calculus, and constrained optimization. It focuses on fundamental mathematical techniques that are essential for economic and business analysis. It emphasizes intuitive and conceptual understanding of the theory of series and multivariable calculus, as well as computation skills; it cultivates the ability to use Calculus to solve problems within mathematics and from business analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
