2026-27 Term 1','None','No co-requisites.','本课程介绍了在商业世界中建模，解决问题和决策所需的数学技能。主题包括解方程组、线性模型、微分和积分、指数和对数函数，以及指数增长和货币的时间价值和偏导数及其在经济学中的应用。','This course introduces the mathematical skills that are required for modelling, problem-solving and decision-making in the business world. Topics include solving systems of equations, linear models, differential and integral calculus, exponential and logarithmic functions, exponential growth and time-value of money and partial derivatives and their applications in economics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
