2022-23 Term 1','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','本课程致力于让学生掌握微积分中函数的倒数，微分与积分，并能运用它们解决现代经济与商业中的实际问题。本课程内容包含基础线性代数，一元函数微积分，以及多元函数微积分简介。具体内容有： 矩阵与向量，数列与极限，函数的连续性，一元函数的倒数与微分， 一元函数的不定积分与定积分，以及多元函数的偏导数与全微分。','This course is intended to develop practical skills in differential and integral calculus. It is also intended to illustrate various applications of calculus to problems in modern business and economics. This course covers the basic linear algebra, calculus for single variable functions, and an introduction of calculus for multi-variable functions. Topics include matrices and vectors;  sequences and limits; continuity, differentiability, and integration of single variable functions; and  partial derivatives and the ingredient of multi-variable functions','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
