2026-27 Term 1','','','MAT1011及其后续课程MAT1012都是面向对数学有兴趣的学生，为学习后续课程提供坚实的基础，并培养学生分析问题、解决问题、数学思维、数学论证和规范表达的能力。本课程教授单变量微积分的基本原理和方法，课程内容包括函数、极限与连续、微分、积分，以及它们的应用。','This course and its continuation MAT1012 are designed for those students who are interested in mathematics, and who wish to build a solid foundation for more advanced courses. These courses are aimed to develop students’ abilities of analysing, problem-solving, mathematical thinking, reasoning and standardized expression. The course MAT1011 deals with the basic theory and skills of calculus of single variable. Topics include functions, limits and continuity, differentiation, integration and their applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
