MAT2042 Linear Algebra','','本课程教授常微分方程的基本原理和方法，包括严格的理论和精巧的技术。课程内容包括一阶方程，二阶线性方程，线性方程组，与非线性方程的定性理论，周期解，以及它们的应用。','This course teaches fundamental principles and methods of ordinary differential equations with rigorous theory and sophisticated techniques. It covers the topics of first order differential equations, second order linear equations, systems of linear equations, and qualitative theory of nonlinear differential equations, periodic solutions, Poincare-Bendixson Theorem, and their applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
