2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites, yet knowledge of Calculus (MAT1001 & 1002) would be an advantage.','No','本课程旨在介绍线性代数的基础概念和方法及其应用。内容包括：向量, 矩阵，向量，向量空间，行列式，线性变换，正交性，线性方程组, 特征理论和奇异值分解，已及二次型。当今大数据和人工智能时代更需要透彻理解抽象的高维线性空间以及熟练处理高维数据的基本能力，而不是停留在中学里已经熟悉的二维或者三维空间。','This course introduces the fundamental concepts and techniques of linear algebra, including: vectors, matrices, vector spaces, determinants, linear transformations, orthogonality, system of linear equations, eigen-theory and singular value decomposition, quadratic forms. The goal is to master the skills to work in more abstract n-dimensional spaces (skills required in the modern era of big data and AI), transitioning from the comfort zone of 2- or 3-diemsnional spaces. This course is designed to help to make this transition less painful.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
