2025-26 Term 2','Linear Algebra (MAT2040, MAT2041), Honours Linear Algebra (MAT2042)','','本课程对现代抽象代数给出了基本的介绍，并为相关领域的进一步学习提供了基础。内容包括：群，环，域，和它们相应的基本理论。','This course provides an elementary treatment on modern abstract algebra and establishes the basics for further study in the relevant fields. Topics include: groups, rings, fields, and their associated fundamental theory.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101974,'MAT3005','抽象代数（二）','Abstract Algebra II','MAT - 数学','3005','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','Linear Algebra (MAT2040, MAT2041), Honours Linear Algebra (MAT2042), Abstract Algebra I (MAT3004)','','本课程对交换代数给出了基本的介绍，并为相关领域的进一步学习提供了基础。内容包括：环，模，代数簇和它们相应的基本理论。','This course provides an elementary treatment on commutative algebra and establishes the basics for further study in the relevant fields. Topics include:
• Commutative rings and ideals - examples include prime ideals, maximal ideal, Jacobean radical, Chinese remainder theorem, Notherian ring, dimension, valuation ring, Artin ring, graded ring.
• Modules -  Modules: Free module, submodule, quotient module,direct sum, product, algebra, tensor product, restriction and extension of scalar, exact sequence.
• Homological algebra - Category, Abelian Category, exact sequence,  cohomology, long exact sequence of cohomology.
• Algebraic varieties - Basic Topology and geometry. Zariski topology, Hilbert nullstellensatz. Affine varieties, algebraic varieties, projective varieties. Morphism of algebraic varieties, rational maps. Blow-up. Algebraic curves, rational points in Elliptic curves. Intersection in projective space, Hilbert polynomials. Sheaves, quasi-coherent sheaves, coherent sheaves.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
