2025-26 Summer','(MAT1001 Calculus I or MAT1003 Analysis I or MAT1011 Honours Calculus or MAT1010 Calculus for Economic Analysis I) and (MAT1002 Calculus II or MAT1004 Analysis II or MAT1012 Honours Calculus II or MAT3010 Calculus for Economic Analysis II)','','本课程的主要目的是让学生熟悉基本的优化方法和他们在各种实际问题中的应用。主要的内容包括线性规划，单纯形算法，非线性优化，最陡下降方法，对偶理论，敏感度分析，整数优化。选修本课程，微积分相关知识是必需，同时建议具有一定的线性代数基础。','This course will focus on the basics of optimization theories and applications. The first part of the course will be mainly about linear programming, including how to formulate a linear program, the simplex method and the duality theory. Then we will study nonlinear optimization, focusing on the optimality conditions and some useful algorithms. Integer programming will also be briefly discussed in this course. To take this course, knowledge of calculus is required, and knowledge of linear algebra is recommended.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101977,'MAT3007H','最优化荣誉课程','Honours Optimization','MAT - 数学','3007H','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','(MAT1002 or MAT1012) and  (MAT2040 or MAT2042 or MAT2041 or MAT2041A)','','本课程是MAT3007的进阶版本，重点讲授优化理论与算法的数学基础。课程深入探讨线性规划，包括单纯形算法、对偶理论和多面体几何。同时，课程还将涵盖整数规划和非线性规划的一些精选主题。学生需要具备扎实的线性代数和多元微积分知识，并具备数学证明的能力。','This course is the advanced version of MAT3007, with a focus on the mathematical foundations of optimization theory and algorithms. It provides an in-depth treatment of linear programming, including the Simplex algorithm, duality theory, and polyhedral geometry, with proofs. It will also cover some selected topics of integer programming and nonlinear programming. A good knowledge of linear algebra and multivariable calculus, as well as the ability to do rigorous mathematical proofs, is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
