(MAT2050 Mathematical Analysis or MAT2060 Honor Mathematical Analysis)','None','本课程的目的是学习复变函数的基础理论。主题包括：初等函数，解析函数，柯西-黎曼微分方程，曲线积分，柯西定理，亚纯函数,留数理论，幂级数，保角映射。课程也会介绍复变函数在其他数学领域的应用。','This course provides an introduction to the basic theory of analytic functions of one complex variable. Topic includes: arithmetic of complex numbers, Euler’s identity, elementary functions, power series, analytic functions, Cauchy-Riemann equations, contour integrals, Cauchy theorems, meromorphic functions, residues theorem, and conformal mapping.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
