2025-26 Term 2','(STA2001 or STA2003 or FIN2210) and (MAT1002, MAT1004, or MAT1012)','','本課程的目的是學習概率論的數學基礎。 內容包括：樣本空間， sigma-代數， Lebesgue測度， 概率測度， 隨機變量， 數學期望， 大數定理，中心極限定理，條件期望，鞅。課程也會提及概率論在統計，計算科學，和工程中的應用。','Building upon real analysis and measure theory, this course establishes the foundational concepts and techniques of probability theory. Throughout the course, we will cover a range of topics including probability spaces, random variables, mathematical expectation, coupling, total variation distance, conditional expectation, martingale, and various convergence concepts. We will also establish the main theorems in probability theory, such as the law of large numbers, the central limit theorem, and the optional stopping theorem. In addition to theory, we will explore some applications of probability theory in fields such as statistics and engineering.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101988,'MAT3300','数学建模','Mathematical Modeling','MAT - 数学','3300','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Term 2
