2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','MAT1001, MAT1002, MAT2040, STA2001 or MAT3280','','本課程是數學建模的入門介紹。本課程將會介紹一些用於量化分析實際問題的基本數學工具。這些問題來自於物理學、生物學、經濟學、工程學或者生活實際。數學模型能夠幫助我們對這些問題進行量化分析並提供解決方案。本課程的核心目標是教給學生一些主要的建模的數學工具，並通過一些具體的例子來解釋如何將數學方法應用到實際問題。','This course is an introduction to mathematical modeling. We will cover some basic mathematical tools for the quantitative description of practical problems arising from physics, biology, economics and engineering. The use of these mathematical models allows us to quantitatively study and provide solutions to these problems. The focus of this course is to give an overview of the mathematical techniques that are commonly used in practice, and illustrate the modeling procedure through some elementary examples.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
