2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MAT2007, MAT2040 and MAT3004.','','拓扑通常被描述为定性几何。本课程从基本点集拓扑开始，包括开集，闭集，紧集，极限点，Heine-Borel定理，连续映射，同胚，连通性，度量空间和商拓扑。

本课程的第二部分是使用单纯复形构建几何对象，并计算它们的基础群。我们将讨论包括同伦，基础群，单纯复形基础群的计算，圆形的基础群及其后果，及Seifert-Van Kampen定理。','Topology is often described as qualitative geometry. This course begins with basic point-set topology, including open set, closed set, compact set, limit point, Heine-Borel Theorem, continuous map, homeomorphism, connectedness, metric space and quotient topology.

The second part of the course is to build geometric objects using simplicial complexes, which is helpful in studying the fundamental group of such objects. We will cover topics including homotopy, fundamental groups of simplicial complexes, fundamental group of circle and its consequences, and the Seifert-Van Kampen Theorem.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101992,'MAT4003','数论','Number Theory','MAT - 数学','4003','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2019-20 Term 1
2020-21 Term 1
2021-22 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2','MAT 1002 (or MAT 1012), MAT 2040 (or MAT 2042), and MAT3253','','本课程旨在向学生介绍数几何、丢番图近似、素数理论以及数论函数的渐近计算等领域的基本成果。具体而言，狄利克雷近似定理及其应用（线性丢番图方程、佩尔方程、𜨻(3)的无理数）；克罗内克近似定理及其应用（模 1 均匀分布、外尔准则）；数论函数（狄利克雷除数问题、高斯圆问题、zeta函数的解析延拓）；素数定理（素数定理、关于 Z[i]的赫克素数定理）；剩余群的特征（有限阿贝尔群的结构、算术级数的素数定理、最小原根的估计、二次互反定理、高斯和）；Lenstra、Lenstra 和 Lovasz算法。','This course is intended to introduce the students to the basic results from the areas of the geometry of numbers, diophantine approximation, prime number theory, and the asymptotic calculation of number theoretic functions. Precisely, The Dirichlet approximation theorem and its applications (linear Diophantine equation, Pell equation, irrationality of 𝜁(3) ); The Kronecker approximation theorem and its applications (Uniform Distribution modulo 1,Weyl''s criterion); Geometry of numbers and its applications (Minkowski''s lattice point theorem, Lagrange''s theorem, Minkowski''s and Hlawka''s theorem); Number Theoretic functions (Dirichlet divisor problem, Gauss circle problem, Analytic continuation of the zeta- function); The prime number theorem (prime number theorem, Hecke''s prime number theorem for Z[i]).; Characters of groups of residues (Structure of finite abelian groups, Prime number theorem for arithmetic progressions, Estimate of the smallest primitive root, Quadratic reciprocity theorem, Gauss sums); The Algorithm of Lenstra, Lenstra and Lovasz.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101993,'MAT4004','图论','Graph Theory','MAT - 数学','4004','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Term 2
