2022-23 Term 2','NONE','NONE','图和有向图的定义与应用，欧拉图，哈密顿图，连通性，树，最短路径，网络流，匹配，平面度，图着色问题。课程将会讲授关于图的理论与算法。','Definitions and applications of graphs and digraphs, Eulerian graphs, Hamiltonian graphs, connectivity, trees, shortest paths, network flows, matching, planarity, graph colouring. Both theory and algorithms will be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
