(101995,'MAT4006','编码理论导论','Introduction to Coding Theory','MAT - 数学','4006','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
