2025-26 Term 2','Basic knowledge of linear algebra and probability is required.

It is recommended (but not required) that students have taken a course in discrete mathematics.','','编码理论是研究用于可靠信息传输和存储的纠错码。它是计算机科学和电气工程中许多应用的基础。

本课程的目标是全面介绍该领域并了解其基本的数学工具。将涵盖的主题包括：线性码、码界限、循环码、里德-所罗门码和解码算法。若时间允许，基于学生兴趣，可能包括其他主题。','Coding theory is the study of error-correcting codes for reliable information transmission and storage. It is fundamental to many applications in computer science and electrical engineering.

The goal of this course is to give a comprehensive introduction to this subject and to understand the basic mathematical tools. Topics to be covered include: linear codes, bounds for codes, cyclic codes, Reed-Solomon codes, and decoding algorithms. Other topics may be included depending on the availability of time and the interest of the students.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(101996,'MAT4007','密码学导论','Introduction to Cryptography','MAT - 数学','4007','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Basic knowledge of mathematics (algebra, probability, and statistics)','','密码学在我们生活中的应用无处不在。我们依赖密码学知识实现无线和网络等安全通信，磁盘文件的加密存储，以及在各种平台上的身份验证等。

本课程(MAT4007)涵盖对称和非对称密码系统，哈希函数和消息认证码，数字签名等多个主题,旨在帮助学生了解和掌握密码学的基本概念和理论基础。学生将参与案例研究、演示和讨论，深入了解密码学在日常生活中的应用。
。','Cryptography is everywhere. We rely on cryptography to provide secure communication for wireless or web traffic, encrypt files on disk, protect contents in DVD, and perform user authentication on various applications, etc. This course (MAT4007) provides an overview of the basic principles of applied cryptography. Topics covered include symmetric and asymmetric cryptography, hash functions, message authentication codes, digital signatures, etc. Emphasis is given on the theoretical foundations of cryptography. Students will engage with case studies, presentations, and discussions, gaining insights into how cryptography helps develop security in our daily lives.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
