MAT3006 Real Analysis','','本课程旨在介绍泛函分析领域的一些基本概念和结果，包括： Hilbert 空间、Banach 空间、对偶空间、Hahn-Banach 定理、共鸣原理、开映射定理、闭图形定理、弱收敛和弱星收敛、紧算子、谱理论等。我们将这些抽象的结果和实际例子与应用结合起来。','The course is meant to introduce fundament concepts and results such as Hilbert spaces, Banach spaces, dual spaces, Hahn-Banach theorem, uniformly bounded principle, open mapping theorem, closed graph theorem, weak and weak* convergence, compact operators, general spectral theory.  These abstract results are to be well-mixed with concrete examples and applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
