MATH2006 (Elementary Real Analysis)
- MATH3253 Complex analysis.
- MATH2040 Linear Algebra','You are on your own to makeup any missing prerequisite materials. So read up if your memory is fuzzy on them.','本课程涵盖欧几里得三空间上的曲线及曲面的基本理论。主题包括：常规曲线，Frenet公式，局部曲线理论，曲线的全局属性，如等周不等式。规则曲面的第一和第二基本形式，高斯曲率和平均曲率，高斯映射。特殊曲面例如规则曲面，曲面旋转，最小曲面；最短程线和Gauss-Bonnet定理。','This course covers basic theory on curves, and surfaces in the Euclidean three space. Topics include: regular curves, Frenet formulas, local theory of curves, global properties of curves such as isoperimetric inequality. 1st and 2nd fundamental form of regular surfaces, Gaussian curvature and mean curvature, Gauss map, special surfaces such as ruled surfaces, surfaces of revolution, minimal surfaces, geodesic, and Gauss-Bonnet Theorem','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
