MAT2002 Ordinary Differential Equation','','本科目介绍抛物型、椭圆型和双曲型偏微分方程及方程组，这类方程用于描述物理、生物、化学、社会科学等领域的模型。本科目主要注重于介绍三类基本方程包括Laplace方程，热方程以及波方程；学习求解这几类偏微分方程的基本方法，例如：分离变量法、特征函数展开法、Green函数、Fourier和Laplace变换。','This course introduces the theory of partial differential equations (PDEs) that models phenomena in areas including physics, biology, chemistry and social science. Solution techniques such as the separation of variables, eigenfunction expansions, Green’s functions, Fourier and Laplace transforms, weak solutions and Sobolev spaces for solving those equations will be studied in detail.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

