2026-27 Term 1','Abstract Algebra I and Advanced Linear Algebra.','None.','本課程有兩個主要主題：伽羅瓦理論和代數數論。 伽羅瓦理論：我們研究伽羅瓦域擴展的經典理論，最終證明一些經典定理：古希臘人關於尺子和圓規的三等分角及倍立方問題，和一般五次方程無根式解。 代數數論：目標是描述數域的性質，尤其是二次域擴張。這些域的整數環不是唯一分解整環，本課程的一個關鍵目標，是以類域論衡量整數環與唯一分解整環的區別。','The course has two main themes: Galois Theory and Algebraic Number Theory. Galois Theory – We study the classical theory of Galois field extensions, culminating in some of the classical theorems in the subject: the insolubility of the general quintic equations, and the impossibility of certain ruler and compass constructions considered by the Ancient Greeks. Algebraic Number Theory - The goal is to describe the properties of number fields, particularly on quadratic fields. In such fields, the ring of integers may not have unique factorization, and a key objective of the course is to introduce the class group which measures the failure of this property.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102008,'MAT5320','黎曼幾何','Riemannian Geometry','MAT - 数学','5320','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','MAT Differential geometry','','\\','An introduction to the geometry of smooth manifolds equipped with Riemannian metrics. Core topics include connections, geodesics, curvature, comparison theorems, submanifold geometry, Hodge theory and Bochner techniques, with optional modern perspectives.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102009,'MAT5340','代數幾何','','MAT - 数学','5340','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','Abstract Algebra','','Projective spaces, algebraic curves, divisors, line bundles, algebraic varieties, coherent sheaves, schemes. Some commutative algebra and homological algebra such as notherian ring, regular ring, valuation ring, kahler differentials.','Projective spaces, algebraic curves, divisors, line bundles, algebraic varieties, coherent sheaves, schemes. Some commutative algebra and homological algebra such as notherian ring, regular ring, valuation ring, kahler differentials.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102010,'MAT5620','應用數學中的方法','Methods of Applied Mathematics','MAT - 数学','5620','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
