2025-26 Term 1','MAT3006 Real Analysis AND MAT4010/MAT5120 Functional Analysis.','','本课程覆盖二阶椭圆及抛物型方程的古典极值原理、Sobolev 空间和椭圆方程的 L^2 理论。此课及后续课（偏微分方程（下））将为学生们以后阅读参考文献和开展相关的科研工作打好基础','The course mainly covers classical maximum principles for second order elliptic and parabolic equations, Sobolev spaces and L^2 theory for elliptic equations. This course, together with its subsequent course (Partial Differential Equations II) prepares students with basic knowledge to read more advanced literature and with tools to carry out related research.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102012,'MAT6115','偏微分方程（二）','Partial Differential Equations II','MAT - 数学','6115','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
