2025-26 Term 2','Partial Differential Equations (MAT6110) and its pre-requisites.','','本课程是 MAT6110 的延续，将介绍变分法的直接方法、勒贝格-博
赫纳空间以及主要的紧性定理（奥本-利翁斯定理和杜宾斯基定
理）。这些内容将应用于演化方程的研究。','The course is a continuation of MAT6110. The course will present the
direct method of the Calculus of Variations, Lebesgue-Bochner spaces
and the main compactness theorems (Aubin-Lions and Dubinskii).
These contents will be applied to the study of evolutionary equations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102013,'MAT6210','李代數及其表示','','MAT - 数学','6210','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Excellent knowledge in Linear Algebra and Abstract Algebra','','本课程为表示论研究做准备。内容包括幂零李代数、可解李代数、恩格尔定理和李定理、半密李代数及其分类、根系和Weyl群、Verma模、BBG解析、Weyl特征公式。','This course is preparation for research in representation theory. The content includes nilpotent Lie algebras, solvable Lie algebras, Engel''s theorem and Lie''s theorem, semismiple Lie algebras and their classifications, root systems and Weyl groups, Verma modules, BBG resolutions, Weyl character formula.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102014,'MAT6220','高等抽象代數 （二）','','MAT - 数学','6220','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1','MAT 3004 and MAT 3040.','','本课程有两个主要主题：交换代数和有限群表示论。交换代数：我们学习交换环及其模的基本结构理论，并探讨其在代数几何和数论中的应用。主要定理包括希尔伯特基定理、准素分解定理、诺特正规化引理、希尔伯特零点定理、中山引理、中国剩余定理以及戴德金整环上有限生成模的结构定理。有限群表示论：主要目标是研究有限群环及其模的基本理论，并探讨其在群论中的应用。主要定理包括马施克定理、韦德伯恩定理、舒尔正交关系、弗罗比乌斯互反律、麦基分解定理、阿廷定理以及伯恩赛德定理。','The course has two main themes: Commutative Algebra and Representation Theory of Finite Groups.
Commutative Algebra – We study the structure theory of commutative rings, especially Noetherian rings in detail, and investigate its applications in algebraic geometry and algebraic number theory. The main theorems to be covered include Hilbert’s basis theorem, Primary decomposition theorem, Noether’s normalization lemma, Hilbert’s Nullstellensatz, Nakayama’s lemma, Chinese remainder theorem, and the fundamental theorem of finitely generated modules over Dedekind domains.
Representation Theory of Finite Groups – The goal is to study the structure of finite group rings and their modules, and to discuss its applications in group theory. The main theorems to be covered include Maschke’s theorem, Wedderburn’s theorem, Schur’s orthogonality relations, Frobenius reciprocity, Mackey’s theorem, Artin’s theorem, and Burnside’s theorem.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102015,'MAT6230','李群與李代數','Lie groups and Lie algebras','MAT - 数学','6230','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','Abstract Algebra','','李群、李代数及其表示理论是代数、几何和分析核心数学思想与技巧的结合，在当今数学和理论物理的发展中发挥着关键作用。本课程是一门关于李群、李代数及其表示的入门课程，面向研究生新生和计划攻读研究生的优秀本科生。课程旨在学习李群和李代数的结构理论和表示理论，并将其应用于齐性空间上的调和分析。','The theory of Lie groups, Lie algebras and their representation is a combination of mathematical techniques in algebra, geometry and analysis and it plays a key role in the current developments of mathematics and theoretical physics.  This is an introductory course on Lie groups, Lie algebras and their representations for beginning postgraduate students and very top undergraduate students who plan for future postgraduate study. The aim is to learn the structure theory and representation theory of Lie groups and Lie algebras with applications to harmonic analysis on homogeneous spaces.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102016,'MAT6240','李群及其表示','','MAT - 数学','6240','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1','Good knowledge in Linear Algebra and Abstract Algebra','','本课程内容包括矩阵群和紧李群的结构理论、李群的李代数、紧李群的最大环面、根系、紧李群的不可约表示。','The aim of this course is to prepare students to enter research in representation theory, in particular, the PhD qualifying examination in representation theory. The content includes structure theory of matrix groups and compact Lie groups, the Lie algebra of a Lie group, the maximal torus of a compact Lie group, root systems, irreducible representations of compact Lie groups.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
