2025-26 Term 1','Theory of elliptic PDEs, numerical analysis, functional analysis. Familiarity with computer programming','None.','微分方程数值解、有限差分法、有限元法、谱法和边界积分法。收敛、稳定性和误差估计的基本理论。直接和迭代方法、编程技术和软件库、稀疏求解器、快速算法、多网格和域分解技术。','Numerical solution of differential equations, finite difference method, finite element methods, spectral methods and boundary integral methods. Basic theory of convergence, stability and error estimates. Direct and iterative methods, programming techniques and software libraries, sparse solvers, fast algorithms, multi-grid and domain decomposition techniques.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102020,'MAT6620','高等数值分析','','MAT - 数学','6620','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','Caculus, Linear algebra, Elementary partial differential equations, Elementary functional analysis, Familiarity with computer programming','None.','本课程涵盖研究生阶段的基本数值方法。主要主题是 PDE 的数值解和线性系统的迭代方法。对于 PDE 的数值解，讨论了椭圆和抛物方程的有限元方法的一些基本理论。主题包括 Sobolev 空间、嵌入和迹定理、变分公式、Lax-Milgram 定理、有限元空间及其插值理论、H1 和 L2 范数的收敛。对于线性系统的迭代方法，主题包括平稳迭代方法、Krylov 子空间方法、DD 和 MG 预处理技术以及收敛理论。','This course covers basic numerical methods in the graduate level. The main themes are numerical solutions of PDEs and iterative methods for linear systems. For numerical solutions of PDEs, some basic theories of finite element methods for elliptic and parabolic equations are discussed. The topics include Sobolev spaces, embedding and trace theorems, variational formulation, Lax-Milgram theorem, finite element spaces and their interpolation theories, convergence in H1 and L2 norms. For iterative methods for linear systems, the topics include stationary iterative methods, Krylov subspace methods, DD and MG preconditioning techniques, and convergence theories.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
