2026-27 Term 1','Probability Theory','None.','本课程介绍连续时间随机过程，包括布朗运动、随机积分、Itô 公式、鞅表示、Girsanov 定理、随机微分方程和跳跃过程。本课程强调随机分析在金融数学建模中的应用，包括 Black-Scholes 模型、风险中性定价和利率建模等等。','This course introduces continuous-time stochastic processes including Brownian motion, stochastic integration, Itô’s formula, martingale representation, Girsanov’s theorem, stochastic differential equations, and jump processes. Applications to mathematical finance are emphasized throughout, including the Black-Scholes model, risk-neutral pricing, and interest rate modeling.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
