Partial Differential','None.','本课程为半群理论专题，旨在介绍其基础理论。课程首先将系统讲授线性半群理论及其主要结果（Hille-Yosida 定理与 Lumer-Phillips定理），并进一步将这些理论应用于发展方程。在课程的最后阶段，将引入非线性半群理论。','This topic course introduces the foundations of semi-group theory. First, we will present the theory of linear semi-groups and the main results(Hille-Yosida and Lumer-Phillips). Then, we will apply these results to evolutionary equations. In the final part of the course, we will introduce the theory of non-linear semi-groups.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
