2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程介绍商业分析经济学的基本原理和分析工具。它涵盖微观和宏观经济学中与商业分析联系最紧密的基本原理以及应用。课程内容包含三部分：1. 微观部分：包括需求与供给均衡分析、消费者选择理论, 厂商生产与成本分析、不同市场结构下的最优经营决策、基本博弈论及其应用；2. 宏观部分：宏观经济学中核心概念和基本原理，包括经济周期，产出缺口，货币供应量等，以及宏观经济分析框架；3. 应用微观和宏观经济原理，理解中国经济发展以及各项政策的经济内涵。','This course introduces the basic principles and analytical tools of business analysis economics. It covers the basic principles and applications most closely related to business analysis in microeconomics and macroeconomics. The course content includes three parts: 1. Micro part: including demand and supply equilibrium analysis, consumer choice theory, manufacturer''s production and cost analysis, optimal management decision under different market structure, basic game theory and its application; 2. Macro part: core concepts and basic principles in macroeconomics, including economic cycle, output gap, money supply, etc., and macro part Economic analysis framework; 3. Apply microeconomic and macroeconomic principles to understand the economic connotation of China''s economic development and various policies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
