2026-27 Term 1','Not applicable','','该课程主要介绍在大数据时代市场营销管理如何通过运用营销要素（产品、定位、定价以及促销）获得最大的消费者满意度。课程重点强调营销定位战略，即一个公司的长期市场竞争力是通过在满足消费者需求的同时创造差异化优势来提高的。本课程还将从时间－空间－关联的视角出发，讨论如何利用大数据和技术来制定和实施营销策略，以及通过简短的案例阐述各种新的营销概念，给学生提供在复杂环境中的决策经验。','This course is designed to illustrate how marketing management varies the marketing mix (price, product, promotion, and place) to achieve maximum consumer satisfaction in the big data age. Emphasis is placed on the marketing positioning strategy that a firm''s long-run market competitiveness is enhanced by the creation of a differentiation advantage while satisfying consumer needs. The formulation and implementation of marketing strategy by using big data and technologies will also be discussed from a time-space-connection perspective. Short cases are used to illustrate the various new marketing concepts and to provide the student with decision-making experiences in a complex environment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
