2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程将从管理会计的⾓度聚焦如何对企业运⾏的关键要素进
⾏科学的计量， ⽐如， 如何确认企业产品或者服务的成本？ 如何设计企业的关键绩效指标？如何设计有效的控制机制？ 如何编制组织预算？ 管理会计不应简单局限于成本与绩效测算， 实现降本增效才是终极⽬标。 因此管理会计应该跳出静态核算与计量， 动态思考现有框架下的改进⽅案。','This course focuses on the scientific measurement of key business elements from a management accounting perspective. It covers product and service cost determination, KPI design, control mechanism development, and budget preparation. Rather than just focusing on cost and performance measurement, the emphasis is on cost reduction and efficiency enhancement. Students will learn to think dynamically to improve existing frameworks.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
