2024-25 Summer','Not applicable','','任何企业或组织最基本的职能就是向顾客传递价值，而“运营”则是组织创造价值的过程，其主要方式为将资源作为投入转化为产品或服务。运营管理就是对该价值创造过程的计划、组织与控制。

本课程将从理论和现实案例中介绍运营管理的职能，旨在使学生对企业的运营管理活动在经营决策和生产运营策略等主要内容方面有个基本的了解，理解企业经营过程中运营管理的作用和重要性，掌握生产运营活动的原则和方法，为学生能够将所学知识运用于工作实践中提供必要的原则。','This course is an introduction to the concepts, principles, problems, and practices of operations management. Emphasis is on managerial processes for effective operations in both goods-producing and service-rendering organization. Topics include operations strategy, process design, capacity planning, facilities location and design, forecasting, production scheduling, inventory control, quality assurance, and project management. The topics are integrated using a systems model of the operations of an organization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
