2024-25 Summer','','','本课程将介绍博弈论的基本原理，辅以现实案例和启发式练习，引导参与者在战略环境中发现科学模式，并理解理论演进的价值和意义。此外，学习者将参与课堂讨论和小组作业，自由探索如何将博弈论应用于实际场景。','This course will introduce the foundational principles of game theory, supplemented by real-world cases and heuristic exercises, guiding participants to uncover scientific patterns in strategic environments and appreciate the value and significance of theoretical evolution. Additionally, learners will engage in classroom discussions and group assignments, freely exploring how to apply game theory in practical scenarios.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102088,'MBM6324','价值投资','','MBM - Business Management','6324','M',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程概述了价值投资的理论和实证基础。主题包括价值投资过程、机构投资者行为、搜索策略、市场心理、忽视现象、估值、内在价值和安全边际概念以及混合证券。该课程还将研究当前市场环境中的真实情况，采用多种评估框架，提高学生做出明智决策的能力。','This course is an overview of the theoretical and empirical underpinning of value investing. Topics include the value investing process, institutional investor behavior, search strategies, market psychology, the phenomenon of neglect, valuation, concepts of  intrinsic value and margin of safety, and hybrid securities. The class will also study real-world situations in the current market environment, employ multiple valuation frameworks and improve students'' ability to make informed decisions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
