2026-27 Term 1','','','商业谈判在现代商业活动的每一个环节中都有着至关重要的作用。这门课程为学生提供关于商业谈判的必要知识、技能和策略，并通过案例分析、谈判模拟使学生了解如何在各种商业环境与场景中有效发挥。','Business Negotiation plays a vital role in every aspect of modern commercial activities. This course provides students with the necessary knowledge, skills, and strategies of business negotiation, enabling them to effectively navigate various business environments and scenarios through case studies and negotiation simulations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102091,'MBM6327','商业模式与战略','','MBM - Business Management','6327','M',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Not applicable','','本课程将深入探讨战略与商业模式的核心概念及其相互关系。课程涵盖企业结构、行为和绩效分析，通过SWOT分析、平衡计分卡等工具，理解如何在快速变化的市场环境中，制定和执行有效的战略决策。同时，课程将通过案例讨论与分析，强化对商业模式创新和战略调整的分析能力。','This course will explore the core concepts of strategy and business models and their interrelationships in depth. It covers the analysis of corporate structure, behavior, and performance, utilizing tools such as SWOT analysis and the balanced scorecard to understand how to formulate and implement effective strategic decisions in a rapidly changing market environment. Additionally, the course will enhance analytical skills related to business model innovation and strategic adjustment through case discussions and analyses.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102092,'MBM6328','领导力与决策','','MBM - Business Management','6328','M',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','Not applicable','','这门课程旨在帮助新领导者和有抱负的领导者发挥自己的潜力，培养高绩效的团队。学生将学习关于动机、情商和沟通方法，以建立个人的领导风格。借助行为学、心理学等学科的知识和研究成果，梳理归纳决策的理性、解读判断和决策的误差、探讨管理沟通中决策的应用。','This course is designed to help new and aspiring leaders unleash their potential, and cultivate high-performing teams. Students will learn about motivation, emotional intelligence, and communication methods to establish personal leadership styles. Through learning knowledge and research findings from disciplines such as behavioral science and psychology, this course organizes and summarizes the rationality of decision-making, interprets the division between judgment and decision-making, and explores the application of decision-making in management communication.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
