2026-27 Term 1','Not applicable','','本课程首先介绍商业分析可以解决的问题，继而结合例子简要介绍商业分析的方法和工具（如商业统计、优化、和仿真）。最后，课程将讨论利用数据与分析工具辅助决策时需要考虑的因素，以帮助企业高管解决竞争激烈的商业环境中的问题。','This course first presents questions that can be addressed by business analytics, and then briefly introduces business analytics tools, such as business statistics, optimization and simulation. The course will conclude by discussing important considerations when using data and analytics to help with making business decisions, in order to help executives to solve problems in competitive business environment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102095,'MBM6331','供应链管理','','MBM - Business Management','6331','M',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
