2026-27 Term 1','','','本门课程介绍了供应链和物流管理的主题，包括概念、见解、实用工具和决策支持系统，用于有效地管理供应链和物流。本门课程将传达许多关键的供应链和物流管理概念背后的逻辑，并提供一些简单的技术，可以用来分析供应链和物流管理的各个方面。','This course introduces supply chain and logistics management topics including the concepts, insights, practical tools, and decision support systems for effective management. This course will convey both the intuitions behind much key supply chain and logistics management concepts and provide simple techniques that can be used to analyze various aspects of the supply chain and logistics management.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102096,'MBM6332','商业创新实践专题','','MBM - Business Management','6332','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1','','','本课程分为两大模块：商业模式与战略（模块一）和商业分析与决策（模块二）。模块一将深入探讨战略与商业模式的核心概念及其相互关系。课程涵盖企业结构、行为和绩效分析，通过SWOT分析、平衡计分卡等工具，理解如何在快速变化的市场环境中，制定和执行有效的战略决策。同时，课程将通过案例讨论与分析，强化对商业模式创新和战略调整的分析能力。模块二将系统介绍人工智能技术体系及其在商业决策中的核心应用。课程涵盖从机器学习到大型语言模型的关键技术解析，重点探讨智能决策的技术原理与实现路径，帮助企业理解如何在数字化转型浪潮中，借助AI工具提升决策质量与商业洞察。课程将通过典型案例分析，深入解读大模型与智能决策系统的结合方式，展示不同行业企业推进智能化转型的具体实践与成效。','The Business Innovation Practicum is an immersive course that combines principles and practice to provide students with the knowledge and skills to succeed in the dynamic world of business innovation. Through a combination of lectures, case analysis, company visits, university-industry entrepreneurial co-creation, and final projects for new business initiatives, this course offers a comprehensive understanding of key principles and emerging trends in the field. Students will explore topics such as new business model design, strategic management, digital transformation, and technology commercialization, while also gaining hands-on experience through real-world projects. The course will also identify potential projects for helping them to make further commercial transformations. By the end of the course, students will have a solid foundation in business innovation, equipped with the skills and mindset necessary to drive innovation and create successful ventures.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102097,'MBM6334','商业整合实践专题（B）','','MBM - Business Management','6334','M',1.50,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Summer','','','本课程具有定制化、实践性和整合性的特点，提供多样化的学习方式。学生通过短期的国内外高校和企业参访，深入了解企业如何在动态环境中制定战略决策并进行定位。此外，学生还能从企业家的讲座中受益，并积极参与案例研究和讨论。这些活动旨在增强学生有效整合理论与实践的能力。','This course embodies the characteristics of customization, practicality, and integration, offering diverse learning methods. Students gain valuable insights into how businesses make strategic decisions and position themselves in dynamic environments through short-term (2.5 days) visits to universities and enterprises, both domestically and internationally. Furthermore, they benefit from lectures delivered by entrepreneurs and actively engage in case studies and discussions. These activities are designed to enhance students'' ability to effectively integrate theory with practice.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
