2025-26 Term 2','None','None','高性能网络是支撑人工智能（AI）成功落地的关键技术。人工智能任务（如大模型训练与部署）通常需要大量计算资源和快速响应能力，而这仅能通过高速、可靠、安全且可扩展的网络解决方案实现。本课程将探讨科研与工业界的网络解决方案，可能会整合数据中心、云端及边缘环境中各类系统与设备的有线和无线连接技术。','High-performance networking is a crucial technology to support successful AI. AI tasks, such as large model training and deployment, often demand substantial computational resources and fast responses. This can be accomplished only with support from fast, reliable, secure and scalable networking solutions. This course will explore research and industrial network solutions, potentially integrating wired and wireless connections across diverse systems and devices within data centers, clouds, and edge environments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
