2025-26 Term 2','Basic knowledge of mathematics (algebra, probability, and statistics)','None.','密码学在我们生活中的应用无处不在。我们依赖密码学知识实现无线和网络等安全通信，磁盘文件的加密存储，以及在各种平台上的身份验证等。本课程涵盖对称和非对称密码系统，哈希函数和消息认证码，数字签名等多个主题,旨在帮助学生了解和掌握密码学的基本概念和理论基础。学生将参与案例研究、演示和讨论，深入了解密码学在日常生活中的应用。','Cryptography is everywhere. We rely on cryptography to provide secure communication for wireless or web traffic, encrypt files on disk, protect contents in DVD, and perform user authentication on various applications, etc. This course covers diverse topics on cryptography including symmetric and asymmetric cryptography, hash functions, message authentication codes, digital signatures, etc. Emphasis is given on the theoretical foundations of cryptography. Students will engage with case studies, presentations, and discussions, gaining insights into how cryptography helps develop security in our daily lives.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
