2025-26 Term 1','','','本课程全面介绍了网络通信的基本原理。它提供了一个统一的视角，结合了不同领域的知识，包括信息论、排队论、效用最大化、控制论、图论和编码理论。这些知识可以帮助学生为各种新兴的新应用设计和优化通信网络。','This course provides a comprehensive introduction to the fundamental principles of network communications. It offers a unified perspective that combines the knowledge from various domains, including information theory, queuing theory, utility maximization, control theory, graph theory, and coding theory. The knowledge can prepare students for design and optimize communication networks for various emerging new applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
