2025-26 Term 2','Have taken courses about basic communication and networking.','None','本课程全面探讨5G与6G无线通信技术。课程内容涵盖移动通信技术演进、5G网络架构及其关键技术组件（包括OFDM、MIMO、波束成形、HARQ和无线资源管理等）。通过基于软件定义无线电和开源实现的实践项目，学生将亲手搭建5G系统。课程最后还将探讨6G前沿议题，包括通感一体化（ISAC）与人工智能驱动的通信技术。','This course provides a comprehensive exploration of 5G and 6G wireless technologies. The curriculum covers mobile communication evolution, 5G network architecture, including key technical components such as OFDM, MIMO, beamforming, HARQ, and radio resource management. The course includes a hands-on project to build a 5G system using software-defined radio and open-source implementations. It concludes with an examination of emerging 6G topics, including integrated sensing and communication (ISAC) and AI-driven communications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
