2018-19 Summer','Basic prior knowledge of probability, linear algebra, data structures and algorithms, and programming, preferably in Python.','MDS5210- Machine Learning','本课程系统介绍数据挖掘的基本概念、核心技术与典型应用，指导学生学习完整的数据挖掘流程，涵盖从商业理解、数据理解、数据准备到建模、评估与部署的各个环节。课程重点包括相似性度量、哈希方法等核心数据挖掘技术，关联规则挖掘、决策树、KNN、朴素贝叶斯、集成学习、聚类等重要模型与方法，以及数据挖掘流程中的效率与可扩展性优化方法。
在此基础上，课程进一步探讨典型的工业界应用，包括结合大语言模型的文本挖掘、流数据处理、布隆过滤器、局部敏感哈希和推荐系统。课程强调实践性模型评估、面向商业决策的分析方法、可复现的数据挖掘管道以及数据挖掘解决方案的部署，旨在培养学生在真实商业场景中有效应用数据挖掘技术的实践能力。','This course covers the fundamental concepts, techniques, and applications of data mining, guiding students through the complete data mining process —from business understanding, data understanding, and data preparationto modeling, evaluation, and deployment. Key topics include core data mining techniques such as similarity measurement and hashing; essential models and methods such as association rule mining, decision trees, KNN, Naive Bayes, ensemble learning, and clustering; and methods for improving efficiency and scalability in data mining workflows.

Building on these foundations, the course explores typical industry applications, including text mining with LLMs, stream data processing, Bloom filters, locality-sensitive hashing, and recommendation systems. The course emphasizes practical model evaluation, business-oriented decision-making, reproducible pipelines, and deployment of data mining solutions, ensuring that students gain practical skills to apply data mining techniques effectively in real-world business settings.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
