Algorithms','','如今，作为最常见的数字媒体形式，图像随处可见且非常容易获取，这使得图像处理和计算在各个领域的广泛应用中变得至关重要。此外，随着深度学习技术的快速发展，计算机视觉领域也引起了广泛关注。本课程将主要聚焦于图像处理和计算机视觉，涵盖该领域的多种课题，并介绍这些课题的传统方法和基于深度学习的前沿技术。相关课题将包括图像分类、分割、检测、增强、合成等。此外，本课程还将深入探讨3D表示以及3D信号处理技术的最新进展。','Nowadays, as the most common medium of digital media, images can be seen everywhere and are very easy to obtain, making image processing and computation essential in a wide range of applications across various fields. Moreover, with the rapid development of deep learning technology, the field of computer vision has attracted significant attention. This course will mainly focus on image processing and computer vision, covering various topics within the field and introducing both traditional methods and cutting-edge techniques based on deep learning. The topics will include image classification, segmentation, detection, enhancement, synthesis, etc. Additionally, the course will delve into 3D representations and the latest advancements in 3D signal processing technologies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102134,'MDS5114','应用并行编程','','MDS - 数据科学','5114','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 2','Students are expected to write code in C, C++.','NA','本课程将介绍并行程序设计的概念与有效地实现方法。课程主题将包括并行计算机架构,并行处理语言,资料结构的设计,同步控制技术,以及在图像处理,人工智慧/机器学习, 和高性能计算上的应用。','This course introduces concepts of parallel programming. Topics include parallel computer architectures, parallel programming languages, data structure designs for efficient parallel processing, synchronization controls, and applying parallel programming to image processing, AI/Machine Learning and related high performance computing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102135,'MDS5115','大数据建模与管理','','MDS - 数据科学','5115','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Fundamental statistics, programming language, i.e., Java or Python','','随着高科技的飞速发展，各种海量数据无处不在并呈指数级增长。直到最近，配备精良的计算机才得以处理和分析这些大规模数据。目前，研究人员面临的最重要挑战是如何处理大数据，从中挖掘有价值的信息，并获得有意义的洞察。
本课程旨在提供基础知识，使学生熟悉用于大数据预处理、存储、操作和分析的最重要信息技术。课程伊始，将向学生简要介绍大数据的概况，包括其定义、可视化、工具包及应用场景。随后，将介绍处理大数据的基础平台，如 Hadoop 和 Spark。在这些平台上，存在多种不同的数据存储方法，以及用于上传、分布和预处理大数据的功能。接着，课程将介绍在这些平台上运行的大数据分析算法，以分析数据并提取有价值的信息。最后，将向学生演示如何可视化分析结果以及如何从中获得洞察。
课程后半部分将重点关注其中一种分析算法——深度学习。深度学习被称为深度结构化与层次化学习，旨在对数据中的高层抽象进行建模。课程将介绍深度学习的基础知识，包括如何构建深度神经网络以及进行参数训练。本课程的目标是培养学生对深度学习的认知，通过作业使其熟悉该技术，并为其在商业应用中提供有用的洞察。','With the rapid development of high technology, all sorts of high-volume data are everywhere and booming exponentially. Only until recently, well-equipped computers are able to handle and analyze these large-scale data. Currently the most important challenge for researchers is how to process the big data, dig out the valuable information from the big data, and obtain meaningful insights from the information. The purpose of this course is to provide fundamental knowledge to familiarize students with the most important information technologies used for preprocessing, storing, manipulating and analyzing the big data. At the beginning of the course a brief overview of the big data is introduced to the students: the definition, visualization, toolbox, and applications. Then the basic platforms for handling big data are introduced, such as Hadoop and Spark. On these platforms there exists several different data storage methods and functions to upload, distribute and preprocess the big data. Then several analytical algorithms on these platforms are introduced to analyze the big data and extract the valuable information. Finally, how to visualize the analytic results and how to get insights from these results are demonstrated to students. The second half of this course mainly focuses on one of the analytical algorithms, deep learning. Deep learning is known as deep structured and hierarchical learning, which attempts to model high-level abstractions in the data. Basics of deep learning are introduced including how to set up deep neural network and perform the parameter training. The purpose is to create students’ awareness of deep learning, familiar with it through assignments and provide useful insights in the business application.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
