2026-27 Term 1','Introductory Statistics,
Basic Programming Skills (R or Python)','None','本课程结合商业应用中的案例研究、理论概念及分析框架，系统介绍网络分析（Web Analytics）与用户体验（UX）研究的理论与实践。课程将从商业视角出发，阐述网络分析的定义、涵盖范围以及全球企业通用的关键绩效指标（KPIs）。

课程前半部分聚焦于网站分析，讲解企业和研究人员如何利用各类工具来衡量和优化网络业务 KPIs；后半部分则专注于用户体验研究，这是网络分析的重要环节，课程将深入结合应用统计学与实验设计方法展开教学。此外，课程内容还涵盖社交媒体、网络安全及用户隐私等议题。

在辅导课环节，学生将使用 R 语言 和 Google Analytics 进行实操演练。课程结束时，学生将对网络技术的运作机制有扎实的理解，并掌握规划与实施网络数据统计分析的能力。','Through a combination of case studies, theoretical concepts, and analytics frameworks used in business applications, this course introduces the theory and practice of Web Analytics and User Experience research. It provides a business perspective on what Web Analytics is, the areas it covers, and the most important KPIs used by companies worldwide. The first part of the course focuses on Website Analytics and the tools companies and researchers use to measure and optimize Web business KPIs. The second part of the course focuses on UX Research, an important aspect of Web Analytics, and draws heavily on applied statistics and experimental design. Other topics covered in the course are social media, network security, and user privacy. During the tutorials, students will use the R programming language and Google Analytics. By the end of the course, students will have a solid understanding of how web technologies work and how to plan and conduct statistical analysis of web data.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
