Basic knowledge of programming languages','None','本课程旨在通过无代码/低代码平台，引导学生实践开发面向商业应用的生成式人工智能（GenAI）解决方案。课程专为非技术背景学生设计，使用Dify、n8n、Coze、编程智能体工具等，实现AI驱动商业解决方案的快速原型开发与部署。课程涵盖GenAI与大语言模型(LLM)基础、GenAI项目全生命周期，智能代理系统构建技能等。通过理论授课、实践教程、专家讲座和小组项目，学生将开发真实商业GenAI应用并展示工作原型。完成本课程后，学生将能够：理解GenAI基础并评估不同模型；为商业场景设计和实现完整的GenAI解决方案；使用无代码/低代码平台构建和优化智能代理系统；将外部数据源和工具集成到GenAI应用中；评估各行业的GenAI应用。
注：课程强调"落地应用"而非技术研究或算法开发。','This course introduces students to the practical development of Generative AI (GenAI) applications for business using no-code and low-code platforms. Designed for students without extensive programming backgrounds, this course enables rapid prototyping and deployment of AI-powered business solutions using platforms such as Dify, n8n, Coze, and coding agent tools. The course covers fundamental concepts of GenAI and Large Language Models (LLMs), the complete GenAI project lifecycle, and emphasizes hands-on construction of intelligent agentic systems. Through theoretical lecture, practical tutorials, invited industry speakers, and a group project, students will develop real-world GenAI applications and present working demonstrations. Upon completion, students will be able to: understand GenAI fundamentals and evaluate different models; design and implement complete GenAI solutions for business contexts; construct and optimize intelligent agentic systems using no-code/low-code platforms; integrate external data sources and tools into GenAI applications; and critically assess GenAI applications across various business sectors.
Note: The course focuses on practical business applications rather than AI research or algorithm development.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
