2023-24 Term 1','Linear algebra, multivariate calculus or analysis at advanced undergraduate level. Familiarity with MATLAB, Python, or other appropriate programming languages is required.','','该课程介绍了基础的优化理论及演算法，主要用于解决机器学习和数据科学领域的优化问题。基础理论部分包括凸分析、对偶理论、最优性条件。基础一阶优化演算法如梯度法、邻近梯度法及其加速的情况，以及交替方向乘子演算法都会讲解到。同时，二阶优化演算法如牛顿法、拟牛顿法以及邻近牛顿法也都会介绍。
該課程要求在電腦上實現演算法並解決問題。','This course covers basic optimization theory, algorithms, and modeling techniques for optimization problems in machine learning and data science. Basic theory covered will include convex analysis and optimality conditions for unconstrained and constrained problems. Basic optimization algorithms such as the gradient method, the proximal gradient method and its accelerated versions, the alternating direction method of multipliers, and stochastic approaches will be presented. Second-order algorithms such as Newton’s method and inexact Newton methods will also be introduced.
The course will require algorithms implementation and problem solving on computers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
