2026-27 Term 1','None','None','人体结构（一）是临床医学的基础课程，将会向学生介绍人体的结构，通过理论课和整合尸体解剖与活体超声解剖同步开展的教学模式来传授知识。在临床技能课程中展示解剖相关的临床知识。主题包括：背与上肢、胸部和骨骼肌运动系统、心血管系统、呼吸系统、组织胚胎学。','Human Structure I introduces students to the structure of human body, which is the foundation for further studies in medicine. Organization of the body is taught through lectures and interactive practicals in cadaver-based dissection synchronized with sonoanatomy in living subjects. Clinical relevance of anatomical knowledge is demonstrated in Clinical Skill sessions. Topics include: back and upper limb, thorax and musculoskeletal/cardiovascular/respiratory system, histology and embryology.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
