(102176,'MED1021','生物化学与有机化学（一）','Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry I','MED - Medicine','1021','M',2.00,1000,'Major','Pass/Fail','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
