2026-27 Term 1','None','None','生物化学与有机化学是一门涵盖了生物化学、有机化学、分子生物学、细胞生物学及遗传学等基础知识的综合性课程。本课程将向学生介绍生命过程中能量的热力学原理，生命过程中大分子/生物分子的变化，细胞组成和他们的功能，以及人类疾病中的各种遗传学或表观遗传学异常。

第一学期的课程将为学生提供关于生命、生命基本规律和微观生物分子的扎实基础和全面认知，然后学生开启第二学期课程，全面了解生物化学、生理学和生物过程等相关领域的知识。','This is an integrated course covering the foundation knowledge of biochemistry, organic chemistry, molecular biology, cell biology, and genetics. This course introduces students the basic principles of thermodynamics of energy in life, microparticle/biomolecular alteration in biological processes, cellular components and their functions, and various genetics or epigenetics abnormalities in human diseases.

Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry I provides students a solid foundation and comprehensive recognition of life, basic rules in life, and microscopic biomolecules in life, before they embark on the journey of Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry II to get an overview of the biochemistry, physiology and bio-process topics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
