2025-26 Term 2','MED1021 Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry I','None','生物化学与有机化学是一门涵盖了生物化学、有机化学、分子生物学、细胞生物学及遗传学等基础知识的综合性课程。本课程将向学生介绍生命过程中能量的热力学原理，生命过程中大分子/生物分子的变化，细胞组成和功能以及人类疾病的遗传学或表观遗传学异常。

生物化学和有机化学（二）为学生提供了生物分子功能和调节作用相关内容的坚实基础，并使他们在学习人类遗传学和其他高级课程的之前有着对分子生物学、生物化学以及生理学的全面认识。本课程的主题包括生物化学、新陈代谢、细胞反应和细胞周期。','This is an integrated course covering the foundation knowledge of biochemistry, organic chemistry, molecular biology, cell biology, and genetics. This course introduces students the basic principles of thermodynamics of energy in life, microparticle/biomolecular alteration in biological processes, cellular components and their functions, and various genetics or epigenetics abnormalities in human diseases.

Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry II provides students a solid foundation of the functional and regulatory roles of biological molecules, and a comprehensive recognition of molecular biology, biochemistry and physiology before they embark on the journey of Human Genetics and further advanced courses. Topics in this course range from introducing detailed biochemistry, metabolism, cellular response, and cell cycles.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
