2026-27 Term 1','None','None','本课程目的在于: 为医学生提供数学和物理基础知识。

课程以生物医学应用为主要动力，加强学生对单变量微积分、常微分方程和物理学的概念理解，并培养其在医学领域应用以上概念的能力。','This course is designed to provide the students in the Medical School the foundation in mathematics. Using biological and medical applications as the main motivator, this course emphasizes conceptual understanding of single-variable calculus, linear algebra, and statistics, and nurtures the ability to apply these concepts in the field of medicine.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
