2026-27 Term 1','MED1011 Human Function I，MED1012 Human Function II','None','人体功能（三）重点学习内分泌系统和生殖系统的生理功能，以及与这些系统相关的部分疾病的基础药理调节。课程内容包括：内分泌学、生殖生理学，以及用于部分内分泌和生殖系统疾病的药物分类。本课程包括讲座、小组辅导和实验课。','Human Function III focuses on the physiological functions of the endocrine and reproductive systems and basic pharmacological regulation of selected conditions related to these systems. Topics include: endocrinology, reproductive physiology and classification of drugs used for selected endocrine and reproductive conditions. The course includes lectures, tutorials and practicals.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
