MED2011 Human Function III','None','人体功能（三）和（四）重点学习内分泌系统、生殖系统和神经系统的生理功能和药理调控，涉及激素、神经和免疫机制等各种身体功能的综合运作。本课程有理论课、实验课，小组辅导，和团队合作学习教授课程内容。主题包括：内分泌学、生殖系统生理学、神经系统功能学、和作用于疼痛控制、中枢神经系统功能的药理学等。','Human Function III & IV focuses on the physiological function and pharmacological regulation of endocrine, reproductive and nervous system as well as the integrated control of various body functions that involve hormonal and neural mechanisms. The course includes lectures, practicals and small group tutorials. Topics include: endocrinology, reproductive physiology, nervous system function, and drug actions in pain control and CNS function.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
