2025-26 Term 2','MED1021 Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry I,
MED1022 Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry II','None','微生物学课程涵盖了人体和体外环境中的多种微生物，包括细菌、真菌、病毒和寄生虫等。同时将介绍这些微生物的细胞结构、生理、新陈代谢和遗传学等原理。此外，本课程还探讨了人类预防和控制感染的一些方法和原理及重要的病原体。通过学习本课程，学生将掌握微生物学的基础知识，尤其是临床相关的病原体，以便学习其他进阶课程，比如临床微生物学。','This course provides general and basic introduction of various microorganisms in the world, including bacteria, fungi, viruses and parasites. It also covers principles of cell structure, physiology, metabolism, genetics of those microorganisms. In addition, various ways to eliminate and control infections and the most medical important microbes will be discussed in this course. Students will acquire general knowledge of microorganisms, especially clinically relevant pathogens to set up the stage for their studies of advanced courses such as clinical microbiology (Year 3).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
