2026-27 Term 1','MED1021 & MED1022 Biochemistry and Organic Chemistry','None','在临床医学中，人类疾病的诊断、预防和治疗需要对遗传信息的全面理解和科学应用。 本课程涵盖基础遗传学概念、系统发育研究、染色体遗传、复杂性状与群体遗传学、多基因及多因子疾病、基因治疗的起步，以及基因发现和诊断的新方法。 此外，学生还将面临开放式问题，如与产前诊断相关的生物伦理、遗传咨询和决策。','In clinical medicine, the diagnosis, prevention, and treating human diseases demand comprehensive understanding and scientific application of genetics information. This course will start from basic genetic concept, pedigree studies, chromosomal inheritance, complex traits and population genetics, multigenic and multifactorial conditions, gene therapy, to the neo-approaches in genetic discovery and diagnostic. Besides, the students will also confront to the debating issues, like bioethics topics regarding prenatal diagnosis, genetic counselling and decision-making.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
