MED2060	Immunology
MED2100	Bioethics and Professionalism II','none','普通病理学是一门基础学科，对于理解不同器官系统疾病发生的机制至关重要。

MED3001 课程全面概述了病理学的核心原理和概念，例如细胞损伤、细胞死亡、炎症和愈合等。这些概念涵盖了不同器官系统可能发生的主要疾病类别，使学生能够将这些知识应用于不同的器官系统，并加深对系统性疾病的理解。

法医病理学是本课程的重要组成部分，它强调了病理学在调查死亡和伤害、伸张正义方面的作用。

完成本课程后，学生将对疾病发生的基本原理和机制有深刻的理解，并具备批判性思维能力。','"General pathology is a foundational discipline that is essential to understand the mechanisms of disease process across various organ systems.
The MED3001 course provides a comprehensive overview of the core principles and concepts in pathology like cell injury, cell death, inflammation and healing, etc. These concepts encompass the major categories of diseases that can occur in different organ systems, enabling the student to apply this knowledge to various organ systems and develop a deeper understanding of systemic diseases.
Forensic pathology, an essential component of this course, highlights the role of pathology in investigating death and injury, in the pursuit of justice.
By the end of this course, students will possess a deep understanding of the fundamental principles and mechanisms underlying disease processes, empowering them to think critically."','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
