MED2100 Bioethics and Professionalism II','None','MED3002 系统病理学课程建立在普通病理学课程所学概念的基础上。本课程深入探讨影响人体主要器官系统的疾病的病因、发病机制和临床病理特征。

通过本课程，学生将深入了解系统性疾病的发病机制，从而能够运用批判性思维分析不同器官系统之间复杂的相互作用及其在疾病发生和发展中的作用。

本课程将重点关注临床表现与病理检查发现之间的关联。这种临床和病理知识的整合将使学生能够提高诊断准确性，指导治疗干预，并为患者制定合适的管理策略。

课程结束时，学生将对系统性疾病的基本原理和机制有深刻的理解，从而能够进行批判性的思考，并将所学知识应用于临床实践。','The MED3002 Systemic Pathology course builds upon the concepts learned in General Pathology. This course delves deeper into the etiology, pathogenesis, and clinicopathological features of diseases affecting the major organ systems of the body.
Through this course, students will develop a robust knowledge of the mechanisms driving systemic diseases, enabling them to critically analyze the complex interplay between different organ systems and their role in the manifestation and progression of diseases.
Emphasis will be placed on correlating clinical presentations with pathological findings. This integration of clinical and pathological knowledge will empower students to enhance diagnostic accuracy, guide therapeutic interventions, and develop appropriate management strategies for patients.
By the end of this course, students will possess a deep understanding of the fundamental principles and mechanisms underlying systemic diseases, enabling them to think critically, apply their knowledge in clinical practice.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
