MED2100	Bioethics and Professionalism II','none','MED3031临床微生物学课程在微生物学基础知识之上，进一步深入探讨微生物所致疾病的病理生理机制、诊断与治疗。通过本课程学习，学生将掌握微生物防控的核心原则以保障患者及医务人员安全，系统理解人类感染性疾病的各类病原微生物特征、诊断方法及临床管理策略，并能够批判性分析抗菌药物耐药性问题及其应对方案。','The MED3031 Clinical Microbiology course builds upon the concepts and knowledge learned in Microbiology. This course delves deeper into the pathophysiology, diagnosis, and treatment of diseases caused by microbes.
By the end of the course, students will possess a fundamental understanding of infection control principles to safeguard patients and healthcare workers, the ability to articulate different microbial causes of human infectious diseases, their diagnostic approaches and clinical management strategies, and the ability to critically analyze the problems of antimicrobial resistance and potential solutions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102202,'MED3099R','美国医师执照考试备考课程','','MED - Medicine','3099R','M',1.00,3000,'Major','已评分','考试','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','●	Senior medical students (Year 3–6) in the Clinical Medicine Program.
●	Completed all pre-clinical and core clinical rotations.','NA','本课程旨在为高年级医学生准备美国医师执照考试（USMLE）。 课程提供考试规范、申请流程、复习计划与应试策略的结构化指导。 学生将完成两场模拟USMLE考试情境的测验，并透过回馈机制找出待加强环节。 经评估具备应考资格的学生，将获得医学院背书申请正式USMLE考试。','This course prepares senior medical students for the United States Medical Licensing Examination (USMLE) Licensing exams. The course provides structured guidance on exam regulations, application procedures, review planning, and test-taking strategies. Students complete two mock examinations simulating USMLE conditions, with feedback provided to identify areas of weakness for improvement. Students who demonstrate readiness will be endorsed by the medical school to apply for the official USMLE examination.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102203,'MED3100','伦理与专业（三）','Bioethics and Professionalism III','MED - Medicine','3100','M',1.00,3000,'Major','Pass/Fail','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
