2026-27 Term 1','Multivariable Calculus, Probability and Statistics.','No co-requisite','本课程面向想要了解金融衍生产品定价原理的学生。 本课程首先介绍期权，期货，掉期和远期合约的基本特征。 然后，使用风险中性定价理论，推导了二项式期权定价模型和Black-Scholes-Merton定价理论。 在高级定价理论中，系统地介绍了伊图引理和mar定价理论。 课程最后将介绍各种新型期权。','The course introduces some basic concepts of stochastic calculus, an important mathematical tool used in financial engineering, and presents systematically the theory of risk-neutral pricing of financial derivatives.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
