2025-26 Term 2','The pre-requisite course is Financial Derivatives (MFE5130) or some courses of equivalent level.  Students need to have some knowledge of derivatives products.  To help understand the materials, students should have a general understanding of the global financial markets.','No co-requisite.','本课程为学生对金融风险提供一个深入了解,通过建立数学模型，以明了这些风险的性质,去量度及使用相关产品和工具来管理它们。教学主题包括在交易层面和投资组合层面的市场风险，如利率风险，信用风险，外汇风险。本课程还包括风险价值，压力测试,流量风险，操作风险，并介绍现今市场介监控银行的条例。','This course provides students with an in-depth understanding of financial risks by building mathematical models in order to understand the nature of these risks and to manage them using relevant products and instruments.  Topics include market risk such as interest rate risk, credit risk, foreign exchange risk at trade level and portfolio level. The course also covers Value at Risk, liquidity risk and an introduction to bank regulations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
