2025-26 Term 2','Multivariable Calculus, Probability and Statistics, MFE5130 (Financial Derivatives), Stochastic Calculus and martingale pricing theory.','No co-requisite','本课程旨在提供对一些不同的广泛使用利率模型进行有系统的讨论。这些模型包括单和多因素的 Heath-Jarrow-Morton models 和 the LIBOR market model 及 Secured Overnight Financing Rate (SOFR)的模型。我们将用这些模型来为在市场上常见的各种固定收益证券进行定价及分析，当中包括一些奇异产品。我们将讨论的证券包括，但不限于，bonds, bond options, caps, floors, swaptions and the derivatives based on SOFR。','The course provides a systematic introduction to the development, analysis and implementation of interest rate models. The materials will cover linear interest rate products and yield curve construction; vanilla interest rate options and single rate option models, interest rate exotics, the modeling of multi-rate term structure, and how to manage interest rate exposure for fixed income portfolios.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
