2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisite','Financial Derivatives','金融工程的各领域在金融市场中发展迅速。本研习课程旨在让学生能与业界人士接触，有互动的机会。 通过课堂和研讨会，学生可以在当前的市场情况下认识金融工程的发展。金融工程项目的业界导师将被邀请为学生的职业生涯及升学机会提供指导。','Various areas of Financial Engineering has been developing rapidly in the financial markets. The Practicum course aims at exposing students to firsthand interaction with Industry Practitioners. Through the lectures and workshops, the students can gain exposure to the financial engineering development in the current market situation. Practitioner Mentors from the FE program are invited to deliver lectures on the career and further studies prospects for the benefits of the students.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
