MFE5120 Investment Sciences or equivalent','Not applicable','本课程介绍银行业和金融业的监管科技。 主题包括金融法规、控制自我评估、风险管理、打击洗钱、金融犯罪控制和监管机构科技。 采用 KNIME 开发工具，将监管科技在现实生活中的行业实施具体化。','This course provides theoretical basis for Regtech developments around the work as well as providing in-depth industry insights and applications to students. Topics include anti-money laundering compliance, theories of anomaly detection, regulatory monitoring and compliance in the finance industry, global government initiatives in Regtech, automation and artificial intelligence in Regtech, and Regtech trends and opportunities. Hands-on practices with Microsoft Azure Machine Learning suite of development tools will be adopted to crystallize the industry implementation of the regulatory technology from academic theories.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
