2026-27 Term 1','Undergraduate level knowledge of probability, statistics, linear algebra, and econometrics.
Familiarity with Python (assignments will require coding with Python).

Basic knowledge of finance and investment is beneficial.','','本课程通过结合传统计量经济学和现代机器学习技术，全面介绍如何在量化投资中应用机器学习。核心内容包括资产定价理论、高维回归、主成分分析与因子模型、多重假设检验等。此外，课程还涉及树模型、神经网络和大语言模型等高级机器学习应用。学生将学习如何应对数据解释性、缺失数据和模型复杂性等实际挑战。本课程专注于金融领域的实际应用，旨在帮助学生分析复杂的金融数据并将机器学习应用于量化投资策略中。','This course provides a comprehensive introduction to machine learning in quantitative investment, bridging traditional econometrics and modern machine learning techniques. Core topics include asset pricing theory, high-dimensional regression, PCA and factor models, and multiple hypothesis testing. Advanced machine learning applications, such as tree-based methods, neural networks, and large language models, are also covered. Students will learn to tackle real-world challenges like data interpretability, missing data, and model complexity. With a focus on practical applications in finance, this course equips students to analyze complex financial data and apply machine learning in quantitative investment strategies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
