2026-27 Term 1','Basic understanding of linear algebra, calculus, and grasp of probability theory are required, along with previous exposure to statistics, optimization, and stochastic processes.','N/A','金融数学导论。主题包括：线性规划及其在定价和二次规划中的应用。利率与现值。基础概率论：随机游走、中心极限定理、布朗运动、股票价格的对数正态模型。期权的布莱克 - 斯科尔斯理论。动态规划及其在投资组合优化中的应用。','Introduction to the mathematics of finance. Topics include: Linear programming with application pricing and quadratic. Interest rates and present value. Basic probability: random walks, central limit theorem, Brownian motion, lognormal model of stock prices. Black-Scholes theory of options. Dynamic programming with application to portfolio optimization.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102271,'MFM5120','金融中的算法设计与运用','','MFM - Financial Mathematics','5120','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','None','None','本模块介绍 Python 编程及其在金融中的应用，尤其是金融算法的设计与实现。内容涵盖 Python 基础与 NumPy 数值计算、金融计算方法、Pandas 数据处理与金融数据建模、可视化绘图工具、用于金融建模的机器学习技术、面向对象与函数式编程在金融工程中的应用，以及性能优化（Cython 与并行计算）。','This module introduces Python programming with applications in finance, with a focus on financial algorithm design and implementation. Topics include Python basics, numerical computing with NumPy, computational methods in finance, data handling with Pandas, visualization tools, machine learning techniques for financial modeling, object-oriented and functional programming, and performance optimization using Cython and parallel computing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102272,'MFM5130','风险建模的统计方法','','MFM - Financial Mathematics','5130','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','None','None','本課程將介紹風險建模的數學理論與統計方法，內容包括：風險測度與管理技術概述、多元分佈、連接函數（Copula）、風險度量、風險聚合、資本配置、投資組合風險管理、蒙特卡洛方法、極值理論，以及時間序列與風險管理。','This course introduces mathematical theories and statistical methods for risk modelling. Overview of techniques for risk measurement and management; multivariate distributions; Copula; risk measures; risk aggregation; capital allocation; risk management for portfolio; Monte Carlo methods; extreme value theory; time series and risk management will be covered.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
