2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程讲授连续时间随机过程理论，内容包括：布朗运动、二次变差、随机积分、伊藤公式、鞅表示定理、Girsanov定理、局部时间与Tanaka公式、随机微分方程、Feynman-Kac公式以及跳跃过程。','This course introduces continuous time stochastic processes including Brownian motions, quadratic variation, stochastic integration, Ito’s formula, martingale representation, Girsanov’s theorem, local time and Tanaka’s formula, stochastic differential equations, Feynman-Kac formula and jump processes.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
