2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程立足于对管理功能的介绍。 它将重点关注管理的理论和基本概念，包括规划、组织、领导和控制。 这个课程将回顾管理思想、职能和实践的演变，重点强调主流管理方法和新兴管理概念。 除了涵盖基本的理论概念，课程通过一些实践环节让学生体会如何成为一个有效管理者。','This course is an introduction to the management function. It will focus on the theory and fundamental concepts of management including planning, organization, leadership, and control. This class will review the evolution of management thought, function and practice and will stress current approaches and emerging concepts. In addition to covering the basic theoretical concepts, the course also allows the students to have some hands-on practice as an effective manager.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
