2026-27 Term 1','MGT2020 Principles of Management','','组织行为学是管理学的高阶课程，通过这门课学生会接触到理解组织中人的行为的若干理论与概念。组织行为学是为了解释、预测、影响组织中个体与团队的行为。在这门课中，我们将会运用相关知识增强学生对自身的洞见，以及提高理解他人的能力，开发人际与领导技能，以及诊断和发现组织的问题。','This is an advanced course in management designed to give your exposure to essential theories and concepts for understanding and managing human behavior in organizations. Organizational behavior (OB) is concerned with explaining, predicting, and enhancing the effectiveness of individuals and groups in work organizations. In this course, we will discuss this knowledge and use it to develop self-insight and your ability to understand others, develop interpersonal and leadership skills, and diagnose and intervene on organizational problems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
