(102293,'MGT3070','职场情绪管理','Managing Emotions at Work','MGT - Management','3070','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','•	No prerequisite','•	No co-requisite.','在职场中员工的情绪会影响其工作态度、决策、沟通，以及与领导、同事、客户的关系。不受控的情绪可能会导致冲突、压力、过劳，进而对绩效和幸福感产生消极影响。这门职场情绪管理课程计划帮助学生培养在职业环境下识别和调节自己与他人情绪的能力。本课程涵盖有关情绪的广泛话题，包括情绪胜任力、积极情绪、消极情绪、道德情绪、情绪调节、情绪劳动，以及情绪和态度、决策、沟通、团队协作、领导、文化的关系等。本课程尝试结合情绪理论和实用经验，采用多种经验式学习方法，例如自我测评、自我反馈、小组讨论、案例方法、项目学习、情境模拟等。','In the workplace, emotions can influence employee attitudes, decision making, communication, and relationship with leaders, coworkers, customers, and other stakeholders. Unmanaged emotions may lead to conflict, stress, and burnout, negatively impacting our performance and well-being. This course on managing emotions at work is designed to help you develop the skills needed to recognize and regulate your and others’ emotions effectively in a professional setting. This course covers a range of topics, including emotional competencies, positive emotions, negative emotions, moral emotions, emotion regulation, emotional labor, as well as connecting emotions with attitudes, decision-making, communication, teamwork, leadership, and culture. Bridging emotion theories and practices, this course exposes you to an experiential learning environment with self-assessments, self-reflection, small group sessions, the case method, project-based learning, and simulations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102294,'MGT3080','社会企业管理','Managing Social Ventures','MGT - Management','3080','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2021-22 Summer
2025-26 Summer','No Prerequisites','No Co-requisites','本课程为对社会企业感兴趣的同学提供了实用的介绍。该课程侧重于社会企业和社会企业家领域的关键概念，介绍用于实现社会和财务目标的各种商业模式。我们将详细讨论社会企业家们面临的挑战，并探讨社会企业的管理战略，包括识别社会创业机会、制定战略计划、社会企业融资和衡量社会影响。除了理论介绍之外，本课程还将提供机会，帮助同学们学习访谈——一种重要管理学研究方法的练习。','This course offers a practical introduction for students interested in the increasingly popular phenomenon of social ventures. The course focuses on key concepts in the field of social entrepreneurship and social enterprise, introducing students to the range of business models used to pursue both social and financial objectives. It presents and details the challenges facing social entrepreneurs and reviews strategies for managing social ventures, including recognizing social opportunities, developing a strategic plan, funding social ventures, and measuring social impact. Besides obtaining knowledge in this field, students also get chances to practice conducting interviews—important methods in management research.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102295,'MGT3090','职场多元化管理','Managing Diversity in the Workplace','MGT - Management','3090','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','•No prerequisite.','•No co-requisite.','职场多元化即主动吸纳多元身份、经验和视角，促进公平、创新与绩效。这门职场多元化管理课程计划帮助学生培养胜任多元化职场环境和促进组织共融的能力。本课程涵盖有关多元化的广泛话题，包括了解多元化的具体类型、辩论多元化和优绩主义、识别多元化的障碍、以及开发组织共融的实践等。本课程尝试结合多元化理论和实用经验，采用多种经验式学习方法，例如自我测评、自我反馈、小组讨论、案例方法、项目学习、情境模拟等。','Diversity in the workplace is the intentional inclusion of varied identities, experiences, and perspectives to drive equity, innovation, and performance. This course on managing diversity in the workplace will help you cultivate diversity competency and develop inclusive practices. This course covers various topics, including understanding diversity in specific types, debating diversity and meritocracy, recognizing barriers to diversity, and developing inclusive practices. Bridging diversity theories and practices, this course exposes you to an experiential learning environment with self-reflection, self-assessments, small group sessions, the case method, project-based learning, and simulations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
