2023-24 Summer','MGT2020 Principles of Management','No co-requisite.','本课程关注国际商务管理中的主要话题。它旨在让学生了解国际视角下的商业管理与战略的相关理论与实践。话题包含国际贸易，外商直接投资，跨国企业，国际商业环境，以及国际商业战略。学生需要运用学到的知识与分析能力去研究当代全球竞争环境中企业面临的问题。','This course builds from the perspective that you have a good understanding of management and other core elements of a business’ functions. This course bridges this understanding to the global environment through a discussion of foundational features to global strategy. Next, this course considers global strategy issues in the context of present-day challenges to competing globally. Finally, this course discusses specific scenarios and cases associated with implementing a regional or global strategy in reality.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
