2022-23 Summer','No','No','本课程重点介绍哈佛商学院Clay Christensen教授所讲授的五种颠覆性战略：创新类型；打造人们需要的产品 (JTBD);创新组织;保持颠覆性视野;以及管理战略发展。这门课让我们的学生有策略地规划和实践他们对创新的理解。课程也会涵盖创新的元素，学生将学习创业成功或失败的7个关键决定因素。','This program focuses on the full roadmap of the 5 Disruptive Strategies as covered by the late Clayton Christensen at Harvard Business School, Types of innovation, Discovering Jobs To Be Done theory, Organizing for Innovation, Maintaining a disruptive scope and managing the Strategy Development process. Allowing our students to act and plan strategically their positioning about innovation. During the introduction we will cover the elements of real innovation, students will learn the 7 key determinants of success or failure for start-ups.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
