(102304,'MGT3650','战略与创业管理中的人工智能','AI in Strategic and Entrepreneurial Management','MGT - Management','3650','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','N/A','No co-requisite.','这门课程探讨人工智能（AI）对战略和创业管理的转型影响。 学生将了解如何利用AI来推动决策、优化业务运营，并创造创新的商业模式。 关键主题包括AI在价值创造活动中的应用，包括产品开发、创新和制造过程。 通过讲座、案例研究、与AI的实践项目以及与业界专家的互动讨论，学生将学习如何将AI工具整合到战略规划和创业项目中，提升他们在以AI为驱动的商业环境中领导的能力。','This course explores the transformative impact of Artificial Intelligence (AI) on strategic and entrepreneurial management. Students will gain an understanding of how AI can be leveraged to drive decision-making, optimize business operations, and create innovative business models. Key topics include AI applications in value-creating activities, including product development, innovation, and manufacturing processes. Through lectures, case studies, hands-on projects with AI, interactive discussions with industrial experts, students will learn how to integrate AI tools into strategic planning and entrepreneurial ventures, enhancing their ability to lead in an AI-driven business landscape.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102305,'MGT3680','创业与企业管理','Entrepreneurship and New Venture Management','MGT - Management','3680','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Summer','','','新企业的创建与市场调研方法与大型、成熟公司所使用的方法有显著不同。当代创业者和初创企业管理者不仅需要掌握传统的市场调研技能，也需要接触与熟悉新兴的市场调研工具，以在创新和数字化时代获得商业成功。这是一门面向有兴趣创业、已经开始创业并希望提高他们的创业技能、或对创业和了解如何创建新企业感兴趣的学生所设计的课程。这门课主要探讨如何创建初创企业，以及如何对初创企业进行市场研究。它阐明了对初创企业和创业者十分相关和关键的概念、方法和战略问题。','New venture creation and market research eschew many of the traditional practices that are typically designed for large and well-established firms. It is of paramount importance for entrepreneurs and new venture managers to get familiarized with a toolkit of both conventional and unorthodox skills to help them gauge for business success in an era of innovation and digitization.
This is a course for students who are interested in starting a new venture, have started a venture and want to improve their entrepreneurial skills and/or interested in entrepreneurship and exposure to how new ventures are created and enter the market. It explores how startup businesses are created, and how market research for new ventures are conducted. It clarifies key concepts, methods, and strategic issues specifically relevant and critical for start-ups and early-stage entrepreneurs.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102306,'MGT3780','量化战略分析','Quantitative strategic analysis','MGT - Management','3780','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','本课程将系统介绍关于公司战略与商业政策相关的定量分析工具。通过学习本课程，可以帮助学生学习如何应用计量模型与数据分析技术，定量地理解公司战略决策的理论与过程。通过互动与实操，学生们将掌握如何理解企业数据，分析竞争环境，了解数据驱动的决策过程等相关技能。','This course provides a comprehensive overview of quantitative methods and analytical techniques used in strategic decision-making within organizations. Students will learn to apply statistical tools, data analysis, and modeling techniques to understand and comprehend the basic mechanisms of  corporate strategic decision making. Through practical applications, participants will develop skills in interpreting corporate data, assessing competitive environments, and making data-driven recommendations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
