2023-24 Summer','MGT2020 Principles of Management','No co-requisite.','案例分析课程旨在让学生了解商业领袖和管理顾问的角色，锻炼学生通过使用分析方法提出解决方案的能力，从而在今后的工作中帮助企业解决实际问题。学生作为未来的业界领袖，一方面需要从宏观层面了解商业环境，成功公司的基本特征，各个公司当下的情况，以及各地区各行业当前和未来的趋势与挑战。另一方面也需要能够找出一个公司内部的主要问题，并且了解如何通过领导力、战略、人事、文化、系统、流程、和科技来完成公司的革新。 这门课程以讨论案例为主，通过提出假设和分析论证来支持论点，从而培养学生用系统的方法和框架解决问题的能力。这门课程同时也鼓励学生使用管理理论、企业战略、商业模式相关的工具和模板以及参考相关文献。
这门课程会引导学生开发和验证管理学相关的模型，并深入讨论公司战略、商业模式、颠覆式创新、蓝海战略等管理热点，同时也将进一步讨论不同行业的案例，如时尚、娱乐、航空、银行、酒店、高科技、电商行业等。在这门课中，学生将有机会自主探索区块链、人工智能、工业 4.0、物联网、3D 打印等前沿技术。这门课程会使用具有代表性的案例供学生讨论、分析，并提出可能的解决方案，同时我们也鼓励学生在学习中对比不同行业的跨国公司和中国本土公司。','Case Study is designed to enable students to understand the roles of business leaders and management consultants and capable to conduct analysis and solution recommendation to help companies to solve real
issues and problems. As a business leader, you need to understand the business context and the essential DNA for a winning company, what might be the future world, what are the current trends and challenges in the country and various industries, and the current position of the company. On the other hand, you should identify the top problems of a company and know how to transform the company by leveraging leadership, strategy, people, culture, system, process, and technologies.

This is a case intensive course to enable students to develop a systematic approach & framework in problem solving by using a hypothesis followed by analysis to support the arguments. Students are encouraged to apply appropriate management theories, corporate strategies, business models, tools and
templates and reference related consulting articles.

In this course, students will be guided to develop and validate the framework and drill down into details

the current management hot topics such as company strategies, business models, disruptive innovation, and blue ocean strategies. We will further discuss cases in different industries such as fashion, entertainment,
airline, banking, hospitality, high technology and e-commerce etc. Students will independently explore frontier technologies such as blockchain, AI, industry 4.0, IoT, 3D printing. We use a broader range of representative business cases to further discuss, analyze and offer possible solutions. More importantly, students will be encouraged to compare the global companies versus the local companies in China in various industries.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
