2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','理论如不应用于实践，永远犹如紙上談兵。能让相关利益持份者或商业利益相关者留下深刻印象，等于是稳拿「成为未来成功的商业领袖」之路的一张入场券。成功的主要关键分别是掌握有效沟通的技能，实践具有影响力的沟通，以及在工作场所创造自己的自我效能感。与一般的迷思相反，优秀的演讲者或出色的沟通者不是与生俱来的。本课程将帮助你获得在现实工作中优秀沟通者的必要技能，并打破在演说时的心理障碍。

与其他以英语语言技巧训练为中心的课程不同，我们的课程目标不是培训演说家。在本课程中，你将学习如何掌握现实商业世界中沟通的黄金法则，以及如何对目标受众发出的有影响力的对话，从而实现你的工作目标，并对业务产生长期可持续性的影响。这些受众群体可能包括投资者、上司、商业伙伴和其他商业利益相关者。实用的沟通技巧，包括在关键100天的成功入职秘诀、 撰写会议记录和与上司开会的艺术；面试技巧的秘密（准备、出席面试和后续），如何管理好职场人际关系，如何对上司说“不”，如何管理虚拟会议等。讲师将利用她在宝洁、联合利华、雀巢、百事可乐、强生和戴森等跨国公司的真实案例，与你分享她的个人实战经验。','Theories will stay on paper forever if they are not applied in practice. To become a successful business leader in the future, the most paramount entrance ticket is to impress your stakeholders.  The major key to success is to master the skills of effective communication, be able to communicate with impact, as well as create your own self-efficacy in the workplace. Contrary to popular myth, there is no natural outstanding presenter or inborn good communicator.  This course will help you acquire the necessary skills of a great communicator in the real working world and break your psychological barrier when you need to present.

Unlike the other language-focus workshops, we are not training for elocutionists.  In this course, you will learn how to master the golden rules of communication in the real world and how to adopt a target audience based impactful dialogue to achieve your goal with long-term sustainable business impact.  These audience groups may include investors, bosses, business partners and other business stakeholders. Practical communications skills including secrets of successful onboarding communications in your first 100 days of your new jobs, art of taking minutes and attending meetings with bosses; secrets of interviewing techniques (Preparation, Present and post), how to manage ups and manage downs, how to “Say No” to your boss, how to manage virtual meetings presences and so on. Lecturers will share with you their personal experience using real cases from MNCs such as Procter & Gamble, Unilever, Nestle, PepsiCo, Johnson & Johnson and Dyson.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102310,'MGT4060','企业战略与管理','Corporate Strategies and Management','MGT - Management','4060','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 2
2016-17 Summer','N/A','','本课程将系统介绍关于公司战略与商业政策相关的理论框架与分析工具，以期帮助学生形成基本的公司战略视野与定量战略分析技能。通过学习本课程，可以帮助学生理解公司外部环境和内部能力、战略决策过程与机制，并初步了解如何以定量分析为辅助作出战略决策。本课程极为强调与重视互动与实操。在本课程授课过程中，学生将同时进行独立作业与团队作业。本课程由三个基本模块组成：教授讲解，定性案例分析，与定量战略分析实操。','This course strives to introduce theoretical frameworks and analytical tools that allow students to understand corporate strategies and business policies, as well as the interplay thereof. Working both individually and in groups, students will learn how to analyze corporates’ external environment and internal capabilities, the options and processes for corporates to make strategic decisions, and the ways to implement strategies in the real business world.
This course is highly interactive and practical. It includes three major components: (1) lectures in which the professor introduces major theoretical frameworks and analytical models for students to understand corporate strategies through the perspective of general managers, (2) qualitative case studies in which students need to draw on the frameworks and models introduced by the professor to search and compile necessary information to analyze given cases (which are all based on major corporate business events), and (3) quantitative strategic analyses in which the students learn how to use statistical tools and software to analyze business and financial data in the spirit of providing quantitative support for their strategic decisions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
