•	MGT3260 Human Resource Management','','人力资本分析是管理学方兴未艾的前沿领域。伴随数字化、人工智能、大数据等技术进展，管理者越来越依靠数字化的手段和数据来管理员工。本课程将使用最新的材料，基于综合案例分析讨论的方式，使学生了解人力资本分析的最新进展。本课程涵盖了人力资本分析的广泛话题，特别聚焦在人力资本分析技术在人力资源管理过程和理解职场行为中的运用。','People analytics is a frontier and emerging field of management. With the development of digitalization, artificial intelligence, big data, and other analytics techniques, managers rely more on a digitalized and data-driven approach to managing people at work. This course adopts an integrated case method based on up-to-date materials to expose students to the latest development in people analytics. This course covers a broad range of people-analytics topics, especially its applications in managing human resources and workplace behaviors.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102312,'MGT4110','领导力发展','','MGT - Management','4110','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Summer
