2022-23 Summer','MGT2020','','领导力发展这门课将着眼于发展潜在有效的领导力，会涵盖三个领域的相关知识：领导力概述，个人技能发展，关系构建。领导力概述将包含领导力定义及其重要的研究视角两个方面。个人技能包括思想，情感，勇气和道德领导及服从这几个方面。关系构建将侧重于激励、沟通、团队和影响力。学生将通过案例、评估和小组练习，以实践的方式学习这门课程。','The Leadership Development course will cover three areas that provide relevant knowledge for developing effective leaders: overview of leadership, individual skills development, and relationships building. The overview will cover leadership definition and important research perspectives. The individual skills include: mind, emotions, courage, moral leadership and followership. The relationships building focuses on motivation, communication, teams and influence. Students will learn about these topics in a practical manner through the use of cases, assessments, and group exercises.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
