2026-27 Term 1','ECO2121 or (STA2001 or STA2003 or STA2001H)','','新兴技术、细粒度数据与AI驱动的分析工具，正以前所未有的速度重塑商业管理与运营的全球格局。在这一环境下，融合商业判断与数据洞察的能力，已成为商科学生迈向职场的一项关键素养。
本课程为商业分析入门课程，强调实践导向与应用价值。对于有意深耕数据分析领域的学生而言，本课程提供了一次系统而完整的早期探索机会，助其在正式规划职业路径前建立全面认知。课程不设编程基础门槛。学生将以真实商业数据集为依托，系统接触当代商业实践中应用最为广泛的分析工具，涵盖传统分析方法、应用型机器学习算法，以及由大语言模型（LLM）驱动的前沿分析技术。课程的技术深度专为商科背景学生量身打造，既能充分对接业界实践需求，又不致陷入冗余的技术复杂性。
为深度联结课堂与产业，本课程将邀请多位资深行业嘉宾开展专题分享，带来AI时代下商业与分析深度融合的一线视角与实战洞察。课程中设置的商业模拟项目将引导学生亲历从数据到战略决策的完整过程；而课程项目所产出的实质性成果，亦可成为学生在求职面试与海外研究生项目申请中彰显分析实力的有力佐证。','Emerging technologies, granular data, and AI-powered tools are reshaping business management and operations at an unprecedented pace. In this environment, the ability to integrate business judgment with data-driven insight has become a defining competency for business students entering the professional world.

This course offers an introduction to business analytics, purpose-built for business students and firmly grounded in practical application. It is particularly well suited for those considering a career in data analytics, providing an early and structured opportunity to explore the field. No prior programming background is required. Working with authentic datasets, students will gain exposure to the analytical tools most widely used in contemporary business practice—from traditional methods to applied machine learning algorithms, to emerging techniques enabled by Large Language Models (LLMs). The level of rigor has been deliberately calibrated for a business audience: substantive enough to meet the demands of industry, yet free from unnecessary technical complexity.

To connect the classroom with industry, the course will feature guest lectures by distinguished practitioners, who will share frontline perspectives on the integration of business and analytics in the AI era. A business simulation game will further allow students to experience firsthand the translation of data into strategic decisions, while course projects yield tangible deliverables that can serve as concrete evidence of analytical capability in job interviews and postgraduate applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
