(102325,'MGT4310','战略管理前沿话题探究','Advanced Topics and Research in Strategic Management','MGT - Management','4310','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2019-20 Term 1
