2022-23 Term 2','No prerequisites','No co-requisites','本课程被设计为研讨会讨论形式，提供一些国际商务（IB）最新研究主题的概述。我们将研究一系列精选的包括国际人力资源管理、跨文化管理、全球战略、公司治理、创新模式、数字经济、并购和全球价值链在内的不同层面和不同商业学科的国际商业（IB）学内容。我们将重点关注国际商业（IB）学者近年来积极参与的一组精选话题，并为您提供这些领域的一些基础知识。更重要的是，在整个课程中，你将有机会向教授和同学们展示并讨论你的概念框架和发现。','This course is designed as a seminar discussion that provides an overview of some of the most contemporary research topics in global business, in-ternationalization, and multinational corporation. Following the conven-tional classification, we will survey a select set of studies of global busi-ness topics at business, corporate, regional and international levels. We will focus on a select set of topics that IB scholars actively engage in re-cent years and provide you with some foundational knowledge in those areas. More importantly, throughout the course, you will be given oppor-tunities to present and discuss your conceptual frameworks and findings with the professor and peer students.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
