(102338,'MGT6301','行为科学研究方法','','MGT - Management','6301','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在为你提供管理学与组织行为研究中常用方法的基础知识。课程将涵盖各类方法的优势与局限，以及如何创造性地将不同方法加以组合，以应对具有挑战性的研究问题。本课程的目标是为你提供多样化的方法论工具，帮助你在追求自身研究兴趣的过程中，成长为你所期望成为的学者。','This course is aimed at giving you foundational knowledge on a range of methods used in management and organizational behavior research. The course will cover the benefits and limitations of each method, and how to creatively mix and match methods to address ambitious research questions. The goal is to equip you with a variety of methodological tools that you can utilize in pursuing your research interests and becoming the scholar you want to be.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
