2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisite.','No co-requisite.','本课程旨在向商务专业人士介绍生成式人工智能（GenAI）支持的编程基础，帮助他们利用大语言模型学习基础编程、进而进行商业创新。课程专为非技术背景的学习者设计，涵盖GenAI基础概念和LLM辅助编程工具在商业自动化和智能中的应用。核心主题包括人工智能基础、大型语言模型（LLMs）、辅助编程、AI驱动的商务应用以及GenAI在商业环境中的伦理问题及局限性。','This course introduces business professionals to the fundamentals of GenAI-supported coding, empowering them to leverage LLM technologies for technology-driven business innovation. Designed for non-technical business professionals, the course covers essential GenAI concepts and LLM-assisted coding tools for business automation and intelligence. Key topics include artificial intelligence basics, large language models (LLMs), GenAI-assisted coding, AI-powered business applications, and ethical issues and limitations of GenAI in business contexts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102344,'MIS2011','商业中的人工智能：实用性导论','AI for Business: A Practical Introduction','MIS - Management Information System','2011','M',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
