2026-27 Term 1','','','《商业中的人工智能：实用性入门》是一门针对初学者设计的课程，旨在让学生对人工智能（AI）及其在当今商业环境中各种应用有基本理解。该课程内容涵盖了一系列AI的核心主题，包括对人工智能的理解与演变、数据处理与分析、机器学习、深度学习、自然语言处理（NLP）以及人工智能在创业企业中的变革性作用和其在提升决策能力方面的潜力。
通过积极参与本课程，学生将深入了解AI的基础知识，并掌握使用AI工具有效管理和扩展业务流程的必要专业技能。此外，课程还通过交互式上机实验、案例研究和一个课程大作业项目为学生提供实践机会，加深他们对AI实际应用的理解。','AI for Business: A Practical Introduction is an entry-level course specifically designed to provide students with a fundamental understanding of artificial intelligence (AI) and its various applications in today''s business landscape. This curriculum covers a wide range of crucial topics, encompassing the understanding and evolution of AI, handling and analyzing data, machine learning, deep learning, Natural Language Processing (NLP), and the transformative role of AI in entrepreneurial ventures along with its capacity in enhancing decision-making.
By actively engaging in this course, students will gain an in-depth foundation of AI, along with the necessary expertise to utilize AI tools to manage and scale business processes efficiently. Additionally, the course offers hands-on experience through labs, case studies and a final project that incorporate real-world applications of AI.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
