2026-27 Term 1','Students who have taken courses similar to database development and/or data mining are not encouraged to take the course.','No co-requisite.','本课程介绍了许多在当今商务应用中使用的关键智能信息科技系统，例如数据库设计和管理、商业智能及分析，和信息系统与人工智能系统的基础设施。本课程为商科学生提供重要的信息科技和分析技能，从而帮助机构解决具有挑战性的业务问题。','The course introduces a number of key IT concepts and techniques used in today’s business applications, such as database design and management, business intelligence and analytics, the infrastructure of IT and AI. The course equips students with important IT and analytics skills to tackle challenges and solve problems in modern businesses.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102346,'MIS3011','面向商务实践者的高级人工智能：从理论到应用','Advanced AI for Business: From Theories to Applications','MIS - Management Information System','3011','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Basic knowledge in linear algebra, statistics, and programming is required for taking this course.','','本课程旨在为商科背景学生构建一个从经典到前沿的全面人工智能技术图谱，并始终聚焦于商业应用价值。通过理论与实践的结合，学生将掌握应用AI技术解决商业问题的核心能力，为成为未来AI产品经理、解决方案架构师等复合型人才打下坚实基础。 课程主要涵盖（1）如何识别 AI 能够解决的商业问题并有效地界定 AI 项目范围；（2）现代 AI 技术，包括经典机器学习、面向计算机视觉和自然语言处理的深度学习、以及生成式 AI及其选型依据；（3）如何设计整合多种 AI 技术的端到端商业解决方案；（4）如何在交付 AI 解决方案时权衡准确性、成本、延迟、部署等商业维度。
学生将通过一系列的上机作业和小组项目，将所学知识付诸实践。项目将模拟真实商业场景，要求以团队形式交付一个AI解决方案原型，全面锻炼学生的技术应用与项目管理能力。','This course is designed for business students to build a comprehensive understanding of the Artificial Intelligence landscape, from classic techniques to cutting-edge technologies, with a consistent focus on business application value. Through a combination of theory and practice, students will master the core competencies to solve business problems using AI, laying a solid foundation for future careers like AI Product Managers and Solutions Architects.
The course primarily covers: (1) classic machine learning methods; (2) the fundamental principles of neural networks and the transformative applications of deep learning; (3) the core technologies driving the Generative AI; and (4) how to build a Generative AI application project.
Students will put their knowledge into practice through a series of hands-on assignments and a group project. The project will simulate a real-world business scenario, requiring teams to deliver an AI solution prototype, comprehensively developing their skills in both technical application and project management.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
