A curious, open mind are beneficial','','《商业世界中的大型语言模型 - 从提示工程到AI智能体》是一门深入探索AI世界的课程，主要关注大型语言模型（LLM）及其在商业或创业中的惊人作用。该课程为非技术背景的学生提供了关键的LLM技术和知识，旨在培养他们应用大型语言模型的能力。课程强调培养学生的算法和计算思维习惯，适合那些励志成为连接管理世界与技术世界的人才的学生。这类人才恰恰是当前商业世界急需的稀缺资源。
通过大量的上机实验操作和动手实践的课程，本课程将为学生提供一个实践AI应用的沉浸式体验。课程旨在培养在商业世界中的创新型“AI使者”，通过了解LLM赋能的AI智能体的优势和局限，从而推动人工智能与人类的互补合作。','LLMs in Business - From Prompt Engineering to AI Management is a course that engages in the world of AI with a primary focus on Large Language Models (LLMs) and their fascinating role in business or entrepreneurship. This course offers crucial techniques and knowledge in LLMs and is designed to facilitate non-technical students, aiming to adopt prompt engineering or content creation proficiency. It emphasizes a habit of algorithmic and computational thinking among students and is suitable for those who aim to bridge the management world and the technical world, a rare skill of dire need in today’s business world.
Throughout this course, students will benefit from an immersive experience with the significant aspects of practical AI applications through lab-heavy and hands-on sessions. It aims to groom innovative AI whisperers in the business world by understanding the strengths and limitations of LLM-empowered AI agents, thereby promoting human-AI complementarity.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
