2026-27 Term 1','MKT2010 Marketing Management','No','消费者行为研究消费者个人或组织为了满足需求，在选择、购买、使用、和使用后处置产品、服务及用户体验的整个过程。本课程将运用心理学、市场营销学、及其他相关领域的研究发现，来解释消费者的行为模式。','Consumer Behavior is the study of the processes involved when individuals or groups select, purchase, use, or dispose of products, services, ideas, or experiences to satisfy needs and desires. We will draw on research from psychology, marketing, and other fields to learn why consumers behave in the ways that they do.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
