2026-27 Term 1','MKT2010 Marketing Management','No co-requisite.','数字与社交媒体平台在现代营销中扮演着关键角色，并重塑了企业与消费者互动和制定战略决策的方式；与此同时，这些平台也为营销研究带来了新的问题与挑战，吸引了来自研究人员、从业者及政策制定者的关注。本课程将介绍数字与社交媒体营销的核心概念，并探讨如何研究该领域中的相关问题。学生将学习如何提出研究问题、设计实验、收集数据，并进行基础统计分析。课程结束后，学生将掌握定性与定量方法，进而解决营销问题并评估营销策略的效果。','Digital and social media platforms play an essential role in modern marketing, reshaping how firms engage with consumers and make strategic decisions. At the same time, they raise new questions and challenges for marketing research, attracting attention from researchers, practitioners, and policymakers. This course introduces key concepts in digital and social media marketing and discusses how to study research questions in this domain. Students will learn how to form research questions, design experiments, collect data, and conduct basic statistical analyses. By the end of the course, students will gain experience with both qualitative and quantitative methods to solve marketing problems and assess the effectiveness of digital marketing strategies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
