2018-19 Summer','Students are assumed to have taken an introductory marketing class (MKT2010)','No co-requisite.','本课程探讨的是最有可能成为营销中最重要的策略，即定价。课程的目的是让学生为解决战略和战术定价问题以及识别定价实践中的利润提升变化做好准备。同时也设定了许多定价情况，并要求学生理解理论定价概念，更重要的是，将它们应用于各种应用营销场景。课程中会讨论的主题如下：
1. 定价和成本
2. 定价和价值创造
3. 有竞争力的价格
4. 细分和有针对性的定价
5. 为多种产品定价
6. 渠道定价策略
7. 定价和促销
8. 国际定价策略
9. 动态定价和AI定价
10.心理定价
当顺利完成本课程后，我们期望学生具备以下能力：
(a) 熟悉定价策略的概念、理论和最新思想；
(b) 学习最先进的定价问题分析框架；
(c) 深入了解不同行业的定价做法，以及
(d) 掌握以战略思维做出有利可图的定价决策的基本技巧。','This course examines perhaps the single most important marketing decision, that of pricing. The objective of this course is to prepare students for addressing strategic and tactical pricing issues and identifying profit-boosting changes in pricing practices. This course examines many pricing situations, and asks students to understand theoretical pricing concepts and, more importantly, apply them to a variety of applied marketing scenarios.  The topics of discussion include
1.	pricing and costs
2.	pricing and value creation
3.	competitive pricing
4.	segmented and targeted pricing
5.	pricing multiple products
6.	channel pricing strategy
7.	pricing and promotion
8.	international pricing
9.	dynamic pricing and AI-driven pricing
10.	psychological pricing

Upon successful completion of this course, students are expected to
(a)	be familiar to the concepts, theories and latest thinking on pricing strategy;
(b)	learn the state-of-the-art frameworks for analyzing pricing issues;
(c)	gain a solid understanding of pricing practices across different industries, and
(d)	master the essential techniques for making profitable pricing decisions with strategic thinking.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
