2022-23 Summer','None (recommendation: MKT3020)','','设计思维是精简化和人性化的重要工具。设计思维的原则包括对用户体验的关注。它是一种多步骤的方法，可以更好地理解用户需求，为他们提供创新的解决方案，并快速迭代从而精准且恰当地解决问题。在课程中，学生将学习如何使用图表和草图等模型来探索问题，并使用原型来试验解决方案，以创造更有针对性的营销。','Design thinking is an essential tool for simplifying and humanizing. The principles of design thinking include a focus on users’ experiences. It is a multi-step method for understanding users’ needs better, creating innovative solutions for them and iterating quickly to get it just right. In the course, students will learn how to use the physical models such as diagrams and sketches, to explore problems and the use of prototypes to experiment with solutions to create more relevant marketing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
