2026-27 Term 1','MKT2010','No co-requisite.','本课程旨在赋能营销从业者及学生，使其掌握推动客户洞察、个性化、内容创作与营销活动优化的实用AI技能。前两周将建立必要的数学和Python编程基础，后续课程将深入现实营销应用——从客户细分与推荐引擎，到生成式AI与营销组合模型。课程结束时，学生将完成一个端到端的AI营销项目。','This course equips marketing professionals and students with the practical AI skills needed to drive customer insights, personalization, content creation, and campaign optimization. The first two weeks establish the necessary math and Python programming baseline, while the remaining weeks dive into real-world marketing applications—from segmentation and recommendation engines to generative AI and marketing mix modeling. By the end, students will have built an end-to-end AI marketing project.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
