Fundamental statistics, programming language, i.e., Python or R.','No co-requisite.','随着高新技术的快速发展，各类海量数据无处不在，并日益成为极具价值的资源。只有深入探索这些海量数据，才能分析其潜在规律。目前，最重要的挑战之一是如何处理这些大数据，挖掘其中蕴含的有价值信息，并从中获得有意义的洞察。
本课程旨在为学生提供基础知识，使其熟悉用于大数据预处理、存储、处理与分析的重要信息技术。在课程开始阶段，将向学生介绍大数据的基本概念、数据可视化、相关工具以及平台。随后，课程将介绍用于存储和管理大数据的平台。学生将学习这些平台的基本架构与功能，掌握如何上传、分布式存储以及预处理大数据。接下来，课程将介绍这些平台上的多种分析算法，帮助学生分析海量数据并提取有价值的信息。最后，课程将演示如何对分析结果进行可视化，并从分析结果中获得有价值的商业洞察。

本课程的第二部分主要聚焦于深度学习算法。深度学习又称为深层结构学习或层次学习，是一种能够利用数据中的模式和表示来进行学习的模型。深度学习近年来取得了广泛成功，其应用涵盖众多领域。课程旨在通过作业和实践帮助学生建立对深度学习的基本认识，使学生熟悉其原理与应用，并能够将深度学习方法应用于商业场景，产生有价值的商业洞察。','With the rapid development of high technology, all sorts of high-volume data are everywhere and booming exponentially. Only until recently, well-equipped computers are able to handle and analyze these large-scale data. Currently the most important challenge for researchers is how to process the big data, dig out the valuable information from the big data, and obtain meaningful insights from the information. The purpose of this course is to provide fundamental knowledge to familiarize students with the most important information technologies used for preprocessing, storing, manipulating and analyzing the big data. At the beginning of the course a brief overview of the big data is introduced to the students: the definition, visualization, toolbox, and applications. Then the basic platforms for handling big data are introduced, such as Hadoop and Spark. On these platforms there exists several different data storage methods and functions to upload, distribute and preprocess the big data. Then several analytical algorithms on these platforms are introduced to analyze the big data and extract the valuable information. Finally, how to visualize the analytic results and how to get insights from these results are demonstrated to students. The second half of this course mainly focuses on one of the analytical algorithms, deep learning. Deep learning is known as deep structured and hierarchical learning, which attempts to model high-level abstractions in the data. Basics of deep learning are introduced including how to set up deep neural network and perform the parameter training. The purpose is to create students’ awareness of deep learning, familiar with it through assignments and provide useful insights in the business application.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102371,'MKT4230','营销决策案例研究分析','Case Study Analysis for Marketing Decisions','MKT - Marketing','4230','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2','MKT2010 Marketing Management','No','本课程的目标是通过案例研究和实际营销情况来研究市场营销的问题和挑战，包括广告、价格、分销、产品选择、客户或消费者行为、市场细分和国际营销。

案例研究分析提供了对可能是真实情况下的解决方案的解释。案例研究分析将讨论企业问题，为特定问题提供最准确的和可供选择的解决方案，并为问题提供最有效的解决方案。学生们将对案例进行分析，并提出有数据和支持证据的解决方案。

教学方案：

1.	向学生介绍案例研究方法的优点和挑战，并详细说明在营销决策的各个阶段所涉及的内容。学习案例分析的基本知识、概念、理论和方法。学生能够通过案例分析练习，将他们对于基本理论知识的理解进行实践。

2.	届时将有行业从业者举办研讨会和讲座，与学生分享行业的真实情况、营销问题、策略和实施问题。学生需要通过复习来实践他们对真实市场营销问题的理解，并提供解决方案。

3.	对于行业企业进行课堂案例讨论和团队课堂演示。

在本课程中，学生将学习案例研究的关键作用:

	案例分析：使用营销课程中教授的概念和框架，帮助整理和组织案例内容的分析工具
	案例讨论：积极参与课堂讨论
	用以解决案例问题的论证：指导学生如何形成案例论证，并以逻辑清晰的文字或课堂演示来表达它们','The objective of the course is to study marketing problems and challenges through case studies and actual marketing situations involving advertising, prices, distribution, product selection, client or consumer behavior, market segmentation and international marketing.
A case study analysis provides an explanation to a solution, which could be a real situation. A Case Study Analysis takes into consideration the business problems, the most accurate and alternate solution for specific problems, and giving out the most effective solution for the problems. Students will analyse the cases and present solutions with statistics and supporting evidences.
Teaching approaches:
1. To introduce students the advantages and challenges of case study methods and to detail the tasks involved in all stages of marketing decisions. Students will learn the fundamental knowledge, concepts and theories of case study analysis and methods.  Case study exercises will be given to students to practice their understanding of the basic theories.
2. There will be seminars and talks given by industrial practitioners to share with students on the real industrial situation, marketing issues, strategies and implementations.  Students are required to do a review exercise to practice their understanding of the real marketing issues, and also provide solutions
3. In-class case discussions and team presentations for industrial firms
In this course, students will learn to understand the critical roles of case studies:
• Analysis of cases: analytical tools that help to sort and organise the content of a case and use the concepts and frameworks taught in marketing courses
• Discussion on cases: participate and contribute actively to classroom discussion
• Arguments develop to solve the problem of cases: guidance on how to develop arguments about the cases and express them in logical and clear writing or presentation','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
