通过完成一项论文水准的研究项目，学生将（1）系统掌握学术研究的基本过程，包括文献综述、研究设计、数据分析与学术写作，（2）并以专业、规范的方式呈现研究成果。','This course enables students to conduct independent research in the field of Marketing under the supervision of a faculty member. Students will identify a research topic, formulate research questions, and design an appropriate research approach based on marketing theories and relevant literature.
Through the completion of a thesis-level research project, students will gain (1) hands-on experience in academic research, including literature review, research design, data analysis, and academic writing, and (2) develop the ability to present research findings in a professional and scholarly manner.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
