2023-24 Term 1','N/A','','企业发展的方式是通过良好的营销：然而，在新的千年里，有效和高效的营销比过去要困难得多，因为纪律本身发生了一系列持续且往往是革命性的变化 : 不断变化的客户品味, 情绪和行为, 创新, 对管理行为的道德和道德的关注，以及塑造当今营销的新观念。 在以往的营销研究的基础上，本课程让学生探索营销领域的当代和新视角，确保学生在 21 世纪处于营销实践的前沿。本课程旨在让学生了解营销的新增长领域，以扩大他们在实践方法和公司学习方面的职业准备。 本课程与营销管理课程不重叠。','The way to grow a business is through good marketing: however, effective and efficient marketing in the new millennium is a much tougher job than it used to be in the past because of a whole array of continuous and often revolutionary changes taking place within the discipline itself; ever changing customer taste, mood and behaviour; innovations; concerns about ethicality and morality of managerial actions and new and emerging ideas shaping today’s marketing.

Building on previous marketing studies, this capstone course allows students to explore contemporary and new perspectives in marketing to ensure students are at the forefront of marketing practice in the 21st century. This course aims to give the students an understanding of new growth areas in marketing to broaden their career preparation in terms of practical approach and company studies.

This course does not overlap with the course of Marketing Management.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
