2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在向学生介绍数字时代的营销研究，并重点关注研究设计与数据分析。课程内容涵盖营销研究中的基础概念以及实证研究中常用的工具。学生将学习如何提出研究问题、设计实验、收集并分析数据，并运用定性与定量方法解释研究结果。本课程还将介绍因果推断方法，并探讨人工智能等新兴技术如何重塑及辅助营销研究。课程结束时，学生将掌握如何设计研究方案，运用真实或模拟数据进行数据分析，并展示研究成果。','This course is designed to provide a forward-looking introduction to marketing research in the digital age, with an emphasis on research design and analysis. The lectures will cover both foundational concepts of marketing research and advanced tools for conducting empirical studies. Students will learn how to frame research questions, design experiments, collect and analyze data, and interpret results using both qualitative and quantitative methods. This course also introduces causal inference methods and discusses how emerging technologies such as AI are reshaping and assisting marketing research. By the end of the course, students will gain experiences with designing a marketing research plan, performing data-driven analyses using real or simulated datasets, and presenting their findings.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102384,'MKT5013','消费者行为','','MKT - Marketing','5013','M',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
