2026-27 Term 1','Nil','Nil','课程旨在让参与者了解什么是客户关系管理（CRM）、为什么它在当代商业世界如此重要，以及它如何在人工智能和大数据时代实践。 除了传统的讲座之外，本课程还将包括生成人工智能教程、案例分析、小组项目和演示。 具体来说，将涵盖以下主题： - 人工智能和大数据驱动的 CRM 革命， - 金融、零售、酒店、和航空业的 CRM 战略和实践,  及营销大数据分析。','The course aims at providing participants with a basic understanding on what customer relationship management (CRM) is, why it is so important in the contemporary business world, and how it is implemented in the AI and Big Data Era. In addition to the traditional lectures, this course will include tutorials, case analyses, group projects, and presentations. Specifically, the following topics will be covered: - CRM revolutions driven by Generative AI and Big Data, CRM strategies and practices in the financial, retail and hospitality industry, and Big Data Analytics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102389,'MKT6017','品牌营销战略','','MKT - Marketing','6017','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
