2022-23 Summer
2020-21 Summer','MKT5011 – Strategic Marketing Management','','在现代商业世界中，品牌已成为企业最宝贵的资产。企业投入大量资源和精力来打造卓越的品牌。战略品牌管理已成为企业成功的关键要素。因此，本课程旨在为学生提供：(1) 对战略品牌管理的概念/理论理解，包括其定义、运作方式以及在当代商业世界中的重要性；(2) 制定品牌战略以建立、监控和管理品牌资产的实践经验（重点在于如何利用市场调研进行品牌管理）。

完成本课程后，学生应具备足够的知识和技能，能够：(1) 识别、解读和分析消费者和市场数据，以制定和执行有效的品牌管理战略；(2) 运用市场调研数据撰写品牌规划。','In modern business world, brands have become the most valuable asset for the firms. Resources and efforts have been put by companies to create great brands. Strategic brand management has become a critical element in a firm’s success.  As such, this course aims at providing students with (1) conceptual/theoretical understanding on what strategic brand management is, how it works, and why it is so important in the contemporary business world and (2) hands-on experience in developing a branding strategy to build, monitor, and manage brand equity (with focus on how to use marketing research for brand management purpose). 

Upon completion of this course, students are expected to have adequate knowledge and skills to (1) identify, interpret, and analyze consumer and marketing data for effective brand management strategy formulation and execution, and (2) use evidence from marketing research to write a branding plan.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
