2024-25 Term 2','','','本节课课程目标是使学生掌握实用的数量分析技能，以解决以数据驱动的市场营销问题。学生将学习如何将产品、价格、地点和推广方面的市场营销问题构建数学和统计模型，并学会运用机器学习和统计技术来解决这些问题。本课程还将讨论这些模型的应用。','Description (English)	The course objective is to equip students with practical quantitative and analytical skills to solve data-driven marketing problems. Students will learn how to formulate marketing problems regarding product, price, place, and promotion as mathematical and statistical models and how to solve them with machine learning and statistical techniques. The course covers basic topics on machine learning and statistical inference, which are performed by most analytics groups in companies.

As the course title suggests, this is a course that trains students to solve marketing problems like engineers: build correct models to understand the market: estimate models with data, and make quantitative predictions and suggestions. Students will also “get their fingers dirty,” like engineers in this course, by applying models to real-world data.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
