2025-26 Term 2','NIL','NIL','本课程向学生介绍了最先进的人工智能（AI）技术，及其营销应用和局限性。我们将介绍三种关键的AI技术，即神经网络，自然语言处理和营销机器人。本课程不要求学生具有IT背景。但是，我们希望学生能掌握一些Python编程知识。学生将会学习如何使用Python实现AI应用程序和分析现实生活中的营销数据集。他们需要在小组的项目和考试中展示他们对人工智能营销应用的知识。','This course presents students with a fundamental understanding of the
state-of-the-art artificial intelligence (AI) technologies, their marketing
applications and their limitations. We will cover three key AI
technologies, namely, neural network, natural language processing, and
marketing robots. This course does not require students to have IT
background. However, we expect students to have some programing
knowledge in Python. Students will learn how to use Python to
implement AI applications and analyze real life marketing datasets.
They need to demonstrate their knowledge of AI Marketing applications in
in both group projects and examination.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
