Basic Python knowledge','','本课程系统讲解人工智能在营销领域从理论到实践的全流程应用，帮助学生理解AI技术本质及其与商业实践的融合逻辑。课程特别强调AI模型的可解释性，通过神经网络解析客户细分与消费行为，运用马尔可夫模型量化客户生命周期价值以支撑广告投放策略，结合概率模型优化搜索引擎结果，并借助Transformer架构构建个性化推荐系统。此外，课程还将深度强化学习应用于动态定价策略，使学生在掌握基础算法后，能够系统性提升营销决策的智能化水平。该课程设计扩展了学生前序课程所学内容，注重将机器学习与商业场景深度融合。','The course will provide an overview of AI in marketing from theory to practice. Student will learn what is AI and how it can be integrated into businesses practice. This course will emphasize on the interpretability of AI model and its applications in the marketing environment. The student will be able to extend what they have learned in previous course to a broader scope in marketing application. Building on the basic machine learning and AI algorithm, the course will teach students how to use AI to predict the outcome and to support sales and marketing strategy in a more advanced way: using to neural network understand customer segmentation and choices; using Markov model to calculate the customer value that constructs the building blocks of advertisement of promotion; using probability model and topic modelling to learn how to provide a better search result; using large model and transformer to provide recommendation to customer; and using (deep) reinforcement learning  to price products.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102399,'MKT6034','物联网与零售技术','','MKT - Marketing','6034','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
