2025-26 Term 2','','','这门课程旨在讨论数字营销中的4P元素。内容涵盖宏观经济与消费/营销之间的互动；社交媒体和影响者营销的崛起；日渐重要的ESG 和CSR议题；不同平台的业务模型讨论, 梳理中国平台经济的发展逻辑；对新兴行业（如及时零售，AI硬件和电动车）的展望；以及生成式人工智能（GenAI）, 大语言模型（LLM）, 代理AI的技术发展及其在营销中的发展和影响。我们将会阅读很多相关题目的前沿市场营销文章。部分课程将会讲解使用真实数据的案例和编程分析。','This course centres around the "4 Ps" in digital marketing. It covers the interaction between macroeconomics and consumption/marketing; the rise of social media and influencer marketing; increasingly important ESG and CSR requirements in marketing; discussions of different business models of platforms, review the developments of platform economics in China; outlook of new industries such as AI hardware and EVs; and the development and the influence of generative artificial intelligence (AI) , large language models (LLM) and Agentic AI on marketing. We will cover many frontier marketing research papers on those topics. We will go through real word application with real data (coding is not mandatory) in many lectures.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

