(102400,'MKT6035','市场营销分析和机器学习','','MKT - Marketing','6035','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','经管学院','经管学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Any undergraduate level or master level marketing management course.','','数据驱动的营销分析是将数据转化为可操作的营销洞察的过程。此领域不仅需要对营销知识有深入的理解，还需要熟练应用数据分析工具来探索、分析和可视化营销数据。随着人工智能（AI）相关技术的发展，营销分析领域面临了新的挑战和机遇。本课程将帮助学生利用统计方法、机器学习模型和AI工具（如深度学习模型、大型语言模型）等数据分析工具，来提取有关消费者和市场的洞察。这门课程将通过介绍数据相关的案例帮助学生培养数据分析思维和技能。此外，课程还将为学生提供实践经验，包括Python编程入门以及如何在大型语言模型的协助下进行编程。','Marketing analytics is the process of transforming big data into actionable marketing insights. It is a field that not only requires a solid understanding of marketing principles but also proficiency in applying data-analytic tools for exploring, analyzing, and visualizing marketing data. With the development of artificial intelligence (AI), marketing analytics has encountered new challenges and opportunities. This course will help students leverage state-of-the-art data-analytic tools including statistical methods, machine learning modes, and AI tools (deep learning models and large language models) to extract insights about consumers and markets. This introductory course is designed to help students develop data-analytic thinking and skills. It will do so by introducing a variety of data-related case studies and tools for data analytics. Moreover, the course will provide students with hands-on experience, including an introduction to Python programming and how to program with the assistance of LLMs.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
