2023-24 Summer','This course is open to students with 33 credits or above. Enrolled students are encouraged to proactively engage with the career counselor by submitting a completed Self-evaluation Form (Appendix II) according to the specified timeline during the term. This will enable them to receive guidance and ongoing feedback. After each consultation, the career counselor will provide a score and feedback in the Internship Evaluation Form - Career Counselor (Appendix IV). Prior to the end of the enrolled term, students must submit the Internship Training Evaluation Form - Employer (Appendix III) to the Programme Office (mscmktpo@cuhk.edu.cn).','N/A','本课程旨在让学生将课堂知识应用于实际工作，使学生获得市场营销相关行业的实践工作经验，最后走向成功的职业道路。本课程中，学生应根据自身兴趣、个人技能及职业发展规划寻找相符的实习职位，主动联系职业发展中心寻求帮助和并获得持续反馈。实习结束后，学生将有机会对自己的职业道路方向进行反思，并根据实际情况优化职业发展规划。','This course links classroom knowledge and real-world applications with an actual work setting opportunity. It provides students with hands-on work experience in the marketing related industry, which are necessary for a successful career path. Students should have some ideas of their job interests, personal skill sets and career path, and then secure a position in line with that.  Students should take the initiative to contact the Career Development Centre for assistance and continual feedback. After the internship, students can have a reflection opportunity on the direction of their career paths.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
