2025-26 Term 2','Genaral chemistry','None.','本科旨在使学生对无机化学再作深入理解。教师将讲授分子对称性及群论之基本概念和应用，以及晶体结构和晶体化学基础知识；并将选择讲授下列最少两项课题：金属簇合物；高等主族元素化学；无机催化；无机合成化学；无机材料化学。','This course aims to provide students a deeper understanding of modern inorganic chemistry. The concept of molecular symmetry as well as the elements and applications of group theory, and crystal structure and crystal chemistry will be introduced. Two or more of the following topics will also be covered: metal clusters, advanced main group chemistry, inorganic catalysis, inorganic synthesis, and inorganic materials.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
