2026-27 Term 1','A strong background in basic organic reactions is desired.','For students in MPhil-PhD of Materials Science and Engineering as well as Chemistry, Year 3-4 students in Chemistry Program.','本课程的目的是向学生教授有机化学中的合成方法以及对化学反应区域、化学、立体选择性和产物生成因素的深层次知识。将讨论有关化学合成分析，现代合成手段，有机反应以及天然产物、药物合成中的合成问题。同时我门也会讨论烯基化、功能团的转换、羰基化学、周环反应、环加成、自有基化学、重排反应以及有机金属催化在含有三元环、四元环、五元环、六元环等有机化合物合成中的应用。','This course is envisioned to discuss the major topics and issues (and their mechanisms) typically utilized in organic synthesis. Methods used for achieving control of stereo-, regio-, and chemo-selectivity will be emphasized. Specific topics including alkene synthesis, cyclopropane preparation, cyclopropane application, cyclobutene preparation and application, cyclopentane synthesis, cyclohexane synthesis, and Diels-Alder reaction will be covered. This is a graduate-level course, and it is expected that students enrolled in this course should already possess a firm grasp of fundamental aspects of organic reactions. Should this not be the case, it is expected that you will take it upon yourself to review appropriate materials (such as basic organic chemistry textbook) to correct any deficiencies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
