(102483,'MSE6204','高等分析化學','','MSE - Materials Science& Engineering','6204','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','','','本研究生课程旨在培养学生掌握尖端分析技术所需的理论知识与实践技能。课程致力于帮助学生实现从常规操作者向创新型研究者的跨越，核心内容聚焦复杂的联用技术（如液质联用 LC-MS/MS）、高分辨光谱、多维色谱技术以及严谨的分析方法验证。学生将学习如何设计前沿的分析工作流程，并运用高级数据分析、化学计量学和人工智能（AI）工具来解析多维复杂数据。本课程着重培养学生在先进材料及生物医学等前沿研究领域的独立问题解决能力与实验设计能力。','Course Description: This postgraduate course equips students with the theoretical and practical expertise required to master state-of-the-art analytical technologies. Designed to transition students from standard practitioners to innovative researchers, the curriculum focuses on complex hyphenated techniques (e.g., LC-MS/MS), high-resolution spectroscopy, multidimensional chromatography, and rigorous method validation. Students will learn to design cutting-edge analytical workflows and apply advanced data analysis, chemometrics, and AI tools to interpret multidimensional datasets. The course heavily emphasizes independent problem-solving and experimental design for frontier research fields such as advanced materials and biomedicine.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
