Organic Chemistry','None.','本课程全面介绍各类高分子材料的设计原理、生产方法、表征方法、材料特性与应用。同时介绍高分子化学、高分子物理、高分子加工、聚合反应工程等学科的基本概念，使学生对高分子材料科学有一个清晰的认识。课程还将涵盖高分子材料的应用新领域（高级专题），包括聚合物链结构定制技术、结构-功能关系、结构和形貌表征以及应用中涉及的机理。','This course is intended to provide an overview of the design principles, production methods, characterization strategies, material properties, and applications of the various classes of polymers discovered over the years or currently under development. Key fundamental concepts in polymer chemistry, polymer physics, polymer processing, as well as polymerization reaction engineering will be introduced to help the students gain a clear understanding of the science of polymeric materials. It will also cover new areas of applicability of polymeric materials (advanced topics) with specific emphasis on the new technologies for the production of well-defined polymers, structure-function relationships, structural and morphological characterization, as well as the mechanism involved in their applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
