(102506,'MSE6503','能源與環境材料','','MSE - Materials Science& Engineering','6503','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','None.','None.','能源和环保材料广泛应用于当今的工业和生活中，几乎遍及传统能源、新能源和环保的整个领域。它们是石油化工、可持续新能源和环境保护等国民经济主要产业的最重要支柱。在介绍能源与环境科学基本原理和研究方法的基础上，本课程重点介绍可持续和可再生清洁能源和环境保护中重要材料的研究现状。最后，系统总结了新能源环保材料的设计思路和方法。通过本课程的学习，学生可以掌握节能环保领域能源与环境材料的基本原理、设计思想、研究方法和研究进展。','Energy and environmental materials are widely used in today''s industries and lives, almost all over the whole field of new energy and environmental protection. They are the most important backbones of major national economic industries such as the petrochemical industry, sustainable new energy, and environmental protection. On the basis of introducing the basic principles and research methods of energy and environmental science, this course focuses on the research status of important materials in traditional fossil fuels, sustainable and renewable clean energy (such as fuel cells, hydrogen production by photo or electrolysis of water, transformation, and utilization of small carbon-based molecules, etc.) and environmental protection (automobile exhaust purification, flue gas denitrification, water treatment, indoor air purification, etc.). Finally, it systematically summarizes the design ideas and methods of new energy and environmental materials. Through the study of this course, students can master the basic principles, design ideas, research methods, and research progress of energy and environmental materials in the field of energy conservation and environmental protection.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
