2025-26 Term 2','None','None','NA','The course of "Materials in Energy Storage" mainly gives an overview of materials in electrochemical energy storage. It explains the most frequently used materials like electrocatalysts, photocatalysts etc, as well as the preparation methods. Also, the course explores how electrochemical methods can be used with other spectroscopic (UV-vis, ESR, impedance).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
