(102527,'MSE6548','材料表徵方法學','','MSE - Materials Science& Engineering','6548','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Summer','None','None','本研究生课程设计侧重于材料表征的常用工具和方法，特别是针对从事凝聚态物理和材料科学研究的学生。本课程介绍各种技术，如扫描电子显微镜 (SEM)、透射电子显微镜 (TEM)、原子力显微镜 (AFM)、X射线光电子能谱/紫外光电子能谱 (XPS/UPS)、X射线衍射 (XRD)、光致发光、拉曼光谱和光学光谱，用于表征薄膜, 块体和纳米材料的结构,物理、光学和电子特性。','The course design for postgraduate students commonly used tools and methods for materials characterization, especially for those engaged in condensed matter physics and materials science research. This course introduces various techniques such as SEM, TEM AFM, XPS/UPS, XRD, GIWAXS, photoluminescence, Raman and optical spectroscopy to characterize the physical, optical and electronic properties of bulk materials, films and nanomaterials.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
