2026-27 Term 1','','','本課程採用一對一教授，旨在複習和加強學生的實際器樂演奏技能或聲樂演唱技能。同時幫助學生建立適當的練習方法，並定期覆檢，以達到演奏/演唱技巧完善。課程亦會介紹不同時期的獨奏/唱曲目，強調學生對相關技巧的把握，並準確演繹作品的流派風格。學期結束時，每位學生必須作大約12分鐘的表演展示*。','This one-to-one teaching course is to review and strengthen students’ practical skills on an instrument or voice.  Appropriate ways of practicing will be established and regularly reviewed to achieve technical competence.  Different kinds of repertoire of solo pieces according to the style periods will be introduced. Related technical skills will be emphasized and stylistic playing is expected.  A performance of around 12 minutes at the end of the course is required*.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
