2025-26 Term 2','MUS1001    MUS1001 Applied Music I','','本课程采用一对一教授，是MUS 1001课程的延续，学生将进一步加强他们的技巧和风格诠释，为自己进入专业水平做准备。同时继续学习不同时期的独奏/唱曲目。课程强调学生对相关技术的把握，并准确演绎作品的流派风格。课程结束时，每位学生必须进行大约12分钟的表演展示。','This one-to-one teaching course is the continuation of MUS1001 in which students will further strengthen their technical skills and stylistic interpretation preparing themselves into the level as a professional performer. Different kinds of repertoire of solo pieces according to the style periods will be studied. Related technical skills will be emphasized and stylistic playing are expected.  A performance of around 12 minutes at the end of the course is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
