2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程将学生组成不同的合奏小组，如三重奏、四重奏、五重奏等，并定期进行小组排练和接受教师指导。该课程将训练学生的合作技能，与此同时，应用适当音乐风格。课程结束时每组需有约10分钟的室内乐演出。
合奏组的乐器/声乐组合可以从室内乐合奏I到V保持不变，或者在完成一个学期后有所变化。声乐学生可以组成纯声乐或带器乐伴奏的重奏组。','This course will have students to form a group such as a trio, quartet, quintet, etc., and to practice regularly under an assigned coach. The course will train students’ ensemble playing/singing and observation of appropriate musical styles. A performance of around 10 minutes at the end of the course is required.
The combination of instruments/voice of an ensemble group may remain the same from Chamber Music Ensemble I to V or they may vary after finishing one school term. Voice students may form a vocal ensemble with or without instruments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
