合奏組的樂器/聲樂組合可以從室內樂合奏I到V保持不變，或者在完成一個學期後有所變化。聲樂學生可以組成純聲樂或帶器樂伴奏的重奏組。','This course is the continuation of MUS 1003 Chamber Ensemble I which will have students to form a group such as a trio, quartet, quintet, etc, and to practice regularly under an assigned coach. The course will further strengthen students’ ensemble playing/singing with reference to the appropriate musical styles. A performance of around 10 minutes at the end of the course is required. The combination of instruments/voice of an ensemble group may remain the same from Chamber Music Ensemble I to V or they may vary after finishing one school term. Voice students may form a vocal ensemble with or without instruments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
