2026-27 Term 1','','','本課程訓練學生在音樂中的聆聽能力，並作出適當的回應。課程將包括調性和無調性的旋律視唱、節奏訓練、旋律聽寫、節奏聽寫與和聲聽寫等內容，並將努力開拓學生的聽覺技巧，以更科學、更系統的方式聆聽音樂，從而提高學生的表演實踐能力。','This course trains students'' aural listening in music and making appropriate response. The class will consist of sight-singing of tonal and melodies, rhythmic training, music dictation of melody, rhythm and harmony, etc. It will try to open up the ears for a better and more intellectual way of music listening through which the students’ performing practice will be improved.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
