2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MUS1007','','本课程训练学生在音乐中的聆听能力，并作出适当的响应。课程将包括调性和无调性的旋律视唱、节奏训练、旋律听写、节奏听写与和声听写等内容，并将努力开拓学生的听觉技巧，以更科学、更系统的方式聆听音乐，从而提高学生的表演实践能力。','This is the continuation of MUS1007. This course trains students'' aural listening to music and making appropriate responses. The class will consist of sight-singing of tonal and atonal melodies, complex rhythmic training, music dictation of melody, rhythm and harmony, etc. It will open up the ears for a better and more intellectual way of music listening through which the students'' performing practice will be improved.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
