2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目内容包括在指挥家带领下，定期进行管弦乐排练，排练的曲目选自常规交响乐名曲。通过系统的训练，学生学习如何在大型合奏中进行互动，从而能够在专业管弦乐队中演奏常规曲目。','This course involves regular orchestral rehearsals under a conductor with repertoire drawn from the regular symphonic masterpieces. Through systematic training, students learn how to interact in a large ensemble thus be able to play the standard repertoire in a professional orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
