2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MUS1010 Orchestral Training I','','此科目是MUS1010的延续，学生将在指挥家的指导下定期参与管弦乐排练，所排练的曲目选自常见的交响乐作品。通过系统的训练，学生将学习如何在大型合奏中进行互动，以便能够在专业管弦乐团中演奏常规曲目。','This is the continuation of MUS 1010 featuring regular orchestral rehearsals under a conductor with repertoire drawn from the regular symphonic masterpieces. Through systematic training, students learn how to interact in a large ensemble thus be able to play the standard repertoire in a professional orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
