(102540,'MUS1110','音乐材料与结构 I','Materials and Structure of Music I','MUS - Music','1110','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目將教授音樂的基本和聲理論，探討音樂的橫向結構與縱向結構的組織關系，引導學生掌握音樂材料與結構的基本理論和實踐。','This course will offer instruction in the basic principles and theories of music, exploring the organizational relationship between the horizontal and vertical structures of music. It will guide students in gaining a fundamental understanding of the theory and practice of musical materials and structures.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102541,'MUS1111','音乐材料与结构 II','Materials and Structure of Music Ⅱ','MUS - Music','1111','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MUS1110','','本科目是MUS1110的延续。课程将探讨调性和声及半音阶和声的分析与写作。同时介绍现代音乐例如无调性和新古典主义风格的创作技法。它将基本涵盖18至20世纪的和声技法。','This course is the continuation of MUS1110 Materials and Structure of Music I. It will deal with the harmonic analysis and writing of tonal and chromatic harmony. Music written with modern techniques such as atonal and neo-classical styles will also be introduced. It will basically cover harmonic practices from 18th to 20th century.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102542,'MUS1112','西方音乐史 I','History of Western Music I','MUS - Music','1112','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目将概述西方音乐从中世纪、文艺复兴、巴洛克到古典时期的发展，并着重介绍后两个时期的音乐发展。将讨论从帕莱斯特里纳到巴赫、亨德尔、维瓦尔第、蒙特威尔第到海顿、莫扎特和贝多芬的重要作品。同时将探讨这些时期音乐的社会政治、哲学和美学元素。学生将了解不同时期音乐的演变和特点，以及作曲家们对社会和思想背景的反映。','This course will give an overview in the development of western music from Medieval, Renaissance, Baroque to Classical with major emphasis in the latter two periods. Important works from Palestrina through Bach, Handel, Vivaldi, Monteverdi into Haydn, Mozart and Beethoven will be discussed. The course will examine the socio-political, philosophical and aesthetical elements of music happening during those periods.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102543,'MUS1150','音乐文献概论 I','Introduction to Music Literature I','MUS - Music','1150','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1','','','本科目指導學生學習音樂文獻的不同類型和專門的音樂詞彙、瞭解音樂理論和音樂文化、提升音樂文獻的閱讀能力。閱讀材料是從西方國家出版的各種英語書籍中選出的文章，文章涵蓋基礎音樂理論、作曲理論和音樂文化等內容。','In this course, students will learn about types of music literature, music vocabularies, ways of understanding music theories and culture, and improve their reading ability. Articles selected from various books published in the English language are the main materials to be taught. These articles will cover basic music theory, compositional theory and music culture.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102544,'MUS1151','音乐文献概论 II','Introduction to Music Literature II','MUS - Music','1151','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS1150 的延续。本科目将研究各个风格时期更精致、更复杂的音乐流派。所选作品将在音乐词汇、结构、长度和复杂性方面呈现更具挑战性的特征。','This is the continuation of MUS1150. This course will examine more elaborate and complex musical genres through the style periods. The works selected for study will present more challenging features in terms of musical vocabulary, structure, length, and complexity.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102545,'MUS1200','唱歌的发音法及语文准备 I','Diction and Language Preparation for Singers I','MUS - Music','1200','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本課程涉及歌手經常遇到的歐洲語言的發音和吐字。它們包括英語、義大利語及拉丁語。學生將學習如何用這些語言歌唱，以達到清晰、良好的語文歌唱發音。','This course deals with pronunciation and diction of selected European languages that singers regularly come across. They include English, Italian and Latin. Students will learn how to produce a clear and well projected singing tone with these languages.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102546,'MUS1211','声乐文献','Vocal Literature','MUS - Music','1211','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目概述西方音乐史上的独唱艺术歌曲。它将涵盖从巴洛克时期至今的意大利语歌曲（包括那不勒斯民歌和拉丁语歌曲）以及英语歌曲。学生将对这些杰作有一个全面的了解，并能够以适当的音乐风格演绎它们。课程将介绍不同时期和风格的独唱艺术歌曲，包括其特点、作者以及文学背景。学生将学习如何解读歌曲的文本和情感表达，并通过演唱实践来提高他们的演绎能力。他们将能够以适当的技巧和风格演绎这些歌曲，传达出其独特的音乐语言和情感内涵。','This course gives a survey of solo songs in the history of western music. It will cover Italian (including Neapolitan arias and songs in Latin) and English songs from the Baroque Period to the present days. Students will have an overall understanding of these masterpieces and be able to perform them in the appropriate styles.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102547,'MUS1220','语言与正音 I','','MUS - Music','1220','M',1.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是集体授课，主要向学生讲授声乐作品中的外语咬字技巧和特点，针对不同语言的咬字和韵律特点对学生进行有针对性的训练，让学生能够了解如何应用所学知识对演唱者进行训练。','This course offers collective instruction on the techniques and features of pronunciation in foreign language vocal works. It provides targeted training to students on the distinctive enunciation and rhythmic characteristics of different languages, enabling them to apply their learning to train performers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102548,'MUS1221','语言与正音 II','','MUS - Music','1221','M',1.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MUS1220','','本科目是MUS1220的延续。课程为集体授课，主要向学生讲授声乐作品中的外语咬字技巧和特点，针对不同语言的咬字和韵律特点对学生进行有针对性的训练，让学生能够了解如何应用所学知识对演唱者进行训练。','This course is the continuation of MUS1220. The course offers collective instruction on the techniques and features of pronunciation in foreign language vocal works. It provides targeted training to students on the distinctive enunciation and rhythmic characteristics of different languages, enabling them to apply their learning to train performers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102549,'MUS1250','指挥艺术概论','','MUS - Music','1250','M',1.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1','','','本课程采取集体授课，介绍乐队指挥艺术基础知识和技巧的课程。该课程旨在帮助学生了解乐队指挥的基本原理、技术和艺术表现，以及如何应用这些知识来指挥乐队并实现高质量的音乐表演。','This course adopts a collective teaching approach to introduce the basics of orchestra conducting art and techniques. The course aims to help students understand the fundamental principles, techniques, and artistic expressions of orchestra conducting, and how to apply the knowledge to conduct an orchestra and achieve high-quality musical performances.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102550,'MUS1350','作曲基础 I','Pre-Composition I','MUS - Music','1350','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1','','','Through discussing and examining phrases, motives, themes, musical textures, rhythm and melody, this course helps students understand the basic building blocks that form the composition. Students are expected to submit their own composition and demonstrate their understanding of the concepts at the completion of the course.','Through discussing and examining phrases, motives, themes, musical textures, rhythm and melody, this course helps students understand the basic building blocks that form the composition. Students are expected to submit their own composition and demonstrate their understanding of the concepts at the completion of the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102551,'MUS1351','作曲基础 II','Pre-Composition II','MUS - Music','1351','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2','MUS1350 Pre-Composition I','','本科目是MUS1350的延续。该课程将讨论小型作曲中的基本技巧。学生需要通过研究调性和后调性的范例，并创作自己的音乐作品。学生在课程结束时需要提交一定数量的作品。','This is the continuation of MUS1350. This course will discuss basic composition techniques in small forms of composition. Students are required to study the topic through examining both tonal and post-tonal examples and writing their own music. Students are expected to submit a specific number of works at the completion of the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102552,'MUS1510','中国民乐队合奏（一）','','MUS - Music','1510','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','实习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
