(102554,'MUS1512','西方音乐史专题研讨 I','Seminar in Western Music History I','MUS - Music','1512','M',1.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是为配合MUS1112 西方音乐史 I，在每节课所授内容的基础上做进一步的研讨。在课上已交代材料的基础上，进一步扩大作品范围，加宽音视频的例子，并思考社会与文化的语境，使学生能够对古代的、中世纪的、文艺复兴的和巴洛克的作品有更加宽泛和深入的了解与认识。','This course is designed to be taken concurrently with MUS1112 History of Western Music I. Students gain a broader scope and greater depth in the music of the Ancient world and of Medieval, Renaissance, and Baroque Europe through the study and discussion of primary sources, additional repertory, and alternative audio-visual examples, as well as through a fuller consideration of the relevant socio-cultural contexts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
