(102557,'MUS1603','钢琴练习（指挥）I','','MUS - Music','1603','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1','','','本科目是一对一课程，主要旨在提高学生的基础钢琴演奏水平和钢琴技术的应用能力，以确保学生具备足够的钢琴演奏能力，能够完成总谱读法、歌剧等相关课程的内容。','This is a personalized one-on-one piano course that focuses on improving student conductors'' basic piano performance level and technical application skills. The aim is to ensure that students have sufficient piano playing ability to confidently complete related coursework such as score reading and opera.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102558,'MUS1604','钢琴练习（指挥） II','','MUS - Music','1604','M',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2','MUS1603 Piano Practice for Conductor I','','本科目是MUS1603的延续。这是一门一对一的课程，旨在提高学生的钢琴演奏水平和钢琴技术的应用能力，以确保学生具备足够的钢琴演奏能力，能够完成总谱读法、歌剧等相关课程的内容。','This course is the continuation of MUS1603. This is a personalized one-on-one piano course that focuses on improving student conductors'' piano performance level and technical application skills. The aim is to ensure that students have sufficient piano playing ability to confidently complete related coursework such as score reading and opera.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102559,'MUS1605','第二乐器练习 I','','MUS - Music','1605','M',1.00,1000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是一对一课程，根据学生的第一乐器情况选择第二乐器，对于以钢琴为主乐器的学生需要选择一件弦乐、管乐或打击乐器作为第二乐器，了解乐队乐器的演奏特点和技术特点。','This course offers personalized one-on-one instruction, with the selection of a secondary instrument based on the student''s primary instrument. For students whose primary instrument is piano, the course requires the selection of a secondary instrument from the categories of strings, winds, or percussion. The curriculum is designed to provide students with an understanding of the unique performance and technical aspects of various orchestra instruments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
