2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS1605的延续。系一对一课程，根据学生的第一乐器情况选择第二乐器，对于以钢琴为主乐器的学生需要选择一件弦乐、管乐或打击乐器作为第二乐器，了解乐队乐器的演奏特点和技术特点。','This course is the continuation of MUS1605. This course offers personalized one-on-one instruction, with the selection of a secondary instrument based on the student''s primary instrument. For students whose primary instrument is piano, the course requires the selection of a secondary instrument from the categories of strings, winds, or percussion. The curriculum is designed to provide students with an understanding of the unique performance and technical aspects of various orchestra instruments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
