2026-27 Term 1','MUS 1002 Applied Music II or equivalent','','本課程採用一對一教學，將繼續幫助學生成為一名專業的音樂演奏者或演唱者。從巴羅克時期到浪漫時期的音樂都將被引入，以訓練學生的個人風格和挖掘學生的才能。與下一個課程表演II一起，學生將能夠在他們的相關樂器或聲樂中涵蓋廣泛的曲目。課程結束時必須作長度不少於20分鐘的表演展示。','This one-to-one teaching course continues to prepare students to become a professional performer. Music from the Baroque to the Romantic Period will be introduced to try out students’ personal style and aptitude. Together with the next course Performance II, students will be able to cover a wide range of repertoire in their related instrument or voice. A performance of 20 minutes at the end of the course is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
