2025-26 Term 2','MUS2001 Performance I','','这是一对一教学课程，是MUS2001课程的延续。学生将进一步完善他们的技术技巧和风格诠释。曲目范围主要涵盖巴洛克时期到浪漫主义时期的作品。根据学生的能力，也可以包括协奏曲等更具挑战性的曲目。在课程结束时，学生需要进行一次持续不少于20分钟的表演展示。','This one-to-one teaching course is the continuation of MUS2001. Students will further polish their technical skills and stylistic interpretation concentrating on Baroque to Romantic repertoire. Concertos may be introduced according to students’ strengths. A performance of 20 minutes at the end of the course is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
