2026-27 Term 1','MUS1004 Chamber Music Ensemble II','','本科目是室内乐合奏II的延续。学生将与MUS1004中相同的组合成员继续合作，或组成新的合奏组。学生将进行定期的小组排练，并接受教师的指导。该课程旨在培养学生的合作技能，同时应用适当的音乐风格。在课程结束时，每个组合需要进行约15分钟的室内乐演出。','This course is the continuation of Ensemble II. Students will continue the same combination in MUS1004 or form a new group. They will practice regularly under an assigned coach. A performance of around 15 minutes at the end of the course is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
