2026-27 Term 1','MUS2003 Chamber Music Ensemble III','','本科目是室内乐合奏III的延续。学生将在相同的组合或新的组合中继续演奏室内乐，尝试进行大型或多乐章的作品演奏。学生将进行定期的小组排练，并接受教师的指导。在课程结束时，需要进行约15分钟的表演展示。','This course is the continuation of Ensemble III. Students will continue the same combination in MUS2003 or form a new group. They will practice regularly under an assigned coach on some extended or multi-movement works. A performance of around 15 minutes at the end of the course is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
