2026-27 Term 1','','','這門課是MUS1006的延續，形式為在指揮領導下的定期合唱排練，並以學期末音樂會結束。旨在訓練學生的常規音樂才能和指揮領導下的團隊協作。同時發展學生的歌唱技巧和音準。學生會演唱各種不同風格和語言的歌曲。','This is the continuation of MUS1006. This course is in the format of regular choir rehearsal under a conductor and finishing with an end-of-term concert. This is to train students’ general musicianship and teamwork under the leadership of a conductor. It also develops students’ singing skills and pitch accuracy. Songs of various styles and languages will be introduced.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
