2025-26 Term 2','MUS2005 Choral Singing III','','这门课程是MUS2005的延续，形式为在指挥领导下的定期合唱排练，并以学期末音乐会结束。旨在培养学生的常规音乐才能和在指挥领导下的团队合作能力。同时发展学生的歌唱技巧和音准。学生将演唱各种不同风格和语言的歌曲。','This is the continuation of MUS 2005. This course is in the format of regular choir rehearsal under a conductor and finishing with an end-of-term concert. This is to develop further students’ general musicianship and teamwork under the leadership of a conductor. It also consolidates students’ singing skills. Songs of various styles and languages will be introduced.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
