2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','MUS1008 Aural Practice and Perception','','本课程是MUS1008的延续，课程将训练学生在音乐中的聆听能力，并作出适当的响应。课程将包括调性和无调性的旋律视唱、节奏训练、旋律听写、节奏听写与和声听写等内容，并将努力开拓学生的听觉技巧，以更科学、更系统的方式聆听音乐，从而提高学生的表演实践能力。','This is the continuation of MUS1008. This course trains students'' advanced aural listening to music and making appropriate response. The class will consist of multipart sight-singing of tonal and atonal melodies, complex rhythmic training, music dictation of melody, rhythm and harmony, etc. Students will find a more intellectual way of music listening to improve their performance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
