2026-27 Term 1','MUS1011 Orchestral Training II','','此科目是MUS1011的延续，在指挥家的指导下，定期进行管弦乐排练，曲目选自常见的交响乐作品。通过系统的训练，学生学习如何在大型合奏中进行互动，从而能够在专业管弦乐团中胜任演奏更高难度的曲目。','This is the continuation of MUS 1011 featuring regular orchestral rehearsals under a conductor with repertoire drawn from the regular symphonic masterpieces. Through systematic training, students learn how to interact in a large ensemble thus be able to play the more advanced repertoire competently in a professional orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
