2025-26 Term 2','MUS2010 Orchestral Training III','','这是MUS2010的延续，学生将在指挥的带领下进行定期的管弦乐排练。除了常见的交响乐作品外，曲目还将扩展到更多大型交响乐曲目。通过系统的训练，学生将能够在专业管弦乐团中胜任演奏更高难度的曲目。','This is the continuation of MUS 2010 featuring regular orchestral rehearsals under a conductor with repertoire drawn from the regular to extended symphonic masterpieces. Through systematic training, students will be able to play the more advanced repertoire competently in a professional orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
