2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目主要培养歌剧指挥、合唱指挥、歌剧辅导、合唱独唱辅导的专业技能。主要教学内容为巴洛克歌剧、清唱剧、古典歌剧。','This course is to train the opera conducting and choral conducting, and the opera coaching and choral soloist coaching. The main teaching content is Baroque opera, oratorio, and classical opera.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
