2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS2025的延续，本课程培养歌剧指挥和合唱指挥、歌剧指导和合唱独唱指导，主要教学内容是古典时期的歌剧和合唱作品。','This is the continuation of MUS2025. This course is to train the opera conducting and choral conducting, and the opera coaching and choral soloist coaching. The main teaching content is opera and choral works from the classical period.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
