2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目规划涵盖任何乐器，具体内容取决于教师。每年将提供不同的乐器供学生选修，主要以中国民族乐器为主。本课程可根据学生的演奏水平分为一对一或小组课程，每种乐器的授课时间为一学年，每周授课一小时，共计一学分。','Any of the musical instruments can be included in this curriculum planning, which will depend on the teacher, and different instruments will be offered each year for students to take, with the main focus being on Chinese folk instruments. This course can be divided into one-on-one or small group course based on students performing skills, and each instrument is offered for one academic year, with one credit for one hour of instruction per week.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
