2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程教授学生德语的吐字和发音、读说技能和简单写作。同时介绍简单的德语日常交流以及德语艺术歌曲、德语歌剧中的歌词。','This course teaches students the pronunciation and diction of the German language including speaking and simple writing skills. Basic communication in simple German will be introduced. There are also simple texts drawn from musical sources such as German Lieder and opera.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
