(102583,'MUS2112','西方音乐史 II','History of Western Music II','MUS - Music','2112','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本課程是MUS 1112的延續。研究的音樂涉及浪漫主義時期，民族樂派，印象主義，直至現代音樂。並探討各種現代音樂的風格，如原始主義、極簡主義、先鋒樂派等。','This course is the continuation of MUS 1112. It will mainly deal with the music from the Romantic Period through Nationalism and Impressionism into the present days. Various types of modern musical styles such as Primitivism, Minimalism, the Avant-garde, etc. will also be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102584,'MUS2200','唱歌的发音法及语文准备 II','Diction and Language Preparation for Singers II','MUS - Music','2200','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本課程涉及歌手經常遇到的歐洲語言的發音和吐字。它們包括法語和德語。學生將學習如何用這些語言歌唱，以達到清晰、良好的語文歌唱發音。','This course deals with pronunciation and diction of selected European languages that singers regularly come across. They include French and German. Students will learn how to produce a clear and well projected singing tone with these languages.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102585,'MUS2211','声乐文献 II：法语及德语歌曲','','MUS - Music','2211','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2','','','本课程概述西方音乐史上的独唱艺术歌曲。它将涵盖从巴洛克时期至今的法语及德语歌曲。学生将对这些杰作有一个全面的了解，并能够以适当的音乐风格演绎它们。','This course gives a survey of solo songs in the history of western music. It will cover French chanson and German Lieder from the Baroque Period to the present days. Students will have an overall understanding of these masterpieces and be able to perform them in the appropriate styles.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102586,'MUS2212','歌剧研究 I','Opera Studies I','MUS - Music','2212','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程旨在让声乐专业的学生了解歌剧制作中的各种角色和职能。并包括实习不同类型的歌剧及其代表作。学生将参与准备歌剧片段展演作为期末作业。','This course is designed for the Voice majors to come to know the various roles and personnel in an opera production. The different types of opera and their representing masterpieces will be practised. Students will be involved in preparing an excerpt of selected works as the end-of-term assignment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102587,'MUS2311','弦乐文献 I','Strings Literature I','MUS - Music','2311','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程将介绍和讨论不同风格时期的弦乐独奏作品。还将讨论一些重要的室内乐作品和管弦乐作品弦乐声部。通过这门课程，学生将能够看到作为独奏家、室内乐和管弦乐演奏家的区别和细节。音乐的例子将主要来自小提琴曲目，并将包括一些中提琴和大提琴曲目。','This course will introduce and discuss solo works of the various style periods written for strings. Some important chamber and orchestral works having a string part will also be discussed. Through this course, students will be able to see the differences and details of being a soloist, a chamber and orchestral player in strings. The musical examples will largely be drawn from violin repertoire and will include a few from viola and cello repertoire.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102588,'MUS2328','配器法 I','Orchestration I','MUS - Music','2328','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目向学生介绍西方管弦乐的乐器知识，包括个别乐器的音域、特点、音色和技术技巧。学生将学习如何以批判和智能的方式聆听乐器的个别声音以及从室内乐到大型管弦乐队的各种管弦乐组合。','This course introduces students the knowledge of instrumentation including the range, character, tone colour and technical skills of individual western orchestral instruments. Students will be guided to listen critically and intelligently the individual sound of an instrument and the various kinds of orchestral combinations from chamber to big orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102589,'MUS2333','作曲 I','Composition I','MUS - Music','2333','M',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','Pre-Composition II (MUS1351)','','本课程训练学生在小型室内乐方面的写作技术，包括写作符合乐器特性的三重奏和四重奏作品，学生也要学习和掌握一定数量的相关音乐文献。','This course trains students in the techniques of writing for small chamber ensembles, including the composition of trios and quartets that are suited to the characteristics of the instruments. Students are also required to study and master a certain amount of related musical literature.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102590,'MUS2334','作曲 II','Composition II','MUS - Music','2334','M',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','MUS2333 Composition I','','作为MUS2333的延续，此科目教授学生更多的曲目体裁和作曲技巧。学生在课程结束时要完成一定数量的作品。','This is the continuation of the course 2333 where more genres and techniques will be tried out. Students are expected to turn out a specific number of works at the completion of the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102591,'MUS2350','作曲主修 I','','MUS - Music','2350','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目为作曲入门课程，指导学生创作独奏或声乐作品，可有伴奏或无伴奏，鼓励学生尝试运用所学的作曲技巧，完成课程后，学生需创作一定数量的作品。','This course is the starting course in musical composition. Students will be guided to write music for solo instruments and voice with or without accompaniment. They are encouraged to try using compositional techniques that they have studied. Students are expected to turn out a specific number of works at the completion of the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102592,'MUS2351','作曲主修 II','','MUS - Music','2351','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS2350的延续，将尝试更多流派和技巧。学生有望在课程结束时创作出一定数量的作品。','This is the continuation of the course MUS2350 where more genres and techniques will be tried out. Students are expected to turn out a specific number of works at the completion of the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102593,'MUS2401','民族音乐学导论','Introduction to Ethnomusicology','MUS - Music','2401','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','','','本科目通过全面介绍民族音乐学的发展历史、研究方法、音乐和文学数据、图像学、历史分析和表演实践，使学生了解民族音乐学学科的形成。','This course introduces the formation of discipline of ethnomusicology through a survey of its history, methodologies, musical and literary resources, iconography, historical analysis and performing practices.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102594,'MUS2411','木管文献 I','Woodwinds Literature I','MUS - Music','2411','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目将介绍和讨论为木管乐器而写的不同风格时期的独奏作品。本文还将讨论一些重要的室内乐和管弦乐作品中的木管部分。通过本课程，学生将能够看到作为独奏者、室内乐和管弦乐演奏者的不同和细节。示例取材于长笛，双簧管，单簧管和大管的曲目。','This course will introduce and discuss solo works of the various style periods written for winds. Some important chamber and orchestral works having a wind part will also be discussed. Through this course, students will be able to see the differences and details of being a soloist, a chamber and orchestral player on winds. The musical examples will be drawn from flute, oboe, clarinet and bassoon.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102595,'MUS2500','音乐研究方法','Research Methods in Music','MUS - Music','2500','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2','','','本科目引导学生运用适当的方法和途径，例如引用、引述和使用参考书目等，从事音乐方面的初级和独立研究。','This course prepares students to embark on primary and independent research in music by using appropriate methodologies and approaches. The use of quotation, citation and bibliography will be included.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102596,'MUS2501','历史音乐学导论','','MUS - Music','2501','M',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目通过介绍音乐学的发展历史、研究方法、音乐和文学资料、图像学、历史分析和表演实践，初步建立学生对音乐学学科的了解。','This course introduces students the discipline of musicology through a survey of its history, methodologies, musical and literary resources, iconography, historical analysis and performing practices.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102597,'MUS2511','铜管文献 I','Brass Literature I','MUS - Music','2511','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程将介绍和讨论为铜管乐器创作的不同风格时期的独奏作品。一些重要的室内乐和管弦乐作品的铜管部分也将讨论。通过这门课程，学生将能够看到作为独奏家、室内乐和管弦乐演奏家的差异和细节。示例音乐取材于小号，圆号和长号曲目。','This course will introduce and discuss solo works of the various style periods written for a brass instrument. Some important chamber and orchestral works having a brass part will also be discussed. Through this course, students will be able to see the differences and details of being a soloist, a chamber and orchestral player on brass. The musical examples will be drawn from trumpet, horn and trombone.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102598,'MUS2512','西方音乐史专题研讨 II','Seminar in Western Music History II','MUS - Music','2512','M',1.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是为配合MUS2112 西方音乐史 II，在每节课所授内容的基础上做进一步的研讨。在课上已交代材料的基础上，进一步扩大作品范围，加宽音视频的例子，并思考社会与文化的语境，使学生能够对古典的、浪漫派的和当代的作品有更加宽泛和深入的了解与认识。','This course is designed to be taken concurrently with MUS2112 History of Western Music II. Students gain a broader scope and greater depth in Western Classical, Romantic, Post-Romantic, and Contemporary music through the study and discussion of primary sources, additional repertory, and alternative audio-visual examples, as well as through a fuller consideration of the relevant socio-cultural contexts.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102599,'MUS2550','中國傳統聲樂作品模唱','Chinese Vocal Music Practicum','MUS - Music','2550','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目旨在通过实践学习，使学生熟悉中国各地的声乐传统，并将相关的演唱技巧应用于包括民歌和中国戏曲（如昆曲和京剧）在内的多种声乐体裁中。','In this course, students gain working familiarity with the wide variety of vocal traditions from across China through practical study and the application of relevant singing techniques to standard works from a wide array of genres, including folk song, narrative music (such as jingyun dagu and pingtan), and various dramatic/operatic forms, including arias from the Kunqu, Cantonese, and Peking opera styles.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

