(102609,'MUS2610','钢琴文献 I','Piano Literature I','MUS - Music','2610','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
2022-23 Term 2
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目將按時間順序研究巴羅克、古典和早期浪漫時期的早期獨奏鍵盤音樂文獻，探討其中與現代鋼琴演奏者相關的內容。','A chronological survey of solo early keyboard literature from the Baroque, Classical and Early Romantic Periods, of relevance to the modern pianist.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102610,'MUS2611','钢琴专题 I','Piano Topic I','MUS - Music','2611','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程介绍钢琴及其前身的历史发展和构造结构，探讨乐谱标记、技巧、曲目和风格是如何适应从文艺复兴后期到现代键盘乐器的变化。','Introducing the historical development and organology of the piano and its immediate predecessors, this course explores how musical notation, technique, repertoire and style modified to accommodate the changes in keyboard instruments from the late Renaissance period to our days.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102611,'MUS2612','键盘技巧 I','Keyboard Skills I','MUS - Music','2612','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','这门以技能为基础的课程训练学生的整体键盘技巧，包括要求学生替固定的高音线及数字低音提供和声伴奏，替合唱曲提供键盘和声，在钢琴上作总谱视奏，转调和基本即兴创作演奏等。','This skill-based course trains students’ overall keyboard techniques including the realization of figured bass with a given treble line, keyboard harmony such as harmonizing a chorale tune, score reading, transposition, and basic improvisation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102612,'MUS2613','键盘技巧 II','','MUS - Music','2613','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MUS2612','','本科目是MUS2612的延续。该课程将进一步训练学生的整体键盘技巧，包括要求学生替固定的高音线及数字低音提供和声伴奏，替合唱曲提供键盘和声，在钢琴上作总谱视奏，转调和基本即兴创作演奏等。','This course is the continuation of MUS2612. This skill-based course trains students’ advanced keyboard techniques including the realization of figured bass with a given treble line, keyboard harmony such as harmonizing a chorale tune, score reading, transposition, and basic improvisation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102613,'MUS2700','音乐治疗导论','* Introduction to Music Therapy','MUS - Music','2700','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目将概述音乐治疗的定义、核心概念和当今的常规操作。将介绍两种类型的音乐治疗，即接受性和主动性。使学生能够利用音乐来提高对生活的感知，并为有意进入这门新学科的学生做好基础准备。','This course will provide a comprehensive overview on defining music therapy, its key concepts and the general practice in the modern days. The two types of music therapy namely receptive and active will be introduced. It enables students to use music to improve the perception of life and prepare them for further study if they want to enter into this new discipline.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102614,'MUS2702','世界打击乐研习 I','World Percussion Studies I','MUS - Music','2702','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','随着打击乐的发展，每个国家的文化都有其独特的打击乐和起源。为了帮助学生了解打击乐的文化及其特点，全面了解打击乐的世界，从而更好地演奏打击乐，我们组织了一系列的学习活动，让学生了解打击乐及其在表演中的运用。','Following the development of percussion, each country''s culture has its own unique percussion and origins. In order to help students understand the culture of percussion and its characteristics and to develop a comprehensive understanding of the world of percussion so that they can perform it better, we have organized a series of studies for students to learn about percussion and how it can be used in performance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102615,'MUS2703','对位法 I','Counterpoint I','MUS - Music','2703','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目旨在介紹16世紀對位法基礎和作曲手法的各種創作形式。示範譜例將主要引自文藝復興時期重要作曲家的作品。','This course aims at introducing the foundation and various ways of contrapuntal writings based on the 16th century tradition. Examples will largely be drawn from the works of important Renaissance composers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102616,'MUS2704','对位法 II','Counterpoint II','MUS - Music','2704','M',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','MUS2703','','本科目是MUS2703的延续。本科目将引入更多的例子，以深入分析展示巴洛克时期至20世纪的调性对位技巧及其写作过程，此外也将详细讨论赋格写作过程。','This is the continuation of MUS2703 Counterpoint I. This course will bring in more examples with in-depth analysis to illustrate contrapuntal techniques and their writing process in Tonal Counterpoint from the Baroque Period to the 20th century. The fugal writing procedures will be dealt with in great details.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102617,'MUS2705','音乐与数位媒体','Music and Digital Media','MUS - Music','2705','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102618,'MUS2706','世界打擊樂研習 II','World Percussion Studies II','MUS - Music','2706','M',2.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102619,'MUS2802','总谱读法 I','Score Reading I','MUS - Music','2802','M',1.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目将系统向学生介绍总谱中各种C谱号和移调乐器的阅读方式，并通过练习让学生可以熟练的阅读各种C谱号和移调乐器，并且能够了解总谱阅读的方法。','The course will systematically introduce to students the reading methods for various C clefs and transposing instruments in the grand staff, and through practice, enable students to read various C clefs and transposing instruments proficiently, and to understand the methods of reading the grand staff.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102620,'MUS2803','总谱读法 II','','MUS - Music','2803','M',1.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
