2026-27 Term 1','MUS2002 Performance II','','此一对一的教学课程是MUS2002的延续。在教师引导下，学生进一步接触印象主义乐派和20世纪中期的音乐，学生以此来拓宽他们的曲目。重点强调演奏/演唱的技术完善和风格阐释。教师可根据学生的个人能力和天资选择适当的曲目。课程结束时必须作30分钟的表演展示。','This one-to-one teaching course is the continuation of MUS2002. It further leads into the Impressionistic and the mid-20th century music as seen appropriate by the teachers so that students can broaden their repertoire. Technical skills and stylistic interpretation are much emphasized. Teachers may choose suitable repertoire according to the competence and aptitude of individual student. A performance of 30 minutes at the end of the course is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102623,'MUS3002','音乐表演 IV','Performance IV','MUS - Music','3002','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','MUS3001 Performance III','','此一对一形式教学的课程是MUS3001的延续。学生现在应该能够达到一个相当高的音乐表演水准，例如与乐队合作演出大型作品。学生对自己的乐器或声音的认知也得到了极大的扩展。课程结束时必须作35分钟等同一个小型音乐会的表演展示。','This one-to-one teaching course is the continuation of MUS3001. Students should now be able to arrive at a considerably high level in music performance by performing an extended piece with an orchestra. The overall knowledge of the students on their own instruments or voice should also be extended.  A performance serving as a Junior Recital of 35 minutes at the end of the course is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
