2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程是由钢琴艺术指导来帮助学生完善他们在学期末音乐会上表演的音乐作品。它是目标明确的指导性实践课。钢琴艺术指导将检查学生的技术能力，音高和节奏的准确性，语调，音乐风格和演绎。对于声乐学生，艺术指导也将纠正和检查所唱歌词的语言发音。','This course features a repetiteur/pianist coaching regular practice of the students on the musical works to be performed in the end-of-term concerts. It serves as a form of guided practice with designated objectives. The repetiteur will check students'' technical competence, pitch and rhythmic accuracy, intonation, musical style and interpretation. For Voice students, the repetiteur will also instruct and check the diction of the language sung.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
