2026-27 Term 1','MUS2011','','这是MUS2011的延续，在指挥的带领下进行定期的管弦乐排练，曲目除了常规交响乐名曲也会拓展更多大型的交响乐曲目。学生学习如何在大型合奏中进行互动，从而能够在专业管弦乐队中胜任地演奏更高难度的曲目。','This is the continuation of MUS2011 featuring regular orchestral rehearsals under a conductor with repertoire drawn from the regular to extended symphonic masterpieces. Through systematic training, students learn how to interact in a large ensemble thus be able to play the more advanced repertoire in a professional orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
