2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是MUS2022的延续。该课程系列涵盖了中级指挥的各个方面，包括管弦乐队指挥、歌剧指挥和合唱指挥等。','This course is the continuation of MUS2022 Conducting Training II. The course series covers all aspects of intermediate conducting, include orchestral conducting, opera conducting and choral conducting, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102631,'MUS3022','乐队指挥专业课 IV','','MUS - Music','3022','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS3021的延续。该课程系列涵盖了高级指挥的各个方面，包括管弦乐队指挥、歌剧指挥和合唱指挥等。','This course is the continuation of MUS3021 Conducting Training III. The course series covers all aspects of advanced conducting, include orchestra conducting, opera conducting and choral conducting, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
