2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是MUS2024的延续。系实践类课程，以集体实践的方式进行。在课程中，根据学生指挥专业课程的情况安排实践曲目，指导学生进行乐团实践活动，获得指挥乐团和排练的实践经验。','This course is the continuation of MUS2024 Practical Training II. This course is a practical, collective practice format where students are arranged practical pieces based on their command of professional courses.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102633,'MUS3024','艺术实践 IV','','MUS - Music','3024','M',1.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS3023的延续。系实践类课程，以集体实践的方式进行。在课程中，根据学生指挥专业课程的情况安排实践曲目，指导学生进行乐团实践活动，获得指挥乐团和排练的实践经验。','This course is the continuation of MUS3023 Practical Training III. This course is a practical, collective practice format where students are arranged practical pieces based on their command of professional courses.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102634,'MUS3025','歌剧与合唱指挥 III','','MUS - Music','3025','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是MUS2026的延续。本课程侧重于歌剧指挥、合唱指挥、歌剧指导和合唱独唱指导的培训，重点关注巴洛克歌剧、清唱剧和古典歌剧。','This is the continuation of MUS2026. This course focuses on training in opera conducting, choral conducting, opera coaching, and choral soloist coaching, with a primary emphasis on Baroque opera, oratorio, and classical opera.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102635,'MUS3026','歌剧与合唱指挥 IV','','MUS - Music','3026','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS3025的延续。侧重于歌剧指挥、合唱指挥、歌剧指导和合唱独唱指导的培训，重点是巴洛克歌剧、清唱剧和古典歌剧。','This is the continuation of MUS3025. This course focuses on training in opera conducting, choral conducting, opera coaching, and choral soloist coaching, with a primary emphasis on Baroque opera, oratorio, and classical opera.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
