(102637,'MUS3110','音乐分析 I','Music Analysis I','MUS - Music','3110','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程将研习音乐的曲式和结构。并介绍音乐中的各种重要曲式，即歌曲曲式、奏鸣曲曲式、回旋曲曲式、赋格曲式等。学生将掌握必要的技能， 对一首乐曲的和声、节奏、旋律、曲式和其它结构细节，进行详细分析。','This course will study the overall forms and structures of music. It will introduce the various important forms in music namely song forms, sonata form, rondo form, fugue, etc. Students will acquire the necessary skills to analyze a piece of music according to its harmony, rhythm, melody, form and other structural details.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102638,'MUS3111','高级和声学','Advanced Harmonic Practice','MUS - Music','3111','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程将探讨不同类型的和声创作技法，探讨从布鲁克纳等作曲家的半音化和声到多位后浪漫主义作曲家，再到二十世纪作曲家所使用的技巧。','This course will examine different kinds of harmonic practices from the chromatic harmony of Bruckner through various late Romantic composers into the techniques used by twentieth century composers.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102639,'MUS3112','中国音乐史','Chinese Music History','MUS - Music','3112','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 1
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程介绍中国音乐的四大乐种，即说唱、民谣、戏曲和器乐，概述了它们在中国历史上的音乐发展。这个概览旨在培养一种对不同类型音乐的智力倾听，感受它们的特点、表演实践、及音乐背后的社会学和文学传统。','This is an introductory course to introduce the four major genres in Chinese music namely Singing Narratives, Folksongs, Regional Operas and Instrumental Music. The overview follows their music development in Chinese history. The approach is to cultivate an intellectual listening of all the different genres noting their characteristics, performing practices, the sociological and literary tradition behind the music.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102640,'MUS3113','世界文化中的音乐','Music in World Culture','MUS - Music','3113','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目介绍除了中国音乐、西方古典音乐和当代流行音乐以外的音乐种类。因此，它涉及中南美、非洲各地、东欧、中东和中国以外的亚洲地区的民间音乐和传统音乐。课堂讨论将更多地集中在这些选曲背后的的文化意义和音乐特性。','This course will introduce music of the world other than Chinese music, western classical music and contemporary popular music. It deals therefore with indigenous folk and traditional music covering the areas of Central and South America, African Diaspora, Eastern Europe, Middle East and Asia other than China. The discussion will center more on the cultural aspects and musical significance of the selected genres.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102641,'MUS3188','乐器学及民乐配器法','Instrumentation and Orchestration for Chinese Music Instruments','MUS - Music','3188','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程介绍中国传统民族管弦乐团常用的中国乐器及常见的器乐组合，并对每一类型的代表作进行实例分析和讨论。课程结束后，学生应具备为小型民乐室内乐团或大型民族管弦乐队配器或改编曲目的能力。','This course introduces the Chinese music instruments commonly used in a traditional Chinese orchestra and their possible combinations. Examples of masterpieces will be analyzed and discussed. At the completion of the course, students should be able to orchestrate and arrange music for a Chinese ensemble from small group to large size orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102642,'MUS3200','声乐教学法','V ocal Pedagogy','MUS - Music','3200','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目将介绍歌唱教学中行之有效的各种教学方法。包括以敏锐的观察力，找出一名歌手的强项和弱项，并提出改进的方法。同时帮助学生巩固全面的知识和经验，并能将这些知识和技能传授给自己的学生。','This course will introduce the various methods in delivering effective teaching in singing. It involves a keen observation to find out the strengths and weaknesses of a singer and suggest methods to make improvement. It helps to consolidate the students’ overall knowledge and experience and to transfer these knowledge and skills to their own students.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102643,'MUS3201','创意产业法律法规','Laws and Regulations in Creative Industries','MUS - Music','3201','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目介绍适用于创意产业的法律法规，让学生了解中国大陆和其他主要市场的法律和监管框架。','This course introduces laws and regulations applied to creative industries, providing students with an overview of the legal and regulatory framework in mainland China and other major markets.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102644,'MUS3210','音乐分析 II','Music Analysis II','MUS - Music','3210','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是MUS3110 音乐分析 I 的延续。学生将更详细地学习整体音乐形式和结构。将选择多乐章中更高级的音乐示例并进行深入讨论。学生将接受训练，以动机、主题和分段的方式批判性地分析一段音乐。他们还将学习在必要时得出适当的分析方法和程序。','This is the continuation of MUS3110 Music Analysis I. Students will study in more details the overall musical forms and structures. More advanced music examples in multi-movements will be selected and discussed in great depth.  Students will be trained to critically analyze a piece of music motivically, thematically and sectionally. They will also learn to derive appropriate analytical method and procedures wherever necessary.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102645,'MUS3211','歌手的演戏及动作训练','Acting and Movement for Singers','MUS - Music','3211','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','恰当正确的动作在歌唱中是必不可少的。这门以技能为基础的课程将教授学生歌唱时的整体身体动作，以及在歌剧等戏剧性表演中作出更精细的举动。课程亦包括在不同表达风格的中表演技巧。','Proper and correct ways of movement are essential in singing. This skill-based course will teach students the overall body movement in singing and more elaborated movements in a dramatic performance especially in opera.  The various styles in acting to produce different expression are also included.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102646,'MUS3212','歌剧研究 II','Opera Studies II','MUS - Music','3212','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','MUS2211 Vocal Literature II: Songs','','本科目是MUS2211的延續。本課程專為聲樂專業學生熟悉浪漫主義和20世紀歌劇曲目而設計，將向學生介紹不同語言和風格的精選歌劇。','This is the continuation of MUS 2211. This course is designed for the Voice majors to get acquainted with the opera repertoire in Romantic and 20th-century. Students will be introduced to selected operas in the different languages and styles.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102647,'MUS3221','歌剧工作坊 I','Opera Workshop I','MUS - Music','3221','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目將讓學生学习莫扎特的歌劇以及其他含舞台表演的浪漫歌劇。學生將瞭解他們所扮演角色、音樂文本，以及透過場景演出學習如何設計肢體動作并表演。','This unique course will give students the experience of Mozart’s operas and other romantic operas with staging. Students will  learn about their characters, the text with the music, and how to move and act through scene performance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
