2025-26 Term 1','','','本科目向学生介绍音乐与审美、人类表达、人类情感的关系；音乐作为一种艺术形式和现代消费而产生的哲学问题。音乐在现代社会中的价值和意义也将被讨论。','This course introduces students the ways in which music is related to beauty, human expression and emotion. It examines the philosophical issues relating to music as an art and as a modern consumption. The value and meanings of music in a modern society will also be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102659,'MUS3502','音乐及音乐家心理学','Psychology of Music and Musicians','MUS - Music','3502','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','这门跨学科科目受到心理学、社会学、音乐学和文化研究的影响，主要研究音乐教育和音乐表演者/创作者音乐行为的相关问题。它还将讨论音乐家通常面对的心理弱点和难题。','This interdisciplinary course draws influences from psychology, sociology, musicology and cultural studies. It examines issues from relating to music education to musical behavior of a performer and composer. It will discuss the psychological weaknesses and difficulties that a musician usually faces.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102660,'MUS3511','铜管文献 II','Brass Literature II','MUS - Music','3511','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目将涵盖以铜管乐器为特色的重要管弦乐作品。并将详细论述从海登到20世纪重要的小号协奏曲、圆号协奏曲和长号协奏曲。','This course will cover significant orchestral works that feature a brass instrument. It will discuss important trumpet concerto, horn concerto and trombone concerto in details from Haydn to the 20th century.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102661,'MUS3512','西方音乐史学术前沿问题研讨','Selected Topic in Western Music History','MUS - Music','3512','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是一门有关西方音乐史学史的专题研究课程。其主要内容涉及到某特殊的历史时期、某国家和地区、某特殊的音乐类型，或某特定作曲家的生平和作品。','This course offers students focused study of a specialized area in the history of Western Music, such as of a specific historical era or period, of a particular country or region, of a selected genre over time, or of the life and works of a given composer.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
