2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程探讨从儒家到当代的各种音乐学说。内容包括众多中国传统美学论述，例如经典著作《礼记》之《乐记》篇和嵇康的《声无哀乐论》。','This course will examine the various doctrines on music from the Confucianist to that of the present days. Articles such as the Record on Music from the Book of Rites and Ji Kang’s Essay: Music Has No Sorrow or Joy Sheng Wu Ai Le Lun will be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
