(102675,'MUS3703','配器法 II','Orchestration II','MUS - Music','3703','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是 MUS2328 的延续。学生将学习乐器的基本知识，包括西方管弦乐的音域、特点、音色和技术技巧。学生将被引导以批判和智慧的方式聆听乐器的个别声音以及从室内乐到大型管弦乐队的各种管弦乐组合。然后他们将根据不同的管弦乐组合创作和编排音乐。','This is the continuation of MUS2328 Orchestration I. Students will be introduced the basic knowledge of instrumentation including the range, character, tone colour and technical skills of individual western orchestral instruments. Students will be guided to listen critically and intelligently to the individual sound of an instrument and the various kinds of orchestral combinations from chamber to big orchestra. They will then write and arrange music to the various orchestral combination idiomatically.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102676,'MUS3704','应用作曲和编曲','Practical Composing and Arranging','MUS - Music','3704','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目训练学生从事功能性的作曲及编曲，包括例如学校校歌、儿童歌曲、宣传歌曲、特定产品的歌曲等。这些音乐作品更可能是具有调性的短篇作品。此外，学生将学习如何把管弦乐作品编为钢琴独奏或小型学校合奏等。学生同时亦学习如何把钢琴独奏编为管弦乐作品等。','This course trains students to compose and arrange music for functional purposes such as school songs, children songs, propaganda songs, jingles for specific products, etc. These musical works are more likely short pieces with tonality. Furthermore, students will learn how to arrange an extended orchestral work for a solo piano or for a small size school ensemble, etc. Students will also learn how to arrange a piano piece for a medium size orchestra.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
