(102684,'MUS3804','总谱读法 III','','MUS - Music','3804','M',1.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1','','','本科目旨在提升学生的读谱能力，涵盖不同的C谱号和移调乐器。学生将学习诠释音乐和发展音乐理念的基本技巧。课程还将指导学生阅读和诠释艺术歌曲、合唱作品和管弦乐作品，重点关注古典主义晚期和浪漫主义早期的交响乐作品。','This course is designed to enhance students'' skills in score reading, encompassing different C clefs and transposing instruments. Students will be taught essential techniques for interpreting music and developing their musical ideas. The course will also include instruction on reading and interpreting lieders, choral pieces, and orchestral works, with a focus on the Symphonic Works of the late classical and early Romantic Period.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
