(102687,'MUS3901','特别专案 I','Special Project I','MUS - Music','3901','M',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','实习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1','','','本科目是针对某一大型特定演出的实践训练，例如排练和准备由学校制作举办的歌剧表演。这类演出呈现的作品内容不应该与室内乐合奏、毕业音乐会或其他课程相关的演出重迭。它通常适用于学校的大型项目，如歌剧演出。','This course is the practical training of a specified performance such as an opera presented by the School. The studied work should not overlap those courses taken in Chamber Music Ensemble, Performance and Senior Recital. It applies normally to those School project such as opera.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
