(102691,'MUS3939','电子音乐','Electronic Music','MUS - Music','3939','M',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目将向学生介绍电子音乐从19世纪末萌芽至今的历史与发展。课程还将涵盖电声音乐。学生将学习合成器、MIDI、现场电子音乐等的使用方法。','This course will introduce students the history and development of electronic music from its embryonic stage in the late 19th century to the present days. Electroacoustic music will also be included. Students will be introduced the use of synthesizer, MIDI, live electronic music, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102692,'MUS4001','毕业音乐会准备','Senior Recital Preparation','MUS - Music','4001','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
