2026-27 Term 1','MUS3002','','此一对一形式的的教学科目包括与指导教师一起制定一场合适的音乐会曲目，并为这个最高艺术水平的独奏/唱音乐会而努力。学生们需要集中精力进行大量的练习。在课程结束时，至少要表演音乐会曲目中的过半数作品，以展示能力和逐步累积经验。','This one-to-one teaching course includes the working out of an appropriate programme plan together with the teacher and to work on it for a recital at the highest artistry. Students will need to practice extensively with the highest concentration. At least a substantial part of the selected works must be performed at the end of this course to demonstrate the accumulated experience.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102693,'MUS4002','毕业音乐会','Senior Recital','MUS - Music','4002','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','个人学习','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','此一对一的科目是专业主修的最后学习阶段，旨在帮助学生完成最高艺术水平的完整毕业独奏/唱会。在学期内，学生将继续有针对性的练习并参加工作坊，不断完善及提高艺术水平。毕业音乐会同时也是一场考试，会由校内及校外组成的评委检视。学生须准备中、英文节目单，其中包括详细的曲目介绍及个人简介。于毕业音乐会时，派给所有观众。','This one-to-one teaching course is the final training to stage a full-length professional recital at the highest artistic level. During the school term, students will continue to practice strategically, to attend workshops and to repeatedly drill for improvement in artistry. The final product is a public concert serving as an examination attended by the internal and external examiners. Students will need to prepare a programme booklet in English and Chinese with detailed programme notes and personal biography.  This programme booklet is to be distributed to the audience on concert day.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102694,'MUS4007','表演指导 III','Coaching Session III','MUS - Music','4007','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是MUS3008的延续，由钢琴艺术指导来帮助学生完善他们在学期末音乐会上表演的音乐作品。它是目标明确的指导性实践课。钢琴艺术指导将检查学生的技术能力，音高和节奏的准确性，语调，音乐风格和演绎。对于声乐学生，艺术指导也将纠正和检查所唱歌词的语言发音。','This is the continuation of MUS3008 featuring a repetiteur/pianist coaching the regular practice of the students on the musical works to be performed in the end-of-term concerts. It serves as a form of guided practice with designated objectives. The repetiteur will check students'' technical competence, pitch and rhythmic accuracy, intonation, musical style and interpretation. For Voice students, the repetiteur will also instruct and check the diction of the language sung.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
