(102699,'MUS4017','表演指导（声乐）I','','MUS - Music','4017','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1','','','本科目的特点是由艺术指导辅导声乐学生定期练习将在学期末音乐会上表演的音乐作品。它是一种具有指定目标的指导性练习形式。艺术指导将检查学生的技术能力，音高和节奏的准确性，音调，音乐风格，解释。艺术指导还将指导和检查所唱语言的发音。','This course features a repetiteur coaching regular practice of the vocal students on the musical works to be performed in the end-of-term concerts. It serves as a form of guided practice with designated objectives. The repetiteur will check students'' technical competence, pitch and rhythmic accuracy, intonation, musical style, interpretation. and the repetiteur will also instruct and check the diction of the language sung.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
