2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程是MUS3110的延续。将分析具有复杂曲式结构和调性组成的大型作品，例如管弦乐作品。调性和非调性音乐的作品都会有所涉及。','This course is a continuation of MUS3110 Music Analysis. Extended works including orchestral works with complex formal and tonal structure will be analyzed. Music of both tonal and atonal styles will be included.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102706,'MUS4111','艺术的道德与创业精神','Ethics and Entrepreneurship in Arts','MUS - Music','4111','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目探讨人类社会及艺术家在艺术行为中的道德标准。艺术家珍视言论自由，但道德责任对每一个有良知的公民同样重要。当一个人想在艺术行业创业时，道德规范尤其重要。本课程提醒学生遵守道德和法律的重要性。在这个瞬息万变的社会，它培养学生在从事艺术活动和具创业精神的同时，亦要遵守法律及符合社会的伦理道德标准。','This course deals with issues of ethics in art and for artist in a human society. Artists treasure freedom of expression yet moral responsibility is equally important for every conscientious citizen.  Code of ethics is particularly essential when one wants to be entrepreneurial in arts industry.  This course alerts students the importance of observing ethics and law. It trains students to be law-abiding and complying to social ethics while performing arts activities and be entrepreneurial.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102707,'MUS4112','当代音乐概论','A Survey of Contemporary Music','MUS - Music','4112','M',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目概述从第二维也纳学派至现代的音乐风格流派发展，涵盖但不限于无调性音乐、序列主义音乐、后序列主义音乐、简约主义音乐、表现主义音乐等。','This course presents an overview of modern music from the Second Viennese School to the present days covering but not limited to atonality, serialism, post-serialism,  minimalism, expressionism, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
