(102714,'MUS4501','音乐与社会专题 I','Topics in Music and Society I','MUS - Music','4501','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','','','本科目涉及音乐的社会学问题，从对人类音乐行为的观察到音乐在社会结构约束下的作用。它也关注新的社会现象，例如重新考虑音乐在数字化时代的价值和作为社会行为的快速更迭。','This course deals with issues in the sociology of music, from the observation of human musical behaviour to the role of music within the constraint of a social structure. It also examines the most updated phenomenon such as the digital age to reconsider the value of music and the social behaviour because of the rapid changes.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
