(102718,'MUS4505','应用音乐学','Applied Musicology','MUS - Music','4505','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程介绍和比较当前的中国音乐产业与国际音乐产业，从价值和可实施性角度试图找出它们的优势和劣势，从而寻找未来音乐产业发展的新模式。','This course introduces the different kinds of music industries currently found in China as comparing to those in the international world. It also tries to identify the weaknesses and strengthens and to look for the future examples from a valuable yet socio-economically viable viewpoint.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102719,'MUS4506','大湾区的音乐文化 I：粤，潮州及客家器乐曲','Musical Culture in the Greater Bay Area I: Instrumental Music of Guangdong (Yue), Chaozhou and Kejia','MUS - Music','4506','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 1
