2025-26 Term 1','','','本科目向学生介绍大湾区具有代表性的音乐文化，首先是广东音乐、潮州音乐、客家音乐中的代表性器乐作品，并对与之相关的乐器形制、演奏方法、调式调性和表演实践进行讨论。','This course introduces students the history and representing instrumental works in the Greater Bay Area namely Cantonese/Guangdong/Yue, Chaozhou and Kejia music. Their characteristics relating to the use of instruments, tonality and performing practices will be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102720,'MUS4507','大湾区的音乐文化 II：潮剧及粤剧','Musical Culture in the Greater Bay Area II: Chaozhou and Cantonese Operas','MUS - Music','4507','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2','','','本科目向学生介绍大湾区最具代表性的两种地方戏曲：粤剧和潮剧。课上将讨论它们的发展历史、音乐特点和文化意义。','This course introduces students the two types of most representing regional operas in the Greater Bay Area namely Cantonese Opera and Chaozhou Opera. Their history, characteristics and significance will be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102721,'MUS4512','世界音乐专题研讨','Selected Topic in World Music','MUS - Music','4512','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目内容包含西方音乐和中国音乐以外的音乐类型，如印度、印度尼西亚、中亚、西非和拉丁美洲各国传统音乐。','This course offers students concentrated study in the music of a particular country or cultural region other than those of China and Western Europe, such as of India, Indonesia, the Middle East, West Africa, and Latin America.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102722,'MUS4611','钢琴专题 III','Piano Topic III','MUS - Music','4611','M',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1','','','本科目探討鋼琴和室內樂演奏者以及音樂教育者所需的基本專業技能。課程包括兩個主要部分：1) 視奏工作坊，和 2) 以弗朗茨·舒伯特的四手聯彈鋼琴曲為主題的期末室內樂研究專案，進行兩到三首不同作品的詮釋，並對此類型浪漫主義作曲家以及表演的準備過程進行討論（例如：尋找權威樂譜、研究手稿、作品的歷史起源、分析音樂形式和風格、演出實踐等）。','This course explores the essential professional skills for the piano performer, chamber musician, and pedagogue. Two major components will be supervised by the instructor: 1) A sight-reading workshop and, 2) A final chamber music research project dedicated to the four-hand piano works of Franz Schubert, focusing on the interpretation of two to three contrasting compositions and discussion of the Romantic composers in this genre, their process of preparation (e.g. location of an authoritative score, exploration of manuscripts, historical genesis of the works, analysis of musical form and style, aspects of performance practice, etc.).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
