2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目帮助学生全面加强线性到多线性的音乐聆听能力。学生将能够在视唱练耳中做出批判性回应。课程将包括较高难度调性和无调性旋律的视唱、复杂节奏的视奏、调性和无调性旋律、节奏及和声的听写等，以帮助学生科学地进行音乐聆听，从而提升他们的表演能力。','This course helps to strengthen students’ aural listening to music in a comprehensive manner from linear to multi-linear. Students will then be able to make critical response in the aural practice and perception. The class will consist of sight-singing of advanced level tonal and atonal melodies, sight-playing of complex rhythmic patterns, music dictation of tonal and atonal melodies, rhythm and harmony, etc. It will open up students’ ears to a more intellectual way of music listening through which students’ performance will be developed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
