2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是实践类课程，根据学生在专业课程中所学到的内容为基础进行乐队排和指挥的实践，并完成音乐会。学生通过实践与职业乐手进行合作，积累指挥与排练的经验。
学生将通过实践课程和实际指挥乐队来提高自己的技能和知识水平。实践项目包含：
参加观摩彩排
专业指挥家指导
艺术实践练习
音乐会等等','Practical training is essential for learning orchestral conducting because it allows conductors to develop technical skills, understand ensemble dynamics, build communication skills, develop rehearsal techniques, and gain performance experience. Through hands-on experience with an ensemble, conductors can gain a deeper understanding of the intricacies of conducting, experiment with different techniques, and receive feedback from experienced mentors and musicians. Practical Training includes the following components:
1.	Attending Rehearsal
2.	Mentorship
3.	On Stage Practice
4.	Studio Concert
etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
