学生将通过实践课程和实际指挥乐队来提高自己的技能和知识水平。实践项目包括：

参加观摩彩排
专业指挥家指导
艺术实践练习
音乐会等','This course will explore the historical development of band literature, its status and influence in music history, and its role in the formation and evolution of music culture across different periods, regions, and styles. Teaching methods will include classroom lectures, music appreciation, and literature analysis to enhance students’ understanding of the topic and improve their music appreciation and literature analysis abilities. The course will also examine the humanistic spirit reflected in band literature, including its relationships with society, identity, and cultural inheritance, with the aim of deepening students’ appreciation of music’s artistic beauty and social-cultural significance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
