2026-27 Term 1','MUS5201 Advanced Performance II','','此一對一的教學課程是MUS5201的延續。學生繼續接受高級程度及專業的音樂表演培訓。學生將全面地準備成為最優秀的表演者。所有標準曲目應已累積完成。一種個人風格亦會在這階段漸漸出現。','This one-to-one teaching course is the continuation of MUS5201. Students continue to receive advanced professional training in music performance on their own instrument or voice. They will prepare themselves thoroughly as a soloist of the highest calibre. All standard repertoire needs to be covered accumulatively. A personal style will eventually be developed at this level.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
