(102797,'MUS6275','高级室内乐研习 III','','MUS - Music','6275','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是高级室内乐研究II的延续。学生应具备极高的艺术造诣，能够作为一名专业的室内乐演奏家，在不同组合的乐团中娴熟演奏。他们能够驾驭不同时期的音乐作品，并能驾驭当代作品。学生将进一步接受培养，成为乐团的领导者，充分发挥乐团的音乐潜能。','This is the continuation of Advanced Chamber Music Studies II. Students should have developed a very high level of artistry capable of playing skillfully as a professional chamber musician in groups of different combinations. They should be able to tackle musical works across the common periods into contemporary works. They will further be trained as the leader of the group to fully develop the group’s musical potentiality.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102798,'MUS6281','管弦乐指挥进阶曲目 II','','MUS - Music','6281','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2','','','本科目将训练学生应用适当的音乐风格，以符合作品文化背景的方式指挥进阶管弦乐作品。','This course trains students in conducting advanced orchestral works observing their appropriate style and cultural background.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102799,'MUS6282','进阶管弦乐指挥 III','','MUS - Music','6282','M',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','音乐学院','音乐学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目是指挥系学生1对1进阶专业课。学生将深入学习乐队指挥的核心理论、技巧和技术，包括乐器技术、音乐理论、乐谱阅读、乐队编排、音乐表现等方面。本系列课程涵盖了指挥的不同方面，包括乐队/歌剧/合唱指挥，等等。','This is an advanced one-on-one course for Conducting students. It covers core theories, techniques, and skills in orchestral conducting, including instrumental techniques, music theory, music reading, orchestration, and musical expression. The course encompasses various aspects of conducting, such as orchestra/opera/choral conducting.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

