2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本科目是指挥系学生一对一的进阶专业课程。学生将深入学习乐队指挥的核心理论、技巧和技术，包括乐器技术、音乐理论、乐谱阅读、乐队编排、音乐表现等方面。本系列课程涵盖了指挥的不同方面，包括乐队、歌剧、合唱指挥等。','This is an advanced one-on-one course for Conducting students. It covers core theories, techniques, and skills in band conducting, including instrument techniques, music theory, sheet music reading, band arrangement, and musical expression. The course encompasses various aspects of conducting, such as orchestra/opera/choral conducting.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
