2026-27 Term 1','','','本科目讨论和研究音乐史上选定的音乐文献。本科目的内容可能每次开课时都不同。选定的文献可能不仅限于西方古典音乐。它可能进一步扩展到非西方音乐，例如中国音乐和世界音乐。重点是选定文献背后的历史和风格背景。','This course discusses and examines selected music literature in the history of music. The content of this course may vary every time when the course is offered. The selected literature may not limit to western classical music. It may further extend to non-western music such as Chinese music and world musics. The emphasis is on the historical and stylistic background behind the selected literature.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
