1.	提高学生运动兴趣；
2.	促进学生运动技巧，增强运动能力；
3.	培养学生运动习惯，增强建立终身健康积极生活方式意识；
学生于本课程所得成绩根据学生经测验所达到的体适能基本理论、基本技能、学习精神及上课出席率及参与度而评定。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. PE is held in 1st term, and fitness and health is held in 2nd term of an academic year. The both take 2 units (1 unit/term). University students are requested to enrol the required course of PE and health in the first year of study period. Those who do not complete the requirement without permission from the PE Unit will be given a failure grade for the assigned course.
PE and health primarily teaches sports skills, health fitness theories, and emphasizes developing students’ generic skills such as creative, communication, team collaboration, and so on.  In the 2nd term, the course of fitness and health aims: (i) to improve students’ interest in sports; (ii) to promote students’ sports skills and exercise abilities; (iii) to cultivate students’ exercise habits and to enhance awareness of active lifestyle in lifespan; (iv) to grasp physical fitness prescriptions.
Students will be assessed and graded according to their performance in written tests, skill tests, attendance and participation in the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102881,'PED1101','羽毛球','','PED - Physical Education','1101','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。羽毛球是体育模块中的课程之一。羽毛球是一项以球拍和羽毛球为器械的隔网对抗性运动项目。比赛在长方形场地上进行，运动员通过发球、击球和灵活移动，将球击过球网，以迫使对手无法有效回球得分。比赛形式分为单打（1 对 1）和双打（2 对 2）两种，适宜在室内场馆或室外无风环境开展。​本课程以体适能基础理论教学为核心，涵盖健身器材的规范使用方法、心肺功能锻炼策略以及肌肉适能训练技巧。同时，结合羽毛球运动技术与动作原理，系统教授正手握拍、反手握拍以及高远球、吊球、扣杀等核心击球技巧。通过理论讲解与针对性实践训练相结合的教学模式，帮助学生掌握羽毛球运动技能，提升身体素质，培养对羽毛球运动的兴趣，进而形成长期规律锻炼的健康生活习惯。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Badminton, a net-separated competitive sport, is played on a rectangular court. Athletes score by serving, striking the shuttlecock, and moving nimbly to send it over the net, leaving opponents unable to return it effectively. The game features two formats—singles (one-on-one) and doubles (two-on-two)—and can be conducted indoors or outdoors in windless environments. This course prioritizes fundamental physical fitness theories, covering proper fitness equipment usage, cardio respiratory training strategies, and muscle function techniques. It integrates badminton techniques with movement principles to systematically instruct core skills, including forehand and backhand grips, high clears, drop shots, and smashes. Through a blended teaching approach of theoretical instruction and targeted practice, the course aims to empower students to master badminton skills, boost physical fitness, foster an interest in the sport, and cultivate a lifelong habit of regular exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102882,'PED1102','把杆训练','','PED - Physical Education','1102','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。把杆是体育模块中的课程之一。把杆训练是一项融合普拉提核心控制、芭蕾基础站姿、心肺耐力训练与瑜伽拉伸的综合性健身课程。课程以体适能基础理论教学为核心，系统涵盖健身器材的规范使用方法、科学的心肺功能训练策略及肌肉力量训练技巧。借助弹力带、瑜伽球、把杆、哑铃等小型器械，配合富有节奏感的音乐，构建起创新的身体训练体系。课程通过针对性训练，实现纠正和改善体态、提升关节灵活度、优化肌肉线条的目标，重点雕琢手臂、臀腿线条，同时强化核心肌群稳定性。教学过程中，教师通过标准示范与专业引导，带领学生跟随音乐节拍完成指定动作与套路组合，配合每周辅助训练计划，帮助学生巩固学习成果。最终，将通过个性化考核方案，全面检验学生的训练成效。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Barre Training is one of courses in the Physical Education. Barre training is a comprehensive fitness program that integrates Pilates core control, basic ballet postures, cardio respiratory endurance training, and yoga stretching. Centered on fundamental physical fitness theories, the course systematically covers the proper use of fitness equipment, scientific strategies for cardio respiratory training, and techniques for muscle strength training. Leveraging small equipment such as resistance bands, yoga balls, ballet barres, dumbbells, and synchronized with rhythmic music, it establishes an innovative physical training system. Through targeted exercises, the course aims to correct and improve body posture, enhance joint flexibility, and refine muscle lines, with a focus on sculpting the arms, glutes, and legs while strengthening core stability. During instruction, instructors guide students through standardized demonstrations, leading them to execute specified movements and routines in rhythm with the music. Weekly training plans are also provided to reinforce learning outcomes. Finally, personalized assessment schemes will be employed to comprehensively evaluate students'' training effectiveness.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102883,'PED1103','篮球','','PED - Physical Education','1103','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。篮球是体育模块中的课程之一。篮球是一项团队运动项目，需要通过提高个人技术能力（如：运球、接传球、投篮）进而增强团队协作。并且融合了团队对抗以及个人对抗，既要求个人精湛的技术，又需要团队配合。本课程注重基础体适能基本理论（包括健身器材的正确使用、心肺耐力和肌肉力量）、篮球技术培养以及篮球比赛规则的学习。通过学习篮球脚步、接传球、投篮等基础技能，以及实战中攻防战术运用，培养学生核心运动能力，进而提升运动表现。通过对抗性实战练习以及个人技术挑战，让学生享受篮球运动的快乐同时也可以培养团队合作精神，提高体育道德。本课程的最终评估中，包含个人篮球技能测试和模拟实战。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Basketball is one of courses in the Physical Education. Basketball is a team sport that necessitates the enhancement of individual skill (like dribbling, passing, and shooting) and tactical abilities to bolster team collaboration. Combining strategic teamwork and competitive intensity, the sport demands both individual mastery and collective coordination. This course focuses on fundamental theories of physical fitness (including proper use of fitness equipment, cardiopulmonary fitness, and muscular fitness), technical skill development and official game regulations. Through basic basketball training drills, footwork passing, shooting, offensive and defensive strategies, students will build foundational competencies while boosting athletic performance. Through organized competitive exercises and skill challenges foster enjoyment of the basketball’s fast-paced nature while cultivating teamwork and sportsmanship. The final assessment of this course will be based on individual basketball skills tests and simulated practical matches.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
