(102886,'PED1104','地壶','','PED - Physical Education','1104','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。地壶球是体育模块中的课程之一。地壶是一项在光滑场地上进行的精准团队运动，运动员需要策略性地滑动地壶以确保得分位置或取代对手的地壶。作为传统冰壶运动的改良版，这项运动融合了身体精准性、团队战术配合和战略决策能力，需要将个人技能与团队战术完美结合。本课程重点讲解体适能的基本理论（包括健身器材的正确使用、心肺功能和肌肉功能）、地壶的八项核心技能（例如，撞壶出界、撞壶进营垒、打甩、冻结等）以及比赛礼仪（例如，出场次序管理和尊重的沟通）。通过结构化练习和模拟比赛，学生可以培养团队合作、领导能力、战略规划和沟通技巧，同时掌握这项运动的技巧和战术决策能力。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of the core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Floor curling is one of the courses in Physical Education. Floor curling is a precision team sport played on smooth surfaces, where players strategically slide stones to secure scoring positions or strategically displace opponents’ stones. As an accessible adaptation of traditional ice curling, this sport blends physical accuracy, tactical teamwork, and strategic decision-making, requiring seamless integration of individual skill and collaborative tactics. This course focuses on fundamental theories of physical fitness (including proper use of fitness equipment, cardiopulmonary fitness, and muscular fitness), 8 core skills of floor curling (e.g., guarding, takeouts, draws, etc.), and competition etiquette (e.g., time management and respectful communication). Through structured practice and simulated matches, students develop teamwork, leadership, strategic planning, and communication skills while mastering the sport’s blend of finesse and tactical decision-making.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102887,'PED1105','飞盘','','PED - Physical Education','1105','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。飞盘是体育模块中的课程之一。飞盘运动发展迅猛，参与者通过传接配合与争抢控制飞盘进行运动。该运动已超越休闲范畴，形成了多元化的竞技模式和完善的专业技术体系。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（包括身体成分分析与运动处方设计）与飞盘核心技术学习。核心技术内容包括：握盘方法、正/反手掷盘、双手合掌式接球、蟹钳式接盘、假动作技巧、颠倒盘掷盘以及攻防战术。学生将通过结构化学习掌握比赛实战技能，包括：摆脱防守技巧、区域防守轮换和得分区进攻跑位等专项练习。练习进度将通过精准度挑战（距离/角度）和实战比赛模拟对抗进行跟踪评估。 本课程超越基础体能训练，依托高强度小规模比赛和锦标赛模式模拟对抗，在提升运动表现的同时，同步培养团队协作、临场应变与抗压能力。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Frisbee is one of courses in the Physical Education.   Frisbee is a rapidly growing sport where players propel discs through the air, aiming for controlled catches by teammates or opponents. Evolving beyond its casual roots, the sport now encompasses diverse competitive formats and specialized techniques. This course focuses on applied physical fitness practices (including body composition analysis and exercise prescription design) and core Frisbee skills: grip method, forehand/backhand throws, two-handed pancake catches, crab-style receptions, deception maneuvers, hammer throws, and offensive/defensive positioning strategies. Students develop game scenario tactics through structured drills like mark evasion patterns, zone defense rotations, and end-zone cutting sequences. Progress is tracked via accuracy challenges (distance/angle benchmarks) and live gameplay simulations. Beyond physical training, the curriculum cultivates teamwork, adaptability, and resilience through high-intensity mini-games and tournament-style simulations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102888,'PED1106','高尔夫','','PED - Physical Education','1106','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。高尔夫是体育模块中的课程之一。高尔夫常被称为“绅士运动”，是一项需要高度专注和精湛技术的精准运动。它将竞技性与休闲性相结合，具有终身参与性和全球吸引力。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（包括健身器材的正确使用、心肺功能和肌肉力量）以及7号铁杆击球和果岭推杆的专项技术。通过分析和应用高尔夫的相关知识，学生可以加深对高尔夫理论的理解，同时提升技术熟练度，进而提高他们的运动技能水平和社交能力。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Golf is one of courses in the Physical Education. Golf, often called "the gentleman''s game," is a precision sport requiring intense focus and technical mastery. Blending competitive rigor with leisure, it offers lifelong engagement and global appeal. This course teaches fundamental theories of physical fitness (including proper use of fitness equipment, cardiopulmonary fitness, and muscular fitness) and specialized techniques for 7-iron approach shots, and green putting. By analyzing and applying the relevant knowledge of golf, students may deepen their understanding of golf theory while refining technical proficiency, they will improve their sports skills level and social skills.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102889,'PED1107','手球','','PED - Physical Education','1107','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。手球是体育模块中的课程之一。手球运动起源于欧洲，其兼具足球与橄榄球的特点，部分规则源自篮球。在比赛中，两队各派出七名球员（含一名守门员）在40×20米的场地上进行对抗。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（包括健身器材规范使用）及手球基础技能，并包含手球的发展历程、战术规则、裁判手势等，通过学习长/短距离传接球、射门及守门员技术等技术，使学生掌握专项运动技能，培养人际沟通能力与合作精神，弘扬体育精神，塑造积极进取、乐观向上的人生态度。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Handball is one of courses in the Physical Education.  Handball, a sport originating in Europe, combines elements of football and rugby, with some rules evolved from basketball. In official matches, two teams of seven players each (including one goalkeeper) compete on a 40m x 20m court. This course focuses on fundamental fitness theory (including proper use of gym equipment) and core handball skills – covering its history, tactics, rules, and referee signals. Through training in long/short-range passing/receiving, shooting, and goalkeeper techniques, students will master sport-specific abilities while developing interpersonal communication skills, collaborative spirit, and sportsmanship – ultimately cultivating a proactive, determined, and optimistic outlook on life.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
