(102891,'PED1109','定向越野','','PED - Physical Education','1109','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。定向越野是体育模块中的课程之一。它是一项集智力与体能于一体的时尚户外运动，在国际上被誉为“智者运动”。参与者使用地图和指南针，独立完成按照规定顺序找到地图上标注的若干地面检查点的任务，并完成整个比赛路线。本课程主要教授体适能的基本理论（包括健身器材的正确使用、心肺耐力和肌肉耐力知识），识别地形图和指南针，并在山地、公园和校园等各种地形中完成短距离定向越野赛、中距离路线赛和团队接力赛。学生能够掌握定向生存技能，培养良好的人际沟通能力和团队合作精神，并进一步形成积极、进取、乐观的生活态度。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Orienteering is one of courses in the Physical Education.  Orienteering is a fashionable outdoor sport that combines intelligence and physical fitness. It is known as the "sport for the wise" internationally. Participants use a map and a compass, independently complete the task of finding several ground checkpoints marked on the map in the prescribed order and finish the entire race course. This course mainly focuses on learning fundamental theories of physical fitness (including proper use of fitness equipment, cardiopulmonary fitness, and muscular fitness), recognizing topographic maps and compasses, and completing short-distance orienteering races, medium-distance route races and team relay races in various terrains such as mountains, park, and campuses. Students can master the orienteering and survival skills, build good interpersonal communication skills and a spirit of cooperation, and further form a positive, enterprising, and optimistic attitude towards life.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102892,'PED1110','匹克球','','PED - Physical Education','1110','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。匹克球是体育模块中的课程之一。它是一种类似于网球的球类运动，融合了网球、羽毛球和乒乓球的元素。球场大小与羽毛球场地相同，2 至 4 名选手使用复合材料制成的球拍击打带孔的塑料球。本课程主要教授体适能的基本理论（包括健身器材的正确使用、心肺耐力和肌肉耐力知识）、匹克球的基本理论知识（特点、发展概况、基本技术和基本战术）、四种击球方式（丁克球、截击、底线击球和发球）、匹克球比赛和规则以及其他基本理论知识。通过本课程，学生将基本掌握四种击球方式，具备参加匹克球比赛的能力，并养成终身锻炼的习惯。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Pickleball is one of courses in the Physical Education.  Pickleball is a ball sport similar to tennis, combining elements of tennis, badminton and table tennis. The court size is the same as that of a badminton court, and 2-4 players use solid rackets made of composite materials to hit a perforated polymer ball. This course mainly teaches the fundamental theories of physical fitness (including proper use of fitness equipment, cardiopulmonary fitness, and muscular fitness), the basic theoretical knowledge of pickleball (characteristics, development overview, basic techniques and basic tactics), four types of technique (dink, volley, groundstroke and serve), pickleball competition and rules, and other basic knowledge. Through the course, students will basically master the four types of pickleball techniques, have the ability to participate in pickleball competitions, and develop the habit of lifelong exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
