(102903,'PED1121','排球','','PED - Physical Education','1121','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。排球是体育模块中的课程之一。排球运动起源于19世纪末的美国，其核心在于运用发球、传球（垫球/二传）、扣球、拦网等技术组织进攻与防守。本排球课程主要教授体适能基本理论（包括健身器材规范使用）以及排球的五大基本技术（垫球、传球、发球、扣球和拦网）。通过系统学习这些基础动作与技能，学生不仅能掌握排球运动技巧，更能培养良好的心理素质、人际交往能力与团队协作精神，同时进一步弘扬体育精神，塑造积极进取、乐观向上的人生态度。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Volleyball is one of courses in the Physical Education.  Volleyball, originating in the United States in the late 19th century, centers on organizing offense and defense through based techniques like serving, passing (forearm pass and overhead pass/setting), spiking, and blocking. This course emphasizes fundamental fitness theory (including proper usage of gym equipment) and volleyball’s five core skills: serving, blocking, spiking, forearm and overhand passing. Through systematic training in these basic skills, students will not only master volleyball techniques but also develop mental resilience, interpersonal skills, and teamwork. Simultaneously, they will foster sportsmanship and cultivate a proactive, determined, and optimistic outlook on life.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102904,'PED1122','武术散打','','PED - Physical Education','1122','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No prerequisites.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。武术散打是体育模块中的课程之一。武术散打是从传统武术技术发展而来的现代徒手格斗运动，主要使用踢、拳、摔和防御技术。 本课程主要学习体适能基本理论（包括正确使用健身器材、心肺功能和肌肉适能）和散打的技、战术。 通过系统的训练，学生将掌握包括腿法、拳击和摔法在内的散打基本技术，同时了解防守和进攻策略。 课程包括基本技能训练、组合技术练习、实战和战术运用。 通过本课程的学习，学生将增强体质，提高自卫防身能力，并培养坚忍不拔的品质。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of the core courses at the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Wushu Sanda is one of the courses in Physical Education. Wushu Sanda is a modern unarmed combat sport developed from traditional wushu techniques and primarily uses kicking, boxing, wrestling, and defensive techniques. This course focuses on fundamental theories of physical fitness (including proper use of fitness equipment, cardiopulmonary fitness, and muscular fitness) and the techniques/tactics of Sanda. Through systematic training, students will master fundamental Sanda techniques, including kicking, boxing, and takedowns, while understanding defensive and offensive strategies. The course includes basic skill training, combination techniques practice, sparring, and tactical application. Through this course, students will enhance their physical fitness, improve their self-defense skills, and develop the quality of perseverance.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102905,'PED1123','瑜伽','','PED - Physical Education','1123','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。瑜伽是体育模块中的课程之一。瑜伽是一种能够提升身体健康和心理福祉的运动，能够培养对健康生活方式的终身兴趣，并支持学生的全面发展。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（包括健身器材的正确使用、心肺功能和肌肉力量）以及瑜伽的基础知识。它可以帮助学生掌握基本的体式、呼吸技巧以及拜日式（Surya Namaskar）的基本流程。通过开放式的教学方法和结合理论与实践的探究式教学方式，课程鼓励学生积极主动地参与实践和日常锻炼。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Yoga is one of courses in the Physical Education. Yoga is a sport that improve physical fitness and mental well-being, foster a lifelong interest in wellness, and support students'' holistic development. This course mainly teaches the fundamental theories of physical fitness (including proper use of fitness equipment, cardiopulmonary fitness, and muscular fitness) and the basic knowledge of Yoga. It can help students to master the basic poses, breathing techniques, and the basic flow of Surya Namaskar. Through an open teaching method and inquiry-based teaching approach that combines theory with practice, it encourages students to actively and proactively engage in practice and daily exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102906,'PED1201','羽毛球','','PED - Physical Education','1201','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。羽毛球是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。羽毛球是一项以球拍和羽毛球为器械的隔网对抗性运动项目。比赛在长方形场地上进行，运动员通过发球、击球和灵活移动，将球击过球网，以迫使对手无法有效回球得分。比赛形式分为单打（1 对 1）和双打（2 对 2）两种，适宜在室内场馆或室外无风环境开展。​本课程以体适能基础理论教学为核心（涵盖身体成分等），结合羽毛球运动技术与动作原理，系统教授正手握拍、反手握拍以及高远球、吊球、扣杀等核心击球技巧。通过理论讲解与针对性实践训练相结合的教学模式，帮助学生掌握羽毛球运动技能，提升身体素质，培养对羽毛球运动的兴趣，进而形成长期规律锻炼的健康生活习惯。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Badminton, a net-separated competitive sport, is played on a rectangular court. Athletes score by serving, striking the shuttlecock, and moving nimbly to send it over the net, leaving opponents unable to return it effectively. The game features two formats—singles (one-on-one) and doubles (two-on-two)—and can be conducted indoors or outdoors in windless environments. This course prioritizes fundamental physical fitness theories (including body composition, etc), and integrates badminton techniques with movement principles to systematically instruct core skills, including forehand and backhand grips, high clears, drop shots, and smashes. Through a blended teaching approach of theoretical instruction and targeted practice, the course aims to empower students to master badminton skills, boost physical fitness, foster an interest in the sport, and cultivate a lifelong habit of regular exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102907,'PED1202','把杆训练','','PED - Physical Education','1202','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。把杆是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。把杆训练是一项融合普拉提核心控制、芭蕾基础站姿、心肺耐力训练与瑜伽拉伸的综合性健身课程。课程以体适能基础理论教学为核心（涵盖身体成分等），科学的心肺功能训练策略及肌肉力量训练技巧。借助弹力带、瑜伽球、把杆、哑铃等小型器械，配合富有节奏感的音乐，构建起创新的身体训练体系。课程通过针对性训练，实现纠正和改善体态、提升关节灵活度、优化肌肉线条的目标，重点雕琢手臂、臀腿线条，同时强化核心肌群稳定性。教学过程中，教师通过标准示范与专业引导，带领学生跟随音乐节拍完成指定动作与套路组合，配合每周辅助训练计划，帮助学生巩固学习成果。最终，将通过个性化考核方案，全面检验学生的训练成效。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Barre Training is one of courses in the Fitness and Health. Barre training is a comprehensive fitness program that integrates Pilates core control, basic ballet postures, cardio respiratory endurance training, and yoga stretching. Centered on fundamental physical fitness theories( including body composition, etc), scientific strategies for cardio respiratory training, and techniques for muscle strength training. Leveraging small equipment such as resistance bands, yoga balls, ballet barres, dumbbells, and synchronized with rhythmic music, it establishes an innovative physical training system. Through targeted exercises, the course aims to correct and improve body posture, enhance joint flexibility, and refine muscle lines, with a focus on sculpting the arms, glutes, and legs while strengthening core stability. During instruction, instructors guide students through standardized demonstrations, leading them to execute specified movements and routines in rhythm with the music. Weekly training plans are also provided to reinforce learning outcomes. Finally, personalized assessment schemes will be employed to comprehensively evaluate students'' training effectiveness.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102908,'PED1203','篮球','','PED - Physical Education','1203','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。篮球是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。篮球是一项团队运动项目，需要通过提高个人技术能力（如：运球、接传球、投篮）进而增强团队协作。并且融合了团队对抗以及个人对抗，既要求个人精湛的技术，又需要团队配合。本课程注重基础体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）、篮球技术培养以及篮球比赛规则的学习。通过学习篮球脚步、接传球、投篮等基础技能，以及实战中攻防战术运用，培养学生核心运动能力，进而提升运动表现。通过对抗性实战练习以及个人技术挑战，让学生享受篮球运动的快乐同时也可以培养团队合作精神，提高体育道德。本课程的最终评估中，包含个人篮球技能测试和模拟实战。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Basketball is one
of  courses in the Fitness and Health. Basketball is a team sport that necessitates the enhancement of individual skill (like dribbling, passing, and shooting) and tactical abilities to bolster team collaboration. Combining strategic teamwork and competitive intensity, the sport demands both individual mastery and collective coordination. This course focuses on fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc), technical skill development and official game regulations. Through basic basketball training drills, footwork  passing, shooting, offensive and defensive strategies, students will build foundational competencies while boosting athletic performance. Through organized competitive exercises and skill challenges foster enjoyment of the basketball’s fast-paced nature while cultivating teamwork and sportsmanship. The final assessment of this course will be based on individual basketball skills tests and simulated practical matches.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102909,'PED1204','地壶','','PED - Physical Education','1204','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。匹克球是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。地壶是一项在光滑场地上进行的精准团队运动，运动员需要策略性地滑动地壶以确保得分位置或取代对手的地壶。作为传统冰壶运动的改良版，这项运动融合了身体精准性、团队战术配合和战略决策能力，需要将个人技能与团队战术完美结合。本课程重点讲解体适能的基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）、地壶的八项核心技能（例如，撞壶出界、撞壶进营垒、打甩、冻结等）以及比赛礼仪（例如，出场次序管理和尊重的沟通）。通过结构化练习和模拟比赛，学生可以培养团队合作、领导能力、战略规划和沟通技巧，同时掌握这项运动的技巧和战术决策能力。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of the core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Floor curling is one of the  courses in Fitness and Health. Floor curling is a precision team sport played on smooth surfaces, where players strategically slide stones to secure scoring positions or strategically displace opponents’ stones. As an accessible adaptation of traditional ice curling, this sport blends physical accuracy, tactical teamwork, and strategic decision-making, requiring seamless integration of individual skill and collaborative tactics. This course focuses on fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc), 8 core skills of floor curling (e.g., guarding, takeouts, draws, etc.), and competition etiquette (e.g., time management and respectful communication). Through structured practice and simulated matches, students develop teamwork, leadership, strategic planning, and communication skills while mastering the sport’s blend of finesse and tactical decision-making.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102910,'PED1205','飞盘','','PED - Physical Education','1205','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）体适能与健康。飞盘是体适能与健康模块中的课程之一。飞盘运动发展迅猛，参与者通过传接配合与争抢控制飞盘进行运动。该运动已超越休闲范畴，形成了多元化的竞技模式和完善的专业技术体系。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（包括身体成分分析与运动处方设计）与飞盘核心技术学习。核心技术内容包括：握盘方法、正/反手掷盘、双手合掌式接球、蟹钳式接盘、假动作技巧、颠倒盘掷盘以及攻防战术。学生将通过结构化学习掌握比赛实战技能，包括：摆脱防守技巧、区域防守轮换和得分区进攻跑位等专项练习。练习进度将通过精准度挑战（距离/角度）和实战比赛模拟对抗进行跟踪评估。 本课程超越基础体能训练，依托高强度小规模比赛和锦标赛模式模拟对抗，在提升运动表现的同时，同步培养团队协作、临场应变与抗压能力。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Frisbee is one of  courses in the Fitness and Health.   Frisbee is a rapidly growing sport where players propel discs through the air, aiming for controlled catches by teammates or opponents. Evolving beyond its casual roots, the sport now encompasses diverse competitive formats and specialized techniques. This course focuses on applied physical fitness practices (including body composition analysis and exercise prescription design) and core Frisbee skills: grip method, forehand/backhand throws, two-handed pancake catches, crab-style receptions, deception maneuvers, hammer throws, and offensive/defensive positioning strategies. Students develop game scenario tactics through structured drills like mark evasion patterns, zone defense rotations, and end-zone cutting sequences. Progress is tracked via accuracy challenges (distance/angle benchmarks) and live gameplay simulations. Beyond physical training, the curriculum cultivates teamwork, adaptability, and resilience through high-intensity mini-games and tournament-style simulations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102911,'PED1206','高尔夫','','PED - Physical Education','1206','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。高尔夫是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。高尔夫常被称为“绅士运动”，是一项需要高度专注和精湛技术的精准运动。它将竞技性与休闲性相结合，具有终身参与性和全球吸引力。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）以及7号铁杆击球和果岭推杆的专项技术。通过分析和应用高尔夫的相关知识，学生可以加深对高尔夫理论的理解，同时提升技术熟练度，进而提高他们的运动技能水平和社交能力。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Golf is one of   courses in the Fitness and Health. Golf, often called "the gentleman''s game," is a precision sport requiring intense focus and technical mastery. Blending competitive rigor with leisure, it offers lifelong engagement and global appeal. This course teaches fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc) and specialized techniques for 7-iron approach shots, and green putting. By analyzing and applying the relevant knowledge of golf, students may deepen their understanding of golf theory while refining technical proficiency, they will improve their sports skills level and social skills.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102912,'PED1207','Handball','','PED - Physical Education','1207','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','ghost_outline_unavailable','',NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,'0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102913,'PED1208','综合格斗','','PED - Physical Education','1208','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。综合格斗是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。综合格斗，即MMA (Mixed Martial Arts) ，是一项竞技格斗运动，比赛中运动员可以使用拳击、泰拳、摔跤、巴西柔术、跆拳道等多种格斗技术。本课程主要学习体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等））和拳法、腿法、肘膝、摔法、地面技术、组合技术、防身术等技术内容，并结合体能训练提升学生的体适能水平。学生通过本课程可以学习基本的综合格斗技术，以提高体适能水平，并掌握MMA理论和竞赛规则。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Mixed Martial Arts is one of courses in the Fitness and Health. Mixed Martial Arts (MMA) is a combat sport where athletes can utilize various fighting techniques, including boxing, Muay Thai, wrestling, Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu, and Taekwondo. This course focuses on fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc) and  learning techniques such as boxing, kicks, elbows, knees, takedowns, ground techniques, combinations, self-defense, and physical conditioning to enhance students'' fitness levels. Through this course, students will learn the basic techniques of MMA to improve their fitness and understand MMA theory and competition rules.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102914,'PED1209','定向越野','','PED - Physical Education','1209','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。定向越野是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。它是一项集智力与体能于一体的时尚户外运动，在国际上被誉为“智者运动”。参与者使用地图和指南针，独立完成按照规定顺序找到地图上标注的若干地面检查点的任务，并完成整个比赛路线。本课程主要教授体适能的基本理论（涵盖身体成分等），识别地形图和指南针，并在山地、公园和校园等各种地形中完成短距离定向越野赛、中距离路线赛和团队接力赛。学生能够掌握定向生存技能，培养良好的人际沟通能力和团队合作精神，并进一步形成积极、进取、乐观的生活态度。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Orienteering is one
of courses in the Fitness and Health.  Orienteering is a fashionable outdoor sport that combines intelligence and physical fitness. It is known as the "sport for the wise" internationally. Participants use a map and a compass, independently complete the task of finding several ground checkpoints marked on the map in the prescribed order and finish the entire race course. This course mainly focuses on learning fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc), recognizing topographic maps and compasses, and completing short-distance orienteering races, medium-distance route races and team relay races in various terrains such as mountains, park, and campuses. Students can master the orienteering and survival skills, build good interpersonal communication skills and a spirit of cooperation, and further form a positive, enterprising, and optimistic attitude towards life.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102915,'PED1210','匹克球','','PED - Physical Education','1210','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。匹克球是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。它是一种类似于网球的球类运动，融合了网球、羽毛球和乒乓球的元素。球场大小与羽毛球场地相同，2 至 4 名选手使用复合材料制成的球拍击打带孔的塑料球。本课程主要教授体适能的基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）、匹克球的基本理论知识（特点、发展概况、基本技术和基本战术）、四种击球方式（丁克球、截击、底线击球和发球）、匹克球比赛和规则以及其他基本理论知识。通过本课程，学生将基本掌握四种击球方式，具备参加匹克球比赛的能力，并养成终身锻炼的习惯。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Pickleball is one
of courses in the Fitness and Health.  Pickleball is a ball sport similar to tennis, combining elements of tennis, badminton and table tennis. The court size is the same as that of a badminton court, and 2-4 players use solid rackets made of composite materials to hit a perforated polymer ball. This course mainly teaches the fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc), the basic theoretical knowledge of pickleball (characteristics, development overview, basic techniques and basic tactics), four types of technique (dink, volley, groundstroke and serve), pickleball competition and rules, and other basic knowledge. Through the course, students will basically master the four types of pickleball techniques, have the ability to participate in pickleball competitions, and develop the habit of lifelong exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
