(102918,'PED1213','足球','','PED - Physical Education','1213','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。足球是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。足球被誉为“世界第一运动”，是一项主要用脚完成技术动作为核心的团队竞技运动。比赛由两队进行对抗，以攻入对方球门的进球数决定胜负。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）和足球基础理论与专项技能：学习足球运动发展历史、核心规则及实践技术（如控运球、传球、射门等）。课程旨在激发学生对足球运动的兴趣与爱好，促进身心健康发展，并培养团队协作意识与能力。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Soccer is one of  courses in the Fitness and Health.   Soccer is known as the "world''s number one sport", mainly using feet to complete technical movements. Two teams compete against each other, and the winner is determined by the number of goals scored in the opponent''s goal. This course mainly focuses on learning applied physical fitness practices (including body composition analysis, etc) and the basic knowledge and specialized techniques of soccer. By learning the basic movements such as dribbling, controlling, passing and shooting in soccer, as well as the development history, tactics and rules of soccer, it aims to cultivate students'' interest and love for this sport, promote their all-round physical and mental health development, and at the same time, develop their teamwork ability.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102919,'PED1214','蛙泳','','PED - Physical Education','1214','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康是香港中文大学（深圳）的核心课程之一。它由两部分组成，即：(i) 体育；(ii) 适能与健康。蛙泳是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。蛙泳是一种对称的游泳方式，以其独特的节奏感而闻名，虽然入门相对简单，但要达到精通的水平却颇具挑战性。本课程将融入体适能理论的相关内容，包括身体成分等，同时结合运动学原理和水上安全技能进行教学。学生将掌握基本的水中技术动作，规范标准的蛙泳泳姿，提升水中生存技能。此外，课程还将注重培养学生的水中自我保护意识和终身锻炼的习惯。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Breaststroke is one of courses in the Fitness and Health. Breaststroke is a symmetrical swimming style known for its unique rhythm; while it is relatively easy to learn, Mastering it can be challenging. This course will incorporate fitness theory, including body composition etc, with principles of kinesiology and water safety skills. Students will learn fundamental underwater techniques, standardize their breaststroke form, and enhance their water survival skills in water. Additionally, the course will also focus on developing students’ self-protection awareness and encourage them to foster lifelong exercise habits.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102920,'PED1215','自由泳','','PED - Physical Education','1215','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康是香港中文大学（深圳）的核心课程之一。它由两部分组成，即：(i) 体育；(ii) 适能与健康。自由泳是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。自由泳（亦称为爬泳）是游泳运动中速度最快泳姿。它强调流线型的身体姿态、高效推进力与呼吸节奏的协调与整合。本课程将融入体适能理论的相关内容，包括身体成分等，同时结合运动学原理和水上安全技能的教学。通过系统化的教学，课程将传授自由泳的基本动作及关键技术要点，帮助学生掌握标准的技术动作，提升自由泳表现和水中生存能力，并培养终身参与体育锻炼的习惯。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Freestyle is one of  courses in the Fitness and Health.. Freestyle (also known as front crawl) is the fastest swimming stroke in the sport. It emphasizes a streamlined body position, efficient propulsion, and the coordination and integration of breathing rhythm.This course will incorporate fitness theory, including body composition etc, with principles of kinesiology and water safety skills.Through a systematic teaching approach, the course will cover the basic movements and key technical points of freestyle, helping students master standard techniques, enhance their freestyle performance, and improve their water survival skills, while also fostering lifelong habits of physical exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102921,'PED1216','乒乓球','','PED - Physical Education','1216','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。乒乓球是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。乒乓球是一项以敏捷性为中心的运动，能够全面检验一个人的身体、心理和智力能力。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）以及乒乓球的基本理论知识。它可以帮助学生学习和掌握正手进攻、反手推挡和搓球等基本技术。通过开放式的教学方法和结合理论与实践的探究式教学方式，鼓励学生积极主动地参与实践和日常锻炼。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Table Tennis is one of  courses in the Fitness and Health. Table tennis is a sport that centers on agility and provides a comprehensive test of one''s physical, mental and intellectual abilities. This course mainly teaches the fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc) and the basic knowledge of table tennis. It can help students learn and master the basic techniques of forehand attack, backhand push and chop. Through an open teaching method and inquiry-based teaching approach that combines theory with practice, it encourages students to actively and proactively engage in practice and daily exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102922,'PED1217','跆拳道','','PED - Physical Education','1217','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。跆拳道是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。 跆拳道是一项主要使用拳、脚技术进行实战或比赛的体育运动。跆拳道具有极高的防身自卫和强身健体价值。 本课程主要学习体适能的基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）和跆拳道技、战术。 通过学习跆拳道技术、品势、自卫术、击破、实战等内容，使学生掌握跆拳道的基本技能，了解跆拳道运动，学习跆拳道精神，并养成良好的锻炼习惯，从而达到强身健体的目的。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of the core courses at the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Taekwondo is one of the courses in the Fitness and Health. Taekwondo is a sport that mainly uses kicking and boxing techniques for combat or competition. It has high practical value for self-defense and physical fitness. This course mainly focuses on learning the fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc) and the taekwondo techniques. Through learning taekwondo competition techniques, poomsae, self-defense, breaking, and sparring, students can master basic taekwondo skills, understand the sport of taekwondo, learn the spirit of taekwondo, develop good exercise habits, and achieve the goal of strengthening the body during the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102923,'PED1218','太极','','PED - Physical Education','1218','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。太极是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。太极是一门融合传统与现代的高校体育课程，是一种集武术与气功于一体的健身运动。它通过缓慢连贯的动作调节呼吸、放松身心，从而达到强身健体的功效。除身体锻炼外，太极还能提升逻辑思维能力、记忆力、创造力等多方面素质。本课程主要学习体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）和太极拳基本功、太极拳习练益处、太极拳相关训练以及树立积极参与运动的态度等。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Tai Chi is one of  courses in the Fitness and Health.  Tai Chi is a physical education course in universities that combines tradition and modernity. It is a fitness exercise that integrates martial arts and Qigong, regulating breathing and relaxing the body and mind through slow and continuous movements to achieve the effect of strengthening the body and improving health. Besides physical exercise, Tai Chi can also enhance logical thinking ability, memory, creativity and other aspects. The content of this course includes: fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc), basic skills of Tai Chi Chuan, benefits of practicing Tai Chi Chuan, Tai Chi Chuan related fitness and establishing a positive attitude towards sports participation, etc.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
