(102926,'PED1221','排球','','PED - Physical Education','1221','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。排球是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。排球运动起源于19世纪末的美国，其核心在于运用发球、传球（垫球/二传）、扣球、拦网等技术组织进攻与防守。本排球课程主要教授体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）以及排球的五大基本技术（垫球、传球、发球、扣球和拦网）。通过系统学习这些基础动作与技能，学生不仅能掌握排球运动技巧，更能培养良好的心理素质、人际交往能力与团队协作精神，同时进一步弘扬体育精神，塑造积极进取、乐观向上的人生态度。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Volleyball is one
of  courses in the Fitness and Health.  Volleyball, originating in the United States in the late 19th century, centers on organizing offense and defense through based techniques like serving, passing (forearm pass and overhead pass/setting), spiking, and blocking. This course emphasizes fundamental fitness theory (including body composition, etc) and volleyball’s five core skills: serving, blocking, spiking, forearm and overhand passing. Through systematic training in these basic skills, students will not only master volleyball techniques but also develop mental resilience, interpersonal skills, and teamwork. Simultaneously, they will foster sportsmanship and cultivate a proactive, determined, and optimistic outlook on life.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
