(102928,'PED1223','瑜伽','','PED - Physical Education','1223','P',1.00,1000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','体育与健康课程是香港中文大学（深圳）的一门核心课程，它分为两个部分，即：（一）体育，（二）适能与健康。瑜伽是适能与健康模块中的课程之一。瑜伽是一种能够提升身体健康和心理福祉的运动，能够培养对健康生活方式的终身兴趣，并支持学生的全面发展。本课程主要教授体适能基本理论（涵盖身体成分等）以及瑜伽的基础知识。它可以帮助学生掌握基本的体式、呼吸技巧以及拜日式（Surya Namaskar）的基本流程。通过开放式的教学方法和结合理论与实践的探究式教学方式，课程鼓励学生积极主动地参与实践和日常锻炼。','Physical Education (PE) and Health is one of core courses in the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. It consists of two sections, namely: (i) PE, and (ii) Fitness and Health. Yoga is one of  courses in the Fitness and Health. Yoga is a sport that improve physical fitness and mental well-being, foster a lifelong interest in wellness, and support students'' holistic development. This course mainly teaches the fundamental theories of physical fitness (including body composition, etc) and the basic knowledge of Yoga. It can help students to master the basic poses, breathing techniques, and the basic flow of Surya Namaskar. Through an open teaching method and inquiry-based teaching approach that combines theory with practice, it encourages students to actively and proactively engage in practice and daily exercise.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
