(102934,'PED2006','篮球','','PED - Physical Education','2006','P',2.00,2000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2019-20 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No Co-prerequisite.','篮球是一项团队运动项目，通过提高个人能力进行团队协作。篮球运动可以有效提高个人综合身体素质，增强信心，强化团队合作意识，是一项培养学生坚强意志品质及团队合作的首选运动。本课程涵盖了篮球项目的发展历史、规则以及适合大学的基本技术训练方法。通过学生的学习及训练，培养对篮球运动的兴趣及爱好，为学生终身体育运动奠定基础。','Basketball is a team game in which you can help your team by improving your individual skills. Basketball requires integration of individual talent into unselfish team play. It requires the sound execution of fundamental skills, which, once learned, can be connected to the entire game. Basketball drills instill confidence, transfer skills to game situations, and contribute to long-term enjoyment. This course have included a great deal of basic theory and common sense of basketball related to rules, history development, and basic skill drills at the university level. To train the students’ interests in basketball and make them lay a foundation for the lifelong physical education.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102935,'PED2007','点球成金：体育产业与管理','','PED - Physical Education','2007','P',2.00,2000,'PE','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2','No prerequisites.','No co-prerequisite.','本课程将向学生介绍有关体育产业和体育管理的各个方面，包括对管理、领导和组织行为理论的理解，以及这些理论在体育企业中的应用。学生还将学习不同体育管理职能领域的原理和应用，包括体育市场营销、体育消费者行为、体育传播、体育产业中的金融、经济与创业，以及体育赛事和设施管理。此外，本课程还将运用国际视角向学生介绍不同的体育领域，包括校际竞技体育、职业体育、国际体育管理与治理，以及体育领域的新兴发展。','This course will introduce students to the various aspects of sport industry and sport management, including an understanding of management, leadership, and organizational behavior theories and how these theories are applied in sport enterprises. Students will also learn principles and applications regarding different sport management function areas, including sport marketing, consumer behavior, sport communication, finance and economics and entrepreneurship in the sport industry, and sport event and facility management. Besides, this course will apply international perspectives to introduce students to diverse sport sites, including intercollegiate athletics, professional sport, international sport management and governance, and emerging developments in sport.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
