(102982,'PHM3015','中医药及天然药物','Traditional Chinese Medicine and Natural Drugs','PHM - Pharmaceutical Science','3015','P',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程旨在介绍中医基础理论和常用草药的药剂学。课程将讨论药材的自然产地、采收及其与药效的关系、药材炮制的目的和方法、常用中药材的应用、鉴定过程中使用设备的介绍和演示、常用天然产物的介绍、和药代动力学等，以及药物效应动力学和草药-药物潜在的相互作用机制。课程还将介绍利用现代药理学和药物化学研究药用植物学的理论和方法。完成本课程后，学生将了解中药基础知识，并将天然药物药剂学知识应用于中药成分新药开发。','This course aims to introduce the basic theories of Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) and the pharmaceutics of commonly used herbal medicines. Topics like natural habitat and harvesting of medicinal materials and their relation to pharmaceutical efficacy, purposes and methods of processing crude medicines, applications of common Chinese Materia Medica, introduction and demonstration using equipment for authentication procedures, Introduction of commonly used natural products, and pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic interactions and mechanisms of potential herb-drug interaction will be discussed. The theories and methods using modern pharmacology and pharmaceutical chemistry in studying medicinal botany will also be introduced. Upon completion of this course, students are expected to understand the basics of TCM and apply the knowledge of pharmaceutics of natural drugs in new drug development with TCM components.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102983,'PHM3017','药物基因组学','Pharmacogenomics','PHM - Pharmaceutical Science','3017','P',2.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','None.','None.','课程将深入探讨基因对药物反应的影响，并结合实际案例进行实操。学生将学习基因型与药物代谢、靶标和作用机制之间的关系，并通过分析基因变异如何影响个体对药物的反应来加深理解。课程还将介绍如何利用实验室技术和计算方法来评估个体的药物反应基因型，以及如何将这些信息应用于临床实践中。通过实际案例分析和实验操作，学生将获得在药物基因组学领域的实际技能和经验。','This course will delve into the impact of genes on drug responses and incorporate hands-on practical components. Students will learn about the relationship between genotype and drug metabolism, targets, and mechanisms of action, deepening their understanding through analysis of how genetic variations affect individual responses to drugs. The course will also cover laboratorisy techniques and computational methods for assessing individual drug response genotypes and applying this information in clinical practice. Through case studies and practical exercises, students will gain real-world skills and experience in the field of pharmacogenomics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102984,'PHM3018','药学科学与药物发现中的人工智能','AI in Pharmaceutical Science and Drug Discovery','PHM - Pharmaceutical Science','3018','P',1.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','',NULL,'BIO1001; CHM1001','None','人工智能 (AI) 正在改变药学科学领域包括药物设计和筛选、化学合成和药物再利用，同时也在改变药剂师提供服务的方式。本入门课程侧重介绍人工智能在制药科学、药物发现和药学实践中的应用。该课程要求学生有一定的基础化学和生物学知识基础。','Artificial intelligence (AI) is revolutionizing the field of pharmaceutical sciences including drug design and screening, chemical synthesis and drug repurposing. AI is also changing the way pharmacists deliver care. This introductory course focuses on AI applications in areas of pharmaceutical sciences, drug discovery and pharmacy practice. Prior knowledge in basic chemistry and biology is required.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102985,'PHM4001','毕业设计项目','','PHM - Pharmaceutical Science','4001','P',4.00,4000,'Major','已评分','论题研究','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程旨在增强本科生对于药学相关科学研究的认识，并开展针对性的科学研究培养和实训，包括文献查阅，课题设计讨论，实验技能训练，及课题项目的进展及汇报答辩等。本课程鼓励学生根据兴趣选择不同药学领域的实习基地和培养导师，经过本课程的培养，学生将初步掌握药学相关科学研究和项目开发的实践方法，能在科研实训的过程中，将所学的课堂知识融会贯通于毕业设计实践中，并得以吸收和升华。 学生将较全面地掌握本专业的基本理论知识和专业科研技能，培养分析、解决实际科学问题的能力和较高的综合科研素质。','This course aims to enhance undergraduates'' understanding of pharmaceutical-related scientific research and to carry out targeted scientific research training and practice, including literature review, project design discussion, experimental skills training, and project progress and report defense. This course encourages students to choose internship bases and training mentors in different pharmacy fields according to their interests. Through the cultivation of this course, students will have a preliminary grasp of practical methods for pharmaceutical related scientific research and project development. They will be able to integrate the classroom knowledge they have learned into their graduation project practice during scientific research and practical training, and be able to absorb and elevate it.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(102986,'PHM4003','生物技术制药与实验','','PHM - Pharmaceutical Science','4003','P',2.00,4000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','医学院','医学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','None.','None.','本课程让学生了解药学研究中的当前生物制药的关键知识和技术。它涵盖了生物技术制药过程中涉及的药物设计、合成与生产、筛选与评价及应用，并且包括新兴生物制药技术合理药物递送方式、部分生物技术制药相关实验等。本课程将介绍不同生物技术与实验用于制药的案例，学生将在其中了解生物技术制药研究现状及相关技术操作。','This course provides students with an understanding of the main knowledge and technology in biopharmaceuticals. It covers drug design, synthesis and production, screening and evaluation, and applications involved in the biotech-based drug development process, and includes rational drug delivery of novel biopharmaceutical technologies, as well as representative experiments related to biopharmaceuticals. The course will introduce cases of representative biotechnologies and experiments used in biopharmaceuticals, from which students will learn the current status of biotech-based pharmaceutical research and related technical operations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
