2026-27 Term 1','','MAT1001:Calculus I','这是一门基于微积分的力学为主的基础工程物理课程，内容包括：力学中使用的物理单位和矢量概念，力和运动，功和动能，势能和能量守恒，动量和冲量，力矩和转动，力的平衡和弹性，流体，振动和机械波。','This is an introductory calculus-based engineering physics course focusing on mechanics. Topics include: units and vectors in mechanics, force and motion, work and kinetic energy, potential energy and conservation of energy, momentum and impulse, torque, essential ideas in rotation, equilibrium and elasticity, oscillations and waves.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
