2022-23 Term 1','','','这是一门基础工程物理课程，内容包括：力学中使用的物理单位和矢量概念，力和运动，功和动能，势能和能量守恒，动量和冲量，力矩和转动，力的平衡和弹性，流体，电磁学，热力学等。','This is an introductory engineering physics course focusing on mechanics. Topics include: mechanics, force and motion, work and kinetic energy, potential energy and conservation of energy, momentum and impulse, torque, essential ideas in rotation, equilibrium and elasticity, electric and magnetism and thermodynamics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
