2021-22 Summer','','None','这是一门以热学、电磁学为主的物理专业入门科目，内容包括：温度和热、热力学第一、第二定律、卡诺循环、熵、麦克斯韦-玻尔兹曼分布、电荷、电荷守恒、库仑定律、电场、电通量、高斯定律、电势、磁场、毕奥萨伐尔定律、安培定律、电磁感应、位移电流、麦克斯韦方程、电磁波。','This is an introductory physics major course focusing on elementary thermodynamics and electromagnetism. Topics include: temperature and heat, first and second laws of thermodynamics, Carnot cycle, entropy, Maxwell-Boltzmann distribution, charge and charge conservation, Coulomb’s law, electric field and flux, Gauss’s law, electric potential, magnetic field, law of Biot and Savart, Ampere’s law, electromagnetic induction, displacement current, Maxwell’s equations, electromagnetic wave.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103008,'PHY1011','力学荣誉课程','Honours Mechanics','PHY - Physics','1011','P',3.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','\\','\\','这是一门基于微积分的力学为主的基础工程物理高阶荣誉课程，内容包括：力学中使用的物理单位和矢量概念，力和运动，功和动能，势能和能量守恒，动量和冲量，力矩和转动，力的平衡和弹性，流体，振动和机械波。','This is an advanced introductory calculus-based engineering physics course focusing on mechanics. Topics include: units and vectors in mechanics, force and motion, work and kinetic energy, potential energy and conservation of energy, momentum and impulse, torque, essential ideas in rotation, equilibrium and elasticity, oscillations and waves.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
