2026-27 Term 1','None.','None.','本科以小组形式，提供学生为本的学习机会。学生需就有关大学物理课程选定课题内的问题作了解，并于课上与同学和老师讨论及汇报解决方案。本科着重提升学生自我研习和解难的能力，并特别注重表达和沟通能力的训练。','This course provides student-centred learning experience in a small-group setting. Students are required to study physics problems on selected topics relevant to introductory physics courses, present the solutions in class, and engage in discussion with classmates and the instructor. Emphasis is put on skills in self-study, problem solving, and especially presentation and communication skills.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103010,'PHY1910','普通物理实验（一）','Physics Laboratory I','PHY - Physics','1910','P',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','PHY 1001 - Mechanics 力学 & PHY 1010 - Principles of Physics II (Thermodynamics and EM) 普通物理（二）(热学和电磁学) or PHY 2001 -  Electricity and Magnetism 电磁学','','本课程通过相关的实验培养学生：1. 使用基础力学、热学、光学及声学实验仪器开展物理实验；2. 掌握基本的数据和误差分析；3. 撰写学术性的实验报告。所选实验涵盖经典力学，如通过杨氏模量分析评估材料刚性、利用单摆法测量向心力、开展波尔共振振动特性实验。同时，课程还引导学生熟练运用理想气体定律探究热学现象，并通过迈克耳孙干涉、光衍射、光速测量实验理解光的波动性与传播规律。此外，学生能借助配套的声速测定与超声波测距实验，掌握声波规律与超声工程测距应用。','This course trains students to use basic mechanics, thermodynamics, optical, and acoustic instruments to perform experiments; develop basic data analysis and error estimation techniques; and write scientific laboratory reports. The selected experiments cover classical mechanics, such as assessing material stiffness through Young''s modulus analysis, measuring centripetal force with the pendulum method, and carrying out Pohl''s resonance vibration characteristic experiment. At the same time, the course guides students to explore thermal phenomena through proficient application of the ideal gas law, and to understand the wave properties and propagation laws of light via Michelson interference, light diffraction, and speed of light measurement experiments. Furthermore, the included experiments on sound velocity measurement and ultrasonic ranging enable students to learn the fundamental laws of sound waves and explore how ultrasonic technology is applied in engineering distance measurement.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103011,'PHY1920','普通物理实验（二）','Physics Laboratory II','PHY - Physics','1920','P',2.00,1000,'Major','已评分','实验室','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','PHY1001/PHY1002','','本课程旨在训练学生实验量测、处理和应用基本仪器的技巧，和建立对数据及误差分析应有的概念与态度。本科的实验内容亦加强及阐释PHY1010普通物理（二）(热学和电磁学)内所教授的概念和理论。学生宜先修读PHY1001/PHY1002','This course aims to introduce basic skills in performing experimental measurements, handling and utilizing basic equipments; and build necessary concepts and attitudes of data and error analysis. The experiments in this course also serve to illustrate the principles and reinforce the concepts taught in PHY1010 - Principles of Physics II (Thermodynamics and EM) courses. Students are advised to take PHY1001/PHY1002 before taking this course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
