2025-26 Term 2','PHY1001 Mechanics','None','本课程致力于介绍电磁现象基本规律。课程内容包括库仑定律，叠加原理，电场与电势，高斯定律，电容，导体和绝缘体，洛伦兹力，安培定律，法拉第定律，欧姆定律，基尔霍夫定律,RLC电路,麦克斯韦方程和电磁波','The aim of this course is to establish a grounding in electromagnetism. The topics include Coulomb''s law, superposition principle, electric field and electrostatic potential, Gauss'' law, capacitance, conductors and insulators, Lorentz force, Ampere''s Law, Faraday''s law, Ohm''s law, Kirchoff’s laws, RLC circuits, alternating current, Maxwell’s equations, and electromagnetic waves.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
