2026-27 Term 1','PHY1001 Mechanics and MAT1002 or MAT1012 (or equivalent course); Understanding of Newton’s laws and Multi-variable Calculus.','','本课程旨在了解热力学的基本概念和理论以及热学量的微观解释，将会讨论热力学在各个学科中的应用，以及将会阐述用于分析不同热力学系统的技巧。本课程对于物理以外的课程也有启发意义','This course aims to understand the fundamental concepts and basic theories of thermodynamics and the microscopic interpretation of thermal quantities. The applications of thermodynamics in various disciplines will be discussed. The skills needed to analyze various thermodynamic systems will also be demonstrated. This course is also inspiring beyond the physics field.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
