2025-26 Term 2','','Calculus, linear algebra','本课程涵盖本科阶段的经典力学基础知识。主题包括：牛顿力学回顾、矢量运算、约束系统、拉格朗日和哈密顿力学、中心力场问题 、刚体、振动、正则变换。','This course covers the foundation of classical mechanics at the undergraduate level. Topics include: review of Newtonian mechanics, vector calculus, constrained systems, Lagrangian and Hamiltonian mechanics, central force problems, rigid body, oscillations, canonical transformations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103026,'PHY3120','理论力学（二）','Classical Mechanics II','PHY - Physics','3120','P',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','PHY3110/MSE6302 Classical Mechanics-I or equivalent courses.','本课程通过拉格朗日与哈密顿体系，对经典力学展开全面探讨。主要内容包括最小作用量原理、正则变换、泊松括号、哈密顿-雅可比理论以及连续系统的表述。课程还介绍了狭义相对论，着重阐述其与经典动力学及不变性原理的关联性。','This course offers an advanced view of classical mechanics through the frameworks of Lagrangian and Hamiltonian formalisms. Topics include the principle of least action, canonical transformations, Poisson brackets, Hamilton–Jacobi theory, the formulation of continuous systems, and the special theory of relativity, emphasizing its connection to classical dynamics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
