2026-27 Term 1','PHY2610 – Mathematical Methods in Physics I, or equivalent;
(can be replaced by MAT2002 – Ordinary Differential Equation, or equivalent;
MAT2040 – Linear Algebra, or equivalent;)','','本课程涵盖本科层次电磁理论的基础内容。主题包括真空和介质中的静电学与静磁学；利用分离变量法、镜像法和多极展开求解边值问题；电磁感应；标势与矢势；真空和介质中的麦克斯韦方程组；以及电磁波与辐射的基本性质、狭义相对论和对称性。学生在修读本课程前应具备矢量微积分的相关知识。','This course covers the basics of electromagnetic theory at the undergraduate level. Topics include electrostatics and magnetostatics in vacuum and medium; the solution of boundary value problems using separation of variables, the method of images, and multipole expansions; electromagnetic induction; scalar and vector potentials; Maxwell’s equations in vacuum and media; and the basic properties of electromagnetic waves and radiation, special relativity and symmetry. Students are expected to have a prior knowledge of vector calculus before taking this course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
