(103036,'PHY3410','量子力学（一）','Quantum Mechanics and its Applications I','PHY - Physics','3410','P',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
