2026-27 Term 1','PHY1001 Mechanics, MAT1001 or MAT1011, and MAT1002 or MAT1012, and MAT2040, or MAT2041, MAT2042 (or equivalent course); Understanding of Newton’s laws, Multi-variable Calculus, and Linear Algebra.','N.A.','本课程介绍了非相对论量子力学的基本概念和理论框架。
内容包括:
量子理论的历史发展
波函数和薛定谔方程
一维问题
谐振子
三维量子力学
自旋和角动量
量子力学的形式化 - 线性代数与狄拉克符号，其他高级的量子力学主题。

本课程涵盖了量子力学的基本基础。它帮助学生培养必要的数学成熟度,学习核心原理,幷将其应用于亚原子物理问题','This course introduces the fundamental concepts and theoretical framework of non-relativistic quantum mechanics.
Topics include:
Historical development of quantum theory,
Wavefunction and Schrödinger equation,
One-dimensional problems,
Harmonic oscillators,
Quantum mechanics in three dimensions,
Spin and angular momentum,
Quantum mechanics formalism with linear algebra and Dirac notation,  other advanced topics.

The course covers the essential foundations of Quantum Mechanics. It helps students build the necessary mathematical maturity, learn the core principles, and practice applying them to subatomic physics problems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103037,'PHY3420','量子力学（二）','Quantum Mechanics and its Applications II','PHY - Physics','3420','P',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','Quantum Mechanics I (PHY3410), or Quantum Mechanics (PHY4221), or equaivalent courses.','','本课程主要介绍量子力学，并侧重其实际应用。课程将讲授量子力学中的关键近似方法，用于解决复杂问题。学生将深入学习微扰理论，包括其数学形式和应用范围。内容涵盖散射理论、量子动力学及其实际应用，并进行详细探讨。此外，课程还深入研究量子态和密度矩阵的性质，强调其在现代量子应用中的重要性。','This course provides an introduction to quantum mechanics focusing on its applications. The course introduces key approximation methods in quantum mechanics to solve complex problems. It will develop a solid understanding of perturbation theories, their formalism and scope of applications. Topics in scattering theory, quantum dynamics, and their real-world applications will be covered in detail. Additionally, the course delves into the properties of quantum states and the density matrix, emphasizing their significance in modern quantum applications.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
