(103039,'PHY3610','数学物理方法（二）','Mathematical Methods in Physics II','PHY - Physics','3610','P',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','1)	MAT1002 Calculus II or MAT1012 Honours Calculus II.
2)	MAT2040, or MAT2041, Linear Algebra or MAT2042 Honours Linear Algebra
3)	PHY 2610 is assumed. If not, a justification must be provided.','/','本课程介绍物理学研究中常用的数学方法和技巧。内容包括下列主题：1）复分析：全纯函数和Cauchy-Riemann方程；多值函数；亚纯函数和洛朗级数；Cauchy定理、留数定理及其应用；Gamma函数、Zeta函数和椭圆函数；共形变换和Riemann映照定理。2) 常微分方程及偏微分方程：格林函数方法、Frobenius方法、超几何型常微分方程。3) 积分变换：傅里叶变换、拉普拉斯和梅林变换和反变换及其应用。4）代数：群论简介','This course introduces the essential mathematical background needed for carrying out undergraduate studies in physics. Topics include: 1) complex analysis: holomorphic function and Cauchy-Riemann equation; multi-valued functions; mermorphic functions and Laurent series; Cauchy theorem; residue theorem and applications; Gamma function, elliptic function, Riemann Zeta function; conformal transformation and Riemann mapping theorem. 2) ordinary and partial differential equation: Green-function method, Frobenius method, and hypergeometric ODEs. 3) integral transform: Fourier, Laplace and Mellin transform. 4) algebra: group theory','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
