2025-26 Term 2','MAT1001 or MAT1011 or MAT1002 or MAT1012, Calculus; MAT2040 or MAT2041 or MAT3040, Linear Algebra; MAT2001 or MAT2002, Ordinary Differential Equations; PHY1001, Mechanics','','本课程主要旨在介绍固体中电子与声子的基本原理，涵盖相关概念及其应用（如材料的电导和热容性），并为有志于在凝聚态物理、材料科学、能源科学等领域继续深造的学生构建概念体系。课程同样适用于计划进入半导体行业的学生。主要内容包括：晶体结构与对称性、中子与X射线衍射、化学键合、声子与热容、自由电子气与基础能带理论、金属与绝缘体、半导体物理以及磁性。','The course is mainly designed to introduce the principles of electrons
and phonons in solids, including concepts and applications, such as
conductivity and heat capacity of materials, and set the conceptual
framework for the students who seeks for future study and graduate
research in condensed matter physics, materials science, energy science,
and so on. The course is also useful for students who seeks to enter
semiconductor industries. The main topics will include: crystal
structure and symmetry, neutron and x-ray diffraction, chemical bonding, phonons and heat capacity, free electron gas and elementary band theory, metal and insulators, semiconductors, and magnetism.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
