2026-27 Term 1','\\','\\','本课程为学生提供在实验或理论物理领域进行深入研究的机会，作为毕业要求的一部分。学生将在教授指导下独立进行研究，培养科研能力，并完成一份完整的报告。','This course provides students with the opportunity to conduct an in-depth investigation in either experimental or theoretical physics as part of their graduation requirements. Students will work independently under the supervision of a faculty advisor to explore a selected topic, develop research skills, and produce a comprehensive final report.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103055,'PHY4280','毕业课题（二）','Senior Project II','PHY - Physics','4280','P',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','PHY4270','','本课程为学生提供深入探讨实验或理论物理学的机会，作为毕业要求之一。学生将在指导教授的监督下独立进行研究，探索选定主题、培养研究能力，并提交一份完整的期末报告。本课程可于修毕 PHY4270后接续修读，组成为期两学期的研究项目。学生须于选课前取得指导教授的同意。','This course allows students to conduct in-depth research in experimental or theoretical physics, fulfilling graduation requirements. Working independently under faculty supervision, students explore a chosen topic, build research skills, and submit a final report. The course may be taken after PHY4270 as a two-semester sequence. Prior permission from the project advisor is required before enrollment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
