2025-26 Term 2','PHY1001 Mechanics and MAT1002 or MAT1012 (or equivalent course); Understanding of Newton’s laws and Multi- variable Calculus.','/','本课程旨在了解热力学统计力学的基本概念和理论。将会讨论统计力学在不同热力学系统的中应用，以及将会阐述用于分析不同热力学系统的技巧。','This course aims at understanding the fundamental concepts and basic theories of thermodynamics and statistical mechanics. The applications of statistical mechanics in various disciplines will be discussed. The skills needed to analyze various thermodynamic systems will also be demonstrated.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
