2026-27 Term 1','Linear Algebra, Calculus, Quantum Mechanics (PHY3410 or its alternative)','None.','本课程旨在对量子力学进行更系统的表述，并涵盖进阶内容。涉及的主题包括：使用狄拉克算符语言回顾量子力学、全同粒子和多体系统的相关概念、量子力学中的对称性、角动量和自旋、定常和含时的微扰方法以及散射理论。如果时间允许，还将讨论相对论量子力学和自旋的起源的基本概念、路径积分以及量子纠缠等。','This course aims at a more systematic formulation of quantum mechanics and covers advanced aspects. Topics covered include: recap of quantum mechanics with Dirac formalism, concept of identical particles and many-body systems, symmetry in quantum mechanics, angular momenta and spin, time-(in)dependent perturbation methods, and scattering theory. If time permits, basics of relativistic quantum mechanics and origin of spin, path integral, and entanglement will be discussed.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103064,'PHY5420','電動力學','','PHY - Physics','5420','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 2
