(103076,'PHY6530','量子场论 II','','PHY - Physics','6530','P',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','理工学院','理工学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','Basic knowledge of PHY5530 (Quantum Field Theory) I is recommended','None.','本课程建立在 PHY5530：量子场论 I 所涵盖内容的基础上，旨在介绍现代理论物理中用到的一些进阶概念与方法。课程所涉专题可为有意从事高能物理、量子多体理论及凝聚态理论当代研究的学生提供必要准备。 本课程将着重讨论重整化、有效场论、非阿贝尔规范理论、自发对称性破缺、希格斯机制以及粒子物理标准模型等专题。其他可能涉及的专题还包括量子反常、BRST 对称性、量子场论中的拓扑项，以及在量子场论在凝聚态与临界现象中的若干应用。 本课程将引导学生产生物理直觉并提供计算技巧方面的训练，构筑研究级知识基础。扎实掌握这些内容后，学生应能理解并尝试解决理论物理中的一些前沿问题。','This course builds on the subjects covered in PHY5530: Quantum Field Theory I and introduces advanced concepts and techniques used in modern theoretical physics. The topics in this course provide essential preparation for students interested in contemporary research in high-energy physics, quantum many-body theory, and condensed matter theory. We will discuss topics including renormalization, effective field theory, non-Abelian gauge theories, spontaneous symmetry breaking, the Higgs mechanism, and the Standard Model of particle physics. Additional topics may include anomalies, BRST symmetry, topological terms, and selected applications to condensed matter and critical phenomena. The course aims to familiarize the students with both physical intuition and computational techniques, helping students build a research-level knowledge base. With a strong grasp of the material, the student should be able to understand and solve some of the current problems in theoretical physics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
