2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','PSY1020 Quantitative Methods (I) and Experimental Design','','本课程讨论使用SPSS分析数据的常用统计方法，是在定量方法I中没有涉及的内容，包括:非参数模型、相关性、线性回归、卡方和对数线性分析、logistic回归、多层线性模型。主要的焦点是(a)了解这些统计方法，知道何时以及如何应用它们，使用SPSS，在心理学或其他社会科学领域进行研究(即，进行分析，正确地报告结果，并从你的发现中得出正确的结论)。此外，(b)基于所获得的统计知识，能够理解在文献中发表的研究论文(在心理学和其他社会科学领域)，并批判性地评估报告的研究结果。上面描述的统计方法是通过有趣的、容易理解的例子来解释的。通过使用SPSS对数据集进行这些分析(在教程辅导中)，可以获得实际经验。','This course discusses common statistical methodologies for analysing data using SPSS, that were not addressed in Quantitative Methods I: non-parametric models, correlations, linear regressions, chi-square and loglinear analysis, logistic regressions, multilevel linear models. The main focus is (a) on understanding these statistical methodologies and on knowing when and how to apply them, using SPSS, when conducting research in the field of psychology or other social sciences (i.e., conducting the analysis, correctly reporting your outcomes and draw the right conclusions from your findings). Moreover, (b) based on the statistical knowledge obtained being able to understand research papers published in the literature (in the field of Psychology and other social sciences) and critically evaluate the reported study findings. The statistical methodologies described above are explained using interesting, easy to understand, examples. Hand on experience is obtained by conducting these analyses with datasets using SPSS (during the tutorials).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103096,'PSY2020','认知心理学（一）','Cognitive Psychology I','PSY - Psychology','2020','P',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
