2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程旨在探讨个人和家庭发展在整个生命周期中不同的阶段。其中特别探索与儿童心理学，发展心理学及系统家庭理论中共同关注的一些合适和非典型的过渡阶段。','This course will include content on individual and family development across the lifespan. Specific emphasis will be given to developmentally appropriate and atypical transitions related to common concerns in child psychology, development psychology and system family theory.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103098,'PSY2040','感觉和知觉','Sensation and Perception','PSY - Psychology','2040','P',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 1
2021-22 Term 1
2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','There are no prerequisites for this course.','There are no co-requisites for this course.','本课程介绍感觉和知觉的基本理论、方法、研究和应用，其中将重点关注视觉方面。我们所感知的世界是我们根据感觉系统受到的刺激模式构建的：我们的感官系统将不同的物理刺激转化为神经信号，由大脑接收并解释这些信号，从而产生我们的感觉和知觉。该课程由讲座和辅导组成。讲座将：（1）重点关注关于感觉和知觉的心理学和神经生物学理论，揭示我们构建对世界的感知的过程； （2）介绍经典和现代心理物理学方法，以及傅里叶分析的基本概念； （3）并触及感觉和知觉的广泛背景，例如语言学思考以及设计和信息可视化中的应用。辅导部分将提供演示、实践和研究经验。','This course introduces the basic theories, methods, research, and applications in sensation and perception, with a focus on vision science. The world as we perceive it is constructed by us based on the pattern of stimulation impinging on the sensory systems: our body turns different physical stimuli into neural impulses, and our brain receives and interprets these impulses, giving rise to our sensation and perception. The course consists of lectures and tutorials. The lectures will: (1) focus on psychological and neurobiological theories of sensation and perception that uncover the processes by which we construct our perception of the world; (2) introduce classical and modern psychophysical methods, as well as the basic concepts of Fourier analysis; (3) and touch upon the broad context of sensation and perception, such as philological musings and applications in design and information visualization. The tutorials will provide demonstrations, hands-on practice, and research experience.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103099,'PSY2110','动机与情绪','Motivation and Emotion','PSY - Psychology','2110','P',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2021-22 Term 2
