2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程将探讨有助于理解人类动机和情绪的理论和研究。着眼于当代的观点和方法，本课程将讨论神经认知机制和相应的主观感受，二者的作用在于：将思想和行为以适应性方式专注于达成目标。课程主题源自认知心理学、社会心理学、情感理论和进化心理学这些交叉学科领域的研究。','This course examines the theories and research contributing to the current understanding of human motivation and emotion. Focusing on contemporary views and approaches, the course discusses the neurocognitive mechanisms and corresponding subjective feelings that focus thoughts and behaviors in an adaptive way toward achieving goals. Topics covered by the course are drawn from research in the overlapping fields of cognitive and social psychology, emotion theory, and evolutionary psychology.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103100,'PSY2120','学习与行为','Learning and Behavior','PSY - Psychology','2120','P',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 1
