2026-27 Term 1','','','学习是生存的根本。本课程专注于人类和其他动物如何通过环境中不同刺激之间的联系以及他们的行动与这些行动的后果之间建立联系来学习，将讨论和考察经典条件反射和操作条件反射，以及更广泛的学习概念（如社会学习和个人学习）。 将努力将这些更抽象的概念与适应性日常生活功能联系起来。课程将努力把这些抽象概念与适应性日常生活功能联系起来。','Learning is a fundamental to survival. This course focuses on how humans and other animals learn by making associations among different stimuli in their environment, and between their actions and the outcomes of those actions. The concepts of classical and operant conditioning will be discussed together with an examination of broader learning concepts such as social learning and individual learning. Effort will be made to relate these more abstract concepts to adaptive everyday life functioning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
