2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本课程研究微观（个人）和宏观（组织）层面的经典组织理论和当代研究，重点关注科学管理、人际关系运作和组织作为系统来运作的原则。研究课题包括：工作分析、招聘选拔、工作绩效、组织学习、动机与态度、职业生涯管理、领导力开发、组织文化等等。理解组织心理学的前沿研究成果对培养学生的组织管理和职业生涯管理技能是至关重要的一步。学生通过学习本课程，不仅会加深对如何提升个体、群体/团队、组织效能的理解，并且会掌握如何采用相应的管理措施来实现效能的提升。本课程不仅兼顾组织心理学的前沿研究和现实应用，也会积极采用多学科视角和知行合一的原则来提升学生素养。','This course examines classical organizational theory and contemporary research at the micro (individual) and macro (organizational) levels, focusing on the principles of scientific management, the human relations movement, and organizations as systems. Organizational psychology research topics include job analysis, personnel selection, job performance, organizational learning, career management, leadership, organizational culture, and so on. It encourages students to identify the relevance of these theories and research for management practices in different sectors. Understanding the fundamental principles of Organizational Psychology is an essential step for students to develop their skills on organizational management and career management. After learning this course, student should develop deeper understanding of how to make individuals, groups/teams, and organizations work effectively, and how to design and implement relevant management practices to make this happen. This course we will examine research and practice side-by-side in order to recognize the multi-disciplinary and applied origins of these different areas of inquiry.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
