HSS1005 General Psychology','','本课程向学生介绍社会心理学领域的主要课题、理论和研究，以批判性、跨学科和历史性的方式说明社会心理学对我们理解个人、人际和群体间关系（如恋爱关系、群体间冲突、亲社会行为、偏见和歧视）所做的贡献。','This course introduces students to key topics, theories and research within the area of social psychology to illustrate the contribution it has made to our understanding of individual, interpersonal and intergroup relations (e.g., romantic relationships, intergroup conflict, pro-social behaviour, prejudice and discrimination) in a critical, inter-disciplinary and historical manner .','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103103,'PSY3020','人格与个体差异','Personality and Individual Differences','PSY - Psychology','3020','P',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
