2021-22 Summer','','','本课程介绍人格的主要理论和研究。包括人格是什么以及我们如何研究人格。 学生将学习人格与日常生活的关系，支持和驳斥人格理论不同原则的证据，以及人格评估的用途和解释。 本课程旨在帮助学生了解个性体现了个人的独特性，我们必须接受自己，这样才能帮助周围的人。本课程鼓励学生将各种理论融入日常实际应用中，进行自我认识和自我反省。','This course introduces major theories and research on personality. It addresses what personality is and how we go about studying personality. Students will learn how personality is related to everyday life, evidence supporting and refuting different tenets of personality theories and uses and interpretations of personality assessments. This course intends to help students understand that personality embodies our individual uniqueness, we must accept ourselves so that we can help other people around us. It will encourage students to integrate various theories to put into daily practical application on self-understanding and self-reflection.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
