2025-26 Term 2','PSY1010 Introduction to Psychology OR HSS1005 General Psychology','There are no co-requisites for this course.','本课程从大脑和神经系统怎样产生人类的感情和行为（诸如感觉、情绪、睡眠与梦境、生殖繁衍、语言和认知）这个角度来探讨大脑与行为的关系。课题包括：神经系统的解剖学和生理学基础、大脑的结构和功能、遗传对行为的影响以及情绪的生物学基础。','This course examines brain-behavior relationships in terms of how the brain and nervous system produce the human range of feelings and behaviors: sensation, emotion, sleep and dreams, reproductive behavior, language, and cognition. Topics include anatomy and physiology of the nervous system, structures and functions of the brain, genetic influences on behavior, and the biological bases of emotions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
