2022-23 Summer','No prerequisites','No prerequisites','教育心理学的研究涉及丰富所有儿童和青少年生活的理论和实践。本课程侧重于教育心理学的研究方法，教育心理学的历史和基础，心理学概念和原则在儿童和青少年学学业能力和社会情感发展中的影响和应用，个人层面和系统层面的评估和干预，以及对学生学习、行为和心理健康需求和课堂困难的理解。','The study of educational and school psychology involves both theory and practice in enriching the lives of all children. This course focuses on the implications and applications of psychological concepts and principles in the child''s academic learning and social-emotional development, individual-level and system-level assessment and interventions, and an understanding of student learning, behavioral, and mental health needs and difficulties in classrooms.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
