2025-26 Term 2','PSY2010: Quantitative Methods (II)','NA','本课程论及心理测量学中的心理测试和实际生活中的心理测试。心理测量学部分将介绍测量理论，侧重于经典测试理论及相关问题，如信度、效度和测验分析。概化理论和项目反应理论也可能会涉及到，但主要强调其实际应用。该课程会还会介绍心理测试工具在教育、临床和工业组织领域的使用和结果解释。','This course addresses psychometrical and practical issues of testing. The psychometrical part introduces measurement theories with a focus on classical test theory and related issues such as reliability, validity, and test analysis. Generalizability theory and item response theory may also be introduced with a focus on practical applications. The practical issues of testing include the use and interpretations of psychological tests in different settings, including educational, clinical, and organizational settings.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
