2025-26 Term 2','PSY4020','None.','此为最后一年的必修课，学生须连续两个学期选择并完成这两门课程。每学期的课程均有两个班：一个班偏重教育和发展方向的研究，一个偏重社会与组织方向的研究。学生需要提交一份完整的研究方案，须在结束部分提及对结果的预期；而研究方案的撰写须始于课程开始之初 。研究方法与构写研究报告 (I) 是一门正规的研究方法课程，在第一学期每周上一次课，教师将讲授和教导研究方法论。研究方案的撰写将从课程一开始就分配给学生，并与方法学的学习保持相同的进度，以便学生可以立即将方法知识应用于其研究方案的撰写。第二学期的研究方法与构写研究报告 (II) 课程，将每周提供时间对学生进行个别指导，学生须在本学期完成研究方案的撰写。教师主要对研究方案的撰写提供个人指导和监督完成。

荣誉论文（选修项）：选修的学生可以在任课教师或一位志愿导师的指导下写一篇完整的论文。这些荣誉学生必须跟所有其他学生一样，完成研究方法与构写研究报告 I和II 两门课，同时将获得写作荣誉论文的荣誉证书。','Students are required to take these two courses in two consecutive semesters of the last year. In each semester, the course has two sessions: one with a focus on the education and development research and one with a focus on the society and organization research. Students will need to write a full-blown research proposal, which includes a section of expected findings, in the end, whereas the writing of the proposal will start from the beginning of the course offering. Research Method and Writing I, which is a standard research method course, will meet weekly during the first semester and the instructor will lecture and coach students about research methodology. The proposal writing will be assigned to the students from the beginning and progresses at the same pace as the methodology instruction so that students can immediately apply the methodological knowledge to their proposal writing. Students complete the research proposal in the second or last semester in Research Method and Writing II which offers individual consultation sessions weekly. The instructor mainly provides individual coaching and supervision of the proposal writing in this second writing course.

Honors Thesis (Optional): Selected students can write a full-blown thesis under the supervision of the instructor or a willing supervisor. These honors students will need to complete Research Method and Writing I and II like every other student but will also receive recognition for writing an honors thesis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
