2026-27 Term 1','This course requires that students have taken the Course PSY2030 (Lifespan Development).','','本课程涉及儿童与青少年期的发展，将考查在这些阶段发生的认知、社会和情感方面的纵深变化。课程将包括幼儿期和青少年期的研究方法和理论之概述，并将论及影响儿童期和青春期认知发展，以及视觉感知、言语发展、数字知识、和社会情绪发展方面的最新研究。本课程要求学生已修读PSY2030。','This course concerns the development in childhood and adolescence. It examines in-depth changes in cognitive, social, and emotional development that occur during these development phases. The course will include an overview of major research methods and theories in childhood and adolescence research. Research on the major issues in childhood and adolescent development will be covered, including linguistic development, numerical knowledge, and social‐emotional development. This course requires that students have taken the Course PSY2030','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
