2022-23 Summer','None','None','本课程向学生介绍临床和谘询心理学的科学和实践。学生将了解许多主要类型的精神疾病的临床特征，以及可用于这些疾病的经科学验证的治疗方法。该课程涵盖了理解和治疗病理行为时的基本理论假设，以及临床和谘询心理学作为一种职业的影响。','This course introduces students to the science and practice of clinical and counselling psychology. Students will learn about the clinical characteristics of many major classes of psychiatric disorders, and the scientifically validated treatments available for these conditions. The course covers the basic theoretical assumptions when understanding and treating pathological behaviors, and implications in clinical and counselling psychology as a profession.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103119,'PSY4170','老年心理学','Psychology of Aging','PSY - Psychology','4170','P',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2
2021-22 Summer','','','《老年心理学》是一门本科阶段课程，旨在引导学生科学认识成年期发展与衰老过程。课程系统考察从成年早期至生命终结过程中个体经历的心理、生理及社会层面的变化。学生将认识到衰老并非单一的机能衰退，而是由个体差异、文化背景与生命经历共同塑造的、动态多维的发展历程。
通过课堂讲授、专题研讨、案例分析和实践应用等多种形式，学生将深入研读实证研究，学习如何运用心理学视角解读老年人面临的实际问题。课程特别关注多元文化视角下的老龄化认知、老年歧视现象，以及快速老龄化社会中的相关政策影响。','Psychology of Aging is an undergraduate-level course designed to introduce students to the scientific study of adult development and aging. This course examines the psychological, biological, and social changes that occur from early adulthood through the end of life. Students will explore aging not as a uniform decline but as a dynamic, multidimensional process shaped by individual differences, cultural contexts, and life experiences.
Through lectures, discussions, case studies, and applied activities, students will critically analyze empirical research and learn how psychological perspectives inform real-world issues faced by older adults. Special attention will be given to cross-cultural perspectives on aging, ageism, and policy implications in rapidly aging societies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103120,'PSY4180','认知神经学','Cognitive Neuroscience','PSY - Psychology','4180','P',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2020-21 Term 2
