2026-27 Term 1','n/a','n/a','本课程训练学生如何使用综合研究方法（包括测量、实验设计和数据分析）在心理、教育和其它社会科学领域进行科学研究。这门课的内容包括心理与教育测量以及实验设计。本课程既介绍定量也介绍定性研究方法，但是重点是定量研究，包括取样、设计、形成及检验假设和研究问题，以及研究效度问题。','This course trains students to conduct research in psychology and other social sciences and education through an integrated approach (measurement, design, and analysis). This course includes psychological/educational measurement, major research design considerations, and both quantitative and qualitative methods, but with the emphasis on quantitative approaches including sampling, design, formulating and testing hypotheses and research questions, and the research validity issues involved in these and other research processes.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
