2025-26 Term 2','This course requires that students have taken PSY5010 Research and Method (Integrated).','This course has no co-requisites.','本课程提供在心理学、教育学和其它社会科学领域中进行实验性和相关性研究所需的全面的知识与方法。课程涵盖两种分析的框架和程序：作为实验研究分析工具的方差分析(ANOVA), 以及作为相关性研究分析工具的多元回归。在此基础上，课程将进一步介绍更为复杂的ANOVA设计与分析，和更高级的结构方程模型等相关数据分析方法。 本课程要求学生已修读PSY5010。','This course provides the full range of knowledge and skills needed to conduct experimental and correlational research in psychology and other social sciences and education. Two analytical frameworks and procedures are covered - analysis of variance (ANOVA) as the analytical tool for experimental research and multiple regression used in correlational research. Complex ANOVA designs and analyses and advanced correlational data analysis such as structural equation modeling will be covered in this course. This course requires that students have taken PSY5010.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
