2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','这一课程从不同的理论视角解析学习和认知功能, 以及如何应用这些知识提升学习、记忆及教学的质量。同时，本课程还探讨生物进化对学习和认知的塑造作用以及其他认知活动（包括知觉、注意力、记忆、推理）的机制及其应用。','This course examines different theoretical perspectives on learning and cognitive functions, and their applications in improving learning, memory, and school teaching. The course also explores the shaping effects on biological evolution on learning and cognition, and mechanisms and applications of other cognitive activities, such as perception, attention, memory, and reasoning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
