2026-27 Term 1','Prior knowledge of the basic psychological concepts and principles of Educational Psychology is required.','','本高级研讨课程旨在探讨教育心理学研究与实践的前沿问题。本课程包含四大模块：教育心理学导论、教育中的个体/文化差异、教育内容领域以及未来教育发展方向。课程将系统涵盖教育心理学核心议题，例如：一般智力与资优教育、人格特质与学习动机、认知与学业发展、人工智能在教育心理学中的应用，以及个性化学习等主题','This is an advanced seminar to discuss and examine current issues in the research and practice of educational psychology. This course includes four modules: introduction to educational psychology, individual/cultural differences in education, content domains in education, and the future of education.   The major issues in Educational Psychology will be covered, e.g., general intelligence & gifted education, personality traits and motivation in education, cognitive and academic development, AI in Educational Psychology, and personalized learning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103131,'PSY5160','心理学中的机器学习','','PSY - Psychology','5160','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','There are no prerequisites for this course.','There are no co-requisites for this course.','本课程涵盖机器学习理论入门及其在心理学领域中的应用。课程针对较少编程基础的学生，内容涵盖Python编程基础及NumPy、pandas和matplotlib等常用数据分析库的运用，并学习核心的机器学习概念与算法，包括无监督学习（如聚类、降维）和有监督学习（如回归、分类）。本课程主要侧重于算法的直观理解与实际应用，辅以算法选择、结果解释和模型调优所需的理论和数学基础，结合心理学相关的实操练习（如预测心理健康结果、分析行为模式），学生将掌握如何在心理学相关领域中运用机器学习技术。','This course provides students with a fundamental understanding of machine learning and its practical applications in psychology. Designed for those with minimal prior programming knowledge, we begin with an introduction to Python programming and essential data science libraries such as NumPy, pandas, and matplotlib. Students will then explore core machine learning concepts and algorithms, including both unsupervised (e.g., clustering, dimension reduction) and supervised (e.g., regression, classification) learning. We will primarily focus on intuitive understanding and real-world applications, with just enough theoretical and mathematical background to support algorithm selection, interpretation, and model tuning. Through hands-on exercises and examples in psychology such as predicting mental health outcomes and analyzing behavioral patterns, students will gain the skills to apply machine learning techniques in psychological fields.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
