2025-26 Term 1','There are no prerequisites for this course.','There are no co-requisites for this course.','本课程综述在行为决策和领导力的研究领域中的进展与成果。讨论的题目包括决策理论、心理价值、功效模型、风险认知与管理、领导的人格与能力测量、领导力的主要理论，如领导员工交换理论，魅力型、变革型和进化型领导理论。课程将着重于决策和领导力的研究成果在组织中的应用。','This course provides an overview of the research development and findings in the studies of behavioral decision making and leadership. Discussion topics include decision theories, psychological values, utility functions, risk perception and risk management, leadership measurement of traits and abilities, major theories of leadership including leader-member exchange, charismatic, transformational, and evolutionary leadership theories. An emphasis is given on applying findings of decision making and leadership research in organizations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
