2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本课程合并了咨询和临床心理学。咨询部分研究不同环境中的咨询和心理治疗的理论、方法和实践，如夫妻、家庭、成人、儿童和团体。临床部分侧重于不同主要类型的精神病的临床特征以及理解和治疗病态行为时的理论假设。','This course combines counseling and clinical psychology. The counseling component examines the theories, methods, and practice of counselling and psychotherapy in different settings such as couples, families, adults, children, and groups. The clinical component focuses on the clinical characteristics of many major classes of psychiatric disorders and the theoretical assumptions when understanding and treating pathological behaviors.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103138,'PSY5320','积极心理学','','PSY - Psychology','5320','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Term 1
