2025-26 Term 2','NA','NA','课程涵盖不同的心理测试和临床测试，以及这些测试在临床和非临床环境的心理评估中的单独/组合使用。课程侧重于智力测验、性格测试、职业兴趣测试和职业评估，以及临床评估工具。课程还将讨论在各种情况下评估的伦理和社会影响。','This course examines different psychological and clinical tests and how these tests are used individually and in combination as part of psychological assessment in clinical and non-clinical settings. The course focuses on intelligence tests, personality tests, tests of vocational interests and career assessment, and clinical assessment tools. Ethical and social implications of assessment in a variety of contexts will also be discussed','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
