2025-26 Term 2','Prior knowledge of the basic concepts and principles of Clinical and Counseling  Psychology is required.','','本课程的总体目标是向您介绍跨文化咨询和心理治疗领域。更具体地说，本课程将帮助您：(a) 提高您对诊断和治疗过程中文化因素的认识；(b) 向您介绍不同的跨文化心理治疗模式；(c) 加深您对不同文化背景的来访者的理解。','The overall purpose of this course is to introduce you to the field of cross-cultural counseling and psychotherapy. More specifically, the course will help you: (a) increase your awareness of cultural factors in the diagnostic and therapeutic processes, (b) introduce you to different models of cross-cultural psychotherapy, and (c) increase your understanding of culturally-diverse clients.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103142,'PSY5410','临床咨询心理伦理与规范','','PSY - Psychology','5410','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
