2026-27 Term 1','None','None','本课程旨在为研究生提供有关咨询和临床心理学伦理准则及法律在心理治疗、评估和研究中的应用培训。本课程将以帮助他人的基本目标为基础，培养咨询师在道德敏感性或追求的原则行事，为学生提供积极的伦理学培训，并学会如何基于法律以及强制性伦理准则的最低能力标准判断伦理困境。该课程将用英文授课。','This course provide graduate students with training in application of the Code of Ethics in counseling and clinical psychology as well as the related laws, as they pertain to the provision of psychotherapy, assessment and research. In doing so, we aspire to train students in positive or active ethics, which reach beyond the minimal standards of competency that are based on legal or mandatory ethics code, by training psychologists to act based on moral sensitivity or aspirational principles, grounded in the fundamental goal of helping others. The course will be taught in English.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
