2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在为学生提供入门和路线图，帮助学生们理解各种公共政策设计的范围、背景和运作流程。课程将探讨公共政策的重要性和特点，以及代表性政策类型的科学决策过程。此外，课程还将介绍发达地区和发展中地区的应用案例。','This course is designed as an introduction and a road map to help students to understand the scope, contexts, and the function process of varied public policy designs. An attempt will be made to discuss the importance and characteristics of the public policy, and the scientific decision-making process of represented policy types. Also, it will introduce the applied cases in both developed and developing regions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
