2025-26 Term 2','','','课程内容全面涵盖行政和公共管理的各个方面。课程将介绍公共行政范围内的社会、政治、经济、法律和实体机构。课程将加强学生的沟通、决策、行政及管理技巧，以在制度的范畴内推行公共政策。此外，课程还将特别关注中国内地、中国香港、中国澳门和亚洲其它国家/地区不断变化的政治、社会和经济环境。','This course will provide a comprehensive training on administration and public management. It will introduce the social, political, economic, legal and physical institutions within the context of public administration. The course will enhance students’ communication, decision-making, administrative and managerial skills to implement public policies within an institutional context. Also, it will have a special focus on the changing political, social and economic environments in Mainland China, Hong Kong, Macau and other Asian countries/regions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
