2026-27 Term 1','None','','本课程将为学生提供有关政策研究和评估的研究方法的训练。课程包括实用的研究方法，如案例研究、内容分析和历史分析，以及培训使用相关的定量工具，如STATA。在课程中，学生应当选择和使用适当的分析工具来解读、评估或设计公共政策，并掌握批判性技能，以更好地解决公共问题。','This compulsory course is primarily designed to help students master different approaches and fundamental methods of public policy analysis. Through the lectures and assignments, the student can understand the nature and functions of policy analysis, master its basic processes and primary methodologies, and establish a solid foundation for future engagement in policy analysis and public management practice.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
