2025-26 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在让学生有机会就选定的公共政策或公共问题发表自己的批判性意见，以展示他们对现实世界政策评估机制的理解。在导师的指导下，学生应当使用案例材料来说明他们可以在多大程度上应用理论，并使用分析工具来生成高质量的实证政策报告。学生应在项目报告中展示自己的实质性知识、理论能力、分析技能和写作能力。','This course is designed to provide students with opportunities to present their critical views on selected public policies or public issues to demonstrate their understanding of policy evaluation mechanisms in real-world. Under the supervision of mentors, students are expected to use case materials to illustrate how much they could apply theories and use analytical tools to generate high-quality empirical policy reports. Students should demonstrate their substantive knowledge, theoretical competence, analytical skills, and writing capabilities in their project reporting.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103159,'PUB5110','城市与社会政策','','PUB - Public Policy','5110','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
2023-24 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','There are no formal prerequisites for this course. General academic skills of analytical thinking, comparison, essay writing, working with statistical material will be helpful.','','这是一门跨学科课程，涵盖有关发达地区和发展中地区城市中的城市和社会政策挑战与机遇的重要主题。本课程旨在丰富学生的知识，提高学生的批判性思维和分析能力。课程将介绍有关城市管理、社区发展、土地使用、交通等方面的具体政策，以及失业、贫困、社会排斥、住房、教育等方面的政策。课程还将特别关注现实世界中的政策案例。','This is an interdisciplinary course that covers important topics in regard to urban and social policy challenges and opportunities in cities in both developed and developing regions. It aims at enriching students’ content knowledge, improving students’ critical thinking and analytic skills. The course will introduce specific policies on city management, community development, land use, transit, as well as policies on unemployment, poverty, social exclusion, housing, education and etc. A special attention will be paid to policy cases in real-world.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
