(103170,'PUB5420','转型发展的政治经济学','','PUB - Public Policy','5420','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 1
2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','No prerequisites','No co-requisites','社会主义计划体制的兴起和转型是 20 世纪最引人注目的事件之一。本课程旨在全面分析从前苏联开始的国家社会主义和社会主义计划经济的兴起、向东欧和亚洲国家以及世界其他地区的扩散、最终向各种资本主义的过渡。讲座和指定读物将强调中国、（前）苏联和日本的比较发展经验，但经济转型和发展的许多经验教训也适用于东欧和越南的其他社会主义国家，以及其他东亚发展型国家。','The rise and transition of socialist planned system was one of the most dramatic events in the 20th century. The course seeks to provide a comprehensive analysis of the rise of state socialism and socialist planned economy starting from the former Soviet Union, their spread into East Europe and Asia countries as well as other areas around the world, their final transitions into varieties of capitalism. Lectures and assigned readings will emphasize the comparative developmental experiences of China, the (former) Soviet Union and Japan, but many of the lessons of economic transition and development apply also to other socialist counties in East Europe and Vietnam, and to other East Asian developmental state as well, and the bulk of the material addresses transitional and developmental strategies, reform policies and outcomes.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
