2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程探讨跨国公司（MNCs）与公共部门实体（政府、国际组织）之间复杂、共生且常充满紧张的关系。学生将分析全球政治、社会和监管环境如何塑造商业战略，以及商业运营如何反过来从地方到国际层面影响公共政策和治理。','This course delves into the pivotal role played by Multinational Corporations (MNCs) in the global economy, exploring the intricate web of connections between international businesses and policy. Beginning with a concise overview of the economic and political foundations that have propelled the ascent of multinational enterprises, it goes on to analyze the intricate dynamics through which global firms engage with policy authorities at both domestic and international levels. Moreover, it examines a spectrum of specific policy issues that arise in the interplay between and within multinational corporations. Through this comprehensive exploration, the course provides a clear understanding of the multifaceted relationship between MNCs and the policies that shape their operations.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
