(103177,'PUB5630','人工智能与政府数据管理','','PUB - Public Policy','5630','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程探讨人工智能与政府数据管理系统的深度融合，旨在培养学生利用AI进行公共部门数据采集、存储、分析与保护的能力。课程首先奠定政府数据管理的基础，重点解析政务框架下的独特挑战、数据完整性及合规标准；其次，深入研究如何运用AI执行数据治理政策，以确保政府数据库的高质量、安全性和隐私保护；最后，课程将全面介绍如何通过AI促进跨部门数据整合，旨在打破信息孤岛，强化政府部门间的协同合作。','This course will explore the sophisticated integration of artificial intelligence with the intricate systems of government data management. This course is designed to prepare students to effectively utilize AI for the collection, storage, analysis, and protection of vast amounts of public sector data. Firstly, students will learn foundations of government data management with an introduction to the unique challenges and requirements of managing data within government frameworks, emphasizing the importance of data integrity and compliance with regulatory standards. Secondly, students will have a deep dive into how AI can be employed to enforce data governance policies, ensuring data quality, security, and privacy in government databases. Thirdly, students will have a comprehensive understanding of using AI to facilitate the integration of data across different government agencies, breaking down silos and enhancing inter-departmental collaboration.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103178,'PUB5710','人工智能的技术监管：中国及全球','','PUB - Public Policy','5710','P',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','None','None','本课程深入探讨人工智能监管的复杂图景，聚焦于理解中国及全球范围内快速演进的AI治理法律与政策框架所必需的关键领域。通过讲座、案例研究和实践应用相结合的方式，学生将系统掌握人工智能监管相关的法律结构及其面临的挑战。课程首先从新技术监管的一般性问题入手，进而深入剖析AI监管的特殊难题，并系统考察中国、美国和欧盟的监管制度，以及新兴的国际框架。','This course delves into the intricate landscape of regulating AI, focusing on key areas crucial for understanding the legal and policy frameworks governing the rapidly evolving landscape in China and beyond. Through a combination of lectures, case studies, and practical applications, students will gain an understanding of the legal structure and challenges surrounding AI regulation. The course begins with the general issue of regulating new technologies and dives into the specific challenges of regulating AI. It explores the regulatory regimes of China, the United States, and European Union as well as emerging international frameworks.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103179,'PUB6010','公共政策理论与实践','','PUB - Public Policy','6010','P',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本进阶课程深入探讨公共政策制定与分析的基础理论、框架及当代实践。课程将理论视角与实际应用相结合，帮助学生批判性地理解政策在复杂的社会政治背景下是如何制定、实施和评估的。学生将开展严谨的政策研究，运用分析工具，并培养应对地方、国家及全球层面现实政策挑战的能力。','This advanced course explores the foundational theories, frameworks, and contemporary practices in public policy development and analysis. It bridges theoretical perspectives with practical applications, fostering a critical understanding of how policies are formulated, implemented, and evaluated in complex sociopolitical contexts. Students will engage in rigorous policy research, apply analytical tools, and develop skills to tackle real-world policy challenges at local, national, and global levels.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103180,'PUB6020','高级公共政策分析','','PUB - Public Policy','6020','P',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本进阶课程的设计目的是令学生深入理解公共政策分析方法及其在复杂政策问题中应用。课程涵盖政策研究的定性与定量方法，例如成本效益分析、多准则决策分析以及高级计量技术。学生将探讨如何评估政策效果、分析实施挑战以及处理政策分析中的伦理问题。','This advanced course is designed for students seeking a deeper understanding of public policy analysis methods and their application to complex policy issues. It covers both qualitative and quantitative approaches to policy research, including cost-benefit analysis, multi-criteria decision analysis, and advanced econometric techniques. Students will explore frameworks for evaluating policy outcomes, assessing implementation challenges, and addressing the ethical dimensions of policy analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
