2026-27 Term 1','There are no pre-requisites for this course.','There are no co-requisites for this course.','西班牙语（一）面向零基础的同学开设。通过介绍西班牙语言的基本原理和西班牙文化，本课程将专注于促进学生用西班牙语进行听、说、读、写的基本技能。课程也会进行基本语法、词汇和发音的教学。','To introduce students to the basic principles of the Spanish language as well as the cultural diversity of the Spanish-speaking world. Classes will promote each of the four skills – listening, speaking, reading, and writing – in conjunction with key elements of grammar, vocabulary and pronunciation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
