2026-27 Term 1','MAT1002 Calculus II or MAT1012 Calculus (Extended) II or MAT1002B Calculus II (B)','MAT2040 linear algebra or MAT2041 Linear Algebra and its Application or MAT2042 Linear Algebra I','概率论和统计学学科主要研究许多实际问题中的不确定性和可变性，并已成为许多科学领域里面重要的描述和分析工具。本课程以激发性问题为背景,发展相关的概率模型来描述这种不确定性和可变性。主题包括古典概率论，离散分布，连续分布，分布性质，多元分布，抽样分布和极限定理。','The discipline of probability theory and statistics is the study of situations in which uncertainty and variability play an important role and become an important descriptive and analytical tool in many scientific fields and practical problems. This course develops relevant probability models and theoretical concepts to describe such uncertainties and variability with motivating practical problems.Topics include basic concepts of probability theory, discrete distributions, continuous distributions, generating functions, multivariate distributions, sampling distributions and limit theorems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
