2025-26 Summer','STA2001/STA2001H: Probability and Statistics I or ECO2121 Basic Statistics','','本课程旨在学习概率统计学中的一些经典和现代的概念。主题包括：描述性统计量、参数的点估计和区间估计、最大似然估计、线性回归模型中的参数估计和统计推断。亦将涵盖：假设检验、似然比检验、卡方检验、非参数检验、方差分析和线性回归。','This course is designed to study some classical and modern concepts of probability and statistics. Topics include: Descriptive statistics, point and interval estimation, and estimations in linear regression models. Would also cover tests of hypotheses as a decision framework, together with concepts of significance level, power, P-value, and critical region. Introductory level of maximum likelihood theory and likelihood ratio test would also be covered. Other selected topics are: Analysis of variance, Distribution-free tests, Chi-square goodness-of-fit tests, and Bayesian estimation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

