2026-27 Term 1','STA2001H Honours Probability and Statis,  or  STA2001 Probability and Statistics I, or having permission from academic advisor','N / A','本课程旨在介绍数理统计学中的基本概念，方法及相关理论。同时，本课程将教授学生如何构造及分析一个统计量。本课程包含如下内容：1.点估计理论：偏差及方差，极大似然估计，矩法及其他方法。2）区间估计：置信区间的定义，枢轴统计量，构造统计量的置信区间。3）假设检验：假设检验的定义，P值，第一类和第二类错误，单/双样本检验，参数及无参数检验，假设检验理论。4）线性回归：线性回归的定义，最小二乘拟合。5）贝叶斯统计：先验/后验分布，贝叶斯推断及一些实际应用。我们还将要求使用Python或R进行数据分析。','"This course is designed to introduce the basic concepts, methods, and related theoretical results regarding the statistics discipline. It also helps students learn how to design & analyze an estimator. Topics include:
1.Point estimation: bias-variance trade-off; maximum likelihood estimation;  method of  moments. 
2.Interval estimation: the concept of confidence interval; pivotal statistics; establish confidence interval for various estimators.
3.Hypothesis testing: concept of hypothesis testing; P-value; Type 1 & Type 2  error;  power  of  a  test;  testing  the  mean;  testing the ratio; parametric test; non-parametric test; uniform most powerful test.
4.Linear regression: concept of regression; linear regression; least-square fitting; R^2; T / F test for linear model; prediction; ANOVA.
Bayesian statistics:   Prior and Posterior distribution;   Bayesian inference; empirical Bayes.   We also introduce analyzing data via Python and R."','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
