2026-27 Term 1','STA2004, MAT2040 and CSC1001','None','本课程旨在系统介绍数据分析的基本理论与方法，重点讲授线性模型的理论基础及其实际应用。主要内容包括：线性模型的构建与最小二乘估计、模型参数与预测的统计推断、模型诊断及模型假设违反时的修正方法、模型选择与正则化等。在此基础上，课程进一步介绍基于线性模型的现代统计学习方法，并阐述其与现代机器学习和人工智能的联系。课程将全程使用统计软件进行数据分析，并要求学生利用统计软件完成作业及其他课程考核。','The course provides a solid introduction to data analysis with an emphasis on the theory and application of linear models. Topics to be covered include formulation and least squares estimation, statistical inference for model coefficients and predictions, model diagnostics and remedial measures when the model assumptions are violated, model selection and regularization. Extensions will be introduced on statistical learning. SThe course also introduces modern statistical learning methods built upon linear models, highlighting their connections to contemporary machine learning and artificial intelligence. Statistical software will be used throughout the course and will be required for the completion of assignments and other assessments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
