2025-26 Term 2','STA2002 or STA2004 or STA2002H','','本课程讲授多元统计分析及其在现实世界中的应用。我们将研究多元数据的各种统计方法，包括多元分布及其推断、方差分析、多元回归、降维方法（例如，主成分分析、因子分析、典型相关分析）、判别分类分析和聚类分析。同时课程也将重点介绍如何将相关多元统计分析方法应用于实际问题。','This course deals with multivariate statistical analysis and their applications in the real world. We will examine a variety of statistical methods for multivariate data, including multivariate distributions and inferences, analysis of variance, multivariate regression, dimension reduction techniques such as principal component analysis, factor analysis, canonical correlation analysis, discrimination and classification, and clustering methods. The integrated use of these techniques in analyzing real problems will be emphasized throughout the course.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
