Python (assignments will require coding with Python).','None','本课程全面探讨金融市场中的统计建模技术，重点关注这些方法在资产定价与投资组合构建中的应用。学生将深入理解用于刻画金融市场预期收益与风险的计量经济与统计方法。此外，课程内容还包括隐性因子模型、贝叶斯统计、动态风险建模、尾部风险建模以及自助法，并强调它们在资产配置与稳健投资组合设计中的应用。此外，教学重点将放在帮助学生将定量方法灵活运用于真实世界的金融分析与投资决策之中。','This course offers a comprehensive exploration of statistical modeling techniques for financial markets, with a particular focus on their role in asset pricing and portfolio construction. Over the semester, students will develop a deep understanding of econometric and statistical methods for modeling expected returns and risks in financial markets. The curriculum also includes advanced topics such as latent factor models, Bayesian statistics, dynamic risk modeling, tail risk modeling, and the bootstrap method, emphasizing their applications in asset allocation and robust portfolio design. Throughout the course, these topics are taught with an emphasis on helping students flexibly apply quantitative methods to real-world financial analysis and investment decision-making.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
