(103223,'STA4041','因果推断','Causal Inference','STA - Statistics','4041','S',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2','STA2002H Honours Probability and Statis  or   STA2002 Probability and Statistics II or having permission from academic advisor.','','发现事件间的因果关系是现代统计学的一个基础问题。本课程旨在介绍因果推断的基本概念及方法。课程包括：1.随机化试验：潜在结果模型， 完全随机实验与费雪随机化检验，分层。 2. 观察性研究：倾向得分及逆概加权估计，双稳健估计， E-值。 3. 工具变量','Investigating causality between events is an important topic in modern-ear statistics. This class introduces basic concepts, methods, and theoretical results on causal inference. Topics include: 1) Randomization experiment: Potential outcomes, Complete randomization experiment and Fisher Randomization Test, Stratification, Regression Adjustment. 2) Observational study: Selection bias, Propensity score and Inverse propensity score weighting estimator, Doubly Robust estimation, E-Value. 3) Instrumental Variable: Definition, Linear IV model, Fuzzy Regression Discontinuity.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
