Matrix analysis CIE6002','','这门课程旨在提供泛化的数据分析认识基础，并将提供统计学习技术的全面概述；包括k均值聚类、主成分分析（PCA）、谱聚类、逻辑回归、判别分析、经验风险最小化、Lasso回归、决策树和随机森林等。课程的第一部分介绍该领域的主要概念和范式，并将通过Python编程实现代表性算法来进行说明。课程的第二部分将介绍一些用于解释和改进统计学习的主要概率工具','This course is designed to foster a broad understanding of data analysis and provides a comprehensive overview of statistical learning techniques, including k-means clustering, Principal Component Analysis (PCA), spectral clustering, logistic regression, discriminant analysis, empirical risk minimization, Lasso regression, decision trees, and random forests. First, we will present the major concepts and paradigms of the field and illustrate them with representative algorithms implemented using the Python programming language. The second part of the course will be dedicated to introducing major probabilistic tools used to explain and improve statistical learning.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
