2024-25 Term 2','STA3020 Statistical Inference','','本课程着重讲授统计分析中的重要概念以及理论分析方法，如估算和检验理论框架。课程囊括的知识点有：再抽样及模拟方法，核函数方法，直方图估计，非参数检验，误差分析，统计推断检验，一致性和极限分布，等。针对课程讲授的统计分析方法及理论，一些相应的应用实例也将会被覆盖到。','This course covers is designed for some advanced topics in statistics, such as concepts and theories in estimation and testing. Topics include histogram estimators, kernel methods, confidence intervals, statistical inference such as tests of significance, non-parametric test, consistency and limiting distribution, method of Monte Carlo, etc. Some applications of statistical topics covered will be introduced.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103227,'STA4102','广义线性模型','Generalized Linear Models','STA - Statistics','4102','S',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','STA2002(H): Mathematics statistics; STA3001: Linear Models, or the permission from academic advisor.','N/A','本课程旨在学习广义线性回归的部分理论及应用。具体包括指数族及广义线性模型，估计，推断及模型诊断。应用包括逻辑回归，分类变量及有序回归，泊松回归及对数线性模型，生存分析，群聚数据及纵向数据，以及贝叶斯回归模型等。','This course is designed to study some theory and practice of generalized linear models (GLM), with theoretical basics in exponential distribution models, the structure, estimation, and inference of generalized linear models, and particular applications in logistic regression, nominal and ordinal logistic regression, Poisson regression and log-linear models, survival analysis, clustered and longitudinal data, Bayesian analysis.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103228,'STA4501','随机分析导论','','STA - Statistics','4501','S',1.00,4000,'Major','Pass/Fail','讲演','Main Campus','数据科学学院','数据科学学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Summer','STA2001 or STA2001H or ECO2121

Remark: Undergraduate-level probability theory, including conditional expectations, random walks, and discrete martingales.','','本课程将系统介绍随机分析理论及其应用，内容涵盖布朗运动、随机积分、随机微分方程、奥恩斯坦–乌伦贝克过程，以及它们在生成式扩散模型中的应用。','This course will provide a concise introduction to the stochastic analysis and its applications. Topics covered will include Brownian motion, stochastic integrals, stochastic differential equations, Ornstein–Uhlenbeck processes, and their applications to generative diffusion models.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
