(103248,'SUD5150','保护生物多样性','','SUD - Sustainable Development','5150','S',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1','NA','NA','本课程通过核心主题系统探究生物多样性保护：界定生物多样性及其保护内涵、识别利益相关者、追溯发展历程、明确保护场所，并深入探讨核心的 “为何保护” 与 “如何保护” 问题。课程涵盖监测技术、威胁识别、个人与社区作用、国家法规、国际机构及深圳等地的本土案例，引导学生分析保护工作的 “棘手性”，并通过口头报告展示学习成果。','This course systematically explores biodiversity conservation through key themes: defining biodiversity and its conservation, identifying stakeholders, tracing historical origins, mapping conservation locations, and examining core "why" and "how" questions. It covers monitoring techniques, threat identification, individual/community roles, national regulations, international institutions, and local case studies like Shenzhen. Students analyze conservation as a "wicked problem" and demonstrate mastery via a final presentation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103249,'SUD5170','气候变化：制度与政策','','SUD - Sustainable Development','5170','S',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','气候变化日益成为国际可持续发展领域一个突出且颇具争议的议题。本课程概述气候变化在国际社会议程中的发展，并让学生接触这一跨学科领域的各个方面。课程将探讨气候变化对国内和全球可持续发展的影响，并通过分析国际气候变化协定的签署过程及其实施效果，探讨促进国际气候变化合作的实践和问题。','Climate change has increasingly become a salient and controversial issue in international sustainable development. This course provides an overview of the development of climate change on the agenda of international community and exposes students to various facets of this very interdisciplinary field. It will examine the impact of climate change on sustainable development at both domestic and global levels and address the practices and problems in promoting international cooperation on climate change by looking into the process that leads to the signing of international accords on climate change and the effectiveness of their implementation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
