2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程介绍翻译的基本原则、概念和实践方法，探讨翻译作为一种语言、文化及传意活动的本质属性。学生将学习如何分析源语文本，并用目标语生成准确且富有意义的译文。通过课堂讨论和实践练习，本课程旨在培养学生的基础翻译技能，引导学生加深对翻译过程涉及的复杂面向的理解。','This course introduces the fundamental principles, concepts, and practices of translation. It explores the nature of translation as a linguistic, cultural, and communicative activity. Students will learn the basics of analyzing texts in the source language (SL) and producing accurate, meaningful translations in the target language (TL). Through classroom discussions and practical exercises, the course aims to develop students'' basic translation skills and their understanding of the complexities involved in translation.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103270,'TRA1020','传意与翻译','Communication and Translation','TRA - Translation','1020','T',3.00,1000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2016-17 Term 2
2017-18 Term 2
