2025-26 Term 1','N/A','TRA1010 Principles of Translation','本課程是專為本科翻譯專業大二學生所設置的口譯入門課。課程旨在讓學生熟悉中英口譯的重要原則、概念和技能，讓學生了解口譯的不同類別（包含視譯、交替傳譯、同聲傳譯、遠程口譯等），其中視譯和交替傳譯將是講解的重點，課程也將利用口譯實驗室為學生提供高強度的口譯訓練。','This is an introductory course of interpreting for year-two translation major students. This course aims to familiarize students with important principles, concepts and techniques of interpreting between Putonghua and English. Students will be exposed to different forms of interpreting (e.g. sight translation, consecutive interpreting, simultaneous interpreting and remote interpreting) with a focus on sight translation and consecutive interpreting. They will also receive intensive interpreting training in the interpreting lab.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103272,'TRA2110','文化与翻译','Culture and Translation','TRA - Translation','2110','T',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2018-19 Term 1
