2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本课程聚焦翻译的跨文化维向，重在探讨译者面临的文化障碍。藉由不同学科视野下的当代文化和翻译理论，来审视不同文化语境下情绪传达（爱、恨、惧等）、行为方式（亲密、隐私、礼仪）、价值观念、两性观念、审美、幽默、符号传意等方面的差异。','This course focuses on the cross-cultural dimension of translation. It examines the most complex cultural barriers faced by the translator - such as differences in the expression of emotions (for instance, love, anger, fear), codes of behavior (for instance, intimacy, privacy, politeness), values and world views, notions of gender, aesthetic taste, humor and forms of symbolism and metaphor. These issues arising from translation practice will be discussed in light of current theories on culture and translation from multiple disciplines.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
