2025-26 Term 2','TRA2010 Introduction to Interpreting','','本课程为已经修过TRA2010口译入门课程，并熟悉口译的基本原则和概念的学生开设。课程旨在进一步加强学生的短时记忆、口译听辨、改述、总结、信息重构和笔记等口译技能，并会就指定话题让学生接受高强度的口译训练。','This course is offered to students who have taken TRA2010 Introduction to Interpreting and are familiar with the basic principles and concepts of interpreting. It aims to further strengthen students’ interpreting techniques, including short-term memory, active listening, paraphrasing, summarizing, reconstitution of message and note-taking. Students will be exposed to intensive training on prescribed topics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
