2025-26 Term 1','TRA2010','None','本課程旨在進一步強化學生在之前口譯課程中所學技能，進一步提升其通順度和準確度，本課程將從如下幾個維度進行：1、通過課堂教學和練習，進一步針對性地鞏固學生在上述兩課程中所學各項技能，教授學生新的必要技能，並幫助學生將各項技能向實戰能力轉化；2、練習材料廣泛涉及各個行業領域。講授時所選練習/範例的難度由易到難、內容由一般性到專業領域，令學生于課程初期在不受其他因素（如專業術語、複雜表述、口音等）干擾的情況下，將注意力主要地放在口譯技能本身。隨著課程進行，視情況逐漸將上述“其他因素”加入，進一步豐富學生技能範圍；3、在強化筆記法前，充分鞏固無筆記交傳涉及的各項技能，既為鞏固筆記法進一步夯實基礎，同時更使學生可以正確理解交替傳譯實踐中腦記與筆記之間的合理比例；4、使學生瞭解譯員的職業道德和規範，深化其對口譯行業的理解。','This course is positioned to further strengthening the knowledge and skills of the students acquired in previous interpreting courses and further improving the fluency and accuracy of interpreting output. This course will be conducted in the following respects: 1. This course is focused on cultivation of practical capabilities despite reviews of the theoretical knowledge acquired in previous courses when and where necessary. Each class will be related to one or more practical skills. 2. The classes will be conducted sequentially in terms of techniques, yet materials related to a variety of industries /contexts will be introduced for teaching and exercises in and out of class. The materials are likely to be easy and general in nature at the beginning in avoidance of possible distraction of the students by other factors (terminology, complicated expression, accents etc.). The above-mentioned factors will be introduced as the lecturer deems necessary. 3. Lay a solid foundation in terms of skills and techniques pertinent to consecutive interpreting without note-taking before enhancing the note-taking skills in the hope that the students could better understand the sensible distribution of attention between note-taking and working memory. 4. Help build up the students’  awareness of the professional ethics and norms for the sake of an in-depth cognition of the interpreting sector.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
