2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本课程为基础英汉法庭口译, 旨在向学生介绍法庭口译的理论与实践。本课程将启动并加强学生在法庭环境中对跨文化和跨语言等问题的理解，包括：翻译的准确性要求、中英文法庭程序、在法律语境中使用的语言、权力的不平衡、伦理、意识形态以及口译员角色和功能。通过课上口译练习、角色扮演、模拟法庭和小组讨论等多种形式进行交替传译、耳语传译、视译等难度递增的基本训练，培养学生在法庭中应对复杂的法庭程序和专业法律术语，并遵循法庭口译员职业道德完成多项任务的能力。','This course introduces students to the theory and practice of court interpreting. The course aims at familiarizing students with court procedures and the language used in the legal context in both English and Chinese. The course will initiate and enhance students’ understanding of specific issues of intercultural and interlingual communication such as accurate and faithful interpretation, institutional discourse, power imbalances, ethics, ideology, and perceptions of role and functions. The course is designed to develop students’ basic skills in doing court interpreting in the mode of consecutive interpreting, whispered interpreting and sight translation. Students will develop these skills by completing interpreting tasks with incremental difficulty levels through a range of practices, role plays, mock trials and group discussions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
