2025-26 Term 2','TRA2010 Introduction to Interpreting','None','本课程旨在拓展学生于TRA2010, TRA2310及TRA2320之所学，通过各类主题及反复练习以提升学生在中英互译时之准确度与通顺度。短交传和长交传为主要练习模式，亦会练习视译与同传以帮助学生顺利过渡到大四的同传学习。','This course aims to build on what students have learned from TRA2010,TRA2310 and TRA2320 through various themes and repetitive drills designed to enhance students’ accuracy and fluency when interpreting between English and Mandarin Chinese. Consecutive Interpreting, both short and long, will be the major modes of interpreting used in class. Sight Translation and Simultaneous Interpreting will also be taught to help students transition into simultaneous interpreting courses in the final year.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
