2023-24 Term 2','TRA2410 Computers and Translation','','本课程聚焦计算机辅助翻译与自动化翻译的理论与实践，着重提高学生对大语言模型、神经网络机器翻译、翻译记忆库与术语管理工具的综合应用能力，旨在提升其翻译实践的质量与效率。','The course aims to introduce the theory and the application of automated and computer-assisted translation technologies. In addition to the theoretical input, students will be given hands-on experience in utilizing mainstream language technologies including large language models, neural machine translation, and translation memory and terminology management software to support and facilitate the translation process.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103281,'TRA2430','翻译与语言技术','Translation and Language Technologies','TRA - Translation','2430','T',3.00,2000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2','NA','NA','本课程全面探讨口笔译研究中的计算方法和数字工具。学生将深入了解机器处理人类语言原理，以及通过文本数据库对语言进行科学分析。课程将帮助学生理解相关理论，同时提供实操指导，帮助学生掌握正在革新口笔译研究与实践的关键语言技术。','This course offers a comprehensive exploration of computational approaches and digital tools in translation and interpreting studies. Students will delve into how machines process human languages and how language can be scientifically analyzed through text databases. Students will develop both theoretical understanding and hands-on experience with key language technologies that are revolutionizing translation and interpreting research and practice.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
