2024-25 Term 2','TRA1010 Principles of Translation','','本课程带领学生从写作的角度探讨翻译，践行“好的翻译就是好的写作”这一基本原则，从词汇、语法、句子、段落、篇章等不同层面让学生意识到英文和中文在语言、文化、修辞以及认知角度存在的差异，并学会如何弥补这种差异。通过高质量的翻译练习和精细的文本分析来探讨双语翻译与写作的基本原则和处理策略，使学生深刻认识到这一问题在理论和实践上的复杂性。课程每周聚焦于一到两个专题，旨在培养学生灵活变通的翻译技能、对本学科性质的初步思考、以及必要的批判性思维，为进一步学习翻译打下坚实基础。','IThis course will lead students to understand and examine translation in terms of the seminal concepts and principles lying at the center of bilingual writing. Special attention is paid to grammar, syntax, diction, and structure. In addition, cultural and rhetorical differences between English and Chinese will also be foregrounded for discussion. Students will derive a deeper appreciation for the craft’s inherent complexities through extensive discussion of translation concepts and strategies, analysis of real-world texts, and most importantly hands-on (independent and group) practice. The lecture of each week provides a focused discussion on one or two special topics, aiming to help students develop transferrable skills and critical thinking in translation between English and Chinese, especially in the light of writing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
