2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程旨在训练学生翻译商业及商业相关的文本，包括贸易和经济协议文件以及日常生活中使用的商业法律。练习文本包括英汉和汉英翻译，尤为注重真实商业世界中的常用词汇。在翻译商业文本的过程中，学生必须积极运用线上和线下的商务字典、术语表及其他参考资料。','The course aims to equip students to translate authentic commercial and business-related texts, including official documents such as trade and economic agreements, and commercial laws used in daily life, from English to Chinese and vice versa. Special attention is given to the vocabulary frequently used in the real business world. It is expected that while translating the commercial texts, students can actively use commercial dictionaries, glossaries and other references in both electronic and paper forms.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
