2019-20 Summer','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在使学生掌握翻译印刷媒体和非印刷媒体文本的原则和技巧，如新闻稿、杂志文章、专题报道、广告以及企业宣传材料。本课程还将介绍翻译媒体文本所必需的实践技能和研究能力，并结合来自现实场景的翻译实例进行讲解。通过本课程的学习，学生将能够制定并运用有效的翻译策略，以应对媒体文本中的语言及文化挑战，游刃有余地进行非技术型媒体文本的中英互译。','The course is designed to equip students with the principles and techniques for translating both print and non-print media texts, including press releases, magazine articles, features, advertisements, and corporate promotional materials. It also introduces practical and research skills essential for translating media texts, with examples drawn from real-world contexts. By the end of the course, students will be able to develop and apply effective translation strategies to address linguistic and cultural challenges in media texts, as well as confidently translate non-technical media content between English and Chinese.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
