2026-27 Term 1','None','None','本课程为基础英汉同声传译, 通过课上单独表现、同学互评和小组讨论等多种形式进行分脑训练、跟读练习、文本分析、视译、摆脱源语外壳等同传基本训练, 培养学生在会议同声传译中合理分配注意力，协调运用各种技巧和完成多项任务的能力。','This course is one featuring the basics of simultaneous interpreting. Basic and fundamental training on distribution of attention, shadowing techniques, text analysis, sight translation and unpacking the source text among others will be conducted in a variety of forms including individual performance, peer assessment and group discussion etc. This course is positioned to cultivate the students’ abilities in SI practices in terms of properly distributing attention, applying a multitude of skills in a concerted manner and finalizing various tasks.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
