2023-24 Term 2','A good mastery of the operating system Windows and a basic mastery of Microsoft Office.','','本课程聚焦语料库的核心理论与语料库在翻译中的实践运用，着重提高学生在以下方面的实践能力：1，建立，分析，并有效检索多语种语料库与术语库；2，将语料库与术语库用于计算机辅助翻译；3，进行基于语料库的人社科研究。','The course aims to introduce the key concepts of parallel corpora and the relation between corpus and state-of-the-art translation technology. In addition to the theoretical input, students will be given hands-on experience in 1) building and analysing multilingual corpora and glossaries, 2) using multilingual corpora and glossaries for computer-aided translation, and 3) conducting corpus-based research in humanities and social science.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103302,'TRA3430','游戏与网站本地化入门','Introduction to Game and Website Localization','TRA - Translation','3430','T',3.00,3000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 2','','','本课程系统地介绍本地化行业，重点关注电子游戏与网站平台的特定工作流。学生将学习并掌握完整的本地化生命周期，包括项目管理、供应商管理、术语管理、现代本地化技术栈（如 CAT 与 TMS 工具）的应用以及AI应用。
在这门课程中，学生将分析游戏 UI 限制与变量处理，探索游戏世界观的文化翻译，以及基于 WordPress 的网站本地化技术架构。通过实操项目模拟，学生将培养工程素养与跨文化专业知识，从而能够胜任专业环境下具备市场交付水准的本地化工作。','This course provides a systematic introduction to the localization industry, with a primary focus on the specialized workflows of video games and website. Students will master the complete localization life cycle, covering project management, vendor management, terminology management, the application of modern localization technology stacks (such as CAT and TMS tools), and AI-human collaboration.
Throughout the course, students will analyze game UI constraints and variable-related logic, explore the cultural translation of game world-building, and examine the technical architecture of Web Localization via WordPress. Through hands-on project simulations, students will develop the technical literacy and cross-cultural expertise required to deliver market-ready localized products in professional settings.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
