2025-26 Term 2','TRA1010  Principles of Translation
TRA1020  Communication and Translation','N/A','本課程關注英漢之間文學文本的翻譯，主要是散文類翻譯，間或旁及詩歌翻譯。本課程也討論在文學翻譯這一對世界的跨語言認知與呈現的文本行為中所體現的語言、文學、文化之間的互動關聯。授課內容與練習設計的目的在於促進學生對特定語境中文本細節的重視，加强學生的翻譯能力，以便發現合適的方法來有理有據地翻譯文學文本。本課程鼓勵學生反思討論在自己動手翻譯中出現的各種問題以及所採用的應對策略。','The focus of this course is on the translation of literary texts from English to Chinese and vice versa, covering mainly prose and occasionally poetry. It will also discuss how language, literature, and culture interact in literary translation as cross-lingual cognition and presentation of the world. Both lectures and exercises are designed with a view to increasing students’ awareness of the importance of textual details in specific contexts, so as to strengthen their ability to discover ways to translate such texts in an informed manner. Students are encouraged to reflect on various problems arising from their hands-on translations, alongside the strategies they may have employed to address such problems.together with the various strategies that might be employed to address such problems.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
