2026-27 Term 1','TRA1010 Principles of Translation      TRA1020 Communication and Translation      TRA2010 Introduction to Interpreting      TRA3010 Theory of Translation','N/A','本课程是翻译专业本科学生在最后一年所要完成的翻译项目。要求学生在导师指导下利用所学知识与技能完成一项长篇（原文不少于5000语词的英语文本或7000字的中文文本）的翻译任务，并从翻译批评的角度，撰写一篇针对完成该项目的翻译评论（1500英文单词）。本课程首先要求学生选定翻译项目内容并提交开题报告，其中包括500语词左右的试译文本。在得到指导老师准许之后，学生开始分阶段来完成翻译内容，按时提交给指导老师。老师在完成每一阶段批改后将与每位学生进行单独讨论和提出修改意见。本课程还要求学生撰写一篇译评，讲述自己如何运用所学到的相关理论、知识技能和翻译策略，解决翻译过程中所遇到的困难。','The course is a final-year capstone project for students majoring translation and interpreting studies, which requires the students to apply their knowledge and skills acquired to complete an English-to-Chinese or Chinese-to-English translation project (containing no less than 5,000 English words, or 7,000 Chinese characters in the source text) under the individualized guidance of their supervisors. Additionally, students are required to write up a translation commentary to critically examine the problems and solutions they have had during the process (1500 words in English). The project starts with the selection of the source text for translation and the preparation of a project proposal, including a trial translation of approximately 500 words, to be submitted to and approved by their supervisors. Then, students are expected to complete the translation in three phases followed by feedback and discussions from their supervisors when each phase is completed. To complete the project, students are required to turn in a translation commentary, reflecting on their work and examining their translation problems and solutions critically.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103309,'TRA4110','汉英翻译','Chinese to English Translation','TRA - Translation','4110','T',3.00,4000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
