2025-26 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程本课程性质为实践导向，旨在培养学生的高级中英翻译技能，重点是法律和医学文本的翻译。本课程将介绍这两个领域的复杂性。学生将参与实践练习，提高他们对法律和医疗文件中固有的术语、文化差异和上下文含义的理解。授课重点在于讲解与实际翻译相关的问题，鼓励学生在授课老师指导下反思与翻译文学文本相关的各种问题，以及各种应对策略。','This course is designed for students seeking to develop advanced Chinese to English translation skills with a focus on translating legal and medical texts. This course will introduce the intricacies of both fields. Students will engage in practical exercises that enhance their understanding of terminology, cultural nuances, and contextual implications inherent in legal and medical documents.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
