(103311,'TRA5100','翻译与生成式人工智能','','TRA - Translation','5100','T',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程聚焦生成式人工智能在翻译实践中的应用，帮助学生在善用人工智能工具的同时，准确识别并妥善应对其局限。课程将系统讲授翻译实践的基本原则与操作流程，引导学生理解不同语言及文化语境下的表达差异，并掌握提示词设计、翻译工作流程优化和质量管理等实用技能。课程同时强调人类译者不可替代的专业价值，着重培养学生的独立判断能力、领域知识与跨文化素养、职业伦理意识，以及审慎、负责的译后编辑能力。','This course explores how generative AI can be used in translation practice and trains students to identify and manage AI limitations. It introduces core principles and procedures for practical translation, with a focus on differences in expression across languages and cultures. Students will also learn prompt engineering, workflow design, and quality assurance for translation. The course emphasises the professional value of human translators, including informed decision-making, domain and cultural competence, ethical judgement, and responsible post-editing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
