2025-26 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本科旨在让学生更好地了解汉英翻译的理论和实践，熟悉汉英翻译中常见的内容、问题和翻译策略；通过完成翻译练习和作业、参与课上讨论和演示，以及阅读相关文献，让学生逐步提高语言的感知和操控能力，更加有效地做好跨文化语言交流以及更好地认识汉英语言的差异，提高自身的汉英翻译水平。本课程还展示了AI对于翻译的影响以及在新的AI 时代译者如何发挥自身的作用。
本课程不要求学生课前具备翻译理论知识和翻译技巧，但是要求学生具备较强的汉英双语能力，并能够积极参与课上和课下的各项活动。','The course familiarizes the learners with fundamental aspects of the theories and practice of Chinese to English translation. It exposes the learners to a variety of topics, issues and translation strategies often encountered in C/E translation and provides ample opportunities for hands-on practice through translation exercises, discussions, projects, presentations and reading assignments. Learners are expected to be able to identify translation problems and to come up with proper solutions for better communication across linguistic and cultural barriers and to become more aware of the nuances of differences between the two languages and more competent in handling difficult translation problems. The course also demonstrates the impact of AI on translation and the unique role of the human translator in the new era of AI technology.
The course does not require previous knowledge of translation theory or translation skills, but it does expect the attendants to have a good mastery of the two languages and to engage actively in the activities both in class and after.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
