2025-26 Term 1','','','本课程旨在培养学生在经贸领域的翻译技能。通过翻译经济、贸易和金融领域的各类文本，学生将掌握各领域特有的语言特点、术语和文体规范。课程强调跨文化语言转换、专业术语应用及行业标准实践。通过案例分析、练习和项目实践，学生将具备满足全球商业环境需求的专业翻译技能。','This course aims to develop students’ translation skills in economic and trade domains. Through translation of various texts in economy, trade and finance, students will master the linguistic features, terminologies, and stylistic conventions specific to each domain. The course emphasizes cross-cultural language transfer, specialized terminology application, and industry standard practices. Through case analysis, hands-on practice, and project-based learning, students will acquire professional translation skills to meet the demands of the global business environment.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
