2026-27 Term 1','NIL','NIL','课程旨在帮助学生认识法律翻译工作。学生通过翻译不同类型的英汉法律文本，熟习法律行业常用的术语、用语以及法律语言的整体风格。这些法律文本包括法例、合同和案例等。在翻译过程中，学生必须积极运用法律字典、术语表和其他法律参考资料。','This course aims to introduce students to the practice of legal translation. Through translating different types of legal texts between Chinese and English, including contracts, statutes and cases, students would be able to get familiarized with some legal terminology and expressions, and the style of legal language in general. It is expected that students can actively use legal dictionaries, glossaries and other references in the process of translating.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
