2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程探讨当代数字时代的传媒翻译理论与实践，重点关注视听媒体。在翻译基础知识之上，学生将通过翻译不同平台和体裁的媒体内容培养分析能力和实践能力。课程兼顾理论框架与实际应用，涵盖多样化媒体的行业标准、字幕组翻译在内的用户驱动的翻译形式。学生将学习应对传媒翻译中的技术、语言和文化挑战。课程还将关注AI辅助翻译工具及其在传媒领域的应用、协作翻译平台、媒体平台和志愿传媒翻译社群的新兴趋势。','This course explores media translation theories and practices in the contemporary digital age, with a particular emphasis on audiovisual media. Building upon foundational translation knowledge, students will develop analytical skills and practical competencies in translating media content across multiple platforms and genres. The course emphasizes both theoretical frameworks and hands-on applications, covering industry-standard practices for diverse media as well as user-driven translation forms, including fansubbing. Students will learn to deal with the technical, linguistic, and cultural challenges of media translation. Additional attention will be given to AI-assisted translation tools and their applications in media contexts, collaborative translation platforms, and emerging trends across media platforms and volunteer media translation communities.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103317,'TRA5114','文学翻译','','TRA - Translation','5114','T',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2017-18 Term 2
2022-23 Term 1
