(103320,'TRA5200','人机协同口译','','TRA - Translation','5200','T',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2026-27 Term 1','','','本课程探讨人工智能在当代口译中的角色及人机协作模式。学生将学习自动语音识别、机器口译、人工智能辅助术语工具及远程口译平台等相关技术。课程重点关注对技术系统性能、错误模式、认知负荷，以及技术介入口译场景中的工作流程设计进行批判性评估。课程同时探讨人工智能应用所涉及的伦理与职业议题，包括保密性、数据治理及行业市场转型等。通过理论学习与应用分析相结合，本课程旨在培养学生理解和评估人工智能口译技术的能力，并帮助学生在智能化、人机协同的沟通环境中明确自身的专业定位与发展方向。','This course examines the role of artificial intelligence in contemporary interpreting and the emerging models of human–AI collaboration. Students explore technologies such as automatic speech recognition, machine interpreting, AI-assisted terminology tools, and remote interpreting platforms. Emphasis is placed on critical evaluation of system performance, error patterns, cognitive load, and workflow design in technology-mediated settings. The course also addresses ethical and professional issues, including confidentiality, data governance, and market transformation. By integrating theory and applied analysis, students develop the ability to position themselves strategically within intelligent and hybrid communication environments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
