2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在教授学生基本的人工智能素养本和口译技术。通过修读，学生应学会如何应用包括人工智能在内的现代技术赋能口译学习和联系，并增强译前准备和译后复盘的能力。

本课程旨在通过对源语理解训练、记忆训练、交传笔记法及其它训练提升学生的汉英交传技巧，帮助学生进行交替传译的实战能力建设。在讲授上述技巧的同时，同时注意在以下几个方面1）表达的灵活性；2）语言的准确度与流畅度；3）译前准备以及口译实践中的应急处理能力等，强化学生的相关技能。
讲授时所选练习/范例的难度总体上遵循由易到难、内容由一般性到专业领域的原则，使学生于课程初期在不受其他因素（如专业术语、复杂表述、口音等）干扰的情况下，将注意力主要地放在口译技能本身。随着课程进行，视情况逐渐将上述“其他因素”加入，进一步丰富学生技能范围；
在引入笔记法前，会先进行视译训练和无笔记交传涉及各项技能的训练，使学生可以正确理解交替传译实践中脑记与笔记之间的合理比例。','This course aims to help students acquire the fundamental knowledge in AI literacy and  interpreting technologies. Students will know how to use modern technologies including AI to empower interpreting learning and practice by enhancing pre-interpreting preparation and post-interpreting analysis.

This course will also cultivate and improve the C-E consecutive interpreting skills by the training on comprehension of the source language, memory, note-taking among others and to helping the students with the ability to conduct interpreting in practice. Meanwhile, this course is also focused on the following respects: 1) Language flexibility; 2) Accuracy and fluency in expression; 3) Pre-task preparation and ability to address emergencies in interpreting practice to strengthen relevant skills.
The materials for the class are likely to be easy and general at the beginning in avoidance of possible distractions by other factors (terminology, complicated expression, accents etc.). The above-mentioned factors will be introduced as the course instructor deems necessary.
Sight interpreting and skills and techniques pertinent to consecutive interpreting without note-taking will be emphasized before introducing the note-taking skills in the hope that the students could better understand the sensible distribution of attention between note-taking and working memory.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
