2025-26 Term 2','TRA5202 Foundation in English to Chinese Consecutive Interpreting','N/A','金融经济是口译任务的重要领域。本课程将介绍交替传译基本原则与理论，通过记忆、笔记和视译辅助交传训练，帮助学生提升交传技巧与能力，为实际口译任务做充足准备。本课程将运用当下经济、贸易与金融领域的相关材料和口译技术，以学生为中心，在学生展示、同侪评价、讨论和刻意练习中提供个性化建议与指导，从而培养学生的口译能力。','Finance and economics serve as an essential field for any interpreter as well as a highly relevant foundation for various interpreting assignments. In this course, students will work with up-to-date conference materials covering topics such as macroeconomics, regulation, financial accounting, earnings result, M&A, etc. to further enhance consecutive interpreting skills with a special focus on finance and economics so as to prepare for real-life interpreting tasks.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
