2024-25 Term 2','Nil.','Nil.','社区口译，也称陪同口译或联络口译，是一种主要用于公共服务如：教育、医疗、社保、法律咨询等场合的，针对外族人士提供的口译服务。本课程将以话题为导向，针对常见的社区口译场景进行授课，旨在提高学生的沟通技能，培养学生为公共机构、政府机关提供口译服务的能力。','Community interpreting, also known by various names such as escort interpreting, liaison interpreting and dialogue interpreting, is a form of language service provided to individuals and small groups for such needs as medical or legal consultation. The course starts from relative simple sentence-by-sentence interpreting (short consecutive) to more complex situations and prolonged segments (long consecutive). By covering a range of topics frequently encountered in such situations, the course will equip students with good communication skills and relevant thematic knowledge.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
