2025-26 Term 2','TRA 5202 Foundation in English to Chinese Consecutive Interpreting','N/A','本门课程中，学生将在导师的指导下进行团队合作和角色扮演，模拟会议实战。学生在会议中分别担任发言人、小组成员、口译员或听众的角色。通常情况下，学生将根据分配的角色提前准备演讲，他们可能会被分配到一个不熟悉的话题。此外，学生还将学习如何做准备以便相对轻松地完成口译任务。','In this course students are expected to work in teams and to role-play under the guidance of instructors in a mock conference. They will take up the roles of speakers, panelists, interpreters, or active audience by participating in Q&A sessions. Usually, students will be assigned these roles and will be expected to prepare for the speeches ahead of time. They will have the opportunity to inform themselves on a subject that is hitherto unfamiliar. They will also learn how proper preparation will enable them to perform the required interpreting tasks with relative ease.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
