2025-26 Term 1','A good mastery of the operating system Windows and Microsoft Office, a working knowledge of text analysis and writing, and a basic familiarity with AI tools especially for post-editing purposes.','Nil.','本課程的機輔翻譯概念更新為生成式人工智能輔助翻譯。課程旨在通過訓練機輔雙語文本分析與寫作的能力，讓學生了解機輔翻譯實操的知識與技巧，並鼓勵學生基於這些知識和技巧與人工智能工具進行深度演練，合作生成從文到詩各類文本的翻譯和譯後編輯。學生需要展現自己在這一學習過程中的操作與發現，以及进行人機建設性互動所需要的自信与批判分析意識。','This course, following an updated conception of CAT as Generative AI-aided translation, aims to introduce knowledge and skills of computer-aided translation practice by way of computer-aided training in bilingual text analysis and composition. Based on this knowledge and skills, students will be encouraged to enter in-depth engagement with AI tools in producing and post-editing translations of different types of text, ranging from prose to poetry. Students are also expected to demonstrate their practices and findings, as well as confidence and critical awareness of the possibilities of constructive human-machine interaction.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
