2025-26 Term 2','NIL','NIL','本课程旨在为学生提供在翻译公司、出版社、新闻机构或其它大公司从事翻译/语言服务项目的机会。期望通过培训和实习经历，使学生对专业翻译领域的一些重要问题有更好理解，并培养学生借助工具和资源翻译专业文本的能力。授课主题包括翻译和口译员培训、道德和法律敏感性、文本处理和业务管理工具、本地化等。','This course aims to provide students with the opportunity to work in translation/language services projects at translation companies, publishing houses, news agencies or other big corporations. It is expected that through the training and internship experience, students will gain a good understanding of the important issues relating to translation theory and practice, and develop the competency to solve various problems in specialized translation under the globalization trend. The topics include training of translators and interpreters, ethical and legal sensitivity, useful tools for text processing and business management, localization, and so on.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103333,'TRA5315','游戏叙事设计与本地化','','TRA - Translation','5315','T',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2','NIL','NIL','要真正理解游戏设计，就必须先理解由创造力、心理学、艺术、技术和商业構成的概念網絡。本课程旨在介绍互动叙事在视频游戏中的广泛艺术和概念理解的基础知识，鼓励学生以开放的心态来学习游戏设计及其本地化。','To truly understand game design is to understand an incredibly complex web of creativity, psychology, art, technology, and business. This course is designed to introduce the basics of a broad artistic and conceptual understanding of interactive narrative in video games. Students are encouraged to set aside their preconceptions about video games, so that they can approach this subject with an open mind.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103334,'TRA5316','语料库与计算语言学','','TRA - Translation','5316','T',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程深入探讨语料库和计算语言学,特别关注其在翻译和口译研究中的应用。学生将深入了解机器处理人类语言，以及如何通过文本数据库对语言进行科学分析。学生将深入了解自然语言处理相关理论原理。这是人工智能的一个重要方面,同时也是数据驱动语言研究的核心技术。课程内容包括语料库建设、统计分析和研究设计等基础技能，重点关注技术其中的伦理。本课程将聚焦研究方法，使学生能够使用先进的语言学工具在翻译和口译研究领域进行前沿研究。','This course provides an in-depth exploration of corpus and computational linguistics, with a special focus on their applications in translation and interpreting research. Students will delve into how machines process human languages and how language can be scientifically analyzed through text databases. Students will gain a solid understanding of the theoretical principles behind natural language processing, an essential aspect of artificial intelligence, as well as techniques central to data-driven language research. The curriculum includes foundational skills in corpus building, statistical analysis, and research design, with a focus on the ethical considerations of these technologies. The course will emphasize research methodologies, enabling students to conduct cutting-edge research in translation and interpreting studies using advanced linguistic tools.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103335,'TRA5317','大语言模型应用','','TRA - Translation','5317','T',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2025-26 Term 1
2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程介绍大语言模型在翻译学及人文社科领域的应用。课程内容涵盖生成式人工智能工具在翻译实践和数字人文研究中的场景和方法，培养学生的提示词设计技能和人工智能素养。','This course introduces the use of large language models in the discipline of humanities and social science, covering various scenarios and strategies for using ChatGPT and other generative AI applications in HSS practices and research, with a focus on prompting students’ competence in prompt engineering and human-AI collaboration.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103336,'TRA5400','高级语言科技','','TRA - Translation','5400','T',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 2
2025-26 Term 2
2026-27 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程探讨前沿语言技术及其在专业翻译和多语言交流中的应用。课程涵盖语料库语言学、术语管理、翻译记忆库、机器翻译，以及人工智能应用。通过行业标准工具的实践操作和项目式学习，学生将掌握在专业翻译实践与学术研究中有效运用语言技术的能力。','This course aims to provide deep insights into the mechanism, application, and future development of cutting-edge language technologies including large language models, neural machine translation systems, and linguistic asset management tools. Its focus is placed on the implications of these technologies on not only translation practice, but also empirical translation research.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
