TRA5201 Foundation in Chinese to English Consecutive Interpreting','TRA5402 Foundation in English to Chinese Simultaneous Interpreting','此门课程为汉译英同声传译之基础课程。除了学习汉英同声传译的基础理论与知识背景之外，学生将会学习到汉英同声传译的应对技巧与契合不同主题的英语表达方式。在课程一开始会辅以视译练习，再逐渐进入到以短篇文本为主之汉译英同声传译训练。','interpreting from a source language (Chinese) to a target language (English). The course will expose students to a range of different speeches and texts for different situations and on different subject matters for interpreting, with the purpose to enhance students'' abilities for text analysis and processing as well as the formulation of fluent delivery in the target language.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
