TRA5511-Seminar 2','本课程旨在为学生提供一个模拟会议环境，使其在教师的指导下进行团队工作和角色扮演。学生将分别承担发言人、专家、译员和听众等不同角色， 探索以前未知领域并学习如何为顺利完成同传任务而做前期准备，如背景知识研究、术语掌握等，条件允许的情况下，学生将到会议现场进行有指导的实践。','This course offers a simulated conference environment for the students to work in teams and do role-play under the guidance of instructors. They will take up the roles of speakers, panelists, interpreters, or active audience by participating in Q & A sessions. Students will be assigned these roles and will learn to make detailed preparation for the speeches ahead of time. They will have the opportunity to inform themselves on subjects that are hitherto unfamiliar. They will also learn how proper preparation will enable them to perform the SI tasks required with satisfaction. Whenever applicable, students will be brought to conference sites for guided practice and hands-on experience in SI.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
