TRA5413 Simultaneous Interpreting for International Relations
TRA5511 Seminar 2','本课程为全球合作与发展高级同声传译课程。鉴于各国在贸易投资、环保、科技交流等领域的相互依存度越来越高，合作与发展已是当今世界两大主要议题。本课程旨在对学生进行严格的同声传译技能培训的同时，进一步强化上述领域的知识，为将来的翻译工作做好准备。','This course is designed for advanced learning in simultaneous interpreting with a focus on global cooperation and development which are the two main themes of the world today. As countries are more and more inter-dependent in the areas of trade, investment, environmental protection and exchanges of science and technology, this course aims at equipping the students with the knowledge of the above areas while carrying out strict training in SI.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
