2024-25 Term 2','N/A','N/A','本课程结合实务练习与研究讨论。实务练习以圆桌讨论形式，利用各类演讲与文本之音视频进行练习与分析。此外，学生须进行独立研究，并针对相关课程中之理论、原则与技巧进行深度讨论，并针对个人兴趣之研究领域进行简报，藉由此课程提升口笔译进阶实务能力与理论基础。','This course is designed to introduce students to the theory of translation and interpreting studies, as well as the practice of conference interpreting. On the one hand, this course will be conducted in a “round-table” fashion, using audio and video recordings of a variety of speeches and texts of different types to practice. On the other hand, students will work independently on the research topic selected by themselves. Students will engage themselves critically, exploring topics of their interest and making presentations. They will be engaged critically in discussions and learn to address topics essential to their understanding of the theories, principles and techniques they have learned from other courses. These will reinforce their mastery of the advanced issues about the nature and process of translation and interpreting, and enhance their understanding of translation and interpretation as complementary pursuits.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
