2025-26 Term 2','NIL','NIL','本课程介绍大语言模型在翻译学及人文社科领域的应用。课程内容涵盖生成式人工智能工具在翻译实践和数字人文研究中的场景和方法，培养学生的提示词设计技能和人工智能素养。','This course introduces the use of large language models in the discipline of translation and interpreting studies and, more broadly, in the humanities and social sciences. It covers various scenarios and strategies for utilising generative AI applications in translation practice and digital humanities research, with an emphasis on developing students’ skills in prompt engineering and AI literacy.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
