2024-25 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程旨在向学生介绍基本的创意写作技巧和规范，以及部分英美现当代经典文学作品，通过大量的阅读和写作训练提高学生在英文散文创作过程中的语感和英语语言运用的综合能力。','This course is designed as an introductory creative writing workshop with an emphasis on prose writing. It intends to acquaint the students with basic writing craft and terminologies, and give a broad introduction to creative practice in the writing of fiction. The first half of the semester will focus on the micro aspects of prose writing (how to order words for emphasis, how to establish a pattern in a paragraph, then give it a twist, etc.); second half, the course is geared towards the examination of storytelling in a macro scope (character orchestration, Aristotle''s narrative structure etc.).','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
