2026-27 Term 1','None.','None.','在这个数字化程度日益提高的世界中，自动化和信息技术在语言学习的相关任务中发挥着关键作用。本课程为希望通过计算机编程来提升专业技能的翻译人员而打造，旨在架起语言学习和编程技术之间的桥梁。同学们将学习Python编程的基础概念，为实现任务自动化、文本的高效处理以及技术的深入理解打下基础。本课程的核心主题包括：Python语法、数据结构与算法、面向对象编程基础，以及与办公自动化和文档处理相关的AI应用。','In an increasingly digitized world, where automation and technology play a pivotal role in language-related tasks, this course serves as a bridge between the realms of language and programming. Specifically crafted for translators seeking to enhance their capabilities by integrating programming into their skill set, participants will be introduced to foundational concepts of Python programming. This enables them to automate routine tasks, manipulate text efficiently, and gain a deeper understanding of technologies. Key topics include Python syntax, data structures and algorithms, basics of object-oriented programming, and AI applications related to office automation and document processing.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
