2024-25 Term 1','Partial completion of Master’s degree programme in T&I studies is required.','TRA6010 Critical Theories for Translation Studies;
TRA6030 Research Methodologies in Translation Studies.','这是一门专门为翻译专业博士生及硕士开设的选修课程，旨在让学生了解在大学本科和研究生阶段的翻译人才培养模式和相关问题的研究方法。本课为学生介绍如何为开展翻译培训进行课程设计，组织课堂活动，开展课堂讨论，评估学生能力与表现。本课程通过让学生广泛阅读、深入讨论翻译理论、教育理念以及教学和评估方法，提升他们在翻译理论与实践以及翻译教学方面的能力。本课程要求学生通过积极参与课堂讨论和完成阅读与论文写作来展示对于所涉及的问题和方面的深度理解以及自身的分析批判能力。','This is a course for PhD and MA students in translation studies, which focuses on the training of translators and interpreters (T&I training) at the undergraduate and postgraduate levels for university education and related studies in the field. The course aims at understanding the state of the art in T&I training by surveying the different models and practices employed by such programmes throughout the world. It also introduces the processes involved in developing a T&I programme, including curriculum design, organizing class activities, engaging students in discussions, performance assessment, etc. The course tries to enhance the learners’ awareness of the importance of theory and practice in T&I training by exposing them to different approaches of studies and development in the past few decades. Students are expected to demonstrate their understanding and their critical/analytical insights on these subjects through their active participation in discussions in class and in completing their reading and writing assignments.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103357,'TRA6030','翻译研究方法','','TRA - Translation','6030','T',3.00,6000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','人文社科学院','人文社科学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2023-24 Term 2
2024-25 Term 2','None','None','本课程采用实践研讨课形式介绍翻译研究领域的主要研究方法，从解释学、社会学到认知学，主要强调定性研究的创新方法，包括表演和叙事民族志、参与式行动研究、口述历史、在线民族志和亚洲认识论。','This course provides a hands-on (workshop-based) introduction to the major research methodologies currently in use in the field of Translation Studies, from the hermeneutical through the sociological to the cognitive, with primary emphasis on innovative approaches to qualitative research, including performance and narrative ethnography, participatory action research, oral history, online ethnography, and Asian epistemologies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
