2025-26 Term 1','N/A','N/A','城市经济学探讨一系例有关城市经济的问题。本课程将地理因素引入对生产与消费的经济学分析，包括企业与家庭如何选择生产与居住地点、城市土地的利用与房屋问题、城市交通、及地方政府在城市发展中的角色。完成本课程后，学生将掌握应用基本经济学原理来理解城市的功能及分析它们面临的机会与挑战。','This course of Urban Economics explores a variety of topics on the economy of cities. It brings geography into economic analysis of production and consumption in urban areas, covering topics such as the choice of location by firms and households, urban land use and housing, urban transportation, and the role of local governments in urban development. By the end of the course, students will acquire skills to apply some basic economic principles to understand the functioning of cities and to analyze the opportunities and challenges they face.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
