2026-27 Term 1','NA','NA','本课程旨在为学生提供理解和评判社会问题研究以及设计和进行社会科学研究的实用工具。课程侧重于实用的定性和定量研究方法，包括扎根研究、案例研究、调查研究、访谈、内容分析、统计分析和其它相关方法。学生应当运用必要的技能来阐释、评判、设计和进行研究项目并解决具体的和可验证的问题。','This course is designed to provide students with practical tools of understanding and critiquing research on social issues and designing and conducting social science research. It focuses on practical qualitative and quantitative research methods, including grounded research, case study, survey research, interview, content analysis, statistical analysis, and other pertinent methods. Students are expected to utilise the skills necessary to interpret, critique, design and conduct research projects addressing specific and testable questions.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103381,'URB5040','社会科学统计分析','','URB - Urban Studies','5040','U',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2024-25 Term 1
2025-26 Term 1','None','','本课程提供在社会科学领域开展实验和相关研究所需的各种统计知识和技能。内容包括统计学基础知识和假设检验、功效和效应量、相关和多元回归、简单和因子方差分析、高级相关数据分析（路径分析或结构方程模型）。学生将学习如何处理定量数据并有效地交流统计结果。','This course provides a wide range of statistical knowledge and skills needed to conduct experimental and correlational research in social sciences. Contents include basics about statistics and hypothesis testing, power and effect size, correlation and multiple regression, simple and factorial analysis of variance, and advanced correlational data analysis (path analysis or structural equation modeling). Students will learn about how to work with quantitative data and effectively communicate the statistical results.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103382,'URB5110','城市公共政策：理论与实践','','URB - Urban Studies','5110','U',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 1
