2025-26 Term 1','N/A','N/A','本课程研究与交通运输业相关的经济、商业和公共政策问题。课程目的是传授运输需求、私人和社会运输成本、市场结构、竞争、运输市场投资及其社会经济影响的基础知识。课程也会介绍主要交通项目和政策的影响评估技术。此外，课程还会讨论围绕交通政策的政治辩论，重点讨论各种政策中的受惠方和受损方。','This course examines the economic, business, and public policy issues related to the transportation industry. The aim of the course is to provide students with the fundamentals of transport demand, private and social transport costs, market structures, competition, and investments in transportation markets and their socioeconomic impacts. It also introduces students to impact assessment techniques for major transportation projects and policies. In addition, it discusses the political debates around transportation policy highlighting winners and losers in various policies.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,''),
(103389,'URB5340','人口与社会','','URB - Urban Studies','5340','U',3.00,5000,'Major','已评分','讲演','Main Campus','公共政策学院','公共政策学院','saved_outline','saved_terms','2022-23 Term 2
