2026-27 Term 1','NA','NA','本课程旨在让学生对社会科学中的定量和定性研究方法和设计有一个基础性的了解。主要目的是帮助学生确定和提出自己的研究问题，并开发和实施回答这些问题的流程。学生将研究研究过程的本质，探索理论与实证研究之间的联系，确定可行的研究课题，学习如何构建良好的论证，了解研究论文和建议书的结构，计划和管理研究活动，并熟悉研究伦理。','This course is designed to provide students with a foundational understanding of quantitative and qualitative research methods and design in social sciences. The main objective is to help students identify and formulate their own research questions, and develop and implement a process for answering them. Students will examine the nature of the research process, explore the connection between theory and empirical research, identify viable research topics, learn how to structure good arguments, understand the structure of research papers and proposals, plan and manage research activities, and become familiar with research ethics.','0','0','seed:build_edu_seed','2026-11-15 00:00:00','',NULL,'');

